Hugh Weaver,GB,1.0,"Every time my wife has a weekend delivery from Amazon , the delivery person simply throws it over the gate without even coming through  it and either posting it through our letterbox or ringing our door bell or leaving it in a safe place or on the doorstep  !!!!!! Today the delivery notification says it was put through  our letterbox !!!!!! It was actually thrown over the gate on to our garden path  !!!!!!!!There is nothing on the delivery  notification to let Amazon know about this inefficiency and unprofessional habit . This only happens with weekend deliveries . So Amazon - Have a word with your weekend delivery person !!!!!!",78.0,110,1.0,0.0,31.233875490745934,Low Trust
Sungmi Kim,CA,1.0,"Stop using Purolator for delivering package for your clients. If you really care about your customer satisfaction, you should be careful who you are associated with in your business. Just go check Purolator's review. I ordered a mattress from you guys, and Purolator gave it to some random person. I was home!!! Only solution I get from Amazon, is I need to wait another 5 days so they can figure it out... Are you kidding me???? You should send me a package with different carrier!!!!!!! Don't make customer deal with bs. IT is your responsibility as You promised to deliver it on short time!!!!!!! If I knew you can't keep the promise, I would have bought from a local mattress shop from the get-go!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",2.0,124,1.0,0.0,31.390914189568143,Low Trust
Ace,US,1.0,Delivery was supposed to be on Tuesday. Called Amazon well in advance to have the order shipped to my job site. It was delivered on Sunday ( 2 days early) to my home address. Not where it was to be sent ! They said I should drive 2 1/2 hours to my home and pick it up and drive 2 1/2 hours back !! My time and gas for their screw up !!! They left it at my gate. They said I should have my 88 year old mother drag it to the porch !!! Big package that she can not do !!! This puts my project 1 week behind do to their screw up. I won’t be home until Friday afternoon. They better hope it’s still there when I get home !!! They seem to think giving me a $20 credit will make things better. That sh** don’t work with me. I have noticed that in the last year their customer service has gone to he** !!!! I’m gonna review my dealings with Amazon to see if I will continue doing business with them. This screw up from them has cost me money and valuable time !!!!!!!!,1.0,198,1.0,0.0,32.22097588334268,Low Trust
Diane LaPatra,US,1.0,If there was a lower rating I would use it!!! AMAZON is worthless!!!! Have used them for a short period of time and have had nothing but EXTREMELY POOR service....Not just in delivering items but also CUSTOMER service....As there LITERALLY is NONE!!!! Honestly have no idea how they stay in business as they have a RIDICULOUS amount of negative reviews!!!!! When I looked up the phone number to call and complain about not receiving an item it was a BOGUS number that was surrounded by  all the AMAZON logo so it looks official.....When talking to someone they were SOOOOOO apologetic about my problem that they were going to give me a few AMAZON gift cards for my inconvenience!!!! WOW!!!! Which turned out to be a TOTAL and BIGGER scam!!!! They were the recipients of gift cards from ME!!!!!! Got CRICKETS from AMAZON when I FINALLY reached a REAL AMAZON number and complained to 4 different people (because no one there gave a crap about my problem) nor from the E-MAILLLLLSSSS (several) which I sent.....WAS SCAMMED OUT OF $119.00 and doubt I will see a penny of that money back!!!! And the REAL kicker is they sent me the WRONG item and I can’t even return it because they suspended my account for SOMEONE TRYING TO GET INTO MY ACCOUNT!!!!!UNBELIEVABLE EXPERIENCE!!! I suggest WALMART is the way to go from NOW ON!!!!!!,1.0,231,1.0,0.0,32.59113853056646,Low Trust
Patricia Mickett Gearing,US,1.0,"Hello all !!I have been an Amazon user for so long and have had no problems!  Recently an item I ordered never arrived and they kept telling me I got my refund and I never did!  Finally, had to contact my bank and file a dispute!But, that is not the BIG one!I placed 4 orders within a week!  One arrived fine and the other 4 were delivered to the wrong address and the thing that got my goat the most is they sent me a picture of someone else’s doorway!!!!!!!  On calling, they have that calm scripted attitude that only made me more angry.  One order I cancelled that was a small amount and went to Staples.  The second order had two items in it and requested replacement!  They only replaced half!  And I had to get the second half replaced also! Don’t you know it, IT went to the SAME wrong address again with a picture of the doorway.  My third order order thank the lord arrived with no problem.  I called back to check on the next replacement and talked to Logistics who assured me everything was fine.  Yesterday the second replacement was due and for some reason I checked my account and there was a delivery confirmation and yet again a wrong delivery and someone else’s house!  By this time I am furious!  After explaining my story again and with anger, they suggested I check the neighborhood and see if I can see it.  We live in a condo with 26 units and you know that wasn’t going to happen.  Since distribution is a town away, I wanted them to call and make the driver return ( of course he would have to remember where he left it ) and of course no dice!  So to make a long story short they are sending a third replacement today, but I don’t have much hope.  So as of this minute there are 3 Katy Perry CD’s out there just floating, and if you got one, please enjoy it on me! And, if she reaches the top of the charts with the cd, well I know I had something to do with it!  What has happened to Amazon, to big, to fast, bound to crash!  Spent almost 2 hours on the phone trying to resolve, I think I will pay full price and go back to brick and mortar!   Beware my friends !!!!  Pretty sure my cd will be in the bargain bin before I see it-Amazon get it together!",5.0,421,1.0,0.0,34.72237801458217,Low Trust
ML,GB,1.0,"Absolutely Terrible!!!!!  Seems Amazon staff no longer have to be polite as Amazon don’t care anymore about their customers and clearly think they are too big to treat people with dignity and respect! I ordered some suitcases for my sons holiday. Said they were ‘delivered’ left on porch….clearly they were not! Or due to it being an insecure area, they were stolen! Called called customer services who said they would NOT give me a refund until I reported the “crime” to the police!!!! What the hell!!!! What crime!!! Who even knows if the delivery company delivered when they said they did! I have had to call on numerous times. Every advisor I spoke to was RUDE!!! I then had to take time out of my day and waste police time to report that a delivery company did not deliver my parcel properly!! This is an absolute JOKE! Like the police don’t have more important things to deal with that a delivery company not doing their job! Amazon should be ashamed of themselves, and the police need to put a stop to this kind of nonsense, unless Amazon are going to donate some of their billion dollar revenue to the UK police force 🤬. I will be taking my business elsewhere they clearly don’t care as long as they get your money!",18.0,221,1.0,0.0,32.47896803140774,Low Trust
julie silva,US,1.0,"0 stars is more like it..  so for what ever reason using prime a picture frame takes 6 days to get to my home state then re-routes itself clear across the United States.  I call Amazon and speak to some dip ship out of the US/ COUNTRY only for the idiot to issue a refund and not credit back my 10.00 credit!   CUSTOMER SERVICE AT AMAZON IS PURE GARBAGE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! I WANT THE FRAME AMAZON, THATS WHY I F-ING ORDERED IT.AMAZONS CUSTOMER SERVICE SUCKS!!  MAYBE BALDLY SHOULD CONCENTRATE MORE ON CUSTOMER SERVICE THEN HIS F-ING ROCKETSHIPS!!!!",3.0,95,1.0,0.0,31.06561974200785,Low Trust
Lindsay Lee,CA,1.0,"4 of my orders not being shipped!!. I paid for them 9 days ago! Can’t cancel them because they say “shipping now” for like 2 days!!!!!!! Keep calling to see what’s happened and the staff keep telling me stuff that pops into their head, one was “item is delayed in transit to facility” another one was “your payment was cancelled” another one was “delayed because one item was slow” what’s next? A dinosaur ate my packages????!!!  I purchased them 9 days ago!! They all say “shipping now”lol, this is insane!! One of them was supposed to be delivered yesterday and it wasn’t and I can’t cancel the order because it says “shipping now” what a load of BS! NONE OF MY ORDERS THAT I PAID FOR 9 DAYS AGO ARE BEING SHIPPED!!  UPDATE***** orders are suppose to arrive today (Dec 9th) , and it still has NOT been shipped out!!!! This is crazy!! I can’t even cancel them!!!!!! Amazon figured out a loophole how to keep your money and not ship the orders!! They mark them as “shipping now” so you can’t cancel them and they don’t have to ship them out and your stuck in a loop with no product and they have your money!!",6.0,206,1.0,0.0,32.310712282669655,Low Trust
Katy,GB,1.0,"This company does not look at good workers, the whole company employs people who only look out for their friends.  People who are hard workers are sacked within 2 weeks so their friends and family can grab these jobs. It's a joke when in this pandemic people are trying to make ends meet.  The warnings aren't even based on their policies or strategies!!!!! Do not work for this company its a joke, all the supervisors and teamleaders are out to get you so they can employ their friends and family!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Who don't speak English,  it's a JOKE!!!!!!",32.0,97,1.0,0.0,31.088053841839596,Low Trust
Roger,US,1.0,"Defective John Deere Kids, riding tractor from Peg prego. Amazon did nothing to solve my problem and made my life much harder!!!They don’t care they sell defective items or care about us as people!!!The defective construction in the drive shaft makes the chain come off when the kid is sitting on it. The chain is too short to reach the next access point.At the same time, there is too much slack in the chain so when the kid sits on the defective john deere tractor. The chain slips off!The part Peg Pegro provided does not fix the problem! The issue is where the pedals are where the crankshaft goes in and where the softer metal and the plastic hold onto the frame. The metal is too soft where it is attached to the plastic. It is low quality and cheaply made.We have driven it to Cahaba Cycles 3 different times. Paid them for their service.The positive is after 5 months of paying to get it fixed the local bike shop. Calling Amazon and the manufacture. Peg Prego did the right thing and refund our money!!!We gave this present to my son for his third birthday party. My mother was in the hospital and passed away two weeks after my child’s birthday. I after burying my mother and getting back on my feet. I reached out to Amazon to help us with the issue.  They told us sorry it’s been 30 days nothing we can do!They basically said pound sand!I asked for a supervisor, and they wouldn’t give me one and said that the supervisor will tell you the same thing!!!!Amazon doesn’t care about us, the customer! They only care about profits!!!!I never will buy anything from Amazon again, even if it saves me money or I have to do without!!!!I try every week to get my wife to quit spending money on Amazon and will never stop!!!!!",1.0,317,1.0,0.0,33.555804823331464,Low Trust
Laurie Wienholz,US,1.0,"I use to LOVE this app! I even got a Amazon store card because I loved them so much! But then out of nowhere they blocked me from leaving any reviews at all! I didn’t do anything wrong! I left honest reviews because I myself rely on most reviews from stores. And I can usually spot the fake ones. I asked them why and they tried accusing me of getting free products for reviews. What the??? Really???? I tried to fight it and lost! Even though they had no proof that I ever did such a thing. Whatever. I didn’t care. Then later on, just a few months ago, I made a payment of over $200 which paid off my store card. A month ago they shutdown my card without any notice!! I chatted with them to ask why. They said it was due to a non payment???? I even had proof of payment!!! It showed on the Amazon store card app itself!!!!!!! And they say they can’t see it??? I took a screenshot of that $230 payment on THEIR app and then one of my bank showing it and then disputed it! Later they said they see the payment but wouldn’t turn my card back on. Ok again. Whatever! Then just yesterday I received another email stating that they did not find the payment and now I have to pay that AGAIN!!! I am beyond angry at this point! I live on a set budget. I can’t afford to throw away another $230!!! I had all the proof I needed to prove I paid it! And they want to say that it’s not enough???? Well guess what? Now I hate this store and refuse to do anymore business with them. And I am going to dispute this AGAIN! Idc how many times I have to fight it. The proof is all right there and they are just trying to rip me off. I would of NEVER thought that such a huge company would ever do this to a customer who has been loyal for years and has spent thousands!! It’s not cool to do this to honest people! Especially when I had enough proof to back it up. And trying to talk to customer service is a joke! They have made me cry so many times from the way they treated me! They are very rude and act like I am a lying criminal. I am far from that! Needless to say I am walking away from this place even though it is my favorite place to shop. I can’t continue to give a company my money when they treat me like this. It’s just not fair!",11.0,448,1.0,0.0,35.02523836231071,Low Trust
Philip Petre,GB,1.0,"Trying to watch a movie, constant glitches! Tried to contact through on line app contact, useless!!! Just says call connected? Connected to who????? Then call the main number, after failing to get any sort of message that actually gets me to speak to anyone!! Then bounced about and have to re explain the issue???? Thats an hour I will never get back!!! Then the line goes dead??? Amazon may want to consider its customers are its business!!! Absolutely useless service by totally inept, so called customer services!!!! How about the business and Mr Bezos, use some of their profits to actually deliver what they say they deliver!!!! Half wits at the very best!!! If amazin wasn't the size it is, then as a start up, they would disappear very quickly!!! Deliver amazon and invest in adequate resources to provide the service, we, the customer, pay for!!!!!",9.0,146,1.0,0.0,31.63768928771733,Low Trust
Deanna Falcon,US,1.0,"I ordered a smart Tv and it came defective so I contacted Amazon and got a replacement. And it worked  great…  I filled out the information needed for someone to come pic up the defective tv. They sent me an email from pilot that said someone will  be at my house THURSDAY MAY 26,2022 between 3-6 pm And said an adult needed to be present, so I left work early to make sure I Would be home, no one showed up or called, I thought maybe they were running late so I waited till 9 pm After 9:00 pm I chatted with Amazon and he said he had to transfer the chat to the concern department, I waited in the chat room for 50 mins no one ever came on. I  decided to call while I still had the chat open and that was faster. I explained what was going on to the lady and she did a 3 way call and got in touch with someone from pilot and they said they see the appointment that was scheduled and they didn’t know why no one showed up. so she  gave me the tracking number and the phone number and told me to call on Friday morning May 27th she said they open at 8:00 am.FRIDAY MAY 27th I  called at 8:00 am and at  8:40  Still No one answered the phone. I stayed on 40 minutes waiting for someone to answer. I had to leave for work but I seen they had an email address so I emailed them explain everything and they never got back with me. SATURDAY MAY 28th I contacted Amazon again he transfer me to bulky items, A lady came on and  I explained everything again, well she fell asleep on me. I said can you hear me??? She came to and started talking but then fell asleep again.. I could hear her snoring then she hung up or the phone was  Disconnected, so I called back AGAIN!!!! this time I got through to someone that got me back in touch with pilot. I explained everything, she said she also seen that they were supposed to pick it up and that she would have someone contact me on Tuesday May 31st because Monday was a holiday.. well I made sure to answer every call on Tuesday TUESDAY MAY 31st NO ONE has contacted me. This is crazy…  I  have made countless calls, I’ve chatted, I have emailed, I left work early, I have waisted so many Hours And I have still not gotten through to anyone so I contacted Amazon again Tuesday night I did the chat I explained everything just like I did here and she transferred to someone else. He said In this case I will escalate the issue to the concern department and ask them to disarm the return label created for this orderSo that I won’t  get charged again And I can keep o donate the item. WEDNESDAY JUNE 1, 2022I got an email that says contact Amazon Again to give more details… i emailed back to see what details they need. Then I got another Email that said they scheduled someone to pick up again. But did not give me a date or a time but that someone over 18 needs to be present. But I have no date or time set to make sure someone is here..!!!FRIDAY JUNE 3rdI finally called corporate (206) 266-1000to see if I can get to the bottom of this well they contacted pilot and told me pilot would call me that day to set up a pick up.. I told the lady ok I already know that they are not gonna call I have been dealing with this the past week so what do I do if that don’t call and told me she would call me on Sunday to see if they called.  I was glad to hear that because I done had to explain this situation to so many people already.SUNDAY JUNE 5thIt is 9:45 Pm and….NO ONE CALLED FROM AMAZON OR PILOT! I emailed this to  jeff@amazon begging and pleading for someone To call me to explain what the hell is going on?????? The T.v has been sitting on my living room floor for 2 weeks now. I am so upset.THIS IS ABSOLUTELY RIDICULOUS.. MONDAY JUNE 6th Contacted Amazon chat  told them send me to the highest person they can get me to. He got back and said he sent info to someone and they gonna contact me in 48 hours and ended chat…….  I just got a email for me to contact the company again that dIdn’t show up, answer my calls, emails or call me when they supposed to!!! Still currently emailing back and forth now they saying I need to contact UPS to come get it!! THIS IS INSANE This is seriously consuming my life. I keep my phone by me at all times answering  spam call after spam call…. Hoping it’s Amazon or pilot!!!!!!  And guess what I AM STILL DEALING WITH THIS!!!!!!!   😡VERY PISSED OFF CUSTOMER😡AND THIS ISSUE IS STILL NOT RESOLVED!!!",6.0,856,1.0,0.0,39.60179472798654,Low Trust
Anthony,GB,1.0,"Suffered a very bad experience over the xmas period. Because they were offering delivery on New Years eve, I thought, why not? There are lots of people, probably, who don't celebrate New Year! So I make an order which includes, LEMSIP. So first of all, I sit for four hours waiting for a delivery which failed to arrive because the driver couldn't find me! All the others do, but this one didn't! And not to rub salt into the wounds, I later discovered they hadn't included the one six pack of LEMSIP! I had, (still have) got a cold of sorts) and now I discover I'm listed on Amazon as someone vulnerable, and likely to OD on LEMSIP!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Well thankyou Amazon, you've excelled yourselves !!!! And lastly please pass on my best wishes to the driver who turned out to be someone with less brain than a newt!!! I hope the party he or she attended instead of completing his or her job, was worth leaving a 76 year old someone, in great discomfort at New Year! Well done!! It will be a story to tell your grandkids, if ever you discover how to have them, of course! Amazon, you really must start vetting these casual drivers you take on, they are not doing your reputation any good at all!!!",55.0,220,1.0,0.0,32.46775098149187,Low Trust
Melissa Rivera,US,1.0,"I didn’t get not 1 or 2 but FIVE PACKAGES said they delivered but instead of this they never arrived in my door!!!!!! Neither my email!!!! This is so unprofessional from then, I called them twice today and they just said they cant refund me so who has my packages them????????!!!Who is stealing my packages???????!!!!Not money not packages , waiting for my son sweater and nothing!!!!! And the customer service hung up on me!!!! Seriously??? This unprofessional. “It’s only one Tear in the ocean, but the ocean wouldn’t be the same without that tear” you lost one customer !!!!!!",1.0,99,1.0,0.0,31.110487941671337,Low Trust
EisaP,GB,1.0,"Although I have been using AMAZON for over 10 years, I noticed lately that their delivery service has detreated beyond imagination. Not only the drivers will drop the parcel at the door without even considering ringing the door-bell (if the parcel is to large to go through the letter-box) regardless to the weather condition. They use to be careful about delivering the parcels but no anymore!! It could be a result of work pressure and delivery quota per driver. Our house is located on the corner of two roads with a front garden leading to the front door via our drive. Last Friday 02nd Feb we were expecting a delivery of a new air-fryer as notified by AMAZON. We were sitting watching TV at lounge which by the front door at around four o'clock in the afternoon when I received an e-mail  from AMAZON stating the the package was delivered and left by the front door (with a photo showing that), so immediately we open the door but found nothing!!!! We looked everywhere around the house in case the driver decided to hide the package but there was nothing!! It is unusal for our neighbours to pick anything from the front of our door unless we were on a holiday and have requested them to do so! Our neighbourhood where we live, is very safe and never encountered nor heard of any theft! Furthermore, It needed someone there and ready for the delivery to be dropped so that he/she swiftly grab  it and run with it which is remotely to happen. Unless, the driver took the photo and picked it up again and took it. No one would've  suspected that action as it would look as if he was returning the item back to the van!! Even if we caught him doing it, he could easily say I didn't want to leave it at the door!!  Both our cars where there on the drive and our door-bell is working!!!!!!! So, we called AMAZON who initially integrated us asking if we are sure is not there, or with neighbours ..etc before telling us that we need to wait 72 hours before we can report it undelivered. So, we waited until Monday 05th and we requested a call-back where we discussed the issue!! Regrettably, the customer-service agent who was based in Ireland could not get through to the correct department who could resolve the issue and told us that she will leave a message on the system for them to call us back and assured us that the case will be resolved. No call was received so today (Tue 06th) once again requested a call back and we spoken to another agent based in Ireland who passed us to another colleague (sounded as if based in India) and who also passed us to another of his colleagues there who told us that they 72 hours  to investigate the matter and we have to wait!! Besides being frustrated with this matter, we feel as if we were accused of false claim!!!   Shameful that AMAZON treats customers like this!!!   .",4.0,516,1.0,0.0,35.787997756590016,Low Trust
Vicky Carney,GB,1.0,"Amazon left a cripple stranded with no food and no money and nobody to assist!!!I placed an order through Amazon with Morrisons. My husband went away on business, so I am on crutches alone. Naturally I thought it would be more reliable to order through Amazon but I was wrong!!!I waited close to the door without the tv on so I could hear a knock. Then I received a message saying that my order couldn’t be delivered due to access! Which absolute nonsense! Amazon deliver all the time! There was no knock and nobody phoned me. I tried to call the driver but it wouldn’t go through! I then called your call centre and was left in a queue for 40 minutes. I then explained the issue in a chat and was passed three times and left stranded with nobody to help me!!!I applied for a refund but it’s going to take 3 days!!! So in summary Amazon didn’t help me!! They with Morrisons left me without food and money because I can’t get my refund straight away!!! They also didn’t bother to help sort it out!!Absolutely unacceptable!!!!",7.0,188,1.0,0.0,32.10880538418396,Low Trust
Andy Tavenner,US,1.0,What has happened to Amazon?????!!!!! Absolutely incompetent!!! They can't find an air force base????? In the US!!!! They failed after 3 attempts!!! Map shows them stopping and turning around.  Maybe they don't our troops!!!!!!!!!!! Customer service is a joke....logistics is even worse!!! Talked to 3 serpervisors who don't know anything. Canceling everything.,1.0,52,1.0,0.0,30.583286595625346,Low Trust
Tina Brackens,US,1.0,"I wouldn't give one star but only way to get a review in.  I had a charge on my CC that I didn't purchase.  I called Amazon, he told me it was not on my account, and he could see it on another account, they used my CC.  I said, great you see that... he said but theres nothing I can do for you.  WHAT??? He said unless I could give the security credentials on that other account, he couldn't do anything!!!!!!  I had to call my bank and cancel my card, wait 2 weeks for another card, and dispute the fraud charge!!!!!!!  So Amazon protects the THEIVES!!!!!!!!!!  You have no rights, only the criminals!!!!!!!! I WILL NOT USE AGAIN.... EVER!!!!!!!",1.0,121,1.0,0.0,31.357263039820527,Low Trust
Megan Mericle,US,1.0,"So I used to be in love with Amazon. I was one of those people who ordered from there like every other day. But not anymore! After spending THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS AND THOUSANDS OF HOURS on Amazon I think I will finally be cancelling my Prime membership. This past week, after finally having time to finish furnishing my apartment after working 14+ hours every day at the hospital (thanks COVID) Amazon screwed up MAJORLY four different times in 48 hours. I will admit that somehow (not convinced this wasn't their fault either) my old address ended up on 4 different orders. So like the responsibile person I am, I tried cancelling the orders first, then I immediately contacted Amazon. I was ASSURED this would be taken care of no problem. I could cancel the one order that was PRIME 24 Hour delivery as SOON as it was assigned to a driver and the rep would take care of the rest. I trusted her so I placed the orders for the correct address. I was able to cancel the one the next morning and she did take care of one. However, one of the the orders from an outside vendors did not cancel and I was contacted and told they would not cancel it nor change it and the rep just out on the request CANCEL, not even the reason! Like what the hell! Now it was too late because FedEx has it. So I am now out of $170. GREAT! Mistake #1. That night I get home from work expecting 2 of my packages.... NOTHING! Ok.... I pull up the GPS. Driver says I'm next and is RIGHT BY MY APT! Yay! Then I notice the driver is driving AWAY FROM MY APT?!?! WHY?!?! Why is the driver driving towards my old place!?!?! I contact Amazon AGAIN they give me the bogus answer of, ""Oh he has a couple of more stops then you..."" Listen Linda, in my last life I was a dispatcher don't pull that bs with me try again! Then I get ""It's after 8pm they can't deliver this late it will have to wait until tomorrow sorry."" WTheck! Mistake #2 So tomorrow is here. I get notice that another package is delivered. So when I get home I grab it, and I open it up. I had ordered the emancipation newspaper article clipping on canvas.... When I opened my package up it was A DEER SCENE IN SNOW ON CANVAS WTheck!!!!! HOW DO YOU MESS THAT UP!?!?! That's mistake#3! Then I check on my other package that was supposed to have been delivered today.... NOT EVEN ENROUTE!!!! #4! I contact customer service.... They promptly end the chat on me without notice and I have to wait for someone else!!! #5! When I finally get a supervisor, they only thing they can do is issue me a refund in the form of a gift card which will take two hours so I can reorder my stuff ... NOT GOOD ENOUGH!!!! Refund my credit card and I WILL TAKE MY MONEY ELSEWHERE (Which I did! Ebay had everything cheaper and of better quality. I just have to wait a little longer for it which is fine at least I know I'll get it!) I'm so DONE AND OVER AMAZON! THEY HAVE FOREVER LOST MY BUSINESS!!!!!!",2.0,557,1.0,0.0,36.24789680314077,Low Trust
Shanda Reynolds,US,1.0,"I use to love ordering from Amazon but my last 2 orders were NEVER DELIVERED!!! I see that one of my items was delivered to someone in New Jersey and I live in Denver Colorado. For 2 months now I have been trying to get assistance from customer service and NOTHING!!! No response and NO REFUND!!!! I am so irritated that these people took my money and just said SCREW ME!!! Well NEVER AGAIN, they will never have another chance to steal from me!!!! WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE EVER!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",1.0,88,1.0,0.0,30.987100392596744,Low Trust
Michelle Phenix,US,5.0,"AMAZON IS MY MONTHLY STOP FOR ANYTHING AND EVERYTHING!   My kindle books, my groceries, even jewelry!!!!!    I LOVE AMAZON!!!   Reliable,  great prices and shipping!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",2.0,24,1.0,0.0,150.26920919798093,High Trust
T. V.,CA,1.0,"I decided to share my experience in dealing with Amazon, especially it’s negative flows. 1. There is no transparency from some vendors, especially from China, about return policy and shipping. I had to deal a few times with situations when the company claims their merchandise is refundable, but in fact they want you to pay for the return out of your own pocket! This is SCAM!! 2. Encountered problems with ordering dog’s treats and supplements. Dog treats were extremely dry and old! The supplements came EXPIRED and total ignore from the company to my complains and no refund!! 😡😡 “No refund on pets supplements “ message was only was provided when I tried to return it. THIS IS ALSO SCAM!!! 😡😡3. Like probably for many other people, I find that some prices are much higher than in stores for identical products! 4. I’m sick and tired to see unreasonably high “delivery” fees added to the price tag! This is again especially true for the Chinese vendors. 5. I find it that delivery home, here in Toronto, is disgusting!! Our camera captured a few time like delivery men toss the packages to the ground instead of carefully placing it. Noteworthy to mention how they take the pictures when they leave the package near your door. Once they sent my son a picture of a completely wrong package with a computer keyboard. The picture captured square type of box, where the keyboard no way could have even fit it. The actual package has NEVER arrived!! Once in Toronto a delivery man text me that he couldn’t find my address (😱🙄) and gave me only 5 min to respond back. They obviously don’t think and don’t care, that a person may not see a text within 5 min or be unavailable. I got a feeling he even didn’t try to delivered as it was a day after some minor snowfall! For delivery they ask for any “special instructions”; mine was “please ALWAYS ring the bell!” No, they don’t bother and don’t care that thefts are not only possible, but are very common now! 6. The worse thing of all, that if you encounter any problem, there is no one to contact to resolve an issue immediately or even EVER!! This company obviously DOES NOT CARE about customers satisfaction!!! They are blinded by all the money they get from us, yet treat people without any due respect!! 7. Amazon encounters very serious PROBLEMS SECURING CUSTOMERS’ PERSONAL INFORMATION and this is a NO-NO!! 😡😡🙏I AM EXTREMELY DISAPPOINTED with many business and customer service aspects of this company and will STOP or drastically REDUCE my dealing to the necessary minimum! I will support a small, hard-working guy, who appreciates my business!! ",7.0,455,1.0,0.0,35.10375771172182,Low Trust
Cassidy C,US,1.0,"I’m so disappointed in Amazon these days. I have been a prime member for 5+ years & have never had to call customer until the past year. Now I am on the phone with customer service  every week. I have been receiving broken items, items that do not fit description, wrong items, about to get charged twice for something I never tried to return. Why would I even be charged twice in the first place? SHADY!!!!!!!!!!!!! All the 3rd parties they are allowing without any check, might as well be on eBay. I received the wrong colors on items. I bought food pouches for my toddler and they were in a random box (not the company box) and the box wasn’t taped all around it was flipped in on sides as if I was packaging it without tape available! I have so many items that are broken. I bought k-cups that were sticked once I received them that they were re-packaged by Amazon, yet it was still the company’s box.... the k cups are bad! They have clumps of stuff. When you shake a k cup you should hear loose coffee grounds not thumps! I recently bought an item that I paid one amount for when I placed the order, I got confirmation email with same price but now the price has changed. I was told should have returned them if I didn’t like the price change. I was supposed to pay $7 and got charged $29... it’s the companies fault not mine, give me my refund I would have never purchased them at that price! I ordered a helmet/bike pad set for my daughter and the gloves on have 4 finger holes in each hand! I don’t know where everyone else lives but where I’m from we have 5 fingers on each hand. They then expected me to to out of my way to return it, even though it was a damaged product! The other bike helmet/pads set was supposed to be pink and white and I received all black...... I wrote a review on one (unicorn light) item I purchased  because the picture was COMPLETELY misleading. They sent me a new one and gave me a refund. But the new one was just as bad & was even chipped! They asked me to remove my review since they replaced & refunded me. I did. But feel bad no one should pay that price for the item. So I plan on going back to re-review bad! Another company emailed me, asking for me to return my product because I discount code was not supposed to go out and if I don’t return the company will go bankrupt... really!? How is that even right!? I seriously could go on and on about the disappointments In the quality of items, the package/delivery, refund policy, customer service. Again, until a year or less I have never had issues with amazon, but after THIS many in such a short amount of time. I’m done! What frustrates me the most is I PAY for this service every year!!!! I’m cancelling my membership and sticking to Target where I always get 5% and don’t pay anything annually! I suggest that to everyone now. I used to say that about Amazon but I will no longer recommend them to anyone. I hope I’m alone in all this mess because I would hate for someone else to go through all this, but from reading some of the reviews seems MANY people are unhappy and Amazon doesn’t care. So hopefully one by one they lose their customers and to bankrupt because they opened all these facilities thinking they were great, which they were til then, now they are awful and I hope they have to start shutting down places all over or get their stuff straight so people can stop having to go through all this!",1.0,648,1.0,0.0,37.26864834548513,Low Trust
Denise Turvey,GB,1.0,"UNBELIEVABLE, AMAZON STOP USING DPD AS A DELIVERY SERVICE, THEY DO NOT DELIVER, ON MORE THAN ONE OCCASION ORDERS PLACED, DPD STATE ""UNABLE TO GAIN ACCCESS DELIVER"" WHEN THERE IS NO PROBLEM AT ALL FOR ACCESS, THEN EVEN THOUGH I CLEARLY STATE DELIVERY ONLY UNTIL 4-30PM IF AFTER LEAVE AT MY NEIGHBOUR THE DELIVERY IS ATTEMPTED AFTER 5.00PM, AND NOT LEFT WITH MY NEIGHBOUR !!!!!!!!!!! AFTER PATIENTLY WAITING THE NEXT DAY I SEE THAT I AM THE NEXT TO BE DELIVERED BUT NOOOOOOOOOO YET AGAIN THE DPD EXCUSE ""NOT ABLE TO GAIN ACCESS FOR DELIVERY"" THIS IS JUST TO FRUSTRATING, COMPLETE AND UTTER LIE, I CANCELLED MY ORDER AND REFUNSE TO PURCHASE ANYTHIN AGAIN FROM AMAZON !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",7.0,117,1.0,0.0,31.312394840157037,Low Trust
Monty,US,1.0,I declined a free Amazon Prime Account and Amazon charged me anyway. When I tried to fix it they charged me again. The also edited my cart and left my warranty on my product off. if you need a warranty on a item it is probably not very good to begin with. I do not reccomend buying from Amazon because of this unethical behavior. They also charged me a 20 % restocking fee on a defective computer they sold me. it was a defect. They will cheat you Do not buy from them !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!,2.0,94,1.0,0.0,31.05440269209198,Low Trust
