Julie Reno,US,1.0,"ONCE AGAIN, THEY ATTEMPTED TO DELIVER MY ORDER AFTER 4PM. TIME IS CLEARLY STATED ON MY ACCOUNT, IN MY DELIVERY INSTRUCTIONS. I HAVE CALLED REPEATEDLY, CHATTED REPEATEDLY, AND STILL THEY CANNOT GET IT RIGHT!!!!!!!!!!!!!! THIS IS THE 10TH ORDER THAT I HAVE HAD ISSUES GETTING WITHIN MY TIMEFRAME. ALL THEY WANT TO OFFER ME IS A LOUSY $5 FOR MY INCONVENIENCE. I AM CANCELLING MY PRIME MEMBERSHIP!!!!!!!!!!!",3.0,67,0.9999999999999993,6.661338147750939e-16,30.751542344363465,Low Trust
Danning Li,US,1.0,"They deleted my address  and my bank card for no reason. I waited for five days for the item to arrived my house, but I wanna return it. However, when I checked my order, they said there is no order placed in half a year. I called the customer service center and they said there was an unauthorized action happened to my account, but they could not explain what action it was. There is no message or phone call!!!!!!! They removed my address and my bank card without my permission!!!!!!I need to wait for two days for them to add my new address and my card to my account!!!! I need to wait until Monday to return my item and the person will only pick it up on Tuesday!!!!!The customer experience is like a sh...it!!!",1.0,135,0.9999999999999978,2.220446049250313e-15,31.514301738642846,Low Trust
felicia lamb,US,1.0,Amazon I’m beyond disappointed in you as an entire corporation! I was a member for over 13yrs! And I purchased a lot from your website! And of course with the pandemic my shopping habits picked up even more so. since I don’t get out much! Back in early spring I purchased an Apple Watch series 6 I believe I can’t recall right now. but I was sent the wrong series so immediately I contacted them and was told I would’ve to wait for a return approval since it was an apple product. well I waited and waited so I chatted online again with them and even called and I was told that the return label will be sent to my email! Tell me why Amazon kept the new watch and my money talking about I returned the wrong series even though they sent me the wrong series & were informed of this! I have screenshots of the conversations! But I have all intentions on taking them to small claims! They closed out my account because I was upset by the services I received so I simple printed off return labels of the last 14-20 days of purchases and they closed my account talking about “abuse of return” or “excessive returning” even though I didn’t even return the items that I printed off! They are crazy and I bet they sells dropped when I left because I was cashing in big time!!! but I’m actually happy that I don’t have to deal with them! I got tired of receiving broken items and packages getting lost in UPS system even delivered my package to my neighbors homes on a few occasions! Just poor services now I’m on to bigger and better things! but my point of my review is Yall need to be careful with Amazon they will send you the wrong item and pretend like You didn’t tell them what was going on before sending it back and they claim they have the right to keep your money and your return! And these scamming askes keep closing out my daughter account thinking it’s me! Even though we have different birthdates and phone numbers and IP addresses and email address!  And why would they say I can open a new account if they keep closing my daughter account? unless it’s a coincidence. I don’t want her dealing with them anyways. Oh yeah I tried to report them to the bbb for what they had pulled they lied and said they reason why my account was closed was because I was using used gift cards?! How is that even possible!? Never had I ever had a Amazon gift card before! The lady sounded dumb and lost! They are crazy if they think I’m going to let them get away with $750.00 dollars! It was the way they did it for me. Just unprofessional as ever!,1.0,482,0.9999999999999905,9.547918011776346e-15,35.40661805945084,Low Trust
Deborah Kearn,US,1.0,"I tried returning something; 1) Never rec'd the return information needed so I got stuck with the items even after contacting them several times! 2) Now I'm stuck w/items I Don't want, so I have to pay my bill via Amazon website which transfers U to Chase - beyond horrible!!!!!!!!! NEVER GET THE AMAZON VISA CARD/CHASE - YOU CAN DO MUCH BETTER REWARDS WISE & NOT HAVE TO JUMP THRU FLAMING HOOPS TO PAY UR DANG BILL!!!!!!!!!!!!!",2.0,77,0.999999999999986,1.3988810110276972e-14,30.86371284352285,Low Trust
Lur,GB,1.0,DO NOT BUY GIFT CARDS FROM AMAZON THEY ARE A SCAM!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!Brought a Amazon gift card for my daughter at WHS. Once I got home card had already been redeemed. Contacted Amazon 7 times and was told they would pay me back my money. Spoke to a manager he told me that is not Amazon policy. All emails I have from Amazon confirm that they would refund me my money back on my card. But Amazon basically LIED!!!! They told me to go back to WHS and they told me that Amazon have to get there fraud team involved. Called back Amazon they told me my gift card has already been used I have to report it to the police. And that I wont get my money back.Amazon is a  scam.. just like the people that set theses scams up. No justice!!!! THEY DONT DESERVE ANY RATINGS,2.0,146,0.9999999999999845,1.554312234475219e-14,31.637689287718107,Low Trust
Emre,TR,5.0,Review text not found,145.0,4,0.9999999999999827,1.7319479184152442e-14,150.04486819966436,High Trust
Taylor Scott,US,1.0,Amazon IS THE MOST HORRIBLE WEBSITE TO ORDER OR DO ANY BUSINESS WITH!!!! STAY AWAY!!!!! I have gender reveal coming up Saturday 4/4/2021 mind you I made a order for all my things on 3/23/2021 and paid and everything and it said it would be here Monday ...Monday comes no package no notification nothing so I try to log in and it tells my my account is locked for unusual activity 🧐🧐🧐 (buying baby reveal things are unusual) anyway I call to try to see what’s going on I get (and always get) some one from over seas that can’t articulate exactly what’s going on then once he realizes that I realize he doesn’t know what the hell he’s talking about then he goes to tell me well I’ve escalated up to the investigation team and it will take 24 - 48 hours for them to contact me 🙁🙁🙁🙁😳😳😳😳😤😤😤😤 MY REVEAL IS ON SATURDAY IF THERE NOT GOING TO CONTACT ME TIL WEDNESDAY OR THURSDAY THAT GIVES NO TIME TO GET MY SH$& HERE  !!!!!!!!😡🤬🤬🤬😡😡😡😡😡 most horrible experience ever in life and this is not the first time !!! Thanks Amazon!!! You single handedly f@$#%@ up a joyous occasion way to be there for your customers 👎🏿👎🏿👎🏿👎🏿👎🏿👎🏿👎🏿,1.0,207,0.999999999999982,1.7985612998927536e-14,32.32192933258643,Low Trust
Colin Fone,GB,1.0,"I ordered over £800 worth of items from amazon 30 + items on 18th January 2023 next day delivery, 4 items failed to turn up. Stayed in all day as did 4 of my house mates, no knock at door, had email confirmation to say items handed to resident !! Which was total lies by the driver.!!Amazon calling card stuck in between the 2 letter box flaps found the next morning. On the card there was no reference, no name, no item or order number, no driver details, no date,no time.. all it said was 'bin'. I went out side looked around bins and in bins and found no parcels !! Called Amazon customer services 30 + times now and 15 + emails for a refund of the items i paid for and not recieved, was told to report to my local police and get a crime reference number which i did, police were very helpful. Amazon say they tried calling the police but are put on hold and cannot contact police to verify the crime of supposedly stolen items( or failed delivery ) Amazon have told me to call the police to verify the crime reference, but the police won't reveal it to me over the phone as data protection and i am the victim, so god knows how amazon think how they will get my data !! So basically going round in circles day after day calling and emailing them like am at a circus talking to clowns at customer service. I called them this morning and chatted twice to customer service and they must have a note on my file to hang up as all 3 times i was cut off lol i wasn't rude in any way either!! I replied to some emails from last week which are just generic emails to explain again whats just happened and no response whats so ever... ( to be expected i guess ).Amazon biggest retailer in the world how professional of them!! I've twice sent emails to mangement and complaints processing which are advertised on amazon websites only to find my emails bounce back to me as emails don't exist lol its the same great help you get on the drop down menus on your account!!! Waste of time !!! So now am looking at financial ombudsman to complain to and then small claims court. When this is eventually resolved from these day light legal robbers i will close my account and use 'very company' and my old faithful 'Ebay' I'd advise everyone to boycott this uncaring , unprofessional company, bad customer service who use lying delivery drivers and on top of all that it would be nice when you call customer service and spoken to that they would be able to understand you and you could understand them !!!! Does anyone else have that problem of poor communication ? stick to honest reliable company's that you know. I rest my case. Good luck all and good to read all of your reviews, wish I'd read them before signing up to Amazon the clown outfit from rip off England.!!",7.0,520,0.9999999999999747,2.531308496145357e-14,35.83286595625477,Low Trust
Thomas Jamlson,US,1.0,"I am still so upset by this company, I purchased a hydraulic ram from them, when it came to me it was in a box with no inside packaging, the very heavy ram did a number on the box, but it looked ok, after reading the directions I did just what it said to do, the ram plunger did not lift, so it said to check the oil level I did and had almost no oil in it, had to go to a store and buy oil, filled to the proper line tried to lift the rams plunger and did not lift, called amazon and they said return the item and had ups come and pick it up, I put the ram back in the box they sent it in and added the packaging filler they never put in it, I later found out they charged me for the return shipping, I called and asked for my shipping money back the more or less said they did not recieve it in the same shape as I got it, I didn't ship the item they did, if you know what a hydraulic ram it would be almost impossible to destroy its all heavy metal, I did not do anything to there item except what I tried, what a nasty company, the manager would not send me a picture of it, or describe what was wrong, don't ever buy from this terrible company, Trying to say I did something to there item, big time con artist, don't deal with these people  ""AMAZON""!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",1.0,260,0.9999999999999722,2.7755575615628914e-14,32.91643297812814,Low Trust
JOSIPA ERENT,CA,1.0,"I used to enjoy shopping with Amazon until they started apply restocking fees. The reality is that not all products are created equal or with high quality.  Not all products listed on Amazon have accurate product descriptions.  Not all products have responsive  resellers, manufacturers who care about customers.. We are talking about  restocking fees of approximately  20% plus. value of Product.   BUY WITH CAUTION. Better yet, shop at your local retail store to avoid restocking fees. BAD CORPORATE MOVE AMAZON!!! Where is the transparency to our PRIME  Amazon members? NON EXISTENT. Shame on your Amazon!! Shame on You!!! I will keep my products rather than pay ridiculous excessive restocking fees!!! I will think twice about buying something using Amazon!!! I will think twice about giving company reviews and I can assure you they will be MORE NEGATIVE if the product is substandard.. It is NOT MY JOB Amazon to answer questions regarding products making money on you website..Its time for you and the manufacturer to practice REAL CUSTOMER SERVICE and answer questions that clearly the manufacturer should answer and does NOT ANSWER!!! I AM ONE UPSET AMAZON MEMBER TODAY!! NO MORE CONTACT REGARDING PRODUCT REVIEWS!!!",22.0,195,0.99999999999995,4.9960036108132044e-14,32.18732473359756,Low Trust
Daniel Bowman,GB,1.0,"I’m sick and tired of Amazon and their appalling delivery and customer service!!!Why oh why are amazon delivery drivers so incompetent. I had a delivery scheduled for this evening. Also my mom had one too and she lives at the same address.  I watched the tracking and saw the driver was approaching my address, then got an email saying a problem had occurred and I wouldn’t be getting my delivery.Moms parcel was delivered to the wrong house!!! next door and mine not at all.Amazon customer service don’t make it easy to find and contact on there website but having found the chat facility I received the same old response and platitudes that I have received many times before THEY JUST DONT LEARN OR AT LEAST DONT WANT TO!!!! We can’t cancel your order until after midnight!!! You’ll have to contact us again!!!! Just ridiculous that a company who keep pushing for me to join their PRIME service! Why on earth would I want to pay more money for appalling customer service!!!!",13.0,171,0.9999999999999365,6.350475700855895e-14,31.918115535617307,Low Trust
Sonata Bella,CA,1.0,Signed in in appMade purchase ! Shows that purchased was made. Purchase was going to mechanic for parts for our truck. Then what they did was took the money out of my visa debit card! Doesnt even now show on app that purchase was ever made !!! I verified as they requested it was me ! They can take out the money and have no problem taking your money! But cancel your order ! Refuse to show it in the app order was even done ! Called woman evasive cant answer ! Refuses to talk keeps muting when she cant answer questions almost 500 !!! They took ! And then they say systemCancelOrder thinking ita fraud ! So now its confirmed its not ! They still take money from bank acct ! Remove it in your app it was even purchased ! Amazin as someone else stated before woman just hangs up in their customer service! Amazon is the scammers !!!,1.0,161,0.9999999999999358,6.417089082333405e-14,31.80594503645862,Low Trust
