Sheri,US,1.0,"HOW DARE YOU TAKE DOWN THE PARLER APP! You are a corrupt company and I will NEVER PURCHASE ANOTHER PRODUCT FROM YOU AS LONG AS I LIVE! I cancelled my Prime Membership and will get rid of the three Fire-sticks I purchased. My family and I spent a lot of money on Amazon, but WON’T SPEND ANOTHER DIME!!!!SCREW YOU AMAZON!!!!! I hope many do the same because you are a disgusting company who NEVER should have done what you did. WE, AMERICAN PATRIOTS WILL NOT BE SILENCED REGARDLESS OF YOUR DISGUSTING BEHAVIOR! You will meet your maker one day... dress cool because it’s hot in HELL!!!! WE LOVE TRUMP! BEST PRESIDENT EVER!!!!!",7.0,112,0.9999999999999087,9.126033262418787e-14,31.256309590582237,Low Trust
Lea,US,1.0,"Amazon delivery service sucks! I honestly think the delivery drivers steal the packages. There is no way I’m supposed to believe they delivered my $150. Gaming headset to my door, while I was home, didn’t get a knock or anything but yet they claim they delivered it. Well it’s not here!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! So what they take a picture of the package at “a door” doesn’t mean they left the package at my door. That could have been for photo purposes alone. I don’t believe it!!!!!! How is this “ taking a picture to prove I delivered the package” even going to honestly prove anything? I mean, what ever happened to ringing the door bell? A bunch of thieves working for Amazon delivery.",1.0,121,0.9999999999999085,9.14823772291129e-14,31.3572630398251,Low Trust
meme,GB,1.0,"I do not trust AMAZON company anymore! they are holding my personal data after locking me out of my account for months. i asked them to remove my back card when i suspected suspicious activity and they put it back onto my account! when you phone up they know your phone number so this is then diverted to india and you have no hope of speaking with the relevant comlaints team. Anyone could be using your name and details to make fake purchases! if you have closed my account why is my personal information still remaining on your data and being used! this only happened because i called them out of what looked like fraudulent activity by sellers or whomever they are, I ordered and was sent items that would break or no longer work within a couple of weeks. when speaking to customers service they were asking for access to my computer!  when trying to get hold of the seller after purchasing an item, the shop would have been closed,  so you cannot contact them for refund or using a new name. as most sellers have two or three different shop names. I complained about this also complaint about the warranty which has been manipulated on most purchases example: upon purchasing an item when you read the description, i would always only purchase from amazon and fulfilled by amazon! and there would be a year or three year warranty, then upon returning to the site that would of been changed to one month or less than that! and a different seller name, not amazon! never purchase from third parties! or tried not too, when the item broke, I would then go back to the site only to find the listing that I bought, changed to some other shop which is now closed! so, you cannot contact anyone to get a refund! so the third party is changing the script to make it look like i am purchasing from amazon when in fact it is not! I called amazon out regarding this and they obviously are not happy! or the third parties that are mad because there scams have been exposed, then my email was harvested for a data breach , my mobile number was used in the usa and so on and so on, you cannot trust these people with your banking as someone from amazon went to collect monies from my bank account! and you cannot trust them with your personal data! their staff are untrustworthy! use with great caution! infact do not use try and find someone else to buy from! support your local businesses. I have now contacted amazon as to what they as a company is still using my personal data for, and what the information is they are holding of me to track my online presents. One is my mobile phone number, as they flagged the call and new it was me! unless this is a bunch of scammers in India !This needs to be removed! ASAP!",56.0,503,0.9999999999999005,9.947598300641403e-14,35.64217610768865,Low Trust
Joseph Barra,US,5.0,Lowest price on-line. Free shipping. Delivery within 24 hours. WOW!!!,3.0,10,0.9999999999998928,1.0724754417879012e-13,150.1121704991641,High Trust
Crissy,US,1.0,OVER AMAZON!! The delivery sucks! And so does customer service! Once again 3 of my packages were left on a strangers door step! I told them I seen the pic that is not my door! And I don’t want a welcome mat! They gave me refunds for 2 Items and not the 3rd! Telling me did I check with FAMILY MEMBERS!? How dumb is that a family member that doesn’t live with me received my package?? And for me to check with neighbors! First off call the delivery driver and tell him come back and check with neighbors! He’s the one that left my packages with them! So crazy then they told me I had do an incident report asking me the same questions I told them over the phone! I did about 10 of them because each time I inquired about my money back they would just email please do a incident report! I swear man!! I am over it! They need to stop hiring overseas they don’t understand they ask the same questions over and over you tell them over and over and they still don’t get it! It’s ridiculous!! They ask dumb questions that has nothing to do with why your calling! It’s been 3 days I still don’t have a refund or the missing package I ended up doing a claim with my bank sick of fighting with them!,1.0,233,0.9999999999998779,1.2212453270876722e-13,32.613572630404306,Low Trust
highmetalman,US,1.0,"First,  I'm going to say that I've been a Prime Member for almost 3 years now, and I've NEVER seen Amazon THIS horrible.  I adopt sick or injured animals,  and I have this amazing cat who has a fractured hip. I ordered 4 total items last week,  one item being a Adult cat hip and joint pain relief bottle.  Over the weekend,  I kept checking the ""package updates,"" like most of us do,  and everything was on schedule,  until Monday,  where it said that the hip and joint pain relief was ""Undeliverable."" (?????????!!!!!!!!!!!!!)Not sure what that even means.  Turns out, there was an amazon delivery driver that came to my house at almost 8 o'clock pm, on SUNDAY NIGHT.  I never recieved a call,  no knocking on the door,  doorbell,  package dropped off... NOTHING.  I just got off the phone with Amazon's so called ""customer service"" and spoke to a guy named Paul. After repeating myself so many times I got seriously pissed. Like,  it was bad... Then,  after I explained everything for the 63rd time,  I simply asked,  so what happened,  why was there a driver at my house but no knock,  no doorbell,  call,  nothing?  They've been to my house several times, no problem?  Okay, whatever.  He says,  sir,  I have no idea what happened or WHY they were even there. (BOOM!!! Mind... BLOWN!) I'm sorry? That's concerning.  But okay I want to hear more... (Keep in mind I'm now trying to find out if they have a ""undeliverable"" product,  why the HELL is someone at my house.... I mean right? Okay,  so then he says I'm sorry for everything,  I say okay cool,  so now what,  can you guys just send it back to me?  He says that he'll issue me a refund,  3 to five MORE business days,  THEN,  I.... (ME!!) Can then,  RE- ORDER the product.  Holy crap. I'm now ready to throw my phone.  After ALLLLLLLLLL that,  I'm okay,  sort of.  I'm raising my voice,  TELLING him that I don't have that time,  but he's horrible at talking to customers. Oh did I mention that every time I spoke,  even AFTER he asks me something,  he continuously interrupted me, saying,  ""Sir, sir, I'm TRYING to explain to you what happened."" Ohhhh, okay, you're trying to explain ""what happened"" but 'has no idea' why the driver was there with no product, or a undeliverable product. He says he'll check something.  Puts me on hold.  Okay fine..... I'm cussing like mad behind his back.  He didn't do this earlier?  Keep in mind,  this whole conversation was almost 35 minutes. (Gives you a time frame of me telling this 'as high of a position I could speak to at the time' guy sooo many times what happened and to just send it back to me,  him interrupting me,  and being put on hold SO FAR.)He comes back,  tells me that the driver said he was on the OPPOSITE SIDE OF MY ROAD. **Whoa!!! Wait, what?  Then where the f##k was he?? Holy God. Can't speak to anyone higher,  tell him how pissed off I am..  Then here's the kicker. Ready...........................?He then goes,  ""Sir, I understand you,  and since you want compensation,  I'll put an extra 10 bucks on your account,  in a gift card.""   You guys. This ass**** just insinuated that I was seeking compensation of 10 whole bucks.  My cat's medicine is 30 bucks.  Which,  I have to re-order myself AFTER I get the refund, then order,  then wait,  the whole process again.  Wow. I tell this guy that I don't care about his 10 dollar 'I'm sorry I suck at my job, please don't do nuthin else' bribe, but Jesus.... I just told him to just issue the refund and I'll be talking to someone tomorrow.  Am I wrong here?  Can't listen,  interrupts continuously, says you're looking for compensation, when you've never said that,  driver is across the street or something, (Which is nothing but country sticks anyway)  doesn't know why,  now YOU have to reorder yourself, do the whole WAIT process,  all for what?  Some guy that is disrespectful, unprofessional,  totally the wrong type of guy you want in customer service. Sorry Amazon, you guys failed humanity with this one.",1.0,706,0.9999999999997595,2.404743071338089e-13,37.91923724061774,Low Trust
