Jana Bellanca Shubat,US,1.0,"Amazon is the worst excuse for a billion dollar company on the face of the earth!! I’ve been a good customer for over 18 years. I spent the last 3 days getting the run around from department to department, chatted with numerous people and was told to send in an email with my issue. Everyone assured me that the problem was either fixed or would be fixed yet nothing was done!!! No one on that whole company knew how to fix the fact that my checking account that is linked as a payment method for 18 years with plenty of funds keeps getting declined!! My bank has no issues yet they can’t figure out why! After 3 days they come up with the fact that I have to change my method of payment!!!! I’m furious!! I wish that there wasAnother company who could take over! 3 days of total frustration!!! #Amazonsucks!!!",2.0,151,0.9999999999992062,7.938094626069869e-13,31.693774537336378,Low Trust
