LA Lid,US,1.0,"Placed an order. Amazon said it was delivered; however, it was delivered to an unknown address. I did receive a refund. Ordered the same item the next day. Two days later my delivery status indicated my item was delivered to a ""safe place"". I'm not even sure what that means! I did not receive my delivery. I contacted Amazon who strongly pressured me into waiting two more days to see if my delivery would arrive. YOU GOT TO BE KIDDING ME! So much for Prime delivery!!!! I can't take it anymore!!! After about 30 minutes of being extremely frustrated, I was finally issued a refund. Definately shopping elsewhere more and more often! Amazon isn't the king anymore!!!!!!  Zero stars!!!!!",5.0,119,0.9999999999988556,1.1444178937836114e-12,31.334828940046002,Low Trust
