Angeline de Cuba,CW,1.0,"I am very unsatisfied with Amazon! They withheld my gift card for an amount of $ 2475.00. As it first it was a third party payment (daa a gift is a third party payment) and second could identify the person behind the gift card, and third is not according their terms and conditions. Moreover, I received am email from Amazon specialist and says as follow:Fri, Apr 2, 12:39 AMto meHello,For your security, we canceled the following orders since we could not confirm your information:-- Order number: 113-3950756-4914630   -- Items in order: WirelessWe are sorry for any inconvenience this has caused. If you still want the items, you will need to place a new order.Sincerely,Account SpecialistAmazon.comThank you for contacting us regarding your account.Your Gift cards are temporarily on hold. We took these actions because either the Amazon gift card or the Amazon gift card balance you are using is in violation of our Terms and Conditions.Gift Card Activity Page 1 of 1 (4 total transactions)Date	Description	AmountFebruary 26, 2021	Balance withheld	$475.00February 26, 2021	Balance withheld	$2,000.00February 16, 2021	Gift card claim (claim code xxxx-xxxxxx-XGAN)	$475.00February 16, 2021	Gift card claim (claim code xxxx-xxxxxx-7YA5)	$2,000.00UP till today no reply on my supports sent of the purchase of the gift cards. Still they have my money.I want my money!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",1.0,217,0.9999999999970617,2.9383162569729393e-12,32.43409983189117,Low Trust
