Megan (May) Styles,US,1.0,"When you think, oh it's FROM AMAZON, I'LL BE SAFE BUYING FROM THEM,, NERRRRP! Think again. I cannot tell you how many people I know of, myself included, have gotten ripped off from this major company!! Especially with beauty products, name brand products, even CLOTHING!! I mean, Amazon's ""3rd party merchants"" are just a friggen way for Amazon to get around getting sued for selling faulty crap! It's a cop out so they don't have to claim responsibility when their customers get ripped off!! It's so they can say, ""oh it wasn't us, how would we have known that vendor was sending you a fake product that burned your skin,,!!"" They KNOW alot of their ""3rd party jerk so-called sellers"" are ripping their millions of customers off BUT THEY DON'T GIVE A CRAP AND AREN'T GOING TO CHANGE IT UNLESS THEY STOP MAKING MONEY FROM US,  THE CONSUMER!! THEY NEED TO START SELLING THEIR OWN **AUTHENTIC** INVENTORY THAT THEY CAN PERFORM QUALITY CONTROL ON!!! I just can't believe how many people have gotten ripped off, yet mad amounts of hard working Americans are still throwing their money away to them! I mean shoot, if you wanna go to wish and compare some of their products to Amazon's, you might be surprised to see IT'S ALOT OF THE SAME CRAP!! Unbelievable they're still a top merchant. Makes me CRAZY!!",5.0,228,0.9999999999965892,3.410827176253406e-12,32.557487380989386,Low Trust
