Zia Taylor- Khan,US,1.0,"DO NOT STORE CREDIT /DEBIT CARDS WITH THIS COMPANY!!! So, i guess that since I had a full cart but had not yet checked out they(AMAZON) decided that I should first watch ANNIE and AMERICAN PIE. So, they purchased it DIGITALLY for me, without my permission and CHARGED MY CREDIT CARD for it!!! YEAH, OKAY!!This is NOT the first time that they have done this and this is NOT the first time that i had to cuss them out for it. That Bald-headed sinner is trying to get rich off of EVERYONE just to support that smelly Hilary. THINK AGAIN BUCKY!! Check and see how many DIGITAL movies they've ordered for you and you paid for them. I'd be rich too, If I set my system up to do the same. Thanx for keeping us up on our toes though. Let's NOT for get that your lifestyle is a MENTAL DISORDER!! Like he could do anything right, YOUR MENTALLY CHALLENGED!! I wish that i didn't have to give 1 star!! YOU DESERVE NO STARS!!!",5.0,174,0.9999999999850442,1.4955814364725484e-11,31.95176668610954,Low Trust
Brenda McGehee,US,1.0,"I have been a PRIME member for 10 years. My COMPLAINT is about my reviews being rejected!! ""MY TIME ""is valuable and 95% of my reviews are positive. I never bash the sellers. During COVID I ,and others needed ROYAL CANIN5 oz can cat food. It's a specialty for sick cats. It's the ONLY food my cat can eat. He almost died that year. You couldn't get it anywhere. A case of 24 ,5 oz cans sold for $90. HOWEVER, a very ""empathetic "" seller (sarcasm  here) took advantage of having a few cases on hand to sell for a mere $250 a case!!!!! So along with other customer's reviews about the disgusting PRICE GOUGING, I added my review. This was 2020. Mine was REJECTED. And from then on no matter how wonderful a review I wrote they found some reason to say it didn't follow ""AMAZON GUIDELINES""!! WELL here is my LAST AMAZON REVIEW ever and AMAZON can't touch it!! What you are doing is a disservice to your customers!!!! You aren't hurting me. I will add this,"" I spend a LOT LESS$$$$ on AMAZON"" I use to spend around $500- $1,000 a month or more. Now, maybe $100.Love the products ,not the lack of appreciation of me and my loyalty as a customer. So go ahead and support the PRICE GOUGERS, the corrupt. I screen shot those comments YOU DIDNT REJECT!! There are lots of different sites that offer great items but with better Customer Service!! ",14.0,248,0.9999999999850051,1.499489421519229e-11,32.78182837988603,Low Trust
Joseph Hewson,US,1.0,"Amazon, sneakily gives you Prime, EVEN THOUGH I NEVER ASK FOR IT!!!!Then, to get out of Prime, they give you an email address that doesn’t allow you to close the “Account Confirmation Request”!  Soooo “Catch 22”!!!  If everyone would STOP USING Amazon, like the light beer!!!, PERHAPS they’d get the message!Apparently, they don’t value customers, or they’d resolve problems expeditiously!!!! STOP BUYING THROUGH AMAZIN!!!",1.0,64,0.9999999999844618,1.553823736344384e-11,30.717891195392728,Low Trust
