Mary,IE,1.0,"AVOID it like the plague, people, they will suck your soul and this doesn't worth it, it is our money we are giving them (which we worked with our time and this time we will never get it back) and they pay us in hassle and harassment in return - They do not deserve our money, peace of mind nor our time to argue over our rightful refund!!! Amazon holds my money and is not refunding!! The item was refused at delivery as it arrived broken and I did not want to accept delivery and return myself as they could have said that I caused the damage!! They say no refund unless the receive it back to their fulfilment centre, which they say it can take 30 days to be processed!! Are you serious?? I never got the item, this is not a return to treat it as such!!This is 1000s of pounds Amazon is holding for the last 3 weeks, always telling me on chat that the refund will be issued soon and finally only to be told that they need to process the item once back at their fulfil centre, then within 30 days they will issue my refund... I have contacted consumer's protection, got legal advice that they must issue my refund asap as I have consumer's rights, Amazon and their staff don't care...! I have spent a fortune to Amazon over the last 8 years I am shopping off them, I will be now getting my custom locally and since I am travelling alot, I will be shopping whatever I need from local shops in other EU countries instead of this business that only cares about stealing your money and treat you like rubbish!!!!!!Literally people, they are good as long as you do not need them to support you, once you will ask for support they will treat you like rubbish... Avoid!",24.0,316,0.9999999999815345,1.846545139017053e-11,33.544587774338865,Low Trust
