Elvia Duenas,MX,1.0,"I need someone to get in touch with me as soon as possible. This is unbelievable , I am very FRUSTRATED AND DISAPPOINTED with the company! I made a purchase of $3,523.12 pesos with monthly payments of $391.52 for 9 months “no interest”. They are not respecting the agreement I made with my monthly payments. I checked my credit card account and have 6 separate payments pending!!! One on the amount of $1,445.08 , the other of $599.99, another of $584.10, and 3 separate payments of $20 pesos !! Wt the heck is going on I need an explanation and have that money refunded with my monthly payments of 391.52 for 9 months to be respected or I will file a BBB complaint and never order from Amazon again!! Get in touch with me asap! !(33)2660-2868 Elvia Duenas!Necesito que alguien se ponga en contacto conmigo lo antes posible. ¡Esto es increíble, estoy muy FRUSTRADA Y DECEPCIONADA con la empresa! Hice una compra de $3,523.12 pesos con pagos mensuales de $391.52 por 9 meses “sin intereses”. No están respetando el acuerdo que hice con mis pagos mensuales. ¡Revisé mi cuenta de tarjeta de crédito y tengo 6 pagos separados pendientes! Uno por la cantidad de $1,445.08, el otro de $599.99, otro de $584.10, y 3 pagos separados de $20 pesos!! ¿Qué diablos está pasando? Necesito una explicación y que me reembolsen ese dinero con mis pagos mensuales de 391,52 durante 9 meses para que se respeten o presentaré una queja de BBB y nunca volveré a realizar pedidos en Amazon. ¡Ponte en contacto conmigo lo antes posible! !(33)2660-2868 Elvia Dueñas! Guadalajar Jalisco.",2.0,271,0.9999999999545239,4.547606735627596e-11,33.03982052947515,Low Trust
Shandoria Goines,US,5.0,"I love amazon !! Great customer service,anything we need for my household I can find at a reasonable price! If anything is wrong they will work with you every time to make sure you are satisfied! Fast shipping!! If they say its going to be there Wednesday it will if not before!!! You cant go wrong with shopping with amazon!!! This company know something!!! lol Trust me you wont be disappointed!!!",3.0,71,0.9999999999518343,4.8165693655732866e-11,150.79641054643523,High Trust
