ccent, I made in clear 'American Supervisor' and that is what I got.Ms. America tells me She Can't See An Order Number, while I then start getting passwords errors after I had changed mine .....I GIVE UP ON AMAZON A SECOND TIME, AGAIN SAID LAST IN TIME FEBRUARY OF 2018...  IF THEY ARE YANKING MY CHAIN AFTER YEARS, BEFORE AND AFTER.  LOOK OUT AND EXPECT THEM TIGHTEN YOUR COLLAR TOO, AS IF WE ARE IGNORANT PUPPY DOGS GETTING PULLED AROUND ON THE CHAIN OF LIFE BY THE MASTER THAT COULD GIVE A 'BIT LESS...""I SPENT TOO MUCH OF MY TIME WASTING MONEY DEALING WITH STUPED SOFTWARE OUTPUT AND MINIMUM WAGE CS REPS THAT KNOW LITTLE... AND COULD CARE LESS^Tully Tavares",1.0,464,0.9999999999480738,5.1926241084743197e-11,35.20471116356097,Low Trust
