Jon McJon,ES,1.0,Lies. All lies. I've now had numerous reviews removed for unknown reasons - without any recourse !! My reviews are always honest and polite - but apparently simply explaining why i think a company/product is not worth the time and money is not allowed !! So they cannot be trusted. Buyer Beware !!!!!!!!!!!!,44.0,53,0.9999999998606537,1.3934631226675265e-10,30.594503652508536,Low Trust
Denice Richards,US,1.0,"Amazon is a sneaky cheat!  I have been returning some items and Amazon states I get a refund BUT that is not what is happening, it is going to CREDIT towards future purchases.  This IS NOT a refund.  So, I am forced to still pay the credit card PLUS interest and the return is credited to future purchases.  This is false advertising and blatant misrepresentation.  Credit is NOT a refund.  If you read the return options, Amazon states three return options:  1. Replace with the exact same item 2) Refund to your Amazon account balance and 3) in a lighter color so you think it is a link - is Refund to your AmazonPLCC ending in XXXX.  You have to choose option 3 or it will not go back as a refund.  Option 2) will give you credits for future purchases, even though it states 'refund' you do NOT get a refund!!! If you used your Amazon/Synchrony credit card, you do NOT have an Amazon Account Balance!!!!  You have a Credit Card Balance!  AND!!! If you choose a drop off at Kohl's to 'keep more trucks off the road' it automatically gives you a credit and NOT a refund (per customer service)!!  You have to choose UPS even though that is not as convenient! Misdirection, misrepresentation and total lies.  No one in their right mind would buy items they can't get a refund for!!  Everyone should be aware of this sneaky scam by Amazon!",6.0,244,0.9999999998587474,1.4125256520003404e-10,32.73696018653543,Low Trust
Vida Azteca,GB,1.0,"If I could give no stars at all I would. For months now I have not received any parcels I have ordered. This is due to new houses being built in another part of town which have been given the same street name as my address. Now all my parcels get delivered to the new build that has the same number and street name as my address instead of coming to my house despite it being a different postcode! I have made several phone calls to complain and each time been told a note will be put on the file for the driver to read the full address instead of just the first line and STILL they keep sending my parcels to the wrong address!! Today another parcel bought from wowcher was delivered by Amazon and no surprise it went to the wrong address again. On calling Amazon they have basically said they can do nothing and one woman I spoke to was even rude enough to be having a conversation with her colleague as I was trying to explain the issue. I told her I would wait for her to finish having her chat, to which she tried to assure me she was listening. At this point I asked to speak to a manager and was told the manager had left, after I continued with my complaint they suddenly “found” a manager for me to speak to, although I suspect the person I spoke to wasn’t a manager at all. I was told there was nothing they could do and would put a note on the file. When I explained that I get told the same thing every time I phone yet the parcel still goes elsewhere I was simply told “sorry”. There must be a million and one notes on my account by now the amount of times I’ve had to complain about the same thing. They’ve probably worn through their keyboard with all the typing! Seems no one can read!!!I then called to ask for a subject access request to request a copy of all the notes on my account, to be told by the person I spoke to that they couldn’t do this. I assured them that under GDPR it is my right to see any data held about myself and therefore it was a LEGALITY for them to supply this. The guy basically didn’t know what the hell I was going on about and tried to put me through to a manager, this took forever so I asked if a manager could call me back and he took 4 attempts to get my email right and 3 attempts to get my phone number right. I really don’t see how hard it is for them to deliver to the right address given the postcodes are completely different! Complete incompetency!!! Yet in the meantime I’m losing money cause Amazon are refusing to refund me cause the product wasn’t bought from them only delivered by them! I normally get any Amazon parcels delivered to my work place instead so I know I will receive them, unfortunately I didn’t realise Wowcher used Amazon for delivery or else I would have picked an alternative delivery address. As for in future I won’t be bothering to order anything from them again and I’ll be steering clear of anyone who I know uses them as their delivery provider. Absolute bunch of cowboys that obviously haven’t even been trained on simple things such as GDPR!!!!!",2.0,582,0.9999999998323506,1.676494498781267e-10,36.528323059420046,Low Trust
Taylor S.,GB,1.0,"stole a bunch of money from me when i sold bitcoin for amazon gift cards. if just ONE PERSON sold me a gift card that was purchased with a stolen credit card, and i ended up redeeming it, then AMAZON.COM would end up suspending my entire account and ignore all my emails. my amazon balance has over 7 THOUSAND DOLLARS. and they just IGNORED ALL MY EMAILS. Happened THREE TIMES! I HATE THEM FOR THAT.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.!.! if u want to make things right with me Amazon please contact me on s.k.y.p.e. at anonxjobz [at] outlook . com - thank you.",2.0,99,0.9999999998262221,1.7377788097405755e-10,31.110487950360234,Low Trust
