Miss Chrissy Rawlings,GB,1.0,Disgraceful service from Amazon today. I rang them in the end and what did I get?  A fast talking totally unhelpful couldn’t care less Customer Care Assistant - HA WHAT A JOKE.  Ok so I’m partially disabled and housebound but my brain full working and I’m not putting up with that attitude.  NO WAY. !!!!So I can’t even say on here what I really think of the rude waste of space was like when he turned up at my door.  My INSTRUCTIONS are in bold writing on our front door.  Front door open please open the door and leave delivery in our porch.  HOW HARD IS THAT ???? Nowhere in those instructions does it say. Knock on the front door wait for me the partially disabled homeowner to open the door.  What he did let happen was my little visitor 8yrs old - opened the door and the idiot handed the TWO BOXES to little lad and walked away.  I was there sitting looking straight at him and said WHY CANT YOU PUT THEM ON THE PORCH FLOOR TAKE YOUR PIC !!  Instead of expecting this little lad to do YOUR job.  I was furious.  IVE BEEN AN AMAZON PRIME CUSTOMERFOR YEARS NOW.  but to be honest I never want to order from or through them again.  HE JUST HAD THIS SUPERCILIOUS MORON look on his face and walked away leaving them in the bairns hand. !!!!!   IM ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTED !!!!,59.0,241,0.9999999992584558,7.415441594105232e-10,32.70330906680239,Low Trust
Sue Driver,GB,1.0,"Why me ? Thought, though I must have had a stupid episode,why have I ordered something from Amazon again, it is beyond belief !! Well it's nearly 10pm and I haven't had my little parcel, promised me today, so I believed them and it doesn't look like it's gonna be today, carrier gone home now or out on the town  who knows ?? Anyway  sanity is returning and thankfully the order wasn't expensive and I have had a word with myself, DO NOT ORDER FROM THEM AGAIN OR YOU WILL BE SHOT AT DAWN!!!!! Ye God's  order and clarity will once again reign in my life as I have listened to my own good advice and it will NEVER HAPPEN AGAIN !! Crikey I order from another competitor all the way from China and I have never had a late delivery or a missing delivery ! Well I shall go to a shop tomorrow and get my item LIKE I SHOULD HAVE IN THE FIRST PLACE !!! BYE BYE AMAZON !! ",55.0,171,0.9999999991590296,8.40970404425434e-10,31.918115577662654,Low Trust
doron,GB,1.0,Thievesi looked on my bank statement and suddenlly discovered the billed me fake billings i blocked them with my bank amazon customer support phone not working billing working - customer support not working - wow !!!!!!!!!!!!!!! briliantf...ck   offfffffffffffffffffffffffff amazon Thieves,24.0,40,0.9999999987218271,1.2781729008537468e-09,30.44868206054353,Low Trust
"Unhappy PAYING, customer 😤",GB,1.0,"Absolutely disgusting delivery service!! I was due to have a parcel delivered from them today. The driver presses my number in the intercom system(I live in a flat) I saw it was a man with a box in his hand so I buzzed him into the building. I wait and wait and wait at my front door, standing there, door wide open.......no one arrives. I check my amazon account,looked at my orders for it to tell me the parcel had been delivered and handed to resident!!!! No such exchange happened at all. I even went downstairs to check to see if it was left down there and nothing. Not the first time this has happened. I saw him, from my window, get back in his van and drive away?! I'm absolutely fuming. When I call to explain, I get a load of ridiculous excuses as to what happened and get asked to wait 24 hours as it may still turn up!! I said not a chance I am waiting any longer. I already waited 3 days for this parcel despite the fact I pay for this service every month and I refuse to wait any longer. She kept telling me she couldn't refund me or reorder for another 24 hours and I repeatedly kept telling her no. Then all of a sudden she was able to offer a refund?! So now I have to wait yet again, for my money to come back to me. 5-7 days to refund!! Takes 5 minutes for them to take the money when I order something though or the stroke of midnight when taking the membership money. Given they are such a big company and the fact I pay for it, they really need to sort themselves out as their service is appalling. This has happened so many times now. Membership is definitely being cancelled just as soon as I get my money. I refuse to pay them another penny as you don't even get the kind of service they say you do with a membership. NEVER AGAIN!!!!",3.0,344,0.9999999984848691,1.515130909623963e-09,33.85866524681656,Low Trust
Michelle Riley,GB,1.0,"After 3 weeks of chasing and emailing Amazon about their delivery driver stealing my parcels they have closed my account, have ignored over 35 emails that I have sent to ofm Amazon handle and Customer services and the CEO still being ignored, they have refused to give me a refund or replacement despite CCTV and Police Crime Report and wont give me back my money. I have asked Amazon on NUMEROUS occasions to investigate their new delivery driver for the last few months but nothing has been done! Instead they have sent me emails saying they have CLOSED MY ACCOUNT for misuse of Amazon Services!!!! I have been a LOYAL CUSTOMER for over 12 years and this has never happened to me before!!! I have now reported AMAZON to Trading Standards and the Financial Ombudsman. I have NOT signed for parcels that are missing and was not at home when the delivery Driver put ""Handed To Resident"" on the app which is UNTRUE. Even tbough I have given amazon the CCTV details they still have ignored the problem and literally just have not tried to resolve the issue at all!!! I have been treated extremely badly as a loyal customer who spends thousands of pounds of my hard earned money to this company who clearly do not know about Customer services or Complaints!!!!!",2.0,223,0.9999999977755092,2.2244908137736275e-09,32.501402242464025,Low Trust
Teresa Wintermeyer,US,1.0,"BEWARE OF AMAZON STEALING YOUR MONEY!! Amazon will not replace any items or refund any purchases even when their customer service representative admits that the package was NOT delivered and was marked delivered incorrectly! And after they tell you that it's your loss they literally hang up in your face smh I have been a prime member for many years UNTIL NOW! Not only did I cancel prime but also audible because the interaction I just experienced was disgusting and inappropriate!! Im pretty sure the majority of prime members have had atleast one package not show up, or had it delivered to the wrong address, and now Amazon will not correct their, or their drivers mistake, they will tell you it says delivered and that's too bad for you!!! Even when the driver coincidentally forgets to take the picture of the item when it's delivered and again even after the initial representative admits that the item was NOT delivered because the truck broke down and even when said conversation was on the chat and they have proof of the conversation!!! BTW the item was only a $6 box of masks!!! #scam #Amazon #thief #ripoff #share",1.0,195,0.9999999973841487,2.615851313336748e-09,32.18732486438763,Low Trust
Francine Leduc,US,1.0,"They should get rid of Logistics for deliveries but they don’t do anything about it. I’ve been a prime member for years! I Was supposed to receive a package today but it was never out for delivery! Chatted with a Rachelle M which has terrible customer service by the way and she went and switched it to the next day delivery “per customer’s request” which I never requested! They lie and don’t even care!!!  Amazon Logistics is probably based on lazy people! One time I was waiting for my delivery and I was the next delivery however I noticed the driver turned the opposite way and minutes later, my delivery info was updated saying they could not deliver because package was damaged!!! My parcel was a rubber bath mat!!!!!!  Really????",1.0,130,0.9999999972548077,2.7451922957055785e-09,31.458216626322987,Low Trust
Tea,SE,1.0,"A big joke company!By mistake I bought a quite expensive Tom Gord sunglasses from the american Amazon site not from the Swedish site where I’m based.When the product arrived to Sweden they did not look as on the pictures on the amazon page. Therefor I sent in an return request for the product.I then only for the adress label to the seller not a prepaid return label.I contacted Amazon again and asked for it, but they couldn’t send me one that I could use here in Sweden. I had to pay for one myself and then be refunded afterwards. Ok for me so far BUT!….I then simply asked for 4 simple informations needed to create a return label in Sweden:AdressName on the person that will receive itPhone numberEmail I now have spent 10!!!! Hours to try to get that information! Yes 10 hours!I have been calling Amazon in both Sweden and in the Us. I have been sending emails without replies, I have been trying to contact Amazon through chat but they cancel the chat as soon as I demand them to send me the details.Without it I can’t make the return since the law in Sweden requires that information.And of course you must have a phone number and email so the postoffice could sent notifications to the seller about the package for it to be delivered!Amazon refuses to help me. They refuse to help me get in contact with the seller, they refuses to send the info thats neccessary to solve this issue. They refuses to make a refund on the product.Status Que!!!It should not take 10hours to provided the customer a solution or these simple details!I guess I have to leave this matter to court to be solved! I will never buy on Amazon again!They should be ashamed of how they treat their customers!",6.0,306,0.9999999969841249,3.015875105205623e-09,33.43241742505062,Low Trust
Lawrence Hall,US,1.0,My wife and I have been Amazon Prime members for 10 years! The company used to have excellent customer service and shipping practices. Now is the worst company to order from in the USA. Seems as though they're pushing products shipped directly from China. Two in the last month I ordered that I was unaware of that were shipped out of China! They do not explain in a listing that the product will be shipped from China! They expect you to look it up because they do not care about their customers anymore! They do not care about their employees as well they don't care if they live or die with the covid-19 cases going on! Amazon simply doesn't care about life in America or American citizens!!! Applying contact in customer service they advised me that they were in the right because it was a third-party seller. But it is Amazon fault because they're not stating the product is coming from China! No more no way am I going to support China in anyway after what has happened in the past 6 months with the covid-19 outbreak and how they treated our country and their own country for that matter! Amazon seems to be treating their employees and customers just as the Chinese communist government treats their citizens. Shame on you Amazon. You suck!!!!!,1.0,224,0.99999999697382,3.026179973275589e-09,32.512619332464354,Low Trust
Leanne Adamson,GB,1.0,"Order number 203-8537586-4712356I’m really not impressed with the delivery! I’m the the house as it’s my day off, driver banged on the door as if he was being attacked and didn’t even wait for me to get to the door before running off!!!To make matters worse he didn’t lock my back gate which is bad enough on any day but on a strong wind day meaning my dogs are now wondering the streets and I can’t find them!!!!!! And yes he knew I had dogs because they were barking like mad when he banged on the front door!!!! Not impressed at all! Better hope I fend my dogs",2.0,108,0.9999999968474171,3.1525828614320517e-09,31.211441548543334,Low Trust
Jeannie Peyton,US,1.0,"I placed a order,  it got delayed instead of waiting til the end of the week for me to call back as I asked they did a refund immediately! I ordered the same exact stuff again then the package showed up!! Called to cancel the order just placed and have them take the refund back!!! So I got get the one they found as I knew it would be found! At that time she put it in as refused, even though I wanted to cancel the new order and give the refund back!!! They lost a customer who was a avid Amazon Shopper who spends thousands of dollars a year!! Due to ppl not listening and providing crappy customer service!!!",1.0,120,0.9999999963893671,3.6106329037721707e-09,31.3460461704363,Low Trust
Linda M,US,1.0,"BEWARE OF AMAZON!  I paid for some recent orders for a birthday party with gift cards, specifically because I don't want Amazon to have my bank info.  (In America, we are free to shop anonymously, but Amazon seems determined to stop that.) When I placed another order to use up the balance on my gift card, I got the message below.  I've wasted hours trying to either get my merchandise or my money back for the gift card. Presently, I have neither.🤬""Your Amazon account is temporarily on hold.""Hello,""We have detected unusual payment activity on your Amazon account [An Amazon gift card is unusual?!]. For your protection, we have temporarily placed your account on hold and placed any pending orders [that I already paid for!] or subscriptions on hold as well.""If we are unable to confirm your payment information within 72 hours, your pending orders will be canceled. Your account will remain on hold until we are able to confirm that you are the authorized owner of the payment method used in the recent transaction [How can I prove I own a gift card??!!!!].""To restore access to your account, sign in and follow the on-screen instructions. You will have the option to upload a document [A billing or banking statement!!🤬] with the required information to verify your account. Once you have provided this document, we will review it and respond within 24 hours. [So if I don't, they keep the money I paid for the gift card?!!]""When uploading a document to verify the ownership of a payment method [I have to do all this to buy something with a gift card at Amazon?!😳], be sure that the name, address, payment type, and relevant transaction information are clearly visible. For your security, only display the last 4 digits of the payment method number...""HOW AND WHY WOULD I PROVIDE THIS INFO IF I PAID WITH A GIFT CARD?!  Their whole retail operation is clearly a ruse to get your sensitive information into their database.  You can't buy anonymously from them.  BOYCOTT AMAZON to do at least a little something to fend off the Chinese-style fascist state they want!   They chose their name appropriately from the outset:  AMAZON - to dwarf all us little people and force us to submit to their will.  Americans BEWARE!",5.0,381,0.9999999961145376,3.88546239626919e-09,34.2736962122204,Low Trust
Charlene Ge,US,1.0,"All CS are train unprofessional. They aren't helping at all. A longe story to short, got an wrong item, and contacted them to see if I will get my item delivered in time. And got an assure from a supervisor that it will be delivery on time. And I didn't receive my package but a garbage that I need to donate or throw it away!!!!!!!!!! Totally waste my 3 hours, and look what I got now!!!!!",2.0,76,0.9999999956188179,4.381182083790236e-09,30.852496012665387,Low Trust
Cheri Smith,US,1.0,"I order 2 days ago, and am a prime member. I knew my item wouldn’t be here until Friday (4 days) but I was fine with it because I needed it on Saturday. So now it shows that it’s not going to be here until Saturday, but if I go to the page it’s sold on, if I buy it today it will be delivered by Friday!!!! It’s worthless if I don’t have it Saturday morning!! They don’t understand that, they sent it USPS instead of being delivered by Amazon. So now I have to wait, and then I get to try to find the time to return it between taking care of a house and running a business/working 65-70 hours a wk outside of the house.Amazon Prime isn’t what it use to be!!!!!!!!!",1.0,134,0.9999999950287051,4.971294931266357e-09,31.503084937291607,Low Trust
Christine Anderson,US,3.0,"I have been an Amazon customer for several years now. Since Covid hit I have spent THOUSANDS of dollars with them. Throughout the entire shutdown Amazon NEVER missed a delivery date. In the past several months it has gone SERIOUSLY DOWN HILL!! What is going on?? If you can not deliver an item on time then why do you even put a delivery day on the items? It's ridiculous. I pay for PRIME SERVICE but I am no longer getting it. Sorry, but I don't go for that crap. When I order a product and it specifically gives me a date of arrival BEFORE I ORDER IT!! I consider that a contract! I pay for the service, I pay for the item...but do not receive my order on the promised date. In May of 2021 I had a little incident where some supplies for a customers order got damaged. I immediately ordered what I needed with the ""promise"" of it being delivered the next day. Sometime around 5:00pm (long after it should have already been delivered) I received a text message informing me that it would not be arriving when promised. It was to arrive on May 21st which still would have given me 2 1/2 days to complete my customers order which was to be delivered on the evening of Monday, May 24th.   I did not receive my supplies until the afternoon of May 24th!! Needless to say I could not deliver as promised because Amazon did not deliver as promised. The loss of that order cost me $300.00!! When I called to complain, they had the AUDACITY to offer me a $5.00 credit to my account. ARE YOU KIDDING ME!!?? You cost me $300.00 and you want to compensate that with a $5.00 credit? Talk about a slap in the face. As a matter of fact that was and is THE ONLY time that Amazon had the courtesy of letting me know. Usually they do not even do that much. It's not until I see UPS drive past my house that I realize that something is wrong and then I have to check. They are also starting to get really cheap with their packaging. I have been ordering my makeup from Amazon for quite a while now. It used to come wrapped in bubble wrap in a box. There were no problems. Now they have been sending it in really thin and cheesy mail bags/envelopes and it arrives in pieces. One time they sent 2 glass bottle of foundation, 2 2 compacts of face powder and a tube of mascara all together in a paper shipping bag. Absolutely no padding, bubble wrap or anything!! Well after shipping and UPS throwing it around for a day and a half, I had a real mess on my hands. How much common sense does it actually take for someone to know that 2 glass bottles and some fragile makeup needs to be packed properly with padding and a box?? I see that Amazon sells Waterford Crystal and Austrian crystal wine glasses at $400.00 -$500.00 per half dozen. I can just imagine how they would arrive!! You NEED to get it together Amazon. Have you ever heard the saying ""Your mouth needs to stop writing checks that your ass can't cash!""",4.0,549,0.9999999949854868,5.014513249079755e-09,96.15816065453944,High Trust
Sunny,AG,1.0,"BUYER BEWARE!! Overseas Amazon Customers HAVE NO PROTECTION NOT EVEN IF THE ITEM IS CLEARLY DEFECTIVE or EXPIRED just because we sent our order to our airfreight shippers in MIAMI!! THIS IS SHOCKING, SHABBY and downright disgusting of AMAZON!! We have been using Amazon for years as many people and companies on our Island do without any issues up until now and I requested an immediate refund for two boxes of coffee from this seller because it states clearly on the old and (other disintegrated box) that the item expired 6/2024!!  We cannot use such a large quantity by JUNE 2024!!  We sent the photos as requested were given the most disappointing level of Customer Service and we're kept on the chat for almost 2 hours between 4 different Agents in an effort to wear us down to try and seek some level of justice and receive a refund or something reasonable for this EXPIRED purchase as THE SELLER should make it clear that these perishable foods are clearance items and about to expire!!! All in All Amazon have failed us to have a FAIR outcome and I will be posting this on all of my purchases throughout Amazon and on my Island and on Trust pilot.com and any other Consumers Affairs Organizations as there is NO BUYER PROTECTION for you if you have to ship your GOODs and Sellers can sell you ANYTHING they want to... YOU HAVE NO REDRESS!!",6.0,241,0.9999999940262243,5.97377569633295e-09,32.703309328413965,Low Trust
Michael,AU,1.0,"I ordered a watch from Amazon in early 2017 and never received it because the seller uses a dodgy delivery company. The delivery company has the one of the worst ratings a company has on the internet and uses students to deliver items. When I wrote a review of my experience Amazon refused to post the review because they believe I should only comment on the features of the product. I will never receive the product so how can I comment on it!How dodgy are Amazon! You effectively have your money stolen, never receive the product and they won't allow the review to appear on the website because I can only comment on the features. How can I comment on the features if I never received the product!!!! There must be hundreds of thousands of people out there like me who have had their money stolen in situations like this or had huge delays with receiving the product. Amazingly they didn't even offer to help me!!!! Beware, you will regret buying through Amazon!!!!The full review I wanted posted on the Amazon site is as follows:My watch was delivered when I wasn't home and the courier left a card. That part was ok, but everything after that point has been terrible. The card has no phone number to contact the company and it is asking me to submit a form online. When I follow the instructions on the card it is impossible for me to submit the online form to Fastway. I then waste my time searching for a phone number and call the company. No one is there to pick so I am asked to leave my number and someone will get back to me. A week passes and no one gets back to me. My friends birthday has now passed and I don't have a gift and I will be lucky to ever receive the watch. The delivery company is called Fastway and if you read the reviews it is probably the worst company in the world. The experience, even if I one day receive my watch, has been a nightmare from beginning to end. I would have been better off paying more elsewhere.Three months after I made the purchase my position was as follows:  It has been about three months since I ordered the watch and I am no closer to receiving it, with no help being offered by the seller or Amazon and no way of contacting the courier. I have checked the update of my purchase and it has been marked as ""delivered"". The option Amazon provide me on their website is to pay to purchase another watch!Three months and a few days after I made my purchase my position was as follows:  I found out the courier marked the watch as delivered two weeks before they even attempted delivery. That means the courier held the watch for two weeks for even bothering to attempt delivery.Also, because I put a negative review on this site about Fastway, they returned my watch back overseas to the seller. I emailed Amazon a few days ago asking for their help and received no reply.Be warned - don't ever use Amazon! Some situations might work out well, but when it goes wrong there is no one to help you. It is simply not worth the risk to go through months of worry. Amazon should be shut down.Five months after my purchase and my position was as follows:I ended up ordering a watch from ebay. It arrived in days and I was able to post a review about the experience and include details related to the shipping.I had to ask my bank for a charge back on my credit card because Amazon refused to help me obtain a refund even though the watch was returned to the seller. When my bank contacted Amazon to discuss the charge back request Amazon sent me an email asking why I wanted my money back when I already had my watch. I replied and then Amazon refused to communicate back to my bank so I had to wait 45 days before my bank could then take my money back from Amazon.It sounds like Amazon provided customer service years ago but now it is the most dodgy company you will ever encounter. You are better off trying to buy something from a market stall in Bangkok over the internet as opposed to going through Amazon. I honestly don't know how they remain in business. It must be that they just churn through people one at a time until people become turned off. One day they will run out of inexperienced people to screw over and the company will fall over.",20.0,784,0.99999999379494,6.205060021358122e-09,38.79416744429675,Low Trust
Rochelle Stone,US,1.0,"What a joke. As of today I will never buy from Amazon again!!!! We had a storm yesterday that messed up part of our road to our house. We didn’t know if the Amazon van would make it down our road, so when we saw him on the road behind ours, my husband went to the end of the road to wait and either help the driver get through the rough part, or get our packages from him, as tomorrow is our daughters birthday and all of her presents were in his van. He came flying down the road, past our driveway from the back side, didn’t stop in any of our houses, got the bad part of the road, sped up, bottomed out the van. Then when he got up to where my husband was waiting and tried to flag him down, he looked at him and kept going!!! I called Amazon. I filed a complaint against the driver. The customer service representative guaranteed me they would be here tomorrow in time for her birthday. Yet my items just updated to anywhere from tomorrow to the 19th?!?! Are you serious?! And the driver lied and said he couldn’t get down our road, when he not only went down our road twice, but didn’t stop at any of the houses either time!!!! I spend a lot of money with Amazon, and because of a lazy, dishonest, incompetent driver, I will never use Amazon again.",2.0,244,0.9999999937402653,6.259734730562627e-09,32.73696049245953,Low Trust
Karolina Pluszczok,GB,1.0,"I have been trying to contact Amazon customer service for days. Every time I go on the chat it was blank and every time I called it stated is outside their working hours when it weren’t! Finally got through to someone I have been put through to 4 different members of staff. The last person I have spoken to I have never ever in my whole entire life come across anyone to rude, patronising in my whole life. Disgusting human being!!I cannot believe I have just been spoken to like this by a member of staff!! Absolutely disgusting behaviour!!!!!After this I’m deleting my Amazon account and cancelled my prime because this is disgusting I will not deal with any company that deals with customers like this! And I have been a customer for years!!!?After an hour wasted my problem didn’t even get solved! ",8.0,143,0.9999999937127133,6.28728669127554e-09,31.60403845233405,Low Trust
Mrs Elizabeth,GB,1.0,"I put two items in my basket, both said FREE DELIVERY  when I went to pay it had £4.99 for delivery I tried to get rid of it but nothing worked so I phoned customer services, only to get a lady answer so softly that I had to ask her to speak up, then see asked me three times to give her my postal code which after the third time she read back to me and still had it wrong, she kept putting me on hold and then she came back to say she had spoken to her manager and i must pay the postage and it will be credited back to me ?????  WTH I was listening to her talking but someone or her were ruffling papers and I couldn't hear her and she kept on saying excuse me, I almost lost my CRAP after 20 minutes of having to communicate with with this person I was finally finished, at one point I said that I would make the purchase elsewhere !!!!!!  WHAT HAS HAPPENED TO AMAZON, IT USED TO BE A REASONABLE COMPANY TO DEAL WITH WTH THEY ARE LOSING THE PLOT !!!!!!!!",36.0,195,0.9999999925075355,7.49246453768393e-09,32.18732510821829,Low Trust
R Groenendijk,ID,1.0,"my account is not accesable, customer service can not or will not help.It is impossible to get in contact or to get acces to my account. Horrible company!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",5.0,28,0.9999999920080079,7.991992068134834e-09,30.31407779724402,Low Trust
Ciara,GB,1.0,"Worst Customer Service EVER!!!!!!!!!!I contacted them through the online chat and was told to call to be able to resolve the issue (I was gifted a Fire Stick). I called and then was told that I needed to get the person who gave me the fire stick to message them on the online chat. Then they were told they need to get me to talk to them on the online chat. Then I was told, I need to call. On the phone I was told AGAIN I needed to get the person who gave me the fire stick to call.When I told them we had already been through all of this, they did not care.My issue was not resolved, it took over 2 hours to get LITERALLY NOWHERE!!!! if I could give them a negative rating I would.",1.0,138,0.9999999912987866,8.701213416451026e-09,31.547953323451022,Low Trust
