Candice Johnson,US,1.0,"This was probably the most horrible set of experiences that I have had online shopping. This company made online shopping a nightmare. I had to worry about my order actually shipping, then I had to worry for weeks about getting my money off an authorization hold with my bank... For product I never received. I am canceling my membership. I will never use amazon for ANYTHING. I will not buy or use any amazon sponsored or supported products.  I will not listen to Amazon music. I will not purchase or use Amazon based products. I will not use Amazon streaming service... and the list goes on.... You have been replaced by Walmart... That is what happens when you stop caring about your customers and outsource your call center to India...... Walmart has stepped it's game up... YOU ARE LOSING AMAZON.... YOU SUCK!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",1.0,142,0.9999999892381747,1.0761825319782758e-08,31.592821626145106,Low Trust
Amy Greene,US,1.0,"Ordered a sole fitness $1,500 elliptical and decided to buy the $89 assembly after ordering - tried to add that to the already placed order - called Amazon - 30 minutes trying to login with a sent link, didn’t work, kept asking to login again, requested a call back via the app so that rep would have access to account already, that person called, put me on hold, she couldn’t figure it out, then transferred to someone else to help and he wanted to send a link for another login process again !!!!!!  Forget it - you just lost $89 more in sales and we will attempt to assemble - tempted to cancel the whole order!!!!!!!!",1.0,116,0.9999999881515619,1.1848438119521632e-08,31.30117838266307,Low Trust
Bärb Marcötte,CA,1.0,If I could give anything less than zero I would!! They keep giving me the run around for getting into my account and I’m sick and tired of it!!! I just want to buy some stuf!!!! They’ve made me give my credit card statement multiple time to get back into my account and they keep doing this to me!! To top it off I can’t even contact them because they’re not allowing it right now. I can’t even get a refund or cancel my orders. I don’t even know how to get in contact with them! I’m ready to kill myself over this!!,1.0,103,0.9999999877441476,1.2255852444020832e-08,31.15535675412745,Low Trust
Raj bant,CA,1.0,Customer service is horrendous!!Customer service is horrendous!!! Physically impossible to speak to a human being. Delivery driver did not leave parcel in safe place as requested! Tried to speak to someone to complain but not possible to do so. Amazon has MASSIVELY gone down hill!!!!!!!!,1.0,45,0.9999999859325601,1.406743987963921e-08,30.50476794958624,Low Trust
A BN,GB,1.0,"Atrocious customer service! Amazon in general is awful!Customer service is awful! Spend hours explaining to one person who cannot allow you to speak to a Manager, if they have said yes then you find out it’s a supervisor who doesn’t have a manager!!  Then 90%of the time the Manager just repeats something that is on no relevance to the situation! I spoke to 6 different people today! Looked up on Google to see if I could speak to someone from the UK… got through and not UK!Prime is useless! You think you have purchased from Prime, no you haven’t and returning it is always ‘ it hasn’t been checked yet!’ Have to chase up every time for a refund which takes 7-9 working days! Yet our money is taken for payment immediately!Everything is useless.  Delivery is traumatic waiting to see if you get a parcel or thrown a parcel!!",11.0,149,0.9999999854117332,1.4588266816772943e-08,31.671341166878285,Low Trust
John Jones,US,1.0,"I have been an Amazon customer since May 19, 2007 - Dec. 3, 2022. From 2019 - 2022 my Amazon delivery have been in constant! Amazon delivery drivers would keep leaving my packages at wrong address randomly! I have two videos of Amazon delivery drivers placing my packages at the wrong address. I have made several phone calls to Amazon customer service and logistics about this issue and Amazon delivery would get my address right and the very next order delivery my order to the wrong address! I was a loyal Prime Amazon customer from May 19, 2007 - Dec. 3, 202! I would loved Amazon customer services and delivery but from 2019 - 2022 Amazon delivery would not deliver my orders to my address constantly! I have made several phone calls to Amazon about their delivery employees not be able to deliver to my address constantly. Amazon customer service would refer me to this website: no links allowed  On this page there is a line item detailing this:RISK OF LOSS All purchases of physical items from Amazon are made pursuant to a shipment contract. This means that the risk of loss and title for such items pass to you upon our delivery to the carrier.  This rule would apply if Amazon was not the shipper but when Amazon is suppose to deliver my package, Amazon takes on the risk of loss because amazon is the carrier.   On Nov 29, 2022, I ordered:  ORICO Hard Drive Case 3.5inch 20-Bay HDD/SSD Multi-Protection Storage Suitcase with Foam Hard Case Shockproof Anti-Static MoistureProof Carrying Case -PSC L20 but it does not hold 20 hard disk drives because I cannot close the lid with 8 hard disk drives in it!  Transformers: A Visual History (Limited Edition) Hardcover is item should up in January 2023 but amazon state dit was delivered on Dec. 21, 2023  On November 24, 2022: Seagate IronWolf Pro 16TB NAS Internal Hard Drive HDD – CMR 3.5 Inch SATA 6GB/S 7200 RPM 256MB Cache for Raid Network Attached Storage, Data Recovery Rescue Service and Amazon stated it was delivered on Dec. 4, 2022 and Amazon delivery stated they gave it to someone but I live alone! Amazon also had me wait for a order because I had to sign for it and they just left it at the wrong address!  On November 13, 202 2 Bayonetta 2 - (Nintendo Switch) but it was not a copy for my country! I could not access the DLC!    I can go on and on but Amazon has decided to first close my account because abuse and then backtrack when I filed credit card disputes for fraud! NowI can only purchase digital goods and nothing physical! I have been with Amazon for over decade and now they want to pull this nonsense! Amazon cannot expect customers to pay for lost and malfuntioning products and claim I am abusing Amazon's policy! Amazon needs better employees and better vetting what is on their website! I want my account back!Date of experience: December 24, 2022",6.0,507,0.9999999849906689,1.5009331111315305e-08,35.68704505781372,Low Trust
Nicola Di Bari,DK,1.0,CUSTOMER SERVICE ARE THE WORST!!!! used to be AMAZING! but on these days are uselesssss!!! please replace of those USELESS human for AI ASAP!!!!!! pleaseeee,4.0,25,0.999999984298112,1.5701888012031873e-08,30.280427032991202,Low Trust
Teri Edwards,US,1.0,"If I could give zero stars I would!  I have my garage opener completely fall apart.   I ordered from Amazon because it promised same day delivery.  So, here I am 3 days later and no opener.  Amazon would only offer me a $5.00 coupon!  B.S.!!!!!!  And for this they discontinued their smile charity program!!!!!!! I will now rarely order from them.  I will order directly from vendor.",6.0,67,0.9999999829802603,1.701973972867421e-08,30.75154319535042,Low Trust
Tracy DeFoe,US,1.0,"The very worst!  They sent me an email regarding recalled products and to contact customer service for a refund.  I contacted customer service and after over an hour of arguing with them, they said that I can't have a refund because the order is expired and it's to late.  Understand that by law they must refund recalled items. The product was purchased in August 2019 and the recall just came out on January 30, 2020 covering January 2013-November 2019.  This, by law, must be refunded, but no, they will let me return it with a restocking fee.  Yes, that is right, a restocking fee for a product that is recalled and they are going to restock it!!!!!!   WTH!!!!!!!  How does Amazon get away with this?  I am contact the FDA, the BBB and t",1.0,134,0.9999999821122548,1.788774517397229e-08,31.50308558311412,Low Trust
Angel R,GB,1.0,"As a loyal yet disabled customer of amazon, I've had nothing but problems with the drivers and customer service advisors who couldn't care less about their customers!!I have additional delivery requirements on my account yet their incompetent useless drivers REFUSE POINT BLANK TO FOLLOW THEM which includes to hand packages to me as the gap between house and doorstep are huge and I've fallen and got PHYSICALLY HURT as a result of the drivers refusing to follow instructions!! Each time I contacted amazon customer service and all they did was patronise me and have the ""too bad so sad"" attitude towards me even though I explained what happened and that my face was BLEEDING from where it hit the doorframe!! When I refused to be patronised they tried to shut me up by offering money which I refused!!!!THIS IS HOW THEY TREAT THEIR CUSTOMERS SO I'D THINK TWICE IF I WERE YOU BEFORE ORDERING FROM THEM!!!! THEY ARE TOXIC TO CUSTOMERS ",7.0,161,0.9999999749989892,2.500101081714945e-08,31.805946286505954,Low Trust
M K Maury,US,2.0,"Amazon makes sure a customer can't get in touch when they claim that a delivery has been made to my door or to the porch. First problem: there's no porch. Second problem and the reason for my complaint: THERE'S NO SIGN OF A DELIVERY OF ANY SORT ANYWHERE TO BE FOUND!!! And Amazon makes sure that I will never get it!!! They say to use their chat, only the chat isn't available!!! There were two failed deliveries priced at $8.20 and $11.28. Neither order arrived. I have given the most explicit instructions; maybe I have to draw a photo map as well?!?!?!? Now I worry that all the orders I place are going to be left just anywhere and I'll just pay for things that I'll never receive. I notice that direct interaction is not possible. That forces me to file complaints elsewhere, which is what I am doing now because I am given no alternative. And I don't appreciate lying of any sort. No, it was not delivered to my door. Funny that Walmart managed to deliver to me with no problem. Amazon has failed me. There's no other way to describe it. I feel sick now. This is what is done to a disabled senior male these days. I'll just post my complaint everywhere possible; I have no other alternative. Some possibility of making contact with a human being should be available; when no possibility is made available, ripping off a customer is child's play. If I have to go out and lead the delivery person by the hand to get to my door, TELL ME SO IN PLAIN ENGLISH, A LANGUAGE IN WHICH I HAVE WRITTEN AND PUBLISHED!!! Amazon has a publication of mine on record, so they can't say my instructions aren't clear. What burns me most is the lying. Delivery was not made. The app gives me no way to make contact. Maybe they assume I'll die before a delivery is made. I give up. I have no way of guessing anymore. If Walmart made a delivery to my door, Amazon should have been able to do the same thing -- maybe. Normally, they store large deliveries in lockers on the property here and give the customer codes to log into the lockers. Instead, they claimed to deliver them to my door when there was nothing to be found. I faxed them about this development and received no notice of change in my favor.",3.0,409,0.9999999736129843,2.638701568358215e-08,64.58777473494249,Medium Trust
James KING,US,1.0,"They working with fraud companies and they dont care you are victim or not! LET ME TELL YOU WHAT WILL HAPPEN IF YOU ORDER SOMETHING FROM FRAUD COMPANY. First fraud company posting an item with nice picture,you ordering,they charging money from your bank account,after 24 hour they sending you an email about item THEY DONT HAVE IT!!! you looking to your banck account but you seem is charged already by amazon,you talking with amazon they not seeing first charged from amazon after 30 minute fight they sending you to another department and they starting to see and telling you money will be in your account 3-5 business day!!! EVEN YOU DIDNT BUY ANYTHING,EVEN ITS THEIR FAULT BECAUSE THEY SHOWING YOU AN ITEM AVAILABLE WHAT IS OUT OF STOCK,and after a while when you talk with amazon agent and tell them about why you allowing this kind fraud sellers in amazon? they offering you $10 for keeo your mouth shut!!! I cant believe that is happened today with amazon its big insult they offering money for keep people mouth shut! And thats why im reporting this here so maybe they can understand little bit they cant buy everybody with their money!!!",1.0,200,0.9999999724228145,2.7577185535143656e-08,32.243411362033704,Low Trust
SoniR,GB,1.0,"Amazon.com is the worst customer service I have ever come across. I’m in the uk and shop all over the world and never experienced this kind of customer service ever. I returned an entire order of 6 creams because the packing label had discrepancies when compared the my original. They refunded me for only one item, when I contacted them by email I got different replies each time from different named representatives, I’m Indian and I could recognise that the representative names were all indian. They cause ld ne do much inconvenience and frustration due to them not doing their jobs properly, they never read past history of messages and simply just threw out emails replies which took me back to step 1 and having to explain the issue over and over again. In the end I had to call and ask to speak to a manager, I was put through to Africa and the manager refunded me! Sorry but wherever there are Indians dealing with customer services, they are useless! They are getting paid to not do their job properly but I fact confuse matters worse and they do not support which is what they are paid to do! So disappointing that a customer has to go through this stress to get a refund they are owed! My question still is, if weight of my return parcel clearly proves the weight of 6 items then how on earth are they saying I only returned one! Where have the other 5 items gone????? Fraud! That’s what!!!!!!! Anyways I got my refund in end but it was a total mess and this is due to customer service representatives in INDIA!",12.0,279,0.999999966501788,3.349821198206371e-08,33.129558601438916,Low Trust
Recordgirlie,US,1.0,"DON'T USE YOUR CREDIT CARD CASH BACK W AMAZON! THEY TAKE 20% OF SOME CARDS!! I've had a good experience w Amazon and returns but I just signed up my Chase cash back credit card to use my cash back CREDIT, just to realize Amazon is taking 20% of my money!!. (When I use my other card, Capitol One Spark card Amazon gives me 100% credit but on my new Chase card Amazon takes 20%! So I've decided just to redeem my cash back at the credit card site on all my cards, just in case!) Amazon takes 20%! EXAMPLE; On certain cards (Chase for sure) If you have a $100 cash back credit and use it to buy something on Amazon they will only credit you $80 and keep $20!! Is this legal!? (Look at the place on Amazon check out where you get your credit card redemption and you'll see something like this. ""$32 total credit. $26 available to use w Amazon!"") That tipped me off and then I looked it up. Buyer be aware!!",1.0,177,0.9999999661457208,3.385427915780781e-08,31.98541952782332,Low Trust
anad adi,SE,1.0,STOPPPPP USING UPS!!!!!!!! I hate the frustration and the extra work UPS puts me through every single time!!!!! I will stop using Amazon just because I can’t handle UPS anymore…… they always make me walk around 30 minutes to pick up my packages when I have several pick up points 2…5…6 minutes away from ny house. Ridiculous service.,6.0,58,0.9999999652122179,3.478778209942135e-08,30.65059063450969,Low Trust
C C,US,1.0,"What a DUFUS!The site said to request a refund from Customer Service. Chatted with Micaella about my order being lost. I requested a refund as advised from Amazon. She instructed me to ask neighbors if they received the order. Stupid! It says it was lost, get a refund. She again said she was unable to refund as it already shipped.Gosh! Read your computer!!!!!She then said to check my mailbox.Our Mailbox is a UPS Store.After many attempts, she asked how I would like the refund.Stupid Chick, she never performed a Refund, just said she did.I had to chat back to get a REAL PERSON!!!!!!",1.0,103,0.999999964102664,3.5897335992629564e-08,31.15535793620163,Low Trust
