Lanet Wynn Kehl,US,1.0,"ORDES TAKE LONGER AND LONGER TO SHIP! Prime membership when I started was guaranteed 1 day delivery....OK fine, I'm a realistic person it was usually here within 3 days, NO problem. Now you're lucky to have your package in 7 days!!! This is becoming VERY VERY UNEXCEPTABLE!!! I pay for prime membership and there are ABSOLUTELY NO REWARDS TO THAT ANYMORE! I mean seriously PRIME MEMBERSHIP IS A JOKE ANYMORE...What do you get with it? - free shipping that TAKES FOREVER, streaming movies that you still have to pay for to watch anything you want to watch, and oh yippy streaming music, but oh you can't listen to the best of the music they have - get this, (UNLESS, YUP YOU GUESSED IT, ""PAY MORE FOR IT"")!!! PRIME REALLY SUCKS! $130 Annually really for ABSOLUTELY NOTHING.",1.0,136,0.99999969068046,3.093195399817006e-07,31.525534254535607,Low Trust
Andy Jackson,GB,1.0,"I placed an order on Prime on the 3rd December for delivery on the 4th for my boys birthday on the 5th.What has transpired to be a simple order has been a nightmare with no end in sight due to short minded CS support. Nobody with any empathy or intelligence to provide a simple solution to a problem.Anyway order has not been delivered 10 days after it was due to arrive. The item is still on the site being sold on NDD, it was an XPLORA 5 Smart watch worth £150, so for 2 weeks they have had my money and not provided anything. They keep saying its being escalated to the fulfillment center but the truth is they have no clue. They even told me to cancel and re-order as the item could be delivered NDD??!!! Can anyone tell me how that makes any sense!! Contacted Managing Director email box and Bezo's one but predictably went through to Customer Relations who told me to wait another 7 days whilst they escalated to their fulfillment center!Not had an issue before with Amazon but typically when something goes wrong they don't have the infrastructure or the talent to resolve customer problems.By far and a way the worst customer experience i have ever had with no solution in sight!!!!!!My little boy continues to wait.....",10.0,222,0.999999674565013,3.2543498695858375e-07,32.490201353072955,Low Trust
