katrina heles,US,1.0,"Amazon scams people!!! I don’t order things from amazon often, but sometimes they do have some cool stuff. I ordered one thing. When I checked out there was option for a one time FREE prime delivery. I was then automatically charged for delivery as a separate transaction! It wasn’t a big charge so I decided to let it go, but now my package is two days late and I received an email that I will be charged monthly for a amazon prime account. You know the one I never wanted. I called the customer service and line and after talking to a stupid machine for 30 minutes I was transferred to a real person just to answer the same questions again! She said the package was delayed and won’t be here for 5 MORE DAYS!! No refund for the shipping. The free prime shipping trail is a scam. It is not free, and it is not any faster than the regular free shipping! My package was important and time sensitive and I would have paid for the faster shipping if I had known this would have been a huge issue! When I told the customer service rep that she immediately tried to refund me. I told her that I still wanted my item, but I wanted to cancel any further payments! VERY annoyed with the service of amazon in every aspect. I will not be order ever again unless this issue is resolved to satisfaction! It is not just OK for packages to be a week late and then receive no explanation!",1.0,262,0.9999994164700604,5.835299395906546e-07,32.93889625445547,Low Trust
