Eric,US,1.0,"Amazon had a PDP Concept Maple 24” Bass drum advertised for $280, a killer deal! I ordered it and 2 days later they write and say it was undeliverable, damaged in shipment and had to be returned to Amazon. They said I had to reorder it for $480! I know what they did. They put the wrong price on the wrong drum. So they tell me it’s undeliverable and I have to now order it for $200 more dollars! That is absolutely unacceptable!! Amazon is now a trillion dollar company and they won’t hold to what they advertised this drum for. They never had a place to leave feedback for this transaction, but all my other orders had a tab to leave feedback. I wonder why??!!I have been a Prime member for years and thought Amazon was better than this. Apparently not! I had already ordered a special case for it, which is now useless. Amazon MORE than earned this 1 star rating on this one!! Buyer beware....if Amazon catches itself in a mistake, trust me...they’ll put it back on you, the customer. Like I said, absolutely unacceptable!!",2.0,188,0.9999994153900862,5.846099138118177e-07,32.10883461467965,Low Trust
