Amy Yager,US,1.0,"If you want to steal someone’s credit card and find a safe place to max it out, have goods delivered to your door without ever having to leave the couch! Come to Amazon! 5 star service for all thieves, abusers, etc everywhere! You can steal another customer of theirs banking info and charge as much as you want. Amazon will never give your name, address, or any of your identifying information to the card owner, the bank, or even the police! You will remain a valued customer even after your charges are confirmed as fraudulent! If you are a normal person who uses their own money, beware! Amazon does not care about you. Amazon only cares about making money, and if someone steals yours and uses it they will not care! They will give you their information because that is confidential! Users beware, criminals have a hay day!!!!",1.0,148,0.9999991896877825,8.103122175473487e-07,31.660163903159948,Low Trust
Julie,US,1.0,"I have had an Amazon account for YEARS!!  It sure would be nice and beneficial to know exactly which review(s) are supposed to be so ""unusual"", and that are supposed to be the problem!  I haven't even written any reviews for a month, probably more. I can't even remember the last time I wrote a review or for which products.  ALL REVIEWS have to go through an approval process by Amazon BEFORE they are even posted ""live"" on Amazon, so why weren't any of these ""suspicious"" &/or ""unusual"" reviews ""red flagged"" and ""kicked back"" during this initial approval process? To me, this entire supposedly suspicious and unusual review blocking of my account seems very suspicious to me. After YEARS of buying and leaving reviews, with ZERO problems on Amazon.......then BOOM, suddenly, I'm just blocked, no explanation, Amazon doesn't even bother to notify me about any of this. I have left a few UNBIASED reviews for a free or discounted product offer, that a seller has included an offer/promotional card or label on their product to do so for the product I ordered from them. HOWEVER, I have ALWAYS disclosed this information in my review (just as have a LOT of other buyers have done on product reviews they have left) and ALL of my reviews, no matter what I was offered or not offered have ALWAYS been true and unbiased! I, myself rely on HONEST, ACCURATE and UNBIASED reviews from other customers for products they have purchased on & off Amazon. I would NEVER leave a false, untrue, biased, or inaccurate review, never! There are already too many false, fake, and biased reviews out there for products &/or scammer sellers on and off Amazon!  That is another reason why I disclose in any review I write, if a seller has ""solicited"" me to write a review (because I feel this is somewhat unethical) AND in fact, I will leave a  more critical review for that product. I have several of these offerings right now, that I have NOT reviewed. If this is NOT allowed on Amazon, then why doesn't Amazon penalize and BLOCK the SELLER and their ACCOUNT from being able to sell their product on Amazon? Why is the buyer/customer being penalized? I have seen so much of this in other customer reviews for YEARS (obviously it wasn't/isn't a problem because all those reviews are visible and have not been removed or blocked by Amazon)! It seems like 80% of everything I have purchased in the past year has come with some sort of solicitation included......this is a SELLER problem and NOT a buyer problem!  BUYERS have ZERO control on what a SELLER includes with their product when it's shipped out to them! So again, why would Amazon be blocking the BUYERS?One more thing I just found out and would like to bring to everyone's attention! I just looked and every single product that I received a solicitation card with the product or solicitation directly on the product itself, and that I still have the solicitation info for was FULFILLED and SHIPPED directly from/by AMAZON! If this is against Amazon policy it would then seem that AMAZON needs to get their own ""house"" in order and stop penalizing their paying customers for solicitation material that their very own Amazon employees are putting in the product packages before shipping them! I have canceled my Prime account and other Amazon subscriptions and will not place any further orders through Amazon. As I am sure Amazon doesn't want to have any further business relationship, with an all of a  sudden, ""suspicious"" and ""unusual"" buyer.",2.0,602,0.9999990607813081,9.392186919310319e-07,36.752711010289616,Low Trust
Kevin Lee Travis,GB,1.0,"Have been a prime member for years. Recently - the massive company that is Amazon, not only is charging me for membership (which is so I can enjoy free deliveries), but have now started charging for next day delivery and you now have to spend over £20.00 for same day delivery. Why are we paying for membership? I would like the Managing /Director of Amazon to read this!! Please make sure he gets this message. You had my my loyalty for years. Please do not trample it!I never though Amazon would have become so underhanded to try these tactics.I also spoke with an agent today who was the most rude, obnoxious, customer service agent I have ever come across. She was not listening to me, she was over talking me, she was condescending, she did not try to help, she tried to frighten me by saying that my account had been compromised as I had 42 different accounts? If this is the case then Amazon has let fraudulent activity take place without my knowledge.Call was made today on 14/10/2023 from the UK - the agent I spoke with was named Samantha.Disgusting behaviors from Amazon and it's associates!!!!!Please let me know what you intend to do about the above two issues!!!!",12.0,210,0.9999990124422398,9.875577602347363e-07,32.35562986022116,Low Trust
Jessica,GB,1.0,"I have bought quite a few things off amazon and they are very hit and miss. Both with quality, Customer service and not to mention their couriers. I have either had my items delivered and them not turn up, turn up damaged or thrown over my hack gate or left outside for people to steal and when this has happened I have been in, I am in majority of the time since I work from home but yet nobody has knocked! Then I get an email saying its been delivered! Half the time it hasn't or for all I know its been robbed. I am dealing with a situation atm where I bought a motherboard and kitten biscuits, They didnt turn up but again saying they have but the woman cant find anything saying that its been delivered even though it says it has. Again not got the product. No refund or replacement given or help even! I was just told to wait 24 hours which I did and now they are saying wait 3 days to investigate. Ive paid for these with my laybuy account and this is going to put my account in default and add a late charge! So not only are they messing me about but they are causing me unnecessary trouble!! Im also still waiting for my £120 refund for my pure white large rug that turned up open, ripped and beyond usable. It was rotten! Again no refund given and its been over a year for this one!! Company was contacted, no resolve, Promised by amazon if I don't get a refund from the company they will issue it automatically and take it off the company themselves, This was not done! Going to take this and my current case to ombudsman. amazon a billion dollar company are stingy b*stards and wont give you your money back!!",30.0,312,0.9999990063579912,9.936420087841569e-07,33.49976925585254,Low Trust
Trustp!lot,NL,1.0,"Never thought i would be giving Amazon 1 star, but they deserve it now! Sh!t delivery notifications, sh!t video service, but A REAL BAD CUSTOMER SERVICE! THAT IS FF_IN UP THE WHOLE AMAZONE EXPERIENCE!!!Promising 5eu as recomp for the 10th time not delivering on the date it says when ordering. After the idiot on the other side promised 5 eu, he/she (Biljana)  closed the chat with: one moment please and left and closed the FF-in chat!. A different one on chat: Same bullsh!t as the first one and ending with: Contact us after delivery to get your recomp....Thats not how customer service works when you guys keep FF-in up!THE ISSUE (what you can read back in a LOT of reviews): Delivery date is different then stated when ordering, so they are always lying. (i got the whole chat history!)Amazone is a perfect example of a company grown to much. ZERO QUALITY!Same goes for Primevideo, Look op movie 'HEIST'Some weird african movie will play instead of Heist. And Amazon does nothing while telling them they uploaded wrong movies....While typing this, even tough it's 'only' 4 eu per month. I am thinking about stopping it, what 'pros' are there left....? Video quality is down, you don't get the movies they offer and worst of all, the Dutch subtitles are heavily incorrect... They don't care about quality it seems",17.0,226,0.999998999144378,1.000855622046437e-06,32.5351033237682,Low Trust
Nancy Saulnier,CA,1.0,extremely disappointed in Amazon will never order from them or use them again. It took over 40 minutes four different Representatives to have three different payments cancelled off my credit card!!!! First representative was amazing but said she couldn't cancel any of the charges and had to put me through to somebody higher..... Which was fine. I had to re-explain my story three more times the last three representatives were extremely rude!!!! It's disgusting how these large companies treat customers. I was extremely nice and still received attitude!!!,1.0,88,0.9999989808599504,1.019140049574041e-06,30.987151349599223,Low Trust
Peter,PL,1.0,"I do not recommend Amazon !!! I advise against buying if you don't have to!Amazon represents the attitude of greed and greed. Only profit counts - at all costs!They do everything so as not to lose their purchase order - that's why they send goods for which they can't collect money. At the same time, they extort additional fees under the guise of not receiving payment for the goods!And they immediately threaten me with debt recovery!It's unfair! If Amazon can't get the amount on my card, why is it sending goods !!! Facing me with only one option - paying extra costs!In addition, I have to analyze the whole situation, wonder what they mean, write to the bank why the download did not take place, write back, get nervous ...I lost a lot of time dealing with this matter. I do not recommend this store.",1.0,145,0.9999989629048234,1.0370951766258685e-06,31.626524092560288,Low Trust
Glynn,GB,1.0,"Hi, I've been an amazon customer for a few years now and I've spent thousands of pounds not only on online purchases but movies and tv shows until recently I've been reasonably happy with the service I've been provided. Recently all our packages now come from your newly opened Rochdale branch and now after receiving good service from your Sheffield branch my parcels are posted through an empty house on an adjacent street and now I spend my spare time talking to your customer service people who are fantastic. I live on Hollins mill lane and your dumb drivers from Rochdale post my products through a door on a different street I also live in an apartment on the second floor so it's reasonable to assume they never get through the security doors to be able to knock on my door. As a lorry driver im only in weekends so when I'm guaranteed a specific day that is what I go by. I am disgusted by the way I've been treated recently to the point I am now going to shop elsewhere and not recommend amazon to my family and friends anymore I am also amazed that nobody has asked me why I've decided to cancel my membership and offer no apologies for keeping me hanging around waiting for deliveries that will never arrive I am truly disappointed with the treatment I've received you need to sort this out a little compensation doesn't hurt but your treating your customers like crap shame on you greedy Amazon. !!!!!!!!!!!!",4.0,257,0.9999989533005238,1.0466994762037274e-06,32.882834163352946,Low Trust
Frank,GB,1.0,"Amazon's owner is one of the wealthiest people in the world and it isn't just because his company sells megatonnes of pre-landfill Chinese products.  He makes his billions off the sweat of workers who he doesn't even pay a living wage.  Many of them are so poor they survive on food stamps, whilst he lives a lifestyle so luxurious most of us couldn't even dream of it.  Now he's talking about finding ways to spend his gluttonous gains by investing in space.How about paying your workers a living wage here on earth Bezos?Read this enlightening truthdig.com article on how Jeff Bezos' sociopathic gluttony could have been used to save lives, feed and clothe the poor: ""one-man-could-end-world-hunger-but-he-wont""",592.0,116,0.9999989401163023,1.0598836976960513e-06,31.30123078442605,Low Trust
Joe Moreno,US,1.0,"Sellers  were great on Amazon fast reliable shipping ! But when it came to delivery, the girl that was to deliver my package was blocking my drive way ( I was next delivery and I always wait to get my delivered package as soon as it’s on my door step as requested!)she had to move her truck due to car wanting out of my drive way. So as I was waiting for her on my balcony to see her walk up my drive way ( and she’s only a bit up the road from my driveway remind you) I have my cell in hand and get a text telling me that my package was handed over to a (not me) resident?(what!) and was delivered ( I recently about a month ago bought a Amazon card at c.v. s store and when I got home to make a purchase I loaded my card up and when I pulled the silver strip and put in the code ,it tells me that the card has already been used and is invalid! Apparently there’s a “pre-paid visa and Amazon card scam going on ! Anyway after reporting it to Amazon Support and cvs store bottom line was that I had to take the loss and that they will not credit me or refund my money !! And now there delivery is just handing out package to people with out asking for any I.D and wrong address they need to hire drivers that are more experienced,  and getting the write address that’s printed on label ( otherwise people that can read! ) and Amazon need to be more professional and start reimbursing there customers money when thing like this(scammers) happens! I just recently bout an ottoman that cost me $365,00! (On an Amazon card! I am great full that I wasn’t scammed on that card purchase ! But every time I by a amazing card it like taking a chance now for me, makes me wonder why am I using Amazon?",3.0,336,0.9999989395052706,1.0604947293657574e-06,33.7689817964695,Low Trust
Takis,CY,1.0,Unfortunately very disappointed in relation to the delivery and customer service!!! people are not competent to provide correct customer service!! in relation of my order which promised to me a refund by two managers in customer service and never received!!! very bad and i will not place an order with them!!!,6.0,51,0.9999989106012857,1.089398714348988e-06,30.572124015645198,Low Trust
camille curinga,US,1.0,"Amazon is running a re-charge scam. You return an item via ups and they issue you a credit. A month later they recharge your card saying that you did not ship it back.I contacted Amazon support and this is there response;“I have checked the details and I am really sorry to inform you that as the return info was not updated that is why you were charged for the item. But no worries, I have updated the info and initiated a full refund for the item and it will be credited within 3-5 business days.”Now if you are not one to regularly check your email you might not catch these emails.Now you think this is a handled matter. But it’s NOT!!5 months later they RE-CHARGE your card AGAIN!!!They send the same response!!I can only assume their game is to bean count how many millions of consumers don’t CATCH IT!!To date this has happened 18 times to my account!!!",5.0,158,0.9999988871570883,1.11284291171021e-06,31.772349528853383,Low Trust
Im her,US,1.0,"The most HORRIABLE customer service!!!!! I spoke to 3 agent and 1 supervior to change a shipping address I was lied to several times and redid my order to change my address. My items werent even shipped before they stated that they couldnt change my shipping address! They are lazy, pathenic, workers! I will NEVER EVER order from them!!!!",1.0,59,0.9999988697305552,1.1302694448156458e-06,30.661862458508693,Low Trust
Trudy Campbell,GB,1.0,"I am disgusted with Amazon as they have blocked me from placing my honest reviews, Amazon want you to LIE and place false reviews, Many reviews are totally FALSE on their website... (This is how they like it).The reason they have blocked me was by a guy called HARSHIT.. his name fits the bill....When there has been a problem, I have phoned customer service and to be honest most have been really helpful, Some think they own Amazon like HARSHIT... He blocked my account!! Really!!!Called the accounts department and they were disgusted by what HARSHIT did.. He was reported.But still my reviews are blocked! I now leave seller reviews.. and also deal with the seller rather than Amazon.... If I have to phone Amazon it would be for a returns label for a dodgy item (lots on Amazon) but they do not care as they are making money and ripping people off...Amazon you are a DISGRACE and CORRUPT company , Your drivers are also a DISGRACE... They throw parcels at your front door rather than ring the door bell.. I asked several drivers why they do this.. All said (WE DO NOT GET PAID ENOUGH TO KNOCK YOUR DOOR) And they have too many parcels for a days work.. Most companies would NOT touch most of the lazy AMAZON drivers .. I wont go into detail as to where they come from.. But we all know!!! I hope , YES YOU AMAZON .. Read this and know you are a DISGRACE.. You treat customers the same way you treat your staff... ( would like to use a stronger word) Lets use HARSHIT's name and you will understand! ....",99.0,278,0.9999988620853443,1.1379146557244368e-06,33.118396772345235,Low Trust
Jermaine Michael Jones,GB,1.0,"Absolutely the most shocking company to ever deal with! Someone has been using my card to make purchases on their account only found out due to a bank statement, I called them up to have my card details removed to then be told we can not remove your card details on another person account due to data protection act !!! It’s my card where is my data protection?? Absolutely stupid uneducated people working behind the scenes at Amazon and to allow one of their customers to continue to use my card is outrageous!!! I’ve had to block the card so that no more transaction come from this card but for Amazon not to remove my card is a joke it’s my card and they have breached my data protection due to me making them aware of this fraud and for their manager to do sweet FA!!!!",10.0,146,0.999998857785605,1.142214394955765e-06,31.637746398437077,Low Trust
J.R.,US,1.0,"So there is a reason I pay for Amazon Prime. Mainly for the next day and two day delivery speeds. As a US Service Member with a service dog yesterday March 4th I ordered Purina One dog food because my dog was out of her food. I do not drive or own a car for that matter. I ordered and paid for next day delivery. Low and behold my order was not delivered and I received an email stating my order was delayed. I contacted customer service and first was told "" I can give you a $5 dollar credit, and have your pets food to you by March 8th"". First off $5 dollar credit is laughable since this has actually happend to me multiple times recently. Secondly as I already stated above my dog was out of her food that's why I had next day delivery.  What's my dog supposed to do until March 8th starve to death?So I asked to speak with her supervisor which his name was Sayajit or something to that nature and was pretty much told there is nothing I can do for you! This guy didn't even offer me the laughable $5 dollar credit the first lady offered me. I ASK IS THIS REALLY HOW YOU WANT TO BE KNOWN TO TREAT US SERVICE MEMBERS WHO HQVE FAUGHT FOR YOUR FREEDOMS? I have ordered stuff from Amazon before and had it delivered the same day. I truly believe that even though I was told it was with the carrier and there is nothing I can do, I should have gotten the $24 dollars I paid for the food as a credit and the dog food for free. Now mind you I live in Burlington Kentucky which is 10 mins down the road from many Amazon Warehouses aswell as The CVG Airport Amazon HUB!! I have already contacted all the local news stations here in Cincinnati Ohio. Letting them know how I was treated as a Service Member with a PTSD Service Dog. Why pay all this money yearly for a service that you Amazon can not honor. You need to consider changing your policy and taking the next day delivery off your site especially if your not going to honor it!!!I have spent probably close to 500-600 dollars roughly in the last 2 weeks with amazon and again to be treated like I was today is sad and hurtful and ridiculous. I'm curious how someone at Corporate thinks about this issue!! And how Jeff Bazos the freaking billionaire would think about US Service members being treated this way.So in a nutshell my dog has to go hungry for the next couple days until this order is delivered and your company didn't even offer me anything as a credit or nothing. Was told to wait for the order and if it doesn't come we can give you a refund or you can send it back for a refund. That my friends is totally assanine in my opinion.  My suggestion is to watch your delivery speeds cause Amazon doesn't always honor that!!!!Sincerely,STAFF SERGEANT JAMES ROSSMY SERVICE DOG 🐕‍🦺  SHAY",5.0,523,0.9999988385338804,1.1614661196146514e-06,35.866575179307105,Low Trust
A L,US,1.0,Amazon will never admit that they are wrong or messed up on their end!!! I have been a prime member for a while and now all of sudden my account is locked due to items being disputed. Their whole team is never on the same page. I've talked to 5 different people and they all are NEVER on the same page!! One person gives me a different answer each time! Thank god I cancelled my prime with them and will no longer be ordering from them again!! Their customer service team sucks ass. One guy was getting frustrated with me cause I kept questioning him. Can you blame me?? Your whole team gave me different responses!!!,1.0,116,0.9999987567008165,1.2432991834954166e-06,31.301239955200337,Low Trust
María Dolores Bolívar,US,1.0,"Customer Service reflects the zero interest Amazon has on customers. They kept trying to prove that what I was saying was not true. They kept me on hold for hours. They concluded they could not help me and when I refuse to accept their arrogant answers, they hung up on me. This is what happened, On Saturday, Jan 2nd, they allowed Amazon France to access all of the cards I have stored with Amazon due to having a Prime Membership in the US. Amazon France was trying to charge me for a year membership, 60 dollars, a transaction I had not authorized and was not aware of. So I received a call from various banks notifying me that they had cancelled my cards. End result, it is Jan 3d and I will not have access to my cards and funds unless I go in person to the banks. Banks do not encourage me to request for them to send me the new cards, since the Pandemic has slowed all transactions of that sort. So in order to access my funds I must go to the banks. Amazon cancelled a purchase I had made prior to their membership scam, coming from France. They made ME call France, on my dime, and to negotiate the reimbursement on my own. They took absolutely no responsibility on their doings on account that they do not have access to what Amazon Prime France does. However, my card information is stored in the US, since I live in California and have nothing to do with France. The bank had the right word for all of this non sense... FRAUD. They are handling this at the FRAUD Department. Yet Amazon Prime does nothing other than give me the run around. Beware of having your information stored with Amazon. and also beware of contacting them. They do not have ""customer service"". The many agents and managers *leaders* who came to the phone ""to assist"" me were reading lines and repeating things that were totally irrelevant to my issue. It seemed to me they could hardly understand me and they did not care about what I said, some even spoke over me requesting me to remain calm and understand that they could not help me. If they are so eager to push their memberships by defrauding customers, should we trust them with confidential information? In my view they showed no ethics on this matter and the leaders and the agents need to be better trained ¨to respond¨, and not merely to read  or repeat lines they have memorized. There is an uneasy feeling when the customer service agent does not really speak the language of Amazon. They need to leave you on hold while ""they check their resources"" a line they use to probably check a manual that issues them a ready made response. Their behavior is awkward, not natural... it feels as if they are machines and not humans attempting to convey messages that are of the sort one could say ""one size fits all"". It is not that they don't speak English, since they do, but they are missing on any sort of local literacy. They sound as if they come from a different planet, and not just a different country. Highly suspicious practices! As for my star, I wish there was the possibility to give the company a minus star, and even several minus stars. How else would you rate another customer service department who took hours and even days to tend to an issue!!!!!?????!!!!!!",2.0,589,0.999998751022671,1.2489773290047523e-06,36.60690484931513,Low Trust
Vicky Litchfield,GB,1.0,"I purchased a rake from electro world which arrived broken, return was agreed but I had to pay postage, at a cost of £12.12, which they said would be refunded! I sent the parcel back and queried the postage to be then told use Hermes! The company electro world is now saying they haven’t got the parcel although it feels like they aren’t even prepared to look for it without a tracking number! No refund on the item or the postage so I’m completely out of pocket!!! Amazon no help at all! I found the whole thing incredibly infuriating and stressful! Can’t even leave a review as it doesn’t meet Amazon guidelines if you mention the company!!!",3.0,117,0.9999987123961377,1.2876038623099717e-06,31.312459220350153,Low Trust
