Hallvard Kvitvik,NO,1.0,"ABSOLUTELY SHAMEFUL CUSTOMER SERVICE!! Giftcard-balances withhels for three weeks for absolutely no reason, order cancelled, no response on emails other than the same nonsense we have already been through repeatedly. Even after they claimed to have resolved the issue and apologized for the inconvenience, they haven't done sh**!! Order still cancelled, no funds returned, no explanation, no answer to my emails for weeks!! Bloodsucking Swindlers, SHAMEFUL!!!!!",1.0,66,0.9999984306872483,1.5693127517479866e-06,30.740403760085144,Low Trust
Lorena Nastase,GB,1.0,"On 15th of April i was delivered by an allocated Amazon driver two packages. One labelled with the proper ordered item from their website , and another one unlabelled  which supposed to have an Ecovacs cleaning robot . Now , to my horrid stupefaction, when taken inside , and start unpacking, instead of a robot cleaner, on that unlabelled box, i found a pack full of paper rolls!!!!!!  The reason why I am writing this experience everywhere  I can is to rise awareness on the level of theft that happens in 2023!!!! I doubt that package left the Amazon warehouse unlabelled and if so, how did the driver know where to delivery it ???? The facts are very simple, and the driver knew what he was doing not caring a damn in the world that he is seen, nobody will do anything, and the “ item” now in someone’s house will be marked as “ lost” . Such a shame I can’t post the pictures too in here …. What Amazon does? Apologies and a refund is issued, the review i wrote on their website it’s not made visible. So, how can you trust buying electronics or more expensive items from Amazon when the people who work with them steal customers goods????? And it’s happening all over Uk, mostly London not only with Amazon and why companies like these and other delivery companies don’t do anything?????? How many times they didn’t delivered the goods, or to the wrong address , or lying you were not yo be found although you were at home and so on???? And now you come to my door and disrespect me to such a horrid level to deliver me a pack full of paper rolls instead of a robot cleaner  ???  How bad is that in 2023???? Horrible , Horrible experience….. I am beyond disappointed…… this needs to change !!",15.0,315,0.9999982602683262,1.7397316738332336e-06,33.53345771008341,Low Trust
Opticalpig,US,1.0,"My account was 'put on hold' which I was told was for 'suspicious activity'. I'm an older person (over 60) and sometimes fumble a bit with tech stuff. But when I tried to resolve this... You want to talk about a VICIOUS CIRCLE!?!?You CAN NOT do an online chat with them unless you log in... HMMM? If you want to talk to them about the fact you CAN'T LOG IN, how is that possible?!? Duh!Then I called the 'security and login issue line'. Whoa. Get a drink, turn on the first Lord of The Rings movie, have the other two movies available and sit back for several HOURS OF ON HOLDNESS!!!!Finally get through to them and the guy talks to me like I'm a criminal!!! He asked me for an order number from something I've purchased. It took me a few minutes as I had deleted those e-mails. I kept saying, ""Hang on second. I'll find one"" He'd respond in a disgusted voice, ""Uh Huh... sure you will"". It was so insulting. I did eventually give him an order number.Then he said, ""I'll turn this over to our security team to check it out. They'll call you within 24 hours""They didn't. Still can't login. I have movies and books I've purchased that can only be viewed or listened to by logging in. So they've sold me these things... and have now STOLEN THEM BACK with no explanation!Amazon sucks.",1.0,238,0.999998258974925,1.7410250749971823e-06,32.669744931231314,Low Trust
JANE JUNIS,US,1.0,"Once again, Amazon has proven what a HORRENDOUS AND USELESS company it is.  On 9-11-23, at around 4:00 a.m., I ordered 2 bags of dog chews.  As a Prime member, I was told I would receive them the same day, between 7-11:00 a.m.  I get a notice around 11:10 a.m., that things are running late.  I tracked my package and was told it was out for delivery at 12:30 p.m..  Then, I get another notice telling me it won't be delivered until 9-12-23, sometime before 6:00 p.m.  I had recently gone through this same scenario with them, and called Customer Service to see what was going on.  They assured me I would get my package on 9-11-23.  I got ONE package - I had ordered TWO.   I had to call Customer Service again, only to find out Amazon had split my order, and two separate drivers would be delivering it. The tracking on the 2nd package originally indicated that it was out for delivery at 11:05 a.m. Then, I get a notice that it would not be coming until sometime before 6:00 p.m. on 9-12-23.  When I spoke to Customer Service, they they again assured me I would get the 2nd package on 9-11-23 but when I asked for a timeframe, I was told sometime on the 11th,  but no later than 6:00 p.m. on the 12th. What kind of an answer is that!!!!  It is 2:45 a.m. on 9-12-23 and NO PACKAGE!!  It is unbelievable that I have to be this frustrated over dog chews!!!!! I am going to be cancelling my Prime membership today, as I am paying for nothing.",4.0,272,0.9999982250888995,1.77491110053829e-06,33.05112632267224,Low Trust
Svetlana Raikina,US,1.0,"I return again to the issue of order delivery. Order delivers do not look at instructions and customer address. The customer service is openly rude, hands up, doesn’t answer calls and behaves terribly. It got to the point where it was necessary to report to the police about the loss of the order. Amazon Prime in every possible way avoids responsibility for all its delivery workers for this!!! I’m just shocked, for our money we have a lot of trouble and rudeness and negative! The company probably forgot that they have profits and salaries from our orders and we pay them money, they don’t pay us.we pay an annual membership fee and Amazon Prime puts $150 on credit to the client without the client’s consent, this is considered illegal, the right to dispose of the client’s finances without his consent! Moreover if you refuse to pay the entire amount at once, they turn off your prime, previously we could pay for it monthly. I am leaving this company and want to close my Amazon Prime account, but I cannot get my money back for the lost order and my membership. I have no respect for this company and no trust!!! They went beyond all humiliation of clients! SHAME on you Amazon Prime, you are unworthy of your customers!!!",2.0,218,0.9999980157534822,1.984246517761079e-06,32.44541609398601,Low Trust
Alina,NL,1.0,"Scammers!!!!!!!!I ordered a super box that cost 50€ and I received a small box which there were some headphones and a wireless camera that on wish together cost 10€and I looked for a return ticket and you can't find it anywhere, normally you should find it either in the box or online.But no, in order to send the package back, you have to contact them and guess what, they don't send you return ticket. €God sees everything!!!",12.0,77,0.9999977779119368,2.2220880632195517e-06,30.86382394792531,Low Trust
Sally Barton,US,1.0,What a scam!! I just ordered some clasps for jewelry and thought 3 weeks Dec. 24 is a long time but okay it’s Christmas. I then get the notice from Amazon saying try Dec. 24-Jan. 17!! That’s next year or 5+ weeks for 10 clasps! I do the Amazon CS on line that’s a joke after 13 min I called and gee it was marked as shipped! Ready for that it shipped but won’t be here for 5 weeks. I said let me guess it’s on a ship from CHINA! There is no way of telling this so I’m told by the human that I can refuse it or return it!! Total scam and am seriously thinking of not using Amazon any longer! They are not the only game in town nor the fastest any longer nor cheapest.UPDATE:Strange this order was canceled although I was told above I couldn’t!,2.0,149,0.9999976661094115,2.3338905884573435e-06,31.67145713199437,Low Trust
Jacki O’Leary,GB,1.0,"Absolutely appalling customer services.  I have been advised to contact my bank to file a dispute for not receiving a refund from Amazons third party seller, after I was advised by Amazon to refuse delivery of the item as I tried to cancel the order within one hour but it was mistakenly refused!  I bought the item from Amazon in good faith and they are not taking responsibility for this!!! I have lost my voice after the number of times I have phoned Amazon and explained the same thing over and over again numerous times and now I’m emotionally drained, frustrated, stressed and cannot believe Amazon have said if the seller does not respond I will not receive my refund!  This is not how I expect Amazon to respond!!!  Beware customers thinking of buying from Amazon!!!",6.0,136,0.9999974740363738,2.525963626154315e-06,31.525645086739917,Low Trust
vandjkrieger,US,5.0,"We adore Amazon!  Customer service is OUTSTANDING! I have trained in customer service throughout my career and Amazon has it in spades!!  Even though I may find a product a little cheaper elsewhere, I will always go with Amazon because they have the #1 customer service of ANY company I have ever dealt with!  Their Prime is fantastic!!  Their shipping is at light speed! You can track all of your orders. Their returns are fabulous! They are 100% reliable!  What more could you ask for?",2.0,85,0.9999970265208873,2.973479112711175e-06,150.95359791680477,High Trust
Shirl Breyfogle,US,1.0,"I like Amazon and have prime, shop often, love the shows and my kindle. Their customer service is horrendous. Some work from so and you hear children in the background and trying to interrupt, some barely speak English and some are just dumber than rocks. It generally takes several phone calls to get someone who can actually help. If I didn't like everything else about them, I would have ceased doing business with them years ago. I am so angry and frustrated with them right now I could scream. I have talked to 2 people, been on the phone a half hour and finally just hung up. I will have to try again when I get home from work. Maybe then I will get someone who speaks and understands English. I had to repeat everything over and over and over and they still couldn't get it. Incompetent!!!!!!!!!!!",2.0,147,0.9999968019210984,3.1980789015895184e-06,31.649066241578282,Low Trust
Jason,US,1.0,Amazon Prime Is Straight Dog Sh🤬🤬 Garbage !! Pay to have a prime account only for orders to ship as long as an regular order or get lost and get nothing in return for the damn headache !! Customer service is way worst & would make you physically want to reach out & touch someone!! For a loyal customer that have spent thousands of dollars with your no good asses you would think do you would get better service !! Some companies or people really think you have to spend money with them when my money will spend ANYWHERE !!!,4.0,100,0.9999967511692758,3.2488307242228842e-06,31.121867433123423,Low Trust
