Pauline.,GB,1.0,"I decided to not renew my Amazon prime subscription it's too expensive now and the service is appalling.Be warned before you cancel read all the small print. I have four Amazon devices and a fire stick. If I cancel I will lose all my files, photos, the movies I purchased from Amazon, I'm sure that counts as stealing in England! My money paid for the films, my money paid the subscription but everything I have on my devices They Will Erase!!! That's stealing at the very least. Maybe they don't have that law in America maybe the bald dumb ass who owns Amazon does it all the time. Reading the reviews on here I'm not the only customer being ripped off and lied to in a right royal way...forgot they don't have a royal family across the pond just a bunch of lying cheating thieves!Shame on you Amazon!!!!!",24.0,148,0.9999966306700296,3.369329970359658e-06,31.66029185404759,Low Trust
Adrienne,GB,3.0,"Delivered next day as agreed and happy with the item however the delivery drivers are in such a rush they don't even have time to knock my door, they just leave the item in my drive-way. Anyone could have taken it, luckily I was in at the time!!!!!!!!!!!",2.0,48,0.999996478885665,3.521114334992248e-06,90.5385944516786,High Trust
Barbara Cox,US,1.0,"NOBODY CAN HELP ME!! When I finally talked to a live person at Amazon, and that was difficult,  THEY HUNG UP ON ME!!!!!!!!",1.0,23,0.999996302439943,3.697560057025484e-06,30.258177026067912,Low Trust
Gaynor Donnelly,GB,1.0,Would rate less than 1 star if possible!! Absolutely disgusted at the treatment I have received. I ordered a fire tablet which conveniently broke after 2 years and 6 days use. It was 6 days out of warranty and I contacted customer service who refused a refund or repair but instead offered a discount of 40% on a new tablet. They sent me an email saying to go ahead and order a new tablet and that I would be refunded a 40% discount of the price of the tablet. I ordered the tablet the following day and was waiting on the refund. 6 months later and still no refund. I have been on live chat trying to sort the issue and passed around countless different associates who have all been zero help! I have sent countless emails with zero response. I finally got speaking to an actual human being on the phone tonight who was even less help. This associate is apparently the highest in her team for customer resolutions and basically said yes she can see the email and promise of discount that was made to me but unfortunately it was incorrect and they cannot fulfill it and process the refund!!! I asked if she was happy breaching this written contract that was made between me and the associate and she said yes. I also made her aware that I never would have ordered the new tablet without the promise of the discount. She couldn't have cared less. I now have to escalate my complaint again and explain this to another individual who will more than likely fob me off also. Really disappointed and disgusted especially since I'm a prime member and constantly shop there. Will be cancelling my prime membership today!!! Absolutely fuming! Also advise people against buying the fire kids tablets. They are cheap and handy with a lifespan of 2 years then you need to purchase a new one! Better off paying a little more for an apple ipad,2.0,333,0.9999961456129303,3.854387069734955e-06,33.7354703413389,Low Trust
Adamah Matau,US,3.0,"Amazon is always misplacing my packages and their only solution to something I actually needed is to refund my money or replace the item!! What are they even doing to the delivery people or delivery service?! Recently, USPS, the worst package delivery service in this country was tasked to deliver my air conditioner. Why is beyond me, because even the USPS rep was surprised by this. Amazon customer service provided no empathy or solution. I called USPS and they themselves had no idea where the package 📦 was which was both bewildering and upsetting!!! Amazon customer service no longer seems to follow-up, so I figure, delivery people are ripping them off because they know Amazon will just simply replace the item and that somehow everything is supposed to be right in my world?! I'm a pretty honest person, and that just doesn't sit well with me. Especially when it's hot as all get out in my apartment and I expected to have what I ordered on the date that it was shown to delivered. What made matters even worse; all of the accessories arrived on time!!!! ",6.0,186,0.9999958469256759,4.153074324109163e-06,92.08657893806841,High Trust
paulwills,GB,1.0,"This Company is a total joke.  I have received an order today where the driver just left the item on the door mat in full view of passers by on the public footpath some 3ft from our front door.  This is not the first time but it will be the last as my purchasing will not be done through Amazon again.  I attempted to contact support and eventually spoke to someone in an overseas (cheap labour) centre.  After explaining my concerns the agent then said they would transfer me to someone else.... but that was the end of any interaction, I waited for 11 minutes but the conversation stopped.  Amazon are a huge retailer but do not back up their operation with any type of Customer Service or care and simply send the complaints to all these overseas centres who simply fob you off.  Its appalling service which is only apparent once they have got your money.  The staff don't give a damn, the online chat agents are insincere and the delivery drivers well say no more !!!!!!!!!",72.0,178,0.999995828860841,4.171139158959392e-06,31.996843441983184,Low Trust
Lisa Torrence,US,1.0,My problem is with amazon delivery - the driver attempted delivery over an hour prior to the scheduled delivery times of 7am because i suppose it was convenient for them - and then requested I provide the security access code to my home - UNACCEPTABLE!!!! There was a reason that delivery  window time was accepted  - when i told Amazon to have the driver come back during the scheduled delivery window - they said it may not be until tomorrow- when i asked to cancel the order - i was told it was not possible- i then asked for a supervisor who then was amazingly able to cancel it!!! However failed to log a complaint until i demanded he do so - i then a heard bunch of typing 😏 - when i asked what was to be done - he basically said its up to the center to decide if anything - 😠 !! Amazon is becoming a monopoly with providing incompetent and bad service and seems to be running amuck with no protocol or set procedures to handle issues - and is randomly doing what it wants when it wants - i will be filing another complaint and now  with the AG to break this monopoly up! I also noted they made it very difficult to have a centralized place to file online complaints!,1.0,226,0.9999957776769534,4.222323046643162e-06,32.53526439713943,Low Trust
Dollie01,CA,1.0,"ACCOUNT ON HOLD; 2-DAYS BEFORE CHRISTMAS!!!Twice I confirmed the Account/Payment information verbally, third time details were confirmed via documentation. Purchases have previously been made with the Mastercard that is on file (details attached); however, you continue to put the account on hold 3 DAYS BEFORE CHRISTMAS!!!!Apparently, Customer Service, Account Specialist, Escalation Department or possibly the Janitor can not understand that it is Christmas and the total of the purchases, as well as the number of purchases will demonstrate as ""Unusual Activity.""I find it very hard to respect the process, when Amazon does not respect their customers. I can understand putting the account on hold for your repetitive concerns, I can not understand being denied complete access; I am unable to see what orders have been put on hold, I have no idea what CHRISTMAS GIFTS are coming. As it stands, this is the service I have received • account put on hold; confirmed details verbally, promised it would not happen again • account put on hold; confirmed details verbally, promised it would not happen again • account put on hold for the THIRD TIME• required info provided; requested documents sent• completely denied access from account; have no idea what CHRISTMAS GIFTS are coming • phone customer service, email sent to Account Specialists (lol); told they would get back to me in 24-HOURS, OR AS SOON AS THEY COULD, (IT IS 2-DAYS BEFORE CHRISTMAS) !!!• asked for contact information, apparently the ""Account Specialist"" do not have phone lines or emails addresses, I can only assume my request was sent to them courier pigeon • my bank account shows the funds required for my Amazon order (that I may not get) are ON HOLD.....REALLY?!",3.0,282,0.999995539400968,4.46059903203011e-06,33.16343110622754,Low Trust
Christopher Fitzgerald,US,1.0,"So I Bought a grill off Amazon  through  a 3rd party  Grill came in damaged  we refused  it when UPS tried delivering it  because  of the damage  I emailed  Amazon  explained  what happened  and also the seller  I asked them to just send me a new grill  because  I needed  for my outdoor  kitchen  weeks went by no updates so I decided  to reach  out to the seller  they basically stop responding  so therefore  I went to Amazon  and told them the situation  I emailed  them the pictures , I even sent  them the slip were UPS sent it back to them  and still Amazon  is saying  it's not enough  to get me a refund  so basically  a month and a half  later I have no grill and they are  refusing  to give me my money back !!! So Amazon  said since it's a 3rd party that they have exhausted  all of there options and there is nothing  they can do for me sooo I'm basically  out of almost  $1500 !! So I have reached out to my credit  card company  to dispute  the transaction  !! Which  honestly  I should  have never had to do at this point   so with that please  note even though  you purchase  the product on  Amazon  if it's a 3rd party  Amazon  does not stand  behind  that company  if they decide  not to give you your money  back !!Company  Name by the way is Deal supply  very unprofessional  and do not respond  to problems   would never do business  with them !!",1.0,256,0.9999955144250364,4.485574963575267e-06,32.871789057211444,Low Trust
Customer L,GB,1.0,"Amazon.....my god can you not get anything right!?! I've spent so much money with them over the years and customer services have deteriorated as well as the telecoms system and site issues it is almost unusable!! I've got some terrible products to return, they are just not fit for purpose which had great reviews but just don't perform, I think this is probably because they pay people or give people incentives for reviews, so please look into products first before buying them. I didn't used to worry to much as when you got a bad product from Amazon you could return it which is why I've spent a fortune with them but just recently you can't get through to anybody or return anything. In fact for the last three weeks I've wasted days on the phone just to get cut off or more frustratingly the code errors, people reusing to help of transfer you to someone who might understand English and been in a job for more than a week. When your request callback it doesn't happen, then when you do get through to somebody they don't know what they're talking about because I've only been there for few days and every time they try and transfer to a manager they refuse 99% of the time, hang up or if they do pass you on to somebody you just get cut off. Even if you tell them that you've had hours of wasted time and spent half a day on the phone and been cut off umpteen times so please take my phone number down so you can call me back I get cut off but it doesn't happen. I've been waiting for a return to be picked up and it hasn't happened, this is now taken well over a week and there doesn't seem to be any progress with it. If that they can't even arrange for the return, they just say they've arrange for a callback and again that never happens... I've had so much time wasted hopeless products and terrible terrible customer service and terrible comms. They really do need to get their act together! Even if you click Amazon assistant from the Amazon site, you get a picture of a bloody dog which is no help at all so that link doesn't work. As well as the telephone line is not working with the codes that you have to put in getting refused and then customer services not know what to do. It's a complete joke and gone to the dogs. I've had days wasted and it's very stressful. I will try and shop anywhere else now apart from Amazon and I spent a lot of money with Amazon but I'm not going to have my stress levels are through the roof and my time wasted any further. Amazon get your act together your not performing at all, the only thing I now expect from you is bad products, a terrible website, customers services and coms that are the worst I've ever came across!! HOPELESS!!!!",41.0,509,0.9999948049863486,5.195013651371205e-06,35.70973815786148,Low Trust
mark smith,GB,1.0,£70 worth of 160gsm navigator paper RUINED!! as amazon delivers battered boxes with navigator paper inside all packs were ripped open and dammaged! i have photos to back this up.! amazon 'chat bot' is a swear word in its self!! this could have been sorted if i could have spoke to a human!! i wud buy local if i cud but theres no shops near me that sell this type of paper and card that i need hence why i have to buy it online! but wen it arrives dammaged and u carnt get to talk to a human about it sites like this help get the word out and hopefully a human will get intouch.. (may be) ,75.0,118,0.9999947160099044,5.283990095583668e-06,31.32387608957769,Low Trust
The BF,US,1.0,"“BLUE LIVES MURDER” seriously?!? YOU KNOW THOSE BLUE LIVES ARE BLACK AS WELL?!? Their lives don’t matter because of a few bad people, which are found in every industry- just look in the mirror?! Are you going to tell us you can’t block this merchandise automatically? Why can we only report each other’s comments but not YOUR content?! YOU ARE SO TRANSPARENT AMAZON LIKE YOU ARENT PROMOTING THIS GARBAGE JUST TO PROTECT YOUR DISTRIBUTION CENTERS FROM GETTING TORCHED! Don’t call those blue lives when the protestors catch on to your scam! I’ll shop elsewhere FOREVER! I will NOT SUPPORT A COMPANY THAT SUPPORTS HATE AGAINST THOSE THAT ARE PROTECTING YOURE STUPID BUSINESS AND POOR EMPLOYEES!  When you call 911 and no one comes, remember this merchandise you sold! Hope it was worth the few dollars of blood money!",12.0,138,0.9999947144137499,5.28558625012554e-06,31.54821716770286,Low Trust
Alexander Baginskie,US,2.0,"Kinda weird, they used to be on top of their game but the quality and service seems to have gotten worse over the years, out of about 7 of my last orders, I've only received about 3 of them because the other ones got stuck in the ethers or some crap, so i had to cancel multiple orders because I'm done the lying on the tracking. Just today amazon said my package would arrive by 8pm and when 8pm hit, it said now arrive a week from now!!!!!!! Like W T F MATE?!!?! Seriously I'm just gonna start shopping LOCAL cuz BLAM this B.S., p.s. It's weird that i can only leave a review on here if I put two stars",3.0,121,0.9999946022366006,5.397763399361821e-06,61.35753292799049,Medium Trust
Meg,US,1.0,"Amazon has stolen so much of my time, money, and energy from me and if I can do business with anyone else, I will. First, my account was deleted with no notice, along with all my wish lists that I spent hours organizing and adding to, all my account credits, all my order history, and all my gift cards, all my kindle books, and my 5 months of kindle unlimited free Bc I had just bought a kindle and signed up for unlimited. All gone. $500 and countless hours, all gone. I’ve spent HOURS on the phone with “customer service” and they simply can’t do sh** except offer me $5 which they still haven’t done. They can’t even do that! Ha! What a joke of a business. I had an account in Spain when I lived there and that’s the account I wanted to cancel. Not my US one. And the only reason I went to cancel it was Bc I got an email from Amazon music saying I had 3 months free based off a recent order I placed in AMERICA and when I went to use it, it said I couldn’t Bc There’s no amazon music in SPAIN. So obviously things were getting tangled and I wanted to get rid of Spain account so I could use amazon music on American account. I called amazon “customer service” before doing so trying to find out why that happened and if I cancelled nothing would happen to American account. They assured me accounts were not linked at all. So I cancelled. And 2 weeks later I get an email saying EVERYTHING is gone. And now it’s all apparently in cyber space and they can’t get it back. No emails, nothing in those 2 weeks verifying if I want to cancel my account. NOTHING. It’s just gone one day. Oh well. Nothing they can do. Amazon I hope you get lost in cyber space you piece of sh**. And then when I go to create a new account, it’s recommending me products based off recently sold items from my old account!! So how is it that they can’t recover my account but Amazon knows what I last bought in my old account?? WT*?! AND SO NOW, today, 3 months after this sh** went down, I received an Amazon gift card and went to add it to my account and get back on my kindle that I haven’t been able to read on much yet Bc amazon is a piece of sh**, and I immediately get locked out of my account. And to get back in, I need to send in a copy of my gift card reciept. I don’t have my gift card receipt Bc I didn’t buy my gift card bc it was a gift!!!!! AHHHHHH! And so I called “customer service” and they said it could be up to Tuesday until my account isn’t on hold anymore. Today is Friday. All I wanted to do was read a f****** book. F you amazon. F you. You owe me. I hope you get a million competitors and go out of biz. You don’t deserve to be in biz you piece of sh**.",2.0,532,0.9999945960599396,5.403940060433321e-06,35.96774075224699,Low Trust
Amy Baccellini,GB,1.0,Absolutely disgusting treatment from Amazon. Not helpful and inconsiderate staff and management.Couldn't get into my account as old phone number attached so I rang them as I needed to place an order for my daughters birthday. I sat customer services giving details etc I managed to get into my account and update everything. All was fine. I ordered my daughters birthday gifts which would of arrived a day before her birthday. The next morning I get a message to say they have cancelled my order but took my money and put my account on hold as it was suspicious activity. !!!??? How? I literally just went through everything on the phone with the team with all my personal details and security checks.So I ring them and they are rude and unhelpful saying the account is locked and they can't get into it. No one can. So I loose my money for God knows how long that's IF I get it back and my daughter looses out on her items she was really excited about. It's just extremely difficult and a waste of time ordering from these. Especially when they don't even try and resolve the issue with no remorse. They admitted if I try and re order again that they could cancel it and the money can take a while to be refunded so what's the point. You don't get that going to asda do you !!!! Stupid company I'm deleting the account never using it again !!!!,1.0,248,0.9999945407929707,5.459207029323565e-06,32.78210133948775,Low Trust
Simon Parr,GB,1.0,"I ordered an electric gate kit through Amazon at £ 299 including a £ 30 discount which got lost in their delivery process so I was told to re order which I did.  It didn't include the £ 30 discount this time so I contacted Amazon via Live Chat who confirmed in writing ( a copy I have ) they would honour the £ 30 discount and to contact them once the gates arrived for them to initiate the refund.  I did this and was told on 5 different occasions they now wouldn't honour their promise and there was nothing they could do.  It is now available again with the £ 30 discount which I'm not eligible for as I now have the goods !!  Absolutely shocking service !!!  To add to this, the gates that were delivered had to be signed for.  I was out, they left them at my back door which is visible from the street !!  Their records said it had been signed for by me.  I had left instructions for it to be left in my garage !!!  ",24.0,183,0.9999944285101762,5.571489823830156e-06,32.05299870909579,Low Trust
