D B,GB,1.0,"Absolute joke, I'm actually fuming, orded my items and waited for delivery date for months, then cancelled cause of suspicious activity. Won't supply me which bank or card I used because its been so long when I placed a order. I can't remember. I do buy 100s off items each year from different websites Not much of help at all. Get a email stating can't share additional information, then I get told on on live chat, that payment won't be charge unless it's shipped, then why didn't you tell me that in my email. Instead of me contacting every single bank and credit card company to find out if there was a transaction been made on March 16th 2023. I used amazon before. I surely won't using amazon ever again period!! The stress you have cause me is absolutely ridiculous. 0* rating. I'm a genuine buyer, not hard is it, just to let me know which payment method I used. Could of mention what bank name it was. Then job done simple. I could of called straight to my bank and credit card and sorted it. Instead of being so complicated about it. Sorry but ebay is better buying page, no offense!! atleast they are more understanding if somethings happens. They tell you straight not like here. Can't share additional information!!! More like protecting the criminals, so someone uses your account but won't let the genuine buyer know where there money went. I even provided my correct details and send proof of everything and yet still said sorry can't share additional information Avoid at all cost!!! I wouldn't even give you 1* will be - 0* rating. Customer service is absolute joke.",15.0,282,0.9999927185195411,7.2814804589205195e-06,33.16357215029889,Low Trust
-MaS-,EG,1.0,"I've an order from Amazon which I've placed on 17 Feb for international  shipment.The order have been shipped on 20 Feb and was estimated by the carrier to be delivered on 25 Feb and by Amazon on 3 March (Also this was inaccurate because one of my items was not available then it became available the next day).Until 24 Feb there was no tracking updates for my order, since then I've contacted Amazon customer service 10th of times, but keep saying ""Please wait your order will be delivered before 3rd March"".I've waited but nothing arrived on the date, contacted them again after 3rd March, but now they tell to wait until 11 March!!!I've paid for 7-10 days delivery and I had to wait for 19 days and still nothing delivered and all they tell it's not our issue but the carrier!!!Even I haven't chosen the carrier they still blame the carrier and me as I've to contact the carrier not them!!After a lot of chat with their bad customer service all they want to do to give me a 5$ promo for my next order!!!The worst service you can ever get, and they don't want to cancel and refund or at least compensate for the waste of time and money they caused to me.I'll never shop on Amazon again, even I was amazed by their service in the past.Now we have lots of other great online markets, who cares for their customers not like the very bad Amazon.",3.0,248,0.9999926801859202,7.319814079753684e-06,32.782194369840276,Low Trust
Kris Gilcher,US,1.0,"I would Have gave Amazon Customer Service a zero but it would not allow me too. They are horrible!!! Logan, the first individual I spoke to was very unprofessional!  After he continued his unprofessionalism I requested to speak to a supervisor and he stated he does not work under a supervisor!  What office in the United States does not work under someone?!  None!! Then, Logan informed me if I wanted to speak to someone else I would need to hang up and call back. What?! I pay a yearly prime membership fee for a service I currently can not use and they refuse to reimburse me for the time they are not allowing me to make purchases. Amazon, you should be ashamed of yourself for you horrible customer service reps!",1.0,130,0.9999921719030246,7.8280969754152e-06,31.458607893912145,Low Trust
