Krystin,US,1.0,"I had the worse experience with Amazon today!! So much so I cancelled my prime membership after being with them for a few years. I ordered a gift for my daughter with expectation of it being delivered today. Well, I just happened to check my email last night and saw that my package was delayed until Monday. Of course, they didn't notify me to let me know. Then when I called to see if there was anything could do due to the circumstances, they were no help. All they wanted to offer me was a $5 credit after I spent almost $150 just on this order alone. I was highly upset due to the fact that my daughter is going out of town Sunday and will not return until next Sunday...so now she has to wait until she gets back to get her gift. I am so beyond pist...I will never order from Amazon again since the delivery time that the quote you is not guaranteed. And then they notify you to let you your package is delayed. So just so you know the date they quote you not guaranteed, even though it says it will be delivered by that day...not estimated time or expected date...but it will be delivered on that date. Its BS!!! They have lost a customer for good..and I will be telling everyone I can do not order thru Amazon!!! They may got your package to you on time and they will not do anything to fix the problem but offer you a $5 credit!!!",2.0,259,0.9999914347643916,8.565235608437582e-06,32.9056441899913,Low Trust
