Cheyenne Eckman,US,1.0,Amazon sucks....you pay monthly for 2 day shipping but I'd you don't get your item you don't get anything to cover that? You still pay!! I ordered 3 items all came together in the same shipment with the same guy...he delivered 2 items then never came to deliver the 3rd...which was the most expensive and the one I needed most....now this happens to me all the time with Amazon and this was just the last straw....I was told if the item did not arrive by 10 pm...I would get a refund for my order but still get my order. 10 can and went so I called customer service and guess what....I had to wait the 4 day period before they could issue a refund ONLY IF THE ITEM DIDNT ARRIVEA....THEN ORDER IT AGAIN AND WAIT ANOTHER 2 DAYS OR LONGER!!! nothing was offered to me for this until I got upset...5 bucks then another person gave me 20 only used for Amazon orders...so they make the money back!!! I canceled my prim bcuz why have it if I never get my orders on time and when they are late I get told we'll wait 4 more days and we will do somthing then....how is that 2 day delivery guarantee? Yea Amazon you honestly have poor customer care!!!,1.0,217,0.9999883681482908,1.163185170915959e-05,32.43468142432971,Low Trust
