Angela Blackledge,US,1.0,"I SPEND WAY TOO MUCH MONEY WITH AMAZON AS A LONG TIME PRIME MEMBER! Ordered antibacterial soap at start of Covid, early April. Unfortunately I did not pay attention that is was coming from CHINA. Spent 3 weeks trying to get my money back. Company now out of business, took my money, no product and Amazon not avail to assist. “Chats?” ARE YOU SERIOUS? No help. Today I finally mentioned, “FRAUD!” Amazon refunded my money. But TWO MONTHS!!!!!!!! It is really bad. LittleTo NO “Customer Service from AMAZON.”",2.0,88,0.9999878136777675,1.2186322232543567e-05,30.987709708708373,Low Trust
Nancy Little,US,2.0,"I have spent over 2 hours today trying to order my product WITHOUT a Prime Subscription! It kept trying to sign me up as I checked out.I spent a hour trying to stop the Prime Membership on my own, then I spent a good hour with a Chat Agent. This is not counting the15 mins trying to even locate how to do find a live agent! They DON'T make it this easy. Finally she says ""Well I need to transfer you to a higher up agent. I had been asking for that for a long time during our conversation. lol  She just couldn't understand why I didn't want it! I shouldn't have to tell my life story, if I don't want it, then please cancel it!!I FINALLY got it cancelled so I could order it without being charged in 30 days. It shouldl NOT be this hard to order a item. Simply have a box that says Prime or Not Prime!! Fis this PLEASE!! All the time it has taken today to order a $12 item is absolutely insane!",1.0,179,0.9999868484541492,1.315154585079803e-05,62.008509512233644,Medium Trust
Julie Ann,US,1.0,"Amazon is the worst! They offer you a 7 day trial for free of their product and then use the credit card you have on file with your regular amazon account and they continue billing you not knowing. I signed up for 7 days FREE and found out 1 year later I was charged $140 in reoccurring charges!! So shady!! I called and since I had already cancelled but did not notice the charges, Amazon did not reimburse me for a penny! They discreetly make for free just to give out the bait so you can start being billed using your information. I gave these people so much of my money, had Amazon Prime membership, ordered many products and groceries and they can’t reimburse me for an App I didn’t even use?! Ridiculous. When I called Kindle to complain and asked for a manager, the manager was yelling at me that I should’ve noticed!! I’m completely boycotting Amazon for good. Their prime membership is horrible with customer service too. They give free shipping but the reason they have so many of their customers getting their packages stolen is because Amazon doesn’t even make their delivery people ring the doorbell! So many times they drop packages and don’t even knock or ring and leave the packages right on a busy street for someone to take. I’m so dissatisfied with Amazon’s customer service, product, and company as a whole. They lost all my respect and I know I’m not the only one.",2.0,250,0.9999865162276036,1.3483772396405413e-05,32.80493666758785,Low Trust
Mar McIntyre,US,1.0,Amazon is the worst company!Awful customer service so much I shut my account down gladly!I returned items and they gave me a gift certificate! Really!Then said I had a apartment number that they needed so to further our conversation. I don’t have an apartment number!I live in a house in rural area. I said how can we fix this. They said they had no idea!I ask to speak with a manager. They said they had no manager. I shut my account down and they didn’t even let me have the “gift certificate money” I had in refunds!!!,1.0,97,0.9999849969157812,1.5003084218756513e-05,31.088803996050533,Low Trust
Karen Wylie,GB,1.0,"Decided that, as holidays are out of the window at the minute, I would buy a hot tub to ease the aching muscles and help with stress. I have Amazon prime and (even though you pay extra for the 'free' delivery) I always try to buy items with prime delivery as they do generally arrive quicker.I picked a hot tub I liked and the ad said it would arrive by Thursday if I ordered that day (Friday). A little longer than normal but it's a large item so I went for it and planned to have everything there ready for a family hot tub weekend.After ordering, the message changed to ""dispatch pending, we will email you when we have a delivery estimate"". I did panic a little bit thought as they haven't let me down before so I'll wait and see.The following day the message hadn't changed so I got onto chat and the man said it was definitely due for dispatch that day and they just had to arrange the courier as it's a large bulky item. I was reassured....Tuesday.... Still the same message. Customer services said they would personally speak to the dispatch department and get it sent asap.Wednesday.. Really starting to panic now. Check Argos to find I can order a different hot tub for delivery the following day. Attempt to cancel the Amazon order so I can order from Argos. Amazon cannot cancel the order as it is in the final stages of dispatch..... Thursday Argos sold out of hot tubs, still no change to dispatch message. Customer services again promise to have it sent out as quickly as possible....I don't believe them any more for some reason.Now Friday night. A day after the advert promised I would have my delivery. Guess what. Still pending!!I'm losing the will to live!I now have spare filters, chemicals, foot bath, gazebo and dip sticks but still no hot tub. My aches and pains are twice as bad and my anxiety is through the roof. Will I have a hot tub this year? Who knows. I and my money are in limbo. Does Amazon care? No because they know I need them more than they need me! I'd cancel my Amazon prime account if my entire house wasn't linked to it!! I just checked and the advert says ""in stock"" and ""delivery by Thursday June 24th for prime members"" ....... Don't believe it folks!!!I'm very disappointed with Amazon and have lost all the trust I had in them!",27.0,418,0.9999846320737459,1.5367926254117314e-05,34.68949526114725,Low Trust
Shalon Shalon,US,1.0,"If i could give zero stars I would.  They have the worst delivery service. I pay for Amazon prime every month and my items are NEVER on time.. What am I paying for?? Then when I call customer service they have me on hold multiple times!! Theres laughter, noise, children in the background!! They dont even know what they are doing!! I shouldn't have to wait till the end of the day!! We should get the option to choose who we receive delivery from. I don't care about paying. At least I know it will be on time!!",1.0,98,0.9999840773231963,1.592267680372572e-05,31.100067025595653,Low Trust
Dee Matis,US,1.0,"I ordered food for my family with my food stamps. Last amount I had to keep us ok until the 1`st. I live in an apartment complex where the buildings are all designed the same, same color and same numbers on apartments. Its very important to get the right building. I don't have a vehicle, so I have to rely on delivery services. I put detailed instructions in my Amazon app for delivery and my number to call if a question. I did not receive my order. Went to neighbors, no luck. I contacted amazon and they actually said the weight of packages when it left the building was the same as the weight wen it was delivered so they cannot help me!!!!!! Here is my response.... And Mr. Bezos, I truly hope you get some pleasure out of ripping off single mothers and taking government food stamp food from the mouths of my children. Somehow, I dont see Elon Musk doing this to a family, but hey....enjoy your time in hell in the afterlife.This is absolutely unlike Amazon customer service. I have never had issues with other services like I have had with you and I will not be recommending this to anyone, in fact I will be posting your response on trustpilot and my social media platforms. My buildings in my apartment complex all look the same and each building has a 207. The delivery driver did not even take a pic of the number on apt. Isnt that against your delivery policies? I do not contest the weight was the same, i am stating the darn thing was delivered to another building. I am a single mother on food stamps. That was my last amount I used and we do not get more until the 1st. But yeah, you make sure Bezos gets that 40.00, because he obviously needs it much more than my kids and I do. You all got too big for your good and its time you got cut down to size!!!!",1.0,338,0.9999834007819638,1.659921803620623e-05,33.79219283246659,Low Trust
Rejane McNamara,US,1.0,Worst customer service !!!! My account was locked and they can’t do anything also they were do a new account and I was my phone number is tied to my old account ! Told them - that I do not want just to create a new email just for Amazon ! I do a lot of ordering online and tell them that I was not so happy - and will not return as a customer and was told a customer got to do what a customer got to do … Bravo Amazon !!!!,1.0,93,0.9999833306000165,1.6669399983459954e-05,31.04401911217528,Low Trust
Sally,GB,1.0,"My items have been left on my doorstep when it clearly says leave in the parcel box in the garden on the order AND on the doorbell in a clear sign .  The courier will throw the item to the ground, ring the doorbell and walk off!! Then click to say handed to the resident when I'm at work.... So angry.  I then spent an hour trying to email or call or comment to customer service and constantly going around their site getting nowhere!! Eventually I was able to speak via chat by pure luck and told the courier will be reprimanded and told I won't know the out come or updates for the issue but we are sorry!!!I won't be buying anything else as I can't trust your couriers to READ where to leave my item and they are left on the front door of a home which is on the main road. Good job I had the door camera to see how it was delivered.  I'm beyond shocked for the lack of care or consideration from someone delivering my paid for items!! Sort it out Amazon",15.0,188,0.9999830894773054,1.6910522694590924e-05,32.109650910318685,Low Trust
Hayley Palazzetti,GB,1.0,"0 stars! I ordered a meta quest 2 bundle for my son for Xmas. It arrived on time but inside the box was a Breville machine and a mug!! I must of called the customer service a million times, sent photos, completed endless forms, returned item…each time told an investigation will take 3 days. I wait 3 days, call back, told another investigation needs to happen, wait another 3 days, then another form etc etc! As a prime long-standing member this is very frustrating and disappointing! Your call centres are in India and are incapable of deviating from reading off a script when you need someone to actually fix the issue! Still no refund despite returning the item via UPS. Tonight I’ve tried again and yet again useless, told another form needs to be completed (3rd) one and form sent relates to a different order! Invest in better customer service because this experience has put me right off! Will be warning others! Totally left me short of money £400 in fact right before Xmas and no present for my son!",2.0,180,0.9999829981643341,1.700183566588631e-05,32.01991907664027,Low Trust
