H P,CA,1.0,"AMAZON DELIVERY DRIVERS HERE SUCK!!!  I was waiting for a delivery all day, when it finally arrived I asked him to please bring it to my door as I am unable to get to the lobby.  He said YES.   I waited.  Nothing.  Then I got an email with a picture showing it left in my lobby.  By the time I managed to get down there IT WAS GONE!!!   I have lost so much to their laziness!  I'm DONE!  SOMEONE IS GOING TO PAY OR REPLACE THIS!!",1.0,86,0.9999778794905497,2.2120509450274106e-05,30.965772318237516,Low Trust
Sharon Curnutte,US,1.0,"BUYER BEWARE!!!!!  I have spent a few thousand dollars lately with about 1 out of 7 purchases, or less (trying to be generous), purchases are defective or broken. For heavy and expensive purchases especially a problem if defective. Amazon only refunded part of the purchase price and later than promised. Amazon promised rewards as compensation, that they now say do not exist. Amazon customer service out and out lies about what they are doing to correct their defective product returns, requiring multiple calls to multiple people who all say something different. Most amazon customer service associates state they do not want a negative customer experience, but then do not deliver a satisfactory result, only partial refund and not when promised, messed up pick up reservations made by amazon for product too heavy for me to load in my car 50 lbs boxes times 2 (the original  purchase and the replacement both broken = 100lbs for an elderly 120 lb woman to deal with), and lies about reward compensations. I THINK AMAZON IS GETTING TOO BIG FOR ITS BRITCHES!!! This is the short version of my Amazon experiences.  I think this alone shows Amazon is ready to take your money, but not willing to deliver good results from mishaps that are out of the customers control! My take away from my Amazon experiences to date are not favorable and thief by deception if their products are defective or not fully listed as needing further parts or accessories. I had to spend several hours on the phone and more time on line in trying to resolve the issues of one of the defective products just to get to the above results. Now multiply that time by every defective product, they have stolen about 2 weeks of my life to date trying to resolve problems in 2020 alone. MY TIME IS VALUABLE, they do not care.  My money is now in their possession and I have no product. They say the refund issued, but I did not receive all they charged me for the product. Everything cannot be blamed on the pandemic, I think Amazon should take responsibility to right the wrongs that happen. And I think the amount of stress and anxiety they caused me concerning the one of many problems I have experienced was totally abusive! Unfortunately for me the purchase I have been referencing is a outdoor fountain (just one of a list of defective products), not a high demand PPE, and I made the purchase to attempt to brighten my life and unstress having lost my Mother and Sister and am a Nurse working under pandemic dangers. GEE THANKS AMAZON for delivering poor products, poor customer service and causing me undue additional stress and anxiety on my attempt to be a loyal customer. Also beware of the product descriptions, they do not always say a needed a drive  that is not installed in electronics to make it usable, just say great product, heck they do not even help you figure out what is needed to make the product usable not to mention the additional costs needed to use the product. Again thief by deception. I would give them a minus 5 stars...but that is not an option.",1.0,538,0.9999774799347889,2.2520065211084628e-05,36.03589885799976,Low Trust
michael king,GB,1.0,"items stolen AGAIN!! This is not the first time .. have installed a delivery box and still the items are left by the door , so even put written instructions on the delivery box and the door nope still the same ... so delivery drivers cant read??? Do they not have to pass a crime check??Have been told latest scam is delivery driver takes a picture then tells his mates where to go .. BUT legally you can claim a refund or replacement as LAW state this is not been delivered if left on door step , that's why the drivers say handed to resident which again is not proof of delivery ... im cancelling anything to do with amazon prime , alexas are going in the bin the company has got so corrupt with its ""AI"" bull crap all that is, is a way to watch and listen more to you, AMAZON your a disgrace with incompetence drivers who steal and con us and you ... BUT hey you need a heart to care !!!!!!!",36.0,176,0.9999771156878783,2.2884312121718153e-05,31.97534500079958,Low Trust
Sofiane MLondon,GB,1.0,"Hi, I would like to make a complain. Summaries : Our neighbor was expecting a delivery today and she have receive a message stating that the delivery have been sent to our property !! in fact we have NOT received anything  or whatsoever. I called Customer Service to find out more (Ridiculous)  . I asked C-S-M to check the signature a person of receiver....  the response from Customer Service was :  ""some time we ask for signature some times not"" .....this a really a joke!!which has caused lot of stress to my family and now your team careless  make us looks we are thief front of all our neighbors which every one heard in the block ..how you can accuse someone collect a delivery and when we ask for signature or more details!! there is no response...we would like to know how this Amazon operate (Policy of delivery.....)  !!!! how can be some times you can ask for the signature some time not....I would someone from senior management(s) to contact us matter of urgency  or will take further action ....We do  not care about of your team did mistake or not or you will replace order to our neighbor our concerns ONLY how ALL our neighbors to know that delivery was not sent to us. at the moment we look THEIF-Rubbish...this the worst things you can do to the family to make them looks criminals front of ALL the  neighbors. What a shame",1.0,243,0.9999768942976299,2.3105702370074255e-05,32.72689841467543,Low Trust
Joanne Tanner,GB,1.0,"Abysmal customer service.  Wanted to return a faulty lawnmower.  To start with Amazon you need to give customers returns labels as I had to go out and drive to a shop to print one.  I returned home and missed the courier by 10 minutes!  Pick up was  then arranged for collection next day, Wednesday   Stayed in no courier arrived.  Then I chat to customer service at Amazon today now Thursday  (by the way they hide the real person chat section so you have to do detective work to find it) Then they say I need to print a new label! Argue no I'm not as I've paid for one it's on the item and not going out again to waste petrol and label cost.  Told me ok keep same label.  Courier coming today, Thursday.  Still hadn't arrived, don't believe they will.  Chat again and say courier will come Friday.  I say no want courier today! Told me they have escalated complaint and courier will come today.  I demand a tracking number to check Evei will come.  Tracking number says thanks for letting us know you don't want item picked up!!! Furious is an understatement!  I want to speak to people not robots! I want to find telephone numbers easily not hunt around the pages to find and be a detective!!  Will never buy a big item from Amazon again.  Too difficult to sort returns if first attempt goes wrong. ",4.0,239,0.9999768915304423,2.3108469557664435e-05,32.682030353371324,Low Trust
John Ritter,US,1.0,"I would give minus 5 if I could!Trust me do not order ANYTHING from Amazon!I just went through 2 days of absolute HELL with these A$$HOLES!They actually made me call my local police and file a police report for something they 100% screwed up on!They delivered my order to an entity that don’t even exist and refused to refund the order.Amazon said “Delivered October 24 Your package was left in the mail room. Signed by: Mail Room”, their exact words, copied and pasted right from the message they sent me.Here’s the big problem, THERE IS NO “MAIL ROOM” anywhere within the 22 units of the condo complex I live in, there is no “mail room” attendant to sign for ANYTHING!Where this package actually went is a big mystery because no driver ever came to my door!I sat right by where my doorbell is all day, my doorbell is in 100% working condition, also I posted 2 signs on my door one saying ring doorbell multiple times and the other saying if no answer call number, I put my number on the sign.As I said no one came to my door, no one rang my doorbell, no one called my phone and the kicker is, THERE IS NO “MAIL ROOM”!So after going through hell talking to multiple people, explaining the exact same thing to each and every one of them over and over again for 2 days and eventually at the end of the next day being on the phone with these a$$holes for another hour they tell me I have to wait until after 5PM before I can request to cancel and get a refund or re-delivery, not very happy, I’m like whatever.So I call back after 5PM, I’m now on the phone again getting jerked around as usual once again for like God only knows how long.They then tell me that I have to call my local police and file a police report, I had to ask them to repeat this a few times because I thought I heard them say I had to file a police report and to my complete and utter surprise that was exactly what they were telling me.I ask them why do I have to file a police report over something that was your fault, you delivered my items to the wrong place, you delivered my items to a place that don’t even exist, you delivered my items to somewhere other than the address I gave you without my consent, your delivery driver never once ever came to my door or even attempted to ever contact me and you are making me file a police report.This so called customer service representative would not even listen to anything I was saying and all she kept saying talking over me is, “is there anything else I can help you with sir”, that was all she keep saying to me, in other words go screw yourself, I am done with you sir and there is nothing you can do about it.So I hung up called my local police and ask him if he’s ever heard of anything like this, he said “Amazon” I thought they just cancel the order and re-ship you another item, I said that’s what ebay does I know this for sure but  not Amazon they make me file a police report for something they screwed up, he was as surprised as I was.So he directed me where to go to file a police report.I then spent more of my time filling out a police report over something that was 100% Amazons fault and I made this very clear on the police report.I tried to copy and paste it here but it’s a PDF file so it’s not possible.Amazon is nothing but big greedy corporate a$$holes who could care less about consumers who make them filthy rich, they hire foreigners in a foreign country paying them absolutely nothing likely with zero benefits and undermining American workers all to fill their greedy pockets.Amazon is way too big and way to greedy and their customer service is beyond horrifying, it’s beyond belief and no one should buy anything from these greedy corporate a$$holes.I have been buying online with eBay well over 20 years with PayPal and yes, they are big corporate, but the truth is in over 20 years I have never, EVER ran into anything remotely close to what I just ran into with Amazon.This was my first order with my new account, and this is how I was treated, unreal and just flat out wrong and no way to treat any customer bring business to your company.Any problems I have ran into buying on eBay the issue was resolved immediately either by Ebay or PayPal and was always handled by them I never had to file some police report.I’ve had items missing on several occasions with eBay and they never questioned me, they just simply sent me another item with absolutely no issues unlike these a$$wipes at Amazon, should be Ama-a$$holes!Fair warning to everyone, never order from Amazon, you just may regret it, I sure as hell do!I will NEVER EVER order anything from these evil, greedy corporate pigs and I will spend the rest of my life as long as Amazon still exist warning everyone to never buy from this place!",2.0,888,0.9999753522665688,2.464773343124893e-05,39.96197271196601,Low Trust
