Ness,GB,1.0,BUYER BEWARE!!!!I didn’t want to give any star at all as rating! We ordered a phone before Christmas for our elderly father. My husband opened the package when he got home from work. Inside was toothpaste and Dylon. The packaging had no doubt been opened and refilled!  Amazon will not give a refund and they are now ignoring all emails.Ringing customer service is impossible from the UK as the customer service reps are a different nationality and so there is a language barrier which doesn’t help when you’re trying to get a point across.AVOID IF YOU ARE THINKING IF IRDERUNG HIGH VALUE ITEMS. Couriers don’t care and Amazon aftersales customer service is non existent!!!,3.0,114,0.9999727947734086,2.720522659138691e-05,31.28010395173899,Low Trust
M T,GB,1.0,"1- REGARDING DELIVERY GUIYS:THEY DELIBERATELY DROP ITEMS YOU BOUGHT AT THE FRONT DOOR BY THE STREET AND LEAVE IT THERE!!!!2- THEY DROP THROUGH ITEMS WINDOWS TOO, IF YOU ARE NOT CAREFUL YOUR BABY MAY GET HURT BECAUSE A STUPID ADULT HUMAN COULD NOT BE BOTHERED TO FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS.AS FOR PRIME VIDEOS SUBSCRIPTIONS AND ABILITY TO FREELY REVIEWS MOVIES:1- TRY AND CANCEL YOUR SUBSCRIPTION... I DARE YOU! RUNNING A MARATHON WOULD NOT BE AS HARD, AND IT WOULD NOT TAKE AS LONG!!!IF YOU WRITE REVIEWS ON MOVIES YOU HAVE ACTUALLY WATCHED:1-IF YOU WRITE REVIEWS THAT BRING UP RACISM AND PEDOPHILIA IN HOLLYWOOD, WHICH ARE OBVIOUS AND CLEAR ISSUES EXPOSED IN MANY MOVIES WHERE CASTING IS NAZIS-LIKE AND CHILD EXPLOITATION COUDL NOT BE MORE WORRYINGLY CLEAR... WELL, YOU WILL BE BANNED FROM WRITING REVIEWS FOR ANY PRODUCT EVER AGAIN! DEMOCRACY DOES NOT WORK THIS WAY.3- IF WE WATCH MOVIES AND SEE INAPPROPRIATE OR DISCRIMINATORY SCENES, IT IS NOT OFFENSIVE TO ACTUALLY EXPOSE THESE IN THE REVIEWS.4- NOT ONLY AMAZON NOW PREVENTS CUSTOMERS FROM PROVIDING REVIEWS, BUT ONCE THEY GO THAT WAY, THEY ACTUALLY DELETE ALL THE PREVIOUS REVIEWS OF THOSE ACCOUNTS.5- WE WILL START A PETITION AGAINST THIS KIND OF AWKWARD DICTATORSHIP. FREEDOM OF SPEECH INCLUDES MOVIES REVIEWS AND ANTI RAICSM AND ANTI PEDOPHILIA IN THE SHOW BUSINESS! ENOUGH IS ENOUGH, THERE ARE WAY TOO MANY MOVIES PROMOTING BOTH, IT IS TIME TO SPEAK UP AGAINST IT, AND REVIEWS ARE A WAY OF LETTING PRODUCERS KNOW THAT THESE ARE CRIMES, OR CLEARLY PROMOTE CRIMES SUCH AS BULLYING, DISCRIMINATION, AND CHILD ABUSE.",7.0,259,0.9999725222270647,2.747777293532483e-05,32.90658981685765,Low Trust
PAT BROWN,US,1.0,"Rep. Rescheduled my package for delivery on June 28th after logistics changed it to the 29th instead of the the 28th and my package still didn't arrive on the 28th, That phone I purchased is my work phone now I have to miss a day of work to wait on a package because of the incompetent LOGISTICS WORKERS. I'm a prime member I pay for 2 day delivery not 4 day delivery I might as well cancel the subscription and this is not the first time this has happened, this is VERY VERY UPSETTING TO ME, IM SICK OF THIS BULLS___!!!!!!!!!",4.0,101,0.9999724733775289,2.7526622471074624e-05,31.13429837262664,Low Trust
