Tracie.L,GB,1.0,"Please check your bank statements carefully- 11 orders I didn't place, all on same day, didn't show up on my ""recent orders"" page, didn't arrive anyway, despite it saying so in 11 emails AND apparently, I gave each one a review with 5 🌟 and it actually states ""verified purchaser""!!!!! I reckon inside job fraud! Now I've got to wait for a new bank card and go through all the hassle of changing all my other accounts! Won't use them again- watch out for TV documentary ironically showing the kind of fraud that's just happened to me and lord knows however many others!",62.0,103,0.9999415461503159,5.84538496840592e-05,31.158278833819033,Low Trust
Beverley,GB,1.0,Two customer service representative cut me off via chat and phone when I asked if they could send out my item again as I paid to get it today!!! The courier didn’t try to deliver it What a liar! I’m disgusted and I am deleting all my families accounts and the appThousands of orders and I get treated like crap…..twice in one day!!,136.0,63,0.9999397998229793,6.020017702068614e-05,30.709684153550974,Low Trust
Hrvoje,HR,1.0,"Ordered phone and charger for approx. 750eur but only charger was in the box I received and Amazon did not help me, washing their hands.I lost my money on Amazon Italy!! Very rude customer service,bad customer service,repetitive emails,only writing on Italian, do not read what you are telling them, do not want to introduce case to higher authority,do not understand English well,you cannot contact them via phone nor chat if you are not Italian,totally disappointed with Amazon Italy.I am buying a lot on Amazon with really good track record and 0 returning (mainly Germany and UK and no problem with them at all,with fully positive experience) but after this I will think twice for buying on Amazon,especially Italy.Since 2nd June I am trying to solve this,lot of time wasted and I am giving up and giving Amazon my money because they deserved it and obviously need it more then their customers...Recap:- On June 2nd received package from UPS, opened and only charger was in the box,no phone- Immediately contacted Amazon asking for help. I tried to solve case directly with Amazon but since very beginning they started repeating same message in different variants again and again to go to Police and report case...I didn't see any reason for that because it wasn't my fault but ok eventually I decided to go to police and waited for hours there ofc.- So I went to Police and provided Report to Amazon in official Croatian Police Report that can be only on Croatian because Croatian is only official language in Public institutions. I provided it to Amazon but Amazon ignored me and said it is not on English or Italian and their desired form, ignoring me further and said that they will not help me any more.- I reported also this missing phone to UPS and they finally UPS confirmed after investigation that there was not phone in the package and they said they will contact Amazon and pay insurance amount directly to Amazon (since Amazon hired them for transport and they can not refund me,they said they will to Amazon and Amazon should refund me...but no!). But guess what, no!! I contacted Amazon with this information with hope that this will be finally solved and that I will be refunded but Amazon told again about this police report not on Italian or English and totally ignored my refering to UPS solved case and they agqin finished correspondence with...you are guessing... will not assist any more because Police report was not in Amazon requested form and language and will not refund me!!So Amazon will at the end earn money on this lost package from UPS insurance! And for me nothing!Be aware!My only option is now to give up or to introduce this to lawyer and start fighting with big ones... overall bad taste and never expected this from Amazon.",5.0,476,0.9999380754409143,6.192455908571315e-05,35.342411987909415,Low Trust
Karen Cherry,US,1.0,"I have been an Amazon Prime customer for as long as I can remember. Their customer service is getting exponentially worse, and their Logistics department is THE WORST! When we moved in early March, any packages sent to our address were being delivered to an unknown other address. CS directed me to provide delivery instructions. No change. Took several weeks and dozens of e-mails, chats, and phone calls to get that situation resolved. Now that they've finally found my house, we're having horrible trouble with deliveries. Amazon needs to stop with the “Uber Eats” model of delivery. I can wait a couple days for my packages! And, at the very least, stop sending drivers out at 4:30 in the morning! Seriously. Stop that: Nobody needs their package at that time of day!! Choosing ""Amazon Day"" isn't always an option - which is super annoying - AND, even when I DO chose that as the delivery option, items are delivered willy nilly anyway. So, really, what's the point? Almost every time we have an issue with a driver, it’s a contractor in a private car. We’ve had drivers racing down our gravel road, we had an underage deliverer driven by his mom deliver a package, had items not arrive at all, items misdelivered, items in the same order arriving in multiple shipments IN THE SAME DAY, and had an uninsured driver with expired tags get stuck on our road while trying to deliver at an unnecessary time of day using ridiculous GPS instructions that he shouldn't have followed in the first place. This is all in the last 2 weeks!! Amazon's vetting process for these drivers seems sketchy at best, and I'm not even sure anything is validated! Safety is Amazon's priority? Nope! I don't feel particularly safe having these contractors on my property. Most customer centric company in the world? No. Get your act together, Amazon! OR, let me pick who delivers my packages.",2.0,324,0.999938026308878,6.197369112204143e-05,33.637422857298674,Low Trust
Simon Griffin,GB,1.0,"Joined Amazon Prime mostly for the ‘free One Day Delivery!’ Proposition! However, it turns out that this is just a gimmick (lie!) & the reality is actually the total opposite! Having ordered an item on Saturday, this was due for delivery on the Sunday, so I waited in… around 15:00 I was checking my social media & emails & noticed an email from Amazon stating that my order had been delivered over an hour earlier! In fact, it stated that it ‘had been handed to resident!’ At which point I’m a little confused as to how exactly I didn’t remember this ‘significant event!?’ But for good measure, I checked outside my front door (which opens out onto the sidewalk) & behold, no parcel… so I’m forced contact Amazon for clarification & am told I have to wait until the following Wednesday before they will ‘assist me’!?? Hence, Amazon Prime promptly cancelled 😡 what an utter waste of space & definitely one to avoid!",43.0,163,0.9999379131660442,6.208683395581005e-05,31.831483477984946,Low Trust
Stuart Kerr,GB,1.0,"Amazon should really change its name to the Chinese Trading Company because all they seem to sell is cheaply made chinese junk. Recently bought an item that had a blatantly manipulated photo in the item listing, so you really dont recieve what is advertised, when i pointed this out they weren't the slightest bit interested, afterall they make lots of many selling crap, knowing most people just dont have the time or the inclination to return. Another item (electric) clearly does not meet any kind of regulation and is danagerous to use!!! Nothing more than highway men ripping people off on a daily basis!!! Bezos has become mega rich ripping people off!!!",12.0,112,0.9999379108225067,6.208917749328524e-05,31.25941404945234,Low Trust
Rory M,GB,1.0,Absolutely disgusting to post a returned hygiene product!!CLEARLY A RETURN!! - Still some stuff on the clippers!!! - It was obvious that the box had been opened before - and absolutely disgusting that Amazon would put a hygiene return back on the shelves!,28.0,43,0.9999370843148354,6.291568516458845e-05,30.48547893064073,Low Trust
joe hannan,US,1.0,"HORRENDOUS!! ABSOLUTELY THE WORST C/S I HAVE EVER SEEN IN 43 YEARS! DISGUSTING!! It is IMPOSSIBLE to talk to someone IN CLEAR ENGLISH, the same problem requires COUNTLESS attempts to address ONE SMALL PROBLEM it absolutely MIND BLOWING they can get away with this and STILL BE IN BUSINESS!! WOWWW!",1.0,50,0.9999331935985589,6.680640144107741e-05,30.56419281586566,Low Trust
Charlotte,GB,5.0,"My Amazon delivery driver today is an absolute legend! I really wish I knew his name but I'll leave feedback on the app also in the hope he gets recognised. He was holding a parcel behind his back and he asked me if the parcel was for me as it had my name on it. I explained my partner ordered it on the account. He asked if it was a Christmas present for me, to which I said yes. He said it wasn't in additional packaging, so I would see what it is, so he asked how I wanted to receive the package. He very kindly came into my porch to hide the package so my surprise wouldn't be ruined! How thoughtful!! I've never had a delivery driver so thoughtful and kind - how amazing! it must be such a busy/stressful time on 23rd dec and yet he still took the time to help (and waited at the door a long time as it took me ages to find my key). I always get deliveries quickly and efficiently but this was exceptional!! Thank you!!",7.0,184,0.9999331023551294,6.689764487055605e-05,152.06728206676402,High Trust
Scott Kosmowski,US,1.0,Ordered an item that was supposed to be delivered overnight sure and then it says it was out for delivery?? Then I get notification that it would be delivered next day!! Customer service was absolutely NO help at all!!! Didn’t offer to anything to rectify the issue!! Ready to cancel my subscription to prime!!,1.0,54,0.9999326534614894,6.734653851059313e-05,30.609088022382625,Low Trust
