Gen,US,3.0,"Amazon is starting to remind me of that company Wish....if you get great stuff....AWESOME....if you get crappy stuff....Sorry for you!!! Amazon has its good points, but overall it really lost its ""Touch""....don't get me started with Amazon Prime Shopping service....it started out strong....but now....it is just plain crap!!!! Expired, rotten, thawed, broken, and open items...are just the norm now....sad! I do not see a benefit Paying for Prime anymore....",2.0,69,0.9999318506911336,6.814930886644976e-05,90.77738390963849,High Trust
