Craig Hatch,US,1.0,"Tired of Amazon taking two days or some times four days to process and order! Last order I placed was on 05/14/20 and now its going on to the 16th! And the order is still not processed! This is a on going issue, even before covid 19! So I am thinking of taking my business else where, like wish!!! I am also tired of not talking to a live person, nevermind it takes a road map to find customer service on Amazon. So done! And I have been a loyal customer for over five years!",8.0,95,0.9999288735019759,7.112649802409887e-05,31.069176066909055,Low Trust
gigi f,US,1.0,"I am having terrible customer service issues. I want to return something that was given to me but having a difficult time. I am asked for a order number. I don't have one. I told her the name of the person, email address and address of the person who gave it to me and still she is asking me for the order number!!!!! She asked me many times, does she not understand English, I don't think so. Just awful They are beginning to have the same service as ATT, ugh!!!! I hate Amazon, they have changed. When you return a gift the return label has the sender's address and name. They will not put the sender's return address. I had to speak to a supervisor and she had a difficult time understanding.",1.0,132,0.9999285444012767,7.145559872334672e-05,31.484223368831287,Low Trust
Quintin W,US,1.0,"1st of all I never get my stuff in 2 days.. Let's just put that out there... I'm fed up! By this time I'm only paying for Prime Video bc ordering products is THE WORST! Here's my breaking point: I planned a birthday party for a child and purchased ALL SUPPLIES from Amazon. Even the birthday outfit! I ordered on Tuesday! I was told I would receive my items by FRIDAY that was pushing it considering the party was Saturday but whatever.. Friday came all I got was the table cover. The other items I received an email saying I wouldn't receive them until that Saturday or Sunday due to a ""delay"" (Oh its Sunday BTW and NOTHING HAS CAME!) Anywho: I called Saturday to just cancel and receive a refund they told me my items were delivered.. I argued with the representative and the Supervisor (Nijel B) bc they kept saying that my items were delivered already. Then when I asked him does he NOT see the email that Amazon sent me saying that my items were running late and would not be there until Nov 7 or Nov 8 he stated he had to escalate my situation. I ended up going to Party City and purchasing so at this point AMAZON JUST GIVE ME MY MONEY SO I CAN MOVE ALONG.. THANKS !!!",1.0,225,0.9999283730693982,7.162693060180914e-05,32.52741757760132,Low Trust
Isa Mb,FR,1.0,"INCOMPETENTS and the worst people at the customer service!! I called the 201 577 1364 phone number for international phone call on January 23 at 1:44pm (French time). I was answered by the MOST INCOMPETENT, unfriendly, bothered by her job, UNHELPFUL member services EVER!!! She NEVER wanted to HELP ME not even ONCE and when I asked her if she could help me by providing an alternate solution she just put herself ON MUTE for 8:35 minutes!!! Who does that? except someone who NOT supposed to be hired. I have a french account with them that I AM GOING TO CLOSE + all my family members. If you dont have a great customer services it just mean that you won't be helped at all. SO DO NOT take AMAZON PRIME or kINDLE or audible. they won't help you out if you have a problem. They like she did, would put you on hold forever while you are paying the conversation from overseas. A SCAM!",2.0,164,0.9999265865324449,7.341346755507239e-05,31.843266859580783,Low Trust
Beverley Fletcher,GB,1.0,"I thought I would be safe buying through Amazon, I can not believe how they let Glitzy gizmos to trade on Amazon even after receiving many many complaints for well over a year, as happened with many other people I received fake goods off Glitzy gizmos. Amazon are not interested in helping me, I trusted Amazon, never ever again, after this happened I went onto trust pilot and could not believe how many people had complaints about Amazon allowing fake companies to sell on their site. On trust pilot Amazon only recommend 2 and a half stars. Wish I had looked into the company and Amazon before I ordered, I would definitely not have ordered a thing, everyone BEWARE OF GLITZY GIZMOS AND ALL OTHER COMPANIES THAT SELL ON AMAZON. THEY ALLOW MANY FAKE COMPANIES TO CONTINUE TO TRADE ON THEIR SITE !!!!!!!!!",25.0,143,0.9999264226319133,7.35773680866636e-05,31.60771700637405,Low Trust
My opinion,GB,1.0,Amazon slowly declining in service!! Drivers lying saying delivery made!!!!! Will be looking at shopping eBay absolute joke,90.0,18,0.9999258419154532,7.415808454680484e-05,30.205614802713036,Low Trust
Jill,US,1.0,"This place SUCKS! I ordered PetSafe fountain filters from the PetSafe store, allegedly sold by and shipped from Amazon, so I thought they were safe. NOPE! Box arrived with NO PetSafe markings ANYWHERE, every inch of everything inside covered in dust, and when I installed it in the fountain and turned the fountain on, it filled with black dust! Was Customer Service helpful at all? NO! Only way to get my money back is to return a wet filter at the nearest Whole Foods! This is insane! They take your money and give you literally nothing in exchange! They profit by stealing! I truly wish there was a way to get everything I need without ever using them again!",4.0,119,0.9999250706087808,7.492939121922504e-05,31.33857540954974,Low Trust
Booya Jones,US,1.0,"terrible customer service!""were sorry the web adress you entered is not a functioning page on our site"" but thats the link amazon sent me!!! account locked out on phone but not on lap top.1st i had total lockout,didnt shop at amazon for 9 months! ,after many calls and finnally 1more hour of talking to rep,got account back all set up,that worked for a week! reps ask so many stupid questions for  basic info its sureal.was hung up on many times,told its my fault!  do i really wanna go thru that  again or just shop ebay!??",1.0,95,0.999915854013471,8.414598652894956e-05,31.069827041334296,Low Trust
Aubree Hill,US,1.0,"UPDATE 11/6/21: It's November and still no PC or refund! After calling them out on twitter a few days ago, they sent me an email to pretty much let me know that they're not going to do anything because it has passed the 90 limit for a claim. Meanwhile, the rep made sure to for some reason, send me a link to the sellers feedback page which ironically, has several reviews of people complaining about getting denied refunds or also missing items after returning them. I showed them this in another email and of course, they just glossed over it and pretty much said ""whoops lol sorry."" A different rep decided to reply to the email and showed me proof of the email that the previous one had sent to the seller Well low and behold, there's also proof of the last email that the last rep also sent to the seller which of course went unanswered, along with the 3 other messages I had sent to the seller too dating back to July of this year! I swear these ""people"" don't read anything! And probably on purpose.Oh, and that refund that was sent as ""compensation"", yeah, now they're threatening to charge me because the associate that did it, sneakily processed it as a regular return request. If anyone happens to come across a 3rd party seller named premier660 on Amazon or any other platform for that matter, DO NOT BUY FROM THEM. They will sell you damaged products hoping that you don't know enough about them to realize that they're broken, and then when they do break after 30 days, they'll ignore you continuously. Amazon will of course, play into this and will run you in circles telling you to wait 3-5 business days while they email the seller for a response in hopes that they can run the time out that you have to file a claim.Horrible customer service and shady third party sellers! I have spent months trying to resolve an issue with a damaged PC I ordered earlier this year. I contacted a rep after not hearing from the seller or manufacturer and they approved me for a partial refund and sent me the label. Seller tells me not to send it back or else they’d just deny the request (even though it had already been approved) and would return it back to me. Since this was the first time I’ve ever had to return something, I didn’t return it. My mom then goes and returns it (before the seller denied, i was at work when I received the label and didn’t want to use the company computer to print it so I sent it to her and asked her to print it out at home. I told her to discard it after I was messaged by the seller so that’s why she had access to the label and was able to ship it without me knowing.) it has nearly been an entire month and I have not seen the PC or the partial refund that the first associate said I’d get. The no refund, I can accept as I figured that wouldn’t be happening. But if you’re going to take both my money AND the product back, THEN I’d either like said money refunded or said product returned to me like the seller said. I contacted another rep a week or two ago and they tell me that if I didn’t get a response within two to three Business days, that I was ok to contact another associate and file a claim to process a partial refund. They then refunded me for another purchase as compensation, which I didn’t ask for.So I wait, then try contacting a rep again as they said, and get told that I can’t file a claim because it’s past 90 days. When I told them that the last rep told me that I could (and I have screenshot evidence of this), they glossed over it and told me that I shouldn’t have tried to return the product. I told her that it was done without my knowledge and asked what could be done to which she replied with “I can email the seller and ask them to return the PC or refund you” which is what I’ve already been doing for months now, and told me that if they don’t respond, I have no other options but to accept the loss. Huh? So you’re fine with allowing the seller to keep both the item and my money? Nah, I don’t think so.The whole experience has been such a huge nightmare that I almost want to do just that. All I’ve been told is “sure! Just Wait x amount of days” or “message the seller” I’m tired of messaging and waiting! It has already proven to not work! The seller has sneakily removed the product to hide the bad reviews on the product as well as my review with the original screenshots, so it’s obvious that they know what they’re doing! Teach your reps how to actually help people instead of reading scripts and giving false answers to get the customer to shut up! After this, I honestly don’t know if I want to order from Amazon anymore knowing that if I have an issue with a product, THIS is the type of service I’ll be receiving!",1.0,896,0.9999142631050237,8.573689497626269e-05,40.05476356937024,Low Trust
Arlene Mershell,US,1.0,"I am very disappointed that you are selling shirts that say Blue Lives Murder!!! That is so disgusting and disrespectful to Police Officers! I am an Amazon Prime member and I have many family & friends that are also Amazon Prime Members! I will make sure that they all pull their memberships and we will ALL take our business somewhere else! If I were you, I would think very hard about selling those and degrading Police Officers like that!!!",2.0,79,0.9999140026115924,8.59973884076437e-05,30.89044681277428,Low Trust
Cindy McCaffrey,US,2.0,"Horrible customer service!!!!Order was to arrive yesterday. just got message it hadn't shipped yet so tried to cancel, customer service said it had shipped so I checked it had not shipped. I'm also getting defective products alot anymore. Amazon had really gone down hill!!! I'm not ordering anything from them again!",2.0,51,0.9999125086696242,8.749133037577739e-05,60.576444112228266,Medium Trust
saj mahmood,ES,1.0,"Amazon a brand you can trust right? NO!So, my brother ordered 4 x Gtech Airram 2 vacuum cleaners, 1 was for him, the other for me and the last 2 were going to be presents. When Black Friday came along who better to take advantage of with their special Black Friday offers than Amazon, after all their customer service is supposedly excellent and they are a reputable company - NOT THIS TIME!!The 4 items were ordered and paid for on their website and we waited for the 1 week deliver date, we are Prime customers and use Amazon frequently for many items. We were excited having bagged a bargain at £120 each, the delivery date came and went and that’s when the problems started. Amazon were contacted to enquire about the whereabouts of the items, after several calls they finally informed us that the items had been delivered! Apparently they had been left at the address in a safe place, we hadn’t received anything. On checking the tracking it appeared that the items had been delivered to somewhere in Scotland and not to us in London. Many stressful days passed and there seemed to be no resolution, Amazon have 3rd party sellers on their websites and apparently the vendor wasn’t bothering to respond to their messages. We kept stressing to them that we wanted the items and not a refund, Amazon decided to refund us anyway! Hooray! We didn’t lose out right? Well, according to Amazon no we didn’t. Amazing, no compensation no nothing! The said vendor is still happily trading on Amazon and selling the vacuums at £200 now. We had many options of purchasing the Gtechs from various places on Black Friday, instead we wrongly trusted Amazon and have now missed out on the Black Friday offers, they suggested that we buy again if we wanted. Well, the whole point of Black Friday is to pick up a bargain and not be forced into paying for something and missing out on a bargain. So, they now think that through no fault of our own we should pay £320 more to buy the same again!I genuinely believe that the Vendor didn’t send anything, they obviously realised that they had priced the item too cheap and decided to pretend that they had sent them to a wrong address, wait for the customer to complain and then refund the customer the original cost, meantime they continue to use the Amazon platform to sell the vacuum cleaners at the normal non discounted price of £200. It’s unbelievable that Amazon allow this kind of practice where their customers lose out!I’ll never be using Amazon again, do so at your own peril.",18.0,448,0.999912333101842,8.766689815797868e-05,35.02962170721861,Low Trust
Zavinta,GB,1.0,"blocks reviews without any explanation! and after writing the request by the specified e-mail - no answer! 3 or more times! There is so many other companys to buy, so I'm just never gonna order from them again!!!!!",8.0,38,0.9999097625648133,9.02374351866575e-05,30.43075976856247,Low Trust
Gale,US,1.0,I get notification Amazon shut my account down due to unrecognized activity.  I call in and they can’t verify my billing address.  The CS rep actually says” M’am go into your account and see what your billing address is!” Lol...I wish I could get into my account moron! Then I ask to speak to a customer service supervisor and he comes back on trying to fool me with a different voice! Never once have I called in to these fools and thousands of dollars later they can’t help me ! Extremely frustrating! Without my bill to address can’t help! Who the hell changed my bill to! Amazon is loaded with unintelligible morons!,4.0,112,0.9999097283656159,9.027163438413144e-05,31.26082317229688,Low Trust
Amber L Campbell,US,1.0,"Amazon has the worst delivery service of all of them except for OnTrac. They are constantly late with deliveries. They don't deliver items to the correct location on the property, frequently leaving packages outside of the secure location despite what is instructed on the account and orders. They are consistently outside of their delivery window. Most recently, I received notification that my items would be delivered between 10:30 am and 11:30 am and that the packages were only 10 stops away. Then absolutely nothing happened and my packages were delayed to the next day. And then they changed my order status to say that I requested a reschedule of my delivery!!!! AMAZON DELIVERY SUCKS!!!!!",3.0,114,0.9999086399794302,9.13600205697529e-05,31.28331169143791,Low Trust
Justin,US,1.0,"In the past I have been such a strong supporter of Amazon and Whole Foods. Immensely matter of fact to the point others know more about my Prime membership than what I do for work. Until recently I had no problem with the occasional late delivery, higher than other sites price or invasion of Amazon devices. This has all changed due to the latest fiasco and complete ignorance of CS. I am now not relying on Amazon as my go to for anything I can find elsewhere. I will curb my visits to Whole Foods due to not wanting to contribute to the furthering of the dominance of the markets. I will not recommend either first before others no more. Besides half of my packages arriving late anymore, my latest order after being 4 days late I was offered a refund for my trouble, I accepted, and drove the 67 miles to the nearest Amazon pickup location to find the delivery cancelled due to refund!? I made absolutely clear I was not asking for a refund I only wanted my order, but agreed after being asked twice with assurance it would not effect my delivery finally arriving that day. After this was found out and I was standing at the pickup location, 67 miles away, I was told by 4 employees there is nothing that can be done ""after an order is refunded."" !!!???What!!??? I explained to each employee I did not ASK for a refund I was OFFERED the refund! And a refund would not effect the order in that way, a CANCELLATION might?? Which was THEIR mistake not mine!! The package had just arrived before I got there and was either in the back, in the local independent couriers vehicle still, or back at the warehouse only 25 mins away. The pickup location was open for 2 more hrs I explained. No one gave a enough to correct THEIR mistake and I am not an Amazon fan any longer.",1.0,331,0.9999070504256938,9.294957430616702e-05,33.71749100086898,Low Trust
Peter Barratt,GB,1.0,I’m trying to work out the point of Amazon tracking service. I’ve just been told my package is delivered to reception????? WHERE? I live in 3 bedroom house that does not have a reception so a bit of detail would be helpful when you can’t be bothered to deliver to the correct address!!!!!!!,41.0,53,0.9999027023993369,9.729760066312654e-05,30.599368525574377,Low Trust
chris tostige,NO,1.0,Shipper's! Do Not use Amazon for shipping! Do Not correlate any of your product's with Amazon! This a derelict company! The delivery and customer service departments are inept in function. They consistently misdeliver their products. They do not even care if they misdeliver their products as long as they take a picture of their misdeliveries. The driver's do not care! Customer service does not care! The company does not care! Buy elsewhere. Stay away from this company!,6.0,77,0.9999013283133282,9.867168667176962e-05,30.86864642785574,Low Trust
Mark Woodcock,GB,1.0,Beware purchasing an iphone! Ordered an iPhone & paid £1350 & received a soap holder. Strangely enough the soap holder was almost the same size as in iPhone! Amazon customer service is useless they just don’t care & just try & organise a collection!!!!! It doesn’t happen! Currently waiting for collection number 5 after 8 days,7.0,56,0.9999011836774597,9.881632254027384e-05,30.63309561141585,Low Trust
