angeliki vessala,DE,1.0,Order  # 306-4679330-6112330 The worst experience we ever had with an on line purchase!!!Since then we do not trust Amazon any more...! we were left uncovered the only time we needed Amazon’s a-z guarantee! Be aware of the Chinese sellers!!!! No guarantee/ no returns/ no support and very poor quality that makes you regret for your orders There are much better on line shops with much more personal support that they know what they sell and from whom... A.Xarchas/ Amazon.de,11.0,80,0.9998937714939937,0.00010622850600627842,30.90267541857008,Low Trust
Amanda Gu,US,1.0,"We purchased an iPhone (renewed premium) on Feb. 17, 2023, totally about $600. We returned it on Feb. 27 with free return service. More than two months have passed, but we still haven't received a refund from Amazon. We called multiple times to Amazon service and was informed each time that they have received the return and would refund us soon. About two weeks ago, their service manager Mr. Dulfo apologized to us and promised to refund us in 3-5 days with an additional compensation of $90 for the inconveniences that Amazon caused to us. He also sent us confirmation emails regarding the refund and the compensation. However, nothing has happened!!! We still have not received anything!!! What we should do to get our money back?!!!",1.0,126,0.999892452631292,0.0001075473687079942,31.41872565783529,Low Trust
Winston,US,1.0,"HORRIBEL and BAD SERVICE!!Amazon has become just AWFUL!! I am constantly receiving broken and destroyed items,Amazons customer service is by far hands down the WORST in all of customer service from any company! The customer service people are snarky,rude and shameless,they act entitled as if I am bothering them, they go out of their way to be difficult.I feel these customer service agents are going unchecked and are being allowed to get away with this behavior.Trying to deal with some sellers directly has also proven difficult as there is zero pride for their business and customers anymore.I am beyond fed up.I used to buy a ton of items per month and practically daily and now I am done,I am tired of the poor quality control and atrocious customer service.I only hope there are other companies out there that I can spend my money with that are honest and would appreciate my business,oh...wait!! THERE ARE!!Also,any time you try and leave an honest negative product review Amazon will not post it,that also goes with the sellers reviews,they allow ot,but cross out the review and adds a comment that Amazon takes responsibility (they do NOT)so then that review does not get counted.The whole system is rigged and people WILL start to catch on and get sick of it.",6.0,215,0.9998906347325713,0.0001093652674286627,32.41713399528394,Low Trust
