Lane Rowland-Wilson,US,1.0,They left me on hold for an hour!!! Without coming back and checking in on me or anything I got tired of it and hung up!!!! Then they called me back five minutes later and said that no one was answering so they’re going to disconnect the call!,1.0,48,0.9998817973486086,0.00011820265139139696,30.544328528531427,Low Trust
Amber Campbell,US,1.0,"I am having a horrible experience with Amazon currently. Over the last three days it has been nothing but a nightmare on the phone with them. First my Amazon account was canceled without my permission or my knowledge. When I called to inquire about this because I have shipped packages which are to be delivered to my home they pretty much told me since my account was canceled there’s nothing they can do to help me and that I would need to open a new account. Keep in mind  I never canceled To begin with. They will not give me any information on my already purchased items And because I can’t check the order status I have no idea if I’m even going to receive “again my already purchased  orders!! “ I did have one customer service representative by the name of Carlos that  explained things a little more clearly for me After speaking to three different supervisors are quite a few other customer  service representatives. I ended up opening a new account with my new email address. Which in return caused me to have to call customer service again to re-register all my Amazon devices including my fire stick, tablet etc. Which had me on the phone once again with customer service for sometime until I finally got a resolution by another supervisor by the name of Jeremy who was also great helping me get these things back in order after the nightmare of customer service representative that could not help me.  Keep in mind I am an Amazon prime customer so with my Amazon a prime account Being canceled right after I paid my Amazon prime bill I’m sure you can understand why I am quite frustrated. And also having packages still not delivered to my home and having no idea where they are or if they will even be Delivered! But because I was reassured that everything Would be fine by supervisor Jeremy I was starting to feel a little better about everything. Moving forward because I’m starting to feel better about everything I begin to place another order on my new Amazon prime account feeling confident that nothing else will happen. Boy was I wrong. I proceeded to place my order to only receive an email not even five minutes after my order was placed stating that my new Amazon prime account has been suspended for suspicious activity!!!????? At this point I have lost all faith. I called customer service and again got absolutely no answers! I was told that I need to wait 24 hours after filling out a form that they sent me via email. Once again my children are not able to use their tablet or the fire stick or any other devices in my home for absolutely no reason! I cannot access my Amazon account at all because it was suspended for absolutely no reason this is a brand new account and this is the first order that I’ve made on it after having a three day nightmare with being on the phone with terrible customer service, having packages delivered to my neighbors that should have been delivered to me. having my Amazon account canceled without my knowledge,  having to open a new Amazon account,  not knowing where my other packages are, Being charge for my prime The day before my account is mysteriously canceled, and  finally suspending my account for suspicious activity for absolutely no reason and then not giving me any answers as to why when I call! I am Mind blown",1.0,592,0.9998817192241114,0.00011828077588860175,36.646407588990726,Low Trust
Kay,GB,1.0,"I wish I could give zero!! After almost 7 hours of phone calls, I still haven’t had my query resolved. 1st. They offered me a new replacement tablet as mine broke, and they did not have a replacement model in stock. They advised me too reorder a new tablet, and I would be refunded once it arrived of £150. This advice took place on online chat , and I have the messages to prove this claim. However, after hours on the phone they agreed a refund but only refunded me the amount I had originally payed for item.  To me this is complete dishonesty on Amazon’s part! And they conned me out of my money !!!!  2nd the item never arrived so I contacted Amazon, who sent me a replacement tablet out.  Well this is what I thought ! Instead they charged me another £150 without my permission. So for a replacement tablet I am £210 out of pocket. I have contacted Amazon numerous times, they either put the phone down after waiting endlessly to be passed over. They are just so unhelpful. I have opened a dispute with the bank now, as I am owed £210, and I have evidence to back up my claims  My  overall judgement is that these tablets don’t come with two year worry free warranty. I will never get the time back I have spent trying to resolve this. And Amazon owe me an apology. And not a fake one which I keep hearing. “Im sorry you feel like this “but no ACTION!",3.0,259,0.9998816347826788,0.00011836521732122574,32.91113418907694,Low Trust
Antonio Margheriti,DK,1.0,"I ordered a Warbeast Guitar Hero Guitar, and the games Guitar Hero III and World Tour.I recieved products after only 4 days with an extra cost of 10 dollars, nice!Opened it like a kid on christmas eve cause i'm basically the biggest guitar hero fan ever, and what a disappointment!The coolest Guitar Hero controller ever made was already used, signed by some tard ""Danny Johnson 2009"", broken and worst of all, the USB hub which is needed to use the guitar wasn't there! WTF!?.Opened the rest of my recievings and the game Guitar Hero III packaging looked like some halfdehumanized african child who were beaten with a gigantic stick! I was like ""Nah"" thats okay, as long as the game works. It didn't. Some cheap chinese game which were not compatible with my other guitar hero controller. SHIT! All i was giving was shit including a perfectly working game (World Tour) Which didn't matter cause my day was fucking ruined so i shipped it all back. More trouble coming, as i demanded a refund. I was told: No problem, we'll refund the SHIT we gave to you. Including the shipping cost of 102 dollars which i paid. Only problem is, none of the refunds were refunded right (4 different refunds), so i have to continously ask them nicely to refund the money, cause they weren't refunded correct. I'm like wtf?! Worst personal consisting of 5 yrs old google translaters who don't know shit ever! i am NEVER shopping from Amazon again, and thanks to Amazon i don't trust ANY foreign stores. I'll stick up to the locals from now.",5.0,273,0.9998785541807803,0.00012144581921968989,33.06832691799407,Low Trust
