Kimberley Paris,CA,1.0,"I order alot from Amazon,  I am a prime member, however I hate being lied to! Angie's review here said it best and is spot on!! On the day my delivery is due I get a shipping notice for 8 days later ! That's bs! I would not have ordered this item, I can get this item somewhere else easily and today!! They just changed the delivery date all on their own and now I can't cancel it either, or actually talk to a customer service rep! This company is hit and miss and you can't trust this, nor where their drivers decide to leave your parcels because I find them in many vulnerable places!",2.0,115,0.9998705873077328,0.00012941269226718344,31.296431374938656,Low Trust
