Megan,GB,1.0,"I ordered alcohol for an upcoming party - It was an £180 order, so you would think it would need to be signed for to start with..But of course I came home to find my parcel outside my building in the pouring rain! When picking up the parcel I realised it was super wet and kind of light! Only to hear and notice all bottles were smashed and the box was not only drenched because of rain water but because of the alcohol! I have a 1 year old baby so I got my neighbour to help me put it in the correct communal bin - I mean why would I even take it inside? It’s damaged, it’s wet and more so it’s a hazard! I of course got in contact with Amazon straight away who have said they can’t help without pictures?! So what I’m meant to climb into the bin and put it all back out ?! Absolutely disgusting service and more so a health and safety issue! I have had many problems with Amazon in the last but this is just appalling!",9.0,185,0.9998685676316247,0.00013143236837531713,32.08172585285511,Low Trust
Anonymous,GB,1.0,"Absolutely SHOCKINGLY BAD customer service. If I could give minus stars I 100% would! Firstly, they refused to speak to me about a package I ordered under my name and with my card details because it was done under my mothers account. Now my mother is trying to talk to them and they HUNG UP ON HER! To make matters worse when I asked to speak to a manager I wasn’t allowed because I wasn’t the account holder? Sorry? In what world is that okay? Said package has not been delivered to my house and I would like to know WHERE IN THE HELL IT IS!! Secondly, their online service for finding out where your package got delivered too is a great big circle of b******t! It doesn’t actually help you, it takes you round in a big circle that gives you 0 help! This forces you to speak to them, and then they won’t help you either and will hang up on you. What company in their right MIND doesn’t allow a paying customer to find out which house their incompetent delivery drivers dropped their parcel off at? Because my ring doorbell certainly agrees with me when I say it wasn’t mine! Sort it the hell out Amazon! I’m disgusted. Absolutely disgusted.",1.0,213,0.9998682044850966,0.0001317955149033878,32.395821407825935,Low Trust
Ankie,NL,1.0,"NEVER NEVER order something again. It's a corrupt companyI ordered and paid a powerbank.They confirned this with an emailI waited and waited for Just a long time. They did not send it.I phoned them. Horabble to reach them. They gave my money back and i could order the same powerbank for €10,- moreThey alsof changed the price on the internetsite. I wrote them protest mail called them and the seller said we received your mail!!!!! One day later i've got an email that my email could not be delivered??????NEVER NEVER BUY HERECORRUPT as they are!!!!Fam. Winkel, Leeuwarden, Holland",2.0,98,0.9998675006504534,0.00013249934954662201,31.105895859232795,Low Trust
mike cavanagh,GB,1.0,"Dont order from amazon if ............ your expecting a delivery on a certain day , it wont arrive !! why pay for amazon prime if it cant keep its end of the deal and deliver orders on time , ordered something told arrival will be in 2 days , 2 days later , there has been a delay it will arrive the next day , waited in all day the next day , no show and no updates on my order within amazon to tell me what time it will arrive or where it actually is !!! they just left me standing , so went ahead and cancelled amazon prime , oh well their loss !!!",54.0,116,0.9998648260051665,0.00013517399483353731,31.30793648998284,Low Trust
Eli,US,5.0,"I've been ordering from Amazon for about 5 years now. I have ordered a variety of products, from dog shampoo to Pokemon products. There were a few instances where I ordered something that I ended up festering an allergic reaction to. Even though the listing said no returns, I was able to speak with Amazon customer service via CHAT (THIS IS THE MOST IMPORTANT PART, SO READ CAREFULLY). I have had ZERO complaints about Amazon customer service. Why? I NEVER get angry at the rep. Doesn't matter if they are Indian or not. Be courteous and polite when conversing with the rep. Don't be a Karen. Do not ask for the manager cause you won't be getting one. The fate of your complaint pretty much rests in their hands. Act like a beech, you won't be provided any resolution whatsoever. You're talking to a stranger, so make sure you have some manners!!! They are not your child, so stop reprimanding them!When returning multiple products, MAKE SURE THAT YOU DIVIDE THEM OUT ACCORDING TO THEIR ORDERS!!!! Throwing in items from multiple orders into a box is actually wrong, I've learned this from an Amazon rep. Doing so will not only ensure that you will NOT get a timely refund, but it creates more work for the people in the Amazon returns department who then have to manually look through your entire order history and match them up. In a busy work environment nobody wants to have to do that. Another thing that people seem to be missing: when returning an item pack the items CAREFULLY. You can initiate a return for a defective/unwanted product, but if the Amazon workers open up your box and find that it is damaged, they will NO LONGER refund you, they have implemented this policy a few years back. So make sure you pack your items carefully. Don't just toss them in a box without any cushioning/padding and then call it a day. Another thing that I've seen too many Amazon shoppers do is that they FAIL to read reviews before purchasing. That item is 3 stars for a reason! Don't just buy it because it looks like it works/is authentic. Too often I'm seeing people write negative reviews for an already terrible product because they failed to read the reviews. The reviews are there for a reason, and should guide you in your purchase making. It's like buying the first car you see because you like the way it looks, then coming back to the dealership the next day because you discovered that you're too small/big to fit properly in the driver's seat. Be a SMART buyer, not a DUMB one. As a suggestion, Amazon needs to invest in a 'cooling warehouse' for perishable products such as skincare, which lose their efficacy by a large margin when exposed to heat. I order skincare products from their respective retailers now since I keep receiving products that are extremely hot to the touch, even though they were probably sitting in a (hopefully) air-conditioned Amazon van.",19.0,508,0.9998598399249379,0.00014016007506212347,155.70526936101615,High Trust
Glynne Thomas,GB,1.0,"I have been trying to order gift cards ( a substantial amount as christmas bonuses for my employees this year) for a week now. At first I received only part of my order, which was delivered to my local post office with no issue. BUT the remamainder of the order has been declined, 4 TIMES! I initially called Amazon 4 days ago to see what the problem was with payment and they advised me that my bank had declined the balance of the order, so I spoke to my bank to authorise the balance. Tried again to put an order in for the remainder of the gift cards, again declined. I again spoke to Amazon 2 days ago. I was advised that the initial order would have to be cancelled by the call handler so that I could again put an order in on line as I was unable to do it over the phone. I agreed to this and tried to order again on line. 20 minutes later I received an email to say that not only had the order been cancelled but my account HAD BEEN CLOSED due to fraudulent activity! Amazon were actually gloating at how good they had been to detect this!! I and my wife AGAIN (for the 2nd time that day) had to call customer service and go through the whole sorry saga again!I was sent another email with a link to retrieve my account. This I did and AGAIN tried to put the order for the balance of the giftcards I wished to purchase along with some batteries I require for tooling for my job. No emails to say that the order had been declined this time but when I went through to the order details via my email, I saw that AGAIN the orders had been CANCELLED. TODAY WAS YET ANOTHER PHONE CALL TO AMAZON CUSTOME SERVICES. 4 TIMES THIS WEEK I HAVE CALLED. As I have a business account, and the order was over £1000, I had to be put through to the business dept. They couldn't help. I needed to speak to yet another dept because, although I can now access my account I cannot actually use it! But they weren't availiable. So I am now having to wait another day for them to call me back, that's if they do and don't send me an email to say they have shut my account yet again.I am trying to spend a lot of money with Amazon, and yes, with gift cards they can be fraudulent purchases I understand that, but all along I and my wife have spoken to Amazon and our bank to get this resolved.I AM TOTALLY DISGUSTED AT THE LEVEL OF SERVICE I HAVE RECEIVED (OR NOT) FROM AMAZON.I WASTRYING TO GIVE MY EMPLOYEES GIFT CARDS AS A CHRISTMAS PRESENT FOR ALL THEIR HARD WORK THIS YEAR AT OUR CHRISTMAS PARTY LAST NIGHT BUT AMAZON HAS RUINED IT! THANK YOU AMAZON! MY EMPLOYEES NOW HAVE IOU'S. NOT GOOD!",7.0,501,0.9998581936919978,0.0001418063080022014,35.626832323252046,Low Trust
Shane Payne,US,1.0,"Package marked delivered, it wasn’t! Called and rep stated “independent contractors” where hired for holiday rush. Some “independent contractors” have been stating delivered and yet the package is either not delivered or the driver steals. Wrote a letter and sent photos of a temp driver delivering package only to return, hop gate, and take back the package! Amazon rep(s) say oh well it’s marked as delivered! So now I’m out of pocket and out of item’s purchased. Received email reading “sometimes these things happen.” Either refund the money or replace items! Simple!! Yet amazon customer service, if we can communicate properly because it’s outsourced, will do absolutely nothing. Shame on you Jeff Bezos, shame on you amazon!!",6.0,117,0.9998568775627062,0.0001431224372937523,31.319550962021726,Low Trust
Bumblebeebuzzing,AE,1.0,Absolutely  disgusting! Ordered twice and order gets cancelled and no show of it on track and manage orders to ask for a refund! NO ITS NOT STRANGE ITS INTENTIONALLY DONE! You need to go back and study business and customer service!I EXPECT A REFUND TO BE AUTOMATICALLY  CREDITED! I have the email confirmation.Sack these people!NOT BUYING FROM THEM!-6!,12.0,58,0.9998564083939149,0.000143591606085125,30.65776847542484,Low Trust
Piotr Srebro,GB,1.0,DO NOT BUY FROM AMAZON AND DO NOT WASTE YOUR MONEY FOR PRIME. Most item with logo PRIME is highly overpriced. U pay extra money for next day delivery but in most cases u have to wait a week. THAT'S AMAZON PRIME!!!!! Avoid them. I have ordered backlighted keyboard which was much overpriced compared to prices on Ebay. But i paid extra as a prime member cause i want it faster . And u know what? - in day of delivery (next day as advertised) i didn't get my item but i get an mail that my delivery will be delayed for few days. That's AMAZON PRIME STANDARDS!!!!So please think twice before u paid extra on Amazon. I'm ensure u that delivery times on ebay are fast and prices are much much lower ALMOST ON EVERYTHING. That was a very bad experience with AMAZON.  But i want to be sure that people will be know that PRIME in Amazon doesn't mean fast. SAVE YOUR MONEY,7.0,165,0.9998558142571053,0.00014418574289465358,31.858022523263635,Low Trust
DAVID WARD,GB,1.0,"My Husband and I have had the most horrendous experience ever! Please take time to read our complaint and the arrogance of the response from Amazon! They’ve clearly gotten too big for their boots. Appalling Service! Good morning.Ref: order no. 026-3091564-4971526In March I purchased a Vax Platinum Carpet Cleaner from Amazon to be delivered to our now old address 306 Pickering Road.  We have since moved to out new address 7 Beech Lawn.  I called over two weeks ago to explain that the appliance had stopped working and was given a full refund and told that the appliance would be collected by a driver.  I explained that I no longer had the packaging and was told this was not a problem.  A UPS driver attended and refused to take the item saying it needed to be boxed, so I rang customer services again and was told it had to be boxed! I then entered an interaction with the manager who was initially very unhelpful and simply kept reiterating things over and over again sending me into such frustration the likes I have never experienced before!I then went on to buy another exact appliance from Amazon and was prepared to use that packaging to return the faulty appliance.  I rang today and spoke with yet another customer service agent who repeated over and over again that I needed to print off a label for the return, I pointed out that I do not have access to a printer and that my husband is disabled.  I asked to speak to a manager and after being refused 10 times he eventually made me wait 10 minutes before I was put through to the most obnoxious individual I have ever had the misfortune to deal with.  This man asked why I was speaking to him in this tone after I spelled out the letters UPS. I said I wasnt speaking to him in any tone and he then began to mock me with his tone which I find incomprehensible in this day and age of so called customer service.  He then abruptly put the phone down on me!I rang again to speak with a Manager this time a female and was blatantly treated with nonescelance. After being told there was no other option available and that I would have to pay for the return, otherwise I would be recharged for the appliance, which sounded to me very much like a threat.  If you see from my account activity I am a loyal PRIME customer, than youll understand why I feel so undervalued and disrespected by the staff at Amazon.  All I want is for the faulty appliance to be collected!  If I hear one more time from Amazon that I have to print out a label then consider my account closed as I will not deal with such a discriminatory organisation.I await your decision and please listen to the calls that I have had to endure.THE RESPONSE:Hello from Amazon, You've written to an address that is not currently accepting incoming e-mails. You may prefer to visit our help pagesus at the bottom of any Help page. In order for us to better assist you we've provided some links below to help answer some common questions.",92.0,541,0.9998536014772713,0.0001463985227286857,36.075743930623254,Low Trust
AKHILESH SANKAR,IN,1.0,"Sometimes Amazon customers care is so funny because it a big joke. Whats funnier is the amazon fulfillment service. Sometimes the contact with them kind of rub off on you and you're going to be so much funnier. A CLOWN! There's so much trust that when you return a product and the courier service tells you that they don't accept returns and you'll loose the courier charge and you still want the return so you call an associate they ask you to send the details and tracking id and everything will be fine and you pay the courier charge which they promise, will be returned along with the refund- Chapter I CLOWN IOI ! Then,just like the courier service said,they does not accept the product and blame the courier service. you'll think the courier service is a joke but no baby!You are! -Chapter 2 CLOWN IOI They say the courier service wouldn't have delivery in the area,and when they checked into the courier service, it was shown that the adress,which is of an amazon shipment shown that the adress,which is ot an amazon shipment center,was incorrect,Which you may be dumb enough to believe (jokes on you actually), then the courier service calls you to say that they have attempted delivery (and you realize almost every major courier service would be having delivery near an amazon shipment hub) and says that they are not accepting the return and if the product should be sent back.You call the associate they ask you to sent the details and then try again and promise they ask you to sent the details and then try again and promise you everything will be fixed this time. Voila! -Chapter 3 CLOWN 101. You sent it again. They reject it again . They ask you to take back the product. Then try the return again and loose twice the money. IDK what you think man but this class is fire! I don't think its the iey. IDK what you think man but this class is fire! I don't think its the joker hype but yeah. This is jocker,but you're the the funny one! 🤡PS - The barcode or details was not tampered because the second time is asked the courier service to retry after sticking the printing labels amazon sent me, just in case if the barcode was tampered or something.",1.0,393,0.9998494019605575,0.0001505980394425066,34.41583051890987,Low Trust
CRYSTAL HOLLON,US,1.0,I ordered a pair of women's shoes they were to little (like most of Amazon's crap it wasn't right) so I sent them back and I got a gift card receipt for them on my account.  So then I placed another order to replace them.  And they canceled it.  I did this 4 times they canceled it everytime even though it says plain as day on my account page they received my return and my refund was issued and I had a gift card balance.  So I tried to contact them on their app I chatted with 6 or 7 of their associates over a course of several days they couldn't tell me why?  And said I would get a phone call within 24 hours it's been 5 days no phone call.  chatted and asked again they said the same thing someone will call me in 24 hours.  Still nothing... So today I opened my Amazon app and my gift card balance is 0. 00!!!!!They straight ripped me off!  DO NOT BUY FROM AMAZON!!! They will take your money,1.0,179,0.9998489702078701,0.00015102979212988643,32.01540342454761,Low Trust
JS,GB,2.0,"I am Amazon Prime Member in Worcestershire . I had X4 Orders have not arrived on time this last week. 1 never showed up, 2 running, 2 days late, still not got them at this time & 4th ordered on 28th, told 3rd Party delivering today. But 3rd Party states they don't have it. & then Amazon sent Email, item running 2 days late. SHAMBLES! Something going on with the Amazon Reddtch Hub! Things go in but don't come out!******1800 hrs 02/10 Just got 2 More emails from Amazon to say X2 Different Orders coming Via Royal Mail due for Delivery by today 02/10 are Now Delayed. The 2 Items HAD Been Pick up by Royal Mail and are in the RM System. All My Deliveties are Showing as: ""PREMIUM DELIVERY!WTH is Going On with Amazon Prime! Terrible Service one is paying for! So Now A Total Of 6 Prime Orders NOT Yet Recieved or Delivered on Time! At this moment in time An Atrocious Paid for service!",34.0,168,0.9998473782798742,0.00015262172012575626,61.8920954718728,Medium Trust
Antonio R,NI,1.0,Amazon needs to play fair when it comes to its products as it’s policy is a joke as it deceives below:We couldn't post your review because it focuses on one or more of these topics:SellersDeliveryPackagingPricingAvailabilityI mean what the hell !!of course people are going to complain about sellers that is what review does !!!go figure !!!,1.0,56,0.9998453011492048,0.00015469885079522072,30.6358897378286,Low Trust
Former Amazon Patron,US,1.0,"Seriously thinking about canceling my Amazon Prime Membership.I will never buy anything of value on Amazon again after Amazon’s latest screw up.I had saved up for close a year for a new IPad.My present one is cracked and hardly works.I ordered the new iPad through my Prime Membership. At 1st, Amazon claimed that it would arrive the very next day.That changed to two days, which I was fine with. I paid a friend to hang out and get the iPad from the Amazon driver. I did this because this was an expensive item and I didn’t want anything to happen to it. The tracking information said the iPad would arrive between 11:45am and 2:45 pm. Only 6 stops away. Later, I saw that the iPad had been delivered!Great, I thought!I got home around 5:30pm and asked my friend where’s the iPad?He told me that No Amazon Track or Driver dropped off anything at the front door?What, I exclaimed!I immediately tried to contact Amazon Customer Service, which is a total nightmare and not much help, other than asking if I had checked my front porch?No, it’s not on the front porch!Customerservice told me that the iPad was delivered because it says so?OMG, what’s wrong with these people.Usually Amazon takes a photo of where the driver left the item.In my case, there was No Photo!So, an hour later I was speaking with an Amazon supervisor.I explained everything for the 20th time.Only to be told, please wait another day?I asked if I could get another tracking number for a time of arrival? No Can Do!If the iPad hasn’t arrived by the end of the 3rd day, please call back and file a claim.Well that day came and went, No IPad.I’m presently taking Amazon to Small Claims Court to get my money back.So, the moral of the story is,Think Twice Before You Order Anything Of Value From Amazon!Because if anything goes wrong, You Are On Your Own!Amazon=Buyer Beware!",1.0,324,0.9998408881221419,0.0001591118778581091,33.642279766635475,Low Trust
