Sharon Morris,GB,1.0,"got up monday morning to find a parcel under my husbands van, it had been raining all night, so it was soaking wet, not even my parcel!!! i have delivered to the right  address. then yesterday there said they tryed to deliver to & i wasn't in. that was there first lie, i have cameras on my driveway, no one tried to deliver. I then contacted them by phone & got told my parcel was still out for delivery. Another lie!!!!! still no parcel. very poor customer service",11.0,88,0.9998330034377682,0.000166996562231847,30.99545022070834,Low Trust
Mrs  Schofield,GB,1.0,"I'm disgusted with the way Amazon are behaving! I bought some tools, they dint come when I asked for a refund they tried giving me an online Amazon voucher! I refused then the agent dissappeared another came on patronising saying ""oh dear oh dear there is nothing we can do here we we refund you a voucher! I said no again. They changed agents again 4 times! they told me I'll have to wait a WEEK for my money! In the mean time while waiting for the tools I ordered 9 bottles of paint, I got 4 this is a next day delivery but I was told it  will be over 48 hours!! I said no I need them before then. Again they tried giving me a voucher, when I said no again they told me  I'll have to wait a week for my refund! This has happened a lot over the last few months I would think twice before shopping on Amazon again",16.0,164,0.9998221858429918,0.0001778141570082381,31.84848689405344,Low Trust
ron snyder,US,1.0,"Customer service has cost them my business! Back to brick and mortar for me. Or just cut the middle man out (Amazon). I’ll pay more to not ever have to deal with these POS’s, and their uneducated staff, drivers and customer service personnel must all be 1st grade dropouts!! Bye Felicia!!!!!",5.0,51,0.9998200914946452,0.00017990850535476444,30.581064970977216,Low Trust
Stuart Jackson,GB,1.0,"I used to be a great fan of Amazon until my recent purchase! I ordered GU10 Warm white for our kitchen. £9.21 for 5. They arrived the next day and although the box stated cool white the bar code had been covered over with another sticker Warm white! On trying the light it was COOL WHITE!! The seller knew this. I contacted Amazon and explained the seller had been deceitful! They said I could return for a refund which could take upto 9 days. I said I would keep 1 light and return 4. That was not possible I was informed, even though they knowingly sent the wrong item. I sent pictures again no response from Amazon. They say they are customer focused not in my case! They are more about protecting the seller. Ebay offer buyers protection!!",52.0,138,0.9998184980440207,0.00018150195597932406,31.55702798618932,Low Trust
Emma Carter,GB,1.0,"Alexa devices at Amazon !Used to love Amazon , myself and my nan have an account and we’re always ordering. I’m very upset with recent contact with Amazon , i bought an AmazonTower a few years ago but I now can’t use this because it’s Obsolete. I asked if there was anything they can do and all I got was that the product is obsolete so it won’t work anymore ! But yet I bought it to Last ? So Why is it fair to keep buying new Amazon music devices because people need to upgrade ? I thinkIt’s disgusting the tower cost me £90 and it should last for years to come ! I have a radio from Argos for £10 that’s last me 10 years ! Yet they thinkIt’s acceptable to sell all these music devices but they DoNot last ! So seriously ,do not buy Amazon music devices ! Go to Argos and get one that will last !!",3.0,162,0.9998180394691952,0.00018196053080477004,31.82626011291152,Low Trust
