Phillip James,US,1.0,"recently buy front, rear, and fog light tint that were supposed to custom fit for my BMW 640i. I took the tint to a 5-star tint installation dealership to have it installed, Well to my surprise the front was not a custom fit. The installer recommended not to install the rear and return the front and contact Rvinyl. I contacted them and sent photos of the tint. Their customer rep Melinda P. stated they will not refund me because it was installed by a third party? Hence I am not a professional installer but using that as an excuse not to refund me and the fact I still have the rear tint still in the shipping plastic. I would not order any custom tint cause it will not be custom fit and no refund!!!!!! Your choice buying from this company!!",5.0,140,0.9997585078578964,0.00024149214210356096,31.582461595327278,Low Trust
