Jessica Grube-cresto,US,1.0,"Amazon customer service representative totally lied to me and pushed me into a refund when the same item from the same seller was available for a replacement. I specified several times that I didn't want a refund I wanted the urn necklace for my mother-in-law and would wait for it to come into stock and be reshipped. The rep stated she was making an exception and trying to help me and that even with the refund it would still reship when it came available. This DIDN'T MAKE SENSE AT ALL! I questioned her a few times and she clearly stated she was doing me a favor for the confusion and inconvenience and that's why I would get the refund and that it would still ship when available. Needless to say SHE LIED AND NOW I'M SCREWED!!!! Thank you ""top of the line"" Amazon customer service for lying to me! They say it's unavailable, but I can find the exact same urn necklace from the same seller on the website! I will never use Amazon again!",1.0,175,0.9995214517583539,0.0004785482416460596,31.986911147359926,Low Trust
Ronni L. Wayne,US,1.0,"I would give 0 stars. I ordered a pair of booties for my granddaughter. I received them three days later. They were thrown in a box and used. Tons of stains on the booties and garbage ready!! The listing had them as new.  I called customer support, they could not have been more rude. I offered pictures and they said no. You need to go to Kohls and return them!!!!!! Their disgusting mistake and I have to go tot he trouble of returning the booties. I am done with Amazon. Where is the quality control? My last item was damaged and this one is used.",1.0,105,0.9995055057380793,0.0004944942619207193,31.202514954262604,Low Trust
Damien BIZEAU,FR,4.0,"Amazon: four stars from me, your life client.Keep up the great work!Thanks to Amazon for its amazing Internet V.I.P Pass for me! I got it!Damien.",168.0,25,0.999492453750051,0.0005075462499489758,120.30580356039424,High Trust
Nadia V,US,1.0,"Absolutely HORRIBLE!!! 3rd time they delivered my package to the wrong address. I mean come on: it doesn't take a rocket scientist to be able to read numbers and I have my house number with BIG NUMBERS on my mailbox. The founder is a damn billionaire and can't properly train these people?? Also, most of this crap and I MEAN: CRAP comes from CHINA !!!! They just throw things into a box. They don't care about nothing but money.  I gave them a chance after chance but today in the morning I am drawing a line. I ordered coffee maker cuz I didn't have time to go to the store and ordered it because it said it would be at my door between 4am and8am. I am a coffee addict like many of American people and wanted my cup when I wake up and I woke up at 4am and then saw a delivery notice with the Pic of my neighbors patio. Thank God it was my next door neighbor because if it wasn't I would not see my coffee maker ever Again.  Therefore I urge everyone to go elsewhere and even if u pay tiny bit more and in some cases a lot less and get a better product guaranteed.",7.0,211,0.999484323255498,0.000515676744502036,32.39258136947412,Low Trust
Amanda,GB,2.0,"I use amazon ALOT and after a friend told me about ‘vine customers’ I made sure to write helpful reviews in the hope I’d be selected as one! Amazon removed my reviews and said I wasn’t allowed to review anymore as they thought I had posted a bias review for a friend or family member! The operator agreed that they couldn’t understand why as the item I had reviewed was Christmas cards, n I had bought about 30 of them all the same kind, but from different sellers on amazon and I left pretty much the same review for all of them! The one seller had no relation and the seller was miles & miles away! Amazon refused to tell me why they thought it was a dodgy review and wouldn't look into it further! So now I can’t become s vine customer and I wasted hours n hours writing helpful reviews! Oh and amazon allows pictures from reviews to be used on other websites as my face is plastered on an online article and the picture that was only posted on an amazon review!",14.0,185,0.9994791651781549,0.000520834821845062,62.10119597552859,Medium Trust
