Trish Carman,US,4.0,I Love the variety of things I order - Generally the prices are good/convenient   - BUT what I don’t understand is why I pay for Prime membership & only 3/4’s of the time I actually get it !!! That’s NOT FAIR that I pay for a service BUT DONT RECEIVE IT !!!,3.0,52,0.9994667914575599,0.0005332085424401001,120.60994702274735,High Trust
