Phatzoot,GB,1.0,"Cheap chinese crap. Ur not allowed to give honest reviews. Bad 1 star reviews get removed for being biased. Had 8 years of reviews deleted and not tood why! The email i recieved letting me know was vague and didnt have a real reason and it started with just the word hello, no name or username so i thought it was spam.it seems ur only allowed to leave good reviews hmmmmm and im biased. Customer service are mongs that drag out sentances and talk really slow. Gone right downhill!!!!!",30.0,89,0.9994024856287568,0.000597514371243224,31.02819316107478,Low Trust
Ashley Chadwick,US,1.0,"After being a prime member for years, Amazon has randomly decided to close my account this week. They say it’s for misuse because I’ve returned too many items. I have NEVER returned an item to Amazon! Despite my best efforts to communicate and get to the bottom of things this week, I’m still without my Amazon account. So obviously our Alexa stopped working, we can’t access prime video, etc. I was able to change my password but that does nothing on a closed account.The real kicker?! THEY STILL TRIED TO CHARGE ME FOR A PRIME VIDEO ACCOUNT I CANNOT ACCESS!! How can you charge a closed account?!? Because their awful “customer service” is allowed!! Meta and Amazon have grown too big for their britches and have no idea how to communicate with their customer base. Disgusting companies!",1.0,137,0.9993999880720378,0.0006000119279622185,31.56673643487259,Low Trust
