Graham Tait,GB,1.0,"Delivery for products not bad, packaging is OTT! The Prime Video website is APPALLING! I’m no web designer, but whoever is in the design/functionality department of this site has a serious problem! Obviously getting paid too much for doing too little. Moved from Netflix to Amazon, and am now considering subscribing to YouTube for entertainment. Sort your website out Amazon! You’re earning enough money to be more creative, so get some intelligent people on board and sort your movie site out. If movies are not available to view in the UK, don’t list them. Give the option to select language... Like I say, get creative! Enough said!!One more month and I move to YouTube and buy more books (from a site other than amazon; would prefer to support a company that cares)Peace",3.0,132,0.9991246602736042,0.0008753397263957519,31.52441757521491,Low Trust
Syd,US,1.0,"TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE! I initiated a return for refund. The next day UPS picked the item up and delivered it to Amazon the following day! I go into check the status on Amazons website and it just states that a return was requested. Now 2 weeks later their website has the same status! I’ve contacted customer service 4 times and get nowhere with them! I should be seeing and updated status, per their policy, and received an email, per their policy, by now, stating the refund process has begun, but I have received nothing but lip service and no refund! Now they are forcing me to file a complaint through Visa to get my refund! TERRIBLE way to treat a good customer!",15.0,122,0.9991235789828626,0.0008764210171373632,31.412301140593268,Low Trust
