Julie Law,GB,5.0,"I ordered off a supplier through Amazon, I ordered three of the items and later discovered Amazon charged me 3x the delivery fee. The product was ordered and would be delivered together!! I requested Amazon to refund 2 x the delivery fee and they refused and also decided to argue with me consistently back and fore on email until I got fed up of their confrontational attitude and gave up. I to date have never received the goods that I paid including delivery of £35.00. They decided to deliver early without warning I was at work so they decided to leave at a post office depot miles away from where I live. I am not going to collect the goods and made that clear to Amazon on email. So to date I do not have the goods and they still have my £35. I will never order from Amazon again. I have made that clear to them and they don't care as they are literally in the pound seat. Dispicable!!!!",30.0,170,0.9988733339732705,0.0011266660267295059,151.96323178703474,High Trust
Jay,US,1.0,"No angry hate words but I was one of their biggest fan until they slowly became bad in every way, Where do I start! Morning away from away professional shipping companies and start their bad shipping Service, I lost many shipments, many came late, some got delivered to my neighbors, kids in U-Haul Vans ! Amzel ! Just bad.And if you’re not happy with the product or the service, you can’t leave reviews like before! You can’t say it’s late! Or didn’t arrive ! They have new policy that takes away that right from you, their main focus is on profit, then more profit, and without premium good luck getting your items shipped! honestly it’s much faster ordering them from any website than amazon, and that’s not even half what I don’t like about them .... leaving Amazon for good after long years of a loyal premium member...",5.0,148,0.9988511301820452,0.0011488698179548118,31.717566878446814,Low Trust
jamie,US,1.0,"If I could leave negative stars I would. Amazon has gone from great to the worst!!! The selection of goods they sell has turned to junk, ship time time is ridiculous (that is if your items even arrive) and their customer service is HORRIBLE!!! Order at your own risk!",1.0,49,0.9988321889208637,0.0011678110791363272,30.60802599983455,Low Trust
KToby,GB,1.0,"I tried to leave a review on Amazon about the awful delivery I had and they wouldn't post it! I came home a few days ago to find my 2 packages on the doorstep and it had been raining too! According to Amazon, it was handed to me! Very difficult to delivery it to me as I was at work!!  Very disappointed! Please post this!",7.0,65,0.9987811274848596,0.0012188725151404123,30.79005187028871,Low Trust
Barbara Turner,US,1.0,"I used to be a Prime member but then didn't need it anymore, cancelled it back in Nov 2017 then last year in May 2018 I started getting these insane emails that would state:""Your Amazon Prime membership debit of $12.99, $14.99, $3.99, was refused on your Visa Debit card"" or whatever amount and this went on for 4 months from late April to July with them causing me to have to get 5 new debit cards reissued as well as 2 temporary cards with WF bank and FINALLY I went to another branch and there I found someone who knew exactly how to fix the problem and I didn't have to close my account and come to find out there are literally thousands of Prof. Hackers who were attaching our WF Visa Debit cards to our Amazon Prime memberships and somehow they got permission from VISA to rollover the charges attempts to the newly issued debit cards with the VISA logo!!!!  OH yeah!  So WF's IT and security dept. put a stop to it all with their cards being used.  DO NOT GO WITH AMAZON OR AMAZON PRIME!  THEY ARE TOO BIG, TOO GREEDY AND TOO POWERFUL!",3.0,197,0.9987700737157623,0.0012299262842376812,32.27125514763869,Low Trust
Morris W  Conway Jr,US,5.0,"Good morning to  everyone that work for the  Amazon Prime Delivery Company Customer Center. I do hope that all of yous are doing ok smile. Also I do hope that all of yous will have a very good day at work ok smile. In ending I want to tell all of yous that one of your very wonderful Staff members name  Allison that's a very wonderful  Amazon Prime Delivery driver was so very  very  Professional Helpful and very  very Caring to me when she delivered a package to my very wonderful friends house etc. ok smile. Last of all I say that Allison has very  very  very very Excellent Communication Skills and yes she knows and loves her job so very much too ok smile. Finally before I end my Review I must say that Allison is always a very Positive Representative for the very wonderful  Amazon Prime Delivery Company that she works for day in and day out ok smile. Now last of all from all of us to all of yous please have a very  very  Happy  Tuesday day, night enjoy take care God Bless. Sincerely, Elizabeth HaffordGlen Hafford Morris W Conway Jr",317.0,195,0.9987638855250255,0.0012361144749745145,152.2491304573438,High Trust
Barry Allan,GB,1.0,"Early February I emailed an add for purchase of a Amazon “pallet.” This was supposed to be a chance to purchase a pallet of all manner of items that are made up of excessive stock, returned items etc selling very cheap. I paid approx £55.00 but after six weeks nothing arrived and then started the tales. Mainly that the goods had been delivered and left in my porch. Funny that as I do not have a porch!! However, after sending Amazon a photo to demonstrate that I do not have a porch, Amazon then said they will send me a replacement. Alas, a further 5 weeks on and guess what? No deliver once again and now Amazon seem to have run out of steam as I cannot get information from them about this matter. I no longer trust this outfit. Total scam and disgrace!! How about a FULL REFUND and a bit of compensation for the use of my money over the last 10 weeks?05.05.2023. Nine weeks later and still no order delivered and no refund. Just promises and promises but nothing. Now out of pocket to the tune of nearly £55.00. Thank you Amazon. Scammed by Amazon!!",91.0,198,0.9987483629628472,0.0012516370371528085,32.28355773520032,Low Trust
Shelly Lembke,US,5.0,Amazon customer service is amazing!  There is not any other company that can come close to compare to.   I order weekly from amazon with my prime membership and a few times I have had delivery issues (which is out of their control once it leaves there distribution center). Not only did customer service respond and react quickly to resolve the issue they went above and beyond what is asked for (only to correct issue) but issued me a full refund which was not needed cause I still received the item 2 days later.   They are so helpful and nice.   I know they ship thousands of products a hr and not responsible for what happens once in fedex or ups hands but still make it right.   I choose to buy everything including household supplies from them some things are a tad bit more expensive but the delivery to my door makes up in price.   I love amazon and recommend them to everyone!!!!!PS.  Also love the jobs it has created in my area for my community from distribution center to drivers!   Amazon has created work for many,1.0,185,0.9987383310786083,0.0012616689213916787,152.1382376805059,High Trust
Zahra Smit,NL,1.0,"I placed an order for a dress. Upon receiving it,  I discovered I received a completely different item than what I ordered. I then spoke to an associate who said it could not be exchanged but I could place a new order with express shipping. Then the price difference of express shipping and sale (the item was on sale when I bought it) would also be refunded. Logical since this was not my fault nor responsibility. I made a copy of the chat where they promised this. After multiple weeks and I think 7 times contacting them about this whole order, I still haven’t received the price difference back!! Multiple things went wrong with the order and I contacted them three times about not receiving the price difference back. Two of the three times the associate again promised the refund was being processed and I should receive it within 3-5 days. Now today another associate (Asad) said they can only offer store credit!!!! So first of all: three associates promised a refund in money of the price difference. Where the first even emphasized to use express shipping since the whole thing was not my fault. 2. The mistake of receiving a completely different item should not affect the customer anymore than it already has 3. The amazon associates are completely incompetent since they cannot even read the chats properly and you have to explain the situation again and again4. I expect my money back and not some store credit which I dont use, especially not now. It’s common sense that when a store (independent sellers or not) makes a mistake, they fix it and the customer should not have to suffer or pay extra for it. Moreover, the response of the last associate was absolutely ridiculous.Be warned if you order at Amazon!",2.0,302,0.9987297258765933,0.001270274123406745,33.45106278076372,Low Trust
Scott,US,5.0,I love Amazon!!! GREAT customer service!!!,6.0,6,0.9987202177187067,0.001279782281293329,150.1312914135599,High Trust
Susan Sutch,GB,1.0,"Ordered a fresh delivery - driver said couldn't find address! Had many deliveries previously no problems!THEN waiting on delivery of dog treats, get notification that they been delivered and handed to resident when THEY WERE NOT! Have door camera no one from Amazon entered my building!SUCH LIARS OR JUST CANNOT BE BOTHERED!!",29.0,52,0.9987020335922834,0.001297966407716622,30.64818491601118,Low Trust
Lia,GB,1.0,"I WILL NEVER ORDER FROM AMAZON AGAIN. They are thieves, I have never had an issue in the past, but now I’m disgusted. I ordered a item which needed an OTP as it was a expensive purchase. OTP sounds like a good idea (ITS NOT) delivery driver came asked for OTP which was given gave parcel & left guess what no expensive item I was waiting for!! So word of warning if you have a OTP open the parcel on the door in front of driver or they’ll call you a liar. Lesson learnt.Update, received refund, I fought for it I gathered all the proof myself and submitted it. Also when I wrote this it was the next day from the ‘incident’ so obviously I was not a happy bunny, Amazon definitely has its issues but this was a confirmed delivery driver issue (he works for Amazon as driver). He obviously knew with the OTP requirement it was a expensive item, so he delivered 1 parcel asked for the OTP, then kept the box that the OTP was for! Crafty, thief!! If I’ve learned anything from this experience it’s document everything, track item like a hawk and have a camera at your door, it will make getting a refund easier. Also when I spoke to customer service about knowing what was in the box before giving the code, they told me obviously you won’t know but it’s your responsibility to open quick at door to know!!",2.0,246,0.9986818414767712,0.0013181585232288073,32.82530220546598,Low Trust
