Erin Miller,US,1.0,"HORRIBLE service! Never got two of the items I had ordered on 4/5 that was supposed to be here by the next day 4/6. By 4/12 I had contacted them TWICE asking what's going on after I had gotten a notice that the delivery had been CANCELED as I did NOT cancel the order. The 1st time I contacted them and asked them why the order had been canceled they claimed the order was NOT canceled and that I should get it soon (LMAO YEAH RIGHT). even though my tracking link said otherwise that my order was being sent back to amazon as they had canceled it. 5 DAYS LATER STILL NO DELIVERY. Such a waste of time and they are such CROOKS! Just want your money and think you will forget about it! TOTAL SCAM! I don't see how Amazon is allowed to stay in business with such SHADY business practices. They finally gave me a refund after telling me the order WAS CANCELED like I had told them it was originally, so I could reorder, and they had also told me they would refund me a month's payment of PRIME for my trouble and all the TIME I wasted since the product did NOT come in a timely manner as it did not even come at ALL! Now I am STILL waiting for my refund for THAT. I'm sure I will have to contact them AGAIN about that to get my refund for my membership. Will be canceling membership ASAP as they have gone downhill and cannot support such a crappy business who does NOT EVEN HONOR THEIR OWN PROMISES AND DO WHAT THEY SAY THEY WILL. JUST GROSS!  Customers should NOT have to keep at a company over and over again to ensure that the company does WHAT THEY SAY THEY WILL. DO NOT ORDER FROM AMAZON. IT IS NOT WORTH THE HEADACHE. Would give ZERO stars if I could!! :/",1.0,324,0.9984645673000958,0.0015354326999041934,33.71109580773778,Low Trust
Brenda Pinkney,US,1.0,"I ordered pleasures perfume on memorial day, on June 1 got a email saying they canceled my order. That was dirty, yall waited until memorial day sales where over  when you said you sent me this email.Why didn't they send me a email before, the 1st. I could of gotten a deal on ebay. Disappointed amazon,WHY!!!!!!!",1.0,56,0.9984611311135356,0.001538868886464373,30.705098239612056,Low Trust
