-,US,2.0,Very disappointed with them. I've always loved Amazon. I buy from them all the time. But I don't know how much more I want to use it after this. I ordered a package then after it not coming for a week past the delivery date I was told the package was lost. I asked for a refund and went to purchase the items again but found that the price of the item had been raised. I expected that they could just send me the same items for the same price but that was not the case. I just don't understand how I have to now pay more for the same items that THEY LOST in the first place!!!!!!! It makes absolutely no sense to me. I understand that they can't control the price but like.... how do you lose 3 packages.,1.0,141,0.9983251746464175,0.001674825353582543,61.6653453058171,Medium Trust
ZIGGY,CA,1.0,"Don’t get me wrong, I loved Amazon never had an issue until now. Their customer service department are not knowledgeable at all and are extremely clueless. I am a Prime member and had to wait a week for nothing to get resolved. They lie to you and tell you that they will help you and get you the refund you deserve just for them to not do that. Even the supervisors lie. They stole my money and my order never got delivered and this has happened multiple times because there incompetent drivers cant find my address and apparently don't know how to use GPS. I will take this further and they will not like it at all. Amazon is JUNK....I will never spend another cent with this s*** company EVER...!!!!!!!",6.0,130,0.9983251162429657,0.0016748837570342845,31.54196067691509,Low Trust
Lili Doly,CA,1.0,"I was ordering sunglasses from Amazon but unfortunately it didn’t fit my face. I decided to return the item back with all original package and label to Canada Post. I was wait thing to get my money back in 14 days after they receive an item. 14 days past and I still didn’t get money back. No item no money 😂 funny joke. I start to chat with customers service and they told me wait another 30 days for return. Is it kind a joke nowadays? Why should I have to wait 44 days to get my money back if in your policy it’s 14 days after receiving the item. It was horrible experience for the first time in my life! I was so mad and disappointed with customer service and support. I have no many and I don’t know if I will have them back. I will wait 30 more days and write additional reviews how they gonna solve this problem. It’s ridiculous way how you treat customers this way!!! Shame on you Amazon. From personal experience I recommend everyone go to the store and buy directly!!! Instead of arguing with customers service that DON’T Care at All about you or your situation. All they care to get money from you , but not responsibility.",1.0,216,0.9983248752018357,0.0016751247981643402,32.506639021736596,Low Trust
Sherry Byers,US,1.0,"I bought a fire stick.  I tried to log in to prime video for the first time last night.  I was given a code and asked to enter it.  I got a message asking to call a number because it was my first attempt to log in?  I called the number.  I was sent an OTP and asked for the OTP.  I then was I feel ""harassed"" to pay UP FRONT for a 1 year ($129) 3 year ($219, I think) or 5 year ($299) plan to ""SAVE"" money?  If I did not, then I would have to pay a one time $69 dollar fee to access the prime video????  I have been ""CHATTING"" with amazon for an hour.  I repeatedly asked about the ""deals"" and ""pricing"" and got switched around to three different people.  At the end I told him that I had all the answers to my questions ""EXCEPT' the guy trying to sell me the plans.  I was trying to see if I had been hacked.  He tried to blame it on xfinity????  I was speaking to amazon when it happened? I gave them the code and the OTP?  I don't know how it happened but I was HACKED through either my fire stick or the number that came throught the internet that I was to call?  AMAZON, PLEASE INVESTIGATE THIS!!!!  BUYERS BEWARE!!!Sincerely,Sherry ByersBuena Vista, VA.",3.0,229,0.9983029045169981,0.001697095483001898,32.65355920488481,Low Trust
