Kerry Isaacs,GB,1.0,"Absolutely shocking, pay for prime every month which has recently increased yet again, I ordered an item for my son which was supposed to come next day (yesterday) didn't come, when he waited eagerly all day, just to be told it wasn't coming!!! Now just says it is expected today with no tracking or any other information, this is not good enough!!my son is eagerly waiting again as he can't wait for this item, he's probably just going to be let down again by amazon and I feel very let let down by them, will be cancelling my prime. They seem to have no regards to how they're treating their loyal customers at the moment as my husband has been treated shockingly too against his account regarding returns, when he's done everything by the book!! Also they make it extremely difficult to complain or sort the issue out,  it's all automated and set up just how they want it to go not what's easiest for the customer, which is why I'm writing this review",9.0,174,0.9978898263131075,0.0021101736868924803,32.057275369706375,Low Trust
Harry Fisher,US,1.0,"Unless you are a prime member shipping is a JOKE. They made Prime membership so expensive I can no longer justify the cost. So I bought my 1st items without prime and the shipping was a joke. I track my shipment it shipped from Ill. Which it does most of the time when I had Prime. Instead of shipping to indiana it went to California then found it way back to Indiana. What a Joke ""Im done with Amazon unless I can order from 3rd party shippers in which I get the items in less than half the time. AMERIZON UOU ARE A JOKE. PERIOD!!!!!!",1.0,105,0.9978757273841298,0.0021242726158702263,31.28400387196008,Low Trust
Kenneth Hammond,US,5.0,"I was shocked the first time I looked back through my order history to find an item I wanted to re-order. I cannot believe how many things I have purchased from Amazon in the past 5 years!!! It was an enlightening experience to go through soooo many pages, Amazon has become my automatic go-to site to purchase just about anything. I don't buy everything from them, but I darn sure look there first before I check any other websites. I am a disabled veteran and live in a home for disabled vets, and haven't left here in 4 years to shop as the busses cause me too much pain, so most of my purchases are online. Also we have around 650 members here and many have me find and buy items for them online as well. What else can I say but....Thank the Lord for Amazon.com!!!!",2.0,146,0.997840487662951,0.00215951233704903,151.74566490456976,High Trust
Tracy Byrd,US,1.0,"I no longer trust Amazon. I have used them for years but really started depending on them when Covid started. A few problems here and there but was always treated fairly and things were made right. NOT THIS TIME! Be very cautious when returning an item. Amazon is not at all helpful if you return an item and it isn't scanned properly by UPS or Fedex. I returned 4 packages all to Amazon using their label. I handed them right to the UPS driver. That night 3 packages had been scanned and I was refunded. The 4th package did not show being scanned. It was A BIG box too! UPS said call Amazon, they had a contract and Amazon had to take care. Amazon told me to wait 14 business days then they would help refund me if package didn't show up. Today I received an email stating that Amazon would not be refunding me since its been too long and they have no proof that I sent the package! Was on hold for almost 2 hours, going from supervisor to supervisor..in the end I am left holding  the bag. They won't file a missing package report, UPS won't take responsibility for the item not scanned and lost. Amazon has insurance! WHY won't they file a missing package! I am out $$ and NOT happy about it. Filed a report with the BBB. Cancelled my membership and account with Amazon. A simple enough situation to fix but they won't even try. RIP OFF!!",4.0,253,0.9978124715299541,0.0021875284700458852,32.947290052217944,Low Trust
Billie Rose,US,1.0,"I was told today that my Amazon account had been hacked/Red Flagged because of attempted purchases out of Texas and New Mexico. I live in Arizona. I was told,  To prove that I do live in Arizona,  Never mind the fact that Amazon just shipped me 2 items this week to my home in ARIZONA, and ALL my personal info indicates I DO Live in AZ.,  I was told I needed to go buy a $100 eBay card or Walmart card. I said I don't have the money to do that and why would I have to buy something like that for $100?! the Amazon manager called me a liar.. He said that I live in the United States and I don't have a $100, yes, I was a liar!  I was in absolute shock!! Amazon is horrible!!",1.0,138,0.997810599313312,0.0021894006866880478,31.657422922724756,Low Trust
Melanie,US,1.0,"I CANT GET THROUGH TO ANYONE OF LEGITIMACY AND HONESTY AND PROFESSIONALISM ITS ONLY THE SAME PEOPLE EVERY TIME FOR OVER  2 WEEKS NOW! My calls are being intercepted by THE SAME GROUP of Amazon employees and supervisors and I have proof. It’s been over 6 weeks of the worst customer service experience of my existence causing a great amount of emotional and mental distress not knowing why these people won’t let me through to anyone who can and will help me? I waited for several weeks on an investigation that was never ongoing like stated numerous times, I was lied to countless times and made to wait and wait on false pretenses never once did anything they stated come with any truth or reality. I finally got through to a very nice woman who filed the investigation on February 16th 2021 at 10:44 PM for the first time to my surprise as I was waiting and waiting for weeks then finding out it was all lies that was a huge blow... but the rep said my investigation was in the top five and I would hear back in 24-48 the latest but likely sooner considering the severity of what I’ve been enduring with some customer service agents and supervisors and I haven’t heard anything since about that investigation... I thought it was going to be over and I am finally going to get real help and be treated Like a human at the very least... I have never been through anything like this in my life I can’t come close to being able to even begin to describe how I feel I just can’t it’s not something I’m able to do right now I have tried believe me. I have emailed nearly every email address I’ve gotten from you guys asking for help begging for someone of legitimacy and honesty and loyalty for amazon and their customers to hopefully to read my messages and help me but I’ve gotten nothing back from anyone, I don’t understand. it’s not okay for anyone to go through any of this I can’t wrap my head around it. This is coming from members of amazon customer service and some supervisors. It’s extremely heart wrenching to say the very least I pray this is resolved soon please help me!! I can’t receive calls from any amazon number I can only call in and be intercepted every single time no matter what I do it’s taking such a toll on my mind body and soul along with my everyday life. They know as I’ve told them numerous times that I am a legally disabled adult and to please stop doing this to me and begging them to stop and to tell me why and they won’t. Being disabled does not make one dumb by any means. it’s incredibly discouraging and i hope no one else ever has to go through any of this I don’t wish anyone to feel the way i do. Amazon was once my Favorite company and my extended family lived and breathed amazon until this. It’s hard for people to believe at first.. I am heartbroken I can’t understand how anyone could be so intentionally cruel! These people taunt me, block my number all the time from receiving calls and ask me to enter my number so they can get me help knowing they blocked my number from receiving and requesting calls and then laugh about it! They are legit evil! The same group of people has been on chat the whole time to with a few new people but one of the same and they stick around and don’t let me talk to anyone other than them and I have witnesses to everything and proof to back it all. This is a true nightmare, I’ve had many panic attacks they are terrible on me I hyperventilate severely, barely catching my breathe, I can’t sleep well, I am stressed to my max, emotionally and mentally exhausted this is terrible please someone see this that can help me I have no voice with amazon I cant get past these customer service agents and supervisors no matter what Amazon # I call. My human rights are being violated why is this happening!! I need help. March 26th update: My iPhones been hacked/compromised, they locked me out of my account and required verification to regain access and one of the requirements was my Social security number. I didn’t enter it but I almost did, being denied equal access and services, and information withheld, I haven’t received any truth at all and I can prove everything I just want it over and peacefully but they refuse to let me get help. They are customer service agents they can’t help in the area in need help in and they tell me all the time but refuse to let me get the real help and when I ask I’m switched over to nothing or someone not speaking til I hang up or a false title or the person sitting beside them. They legit just change their names and say the same lines “this is my first day at Amazon” or “I’ve never spoke with you before” even if I don’t say anything about that. It really takes a toll on a person after a while and I’m to my limit I can’t comprehend how anyone can be so cruel.",1.0,902,0.997807727490904,0.002192272509096038,40.227392649571456,Low Trust
Peter Moylan,US,2.0,Your service has dramatically went down! I don't even know why I have Amazon Prime anymore... so much for 2 days shipping... if something doesn't change within a month I will be canceling my membership!!! Y'all need to get your act together and fix this crap! Shipping is taking way too long!,2.0,52,0.9978006047341916,0.002199395265808368,60.69325635891577,Medium Trust
BH,US,1.0,"Amazon customer service and delivery have gotten horrible! I ordered over $500 dollars of merchandise for Christmas, and every single package has been delivered to the wrong address!!! Luckily there people have been honest and either contacted Amazon or me directly. Then one one the packages I received was missing an item. I called customer service and instead of refunding me my money, the sent me a return label. What part of ""I didn't get it"" do they not understand!! Could hardly understand the rep from the Philippines, so maybe the didn't understand me? I've been an Amazon member for over 10 years. The service has just gone down the tube. I won't be renewing, nor shopping with them anymore. Sad, very sad!",2.0,123,0.9977892518234497,0.0022107481765503145,31.490234548479783,Low Trust
Kelly,GB,5.0,Finally my delivery note is being read and parcels are not being left on my doorstep to go missing.    Keep up the good work ,264.0,24,0.997788180687644,0.0022118193123560337,150.37980016359873,High Trust
Kimber M,US,1.0,"We have been a long time Amazon (Prime) customers. Never having any issues with promised dates or delivery. Since Amazon has gone to their own delivery system and no longer using USPS we have had nothing but issue after issue. The drivers don’t follow instructions where to leave the packages or to even simply ring a doorbell to notify the home something or someone is at the door so we can retrieve the package before a porch pirate comes.Now most importantly This is the 2nd time this month that we have placed a prime order and it will state that it has arrived at a facility 1 1/2 hrs away from us,  then off to the other facility 45-50 minutes from our home but delayed, yet it’s NEVER DELIVERED!We have been calling since Monday the day it was due to be delivered and was told no worries it will be delivered by 8 p.m. Tuesday... Nothing delivered.. called Tuesday was told again  you’ll receive it tomorrow it keeps being scanned so it’s just delayed. Called again yesterday and had nothing but a run around rep after rep. Even called the corporate office and it has gone nowhere. After pushing the issue they should be able to contact their own facility and speak to a supervisor to try to have package located and see why it’s not getting loaded on the truck to be delivered, The logistics rep stated that we would have a call last evening within 2 hrs from the facility that the package is in. To no surprise we never received a call back from that facility. Now as anyone would understand we know it’s not the reps fault on the other end of the phone that the package is sitting lost in one of Amazons own facilities, but when it’s been 4 days of no answer and no package with our items it is frustrating to know they cannot call or email that facility to get an answer to get back to the customer. Even more frustrating that they claim they can’t reach someone in that facility to physically go look for a missing package. Their answer is we’ll refund you and you can reorder your items. That’s fine on one of our items but what about the others that are already sold out that we already waited over a month in a half to be restocked on the site? I ever In a million years would have given Amazon a 1 star rating but at this point I feel a 1 is being beyond generous!! If we wanted a refund instead of the item... then why would we order the item in the first place? All we ask is the items you packaged all together gets found and delivered ..... yet, Amazon can’t do that simple task that all other postal carriers are able too. Just we’re sorry.. do you want that refund??? Amazon has gone down hill quickly. Beware when ordering it’s a crapshoot if you’ll receive your item by the expected date if ever at all!!!!",2.0,512,0.9977858563643576,0.0022141436356424293,35.85383673870865,Low Trust
Shaikh Basit,GB,1.0,Please helpp !!!!Rude customer service hanged up on me accused me of lying.I placed a order for apple airpods pro and accepted the delivery with the one-time password.I opend the box and there was a apple box inside not sealed inside there was no actual headphones or case inside just a charger.I contacted the customer service seconds after opening the box and got told that this cant be true of one of the member of the specalist team he was being sacastic laughed at me interrupted me saying stuff like why you repeating yourself over and over again i work at amazon i dont know where you work but things work different here and hanged up on me. (Listen to the call recording)I called back the customer service demanding to speak to a manager and got transfered again to the specalist team who told me to file a police complaint.What should i explain the police i received everything but no headphones????? I got promised a call back which i never got !!! I spend £200 and i am left with nothing i am frustrated and worried at the same time.Please helppp nobody is helping please get back to me to resolve this.,4.0,202,0.9977699416752931,0.0022300583247069072,32.37734699924151,Low Trust
Denise Evans,US,1.0,"I had been a loyal customer,  constantly raving about their website.  You see I work for a tax software company.  I was pleasantly surprised at the ease of using the website. I bragged about how amazing their technology is.  And then this week happened. I was more than happy to use $300 in gift cards.  Little did I know the order was duplicated and they started taking money from my checking account.  No problem,  I'll just cancel the items. Bullsh@t... Amazons website isn't as great and wondrous as I had proclaimed.  I attempted to chat with someone,  but you can't because it's all A.I. No live person.  As I started canceling items, instead of Amazon putting my cash back in my account,  they decided to credit the gift card.  Amazon has taught me a valuable lesson this year.  Stop shopping online and get out there in the real world!! These so called conveniences come at a price.  I would have recommended Amazon to anyone prior to this.  I will never order from them again!! Waste of time and money!!!",4.0,179,0.9977598744112879,0.0022401255887121163,32.11985821437672,Low Trust
