Amrii Grewal,GB,1.0,I would put 0 stars if I could ... had the worst experience ... a friend had two items ordered via amazon to be delivered at the hospital I am admitted at ... first item came perfectly ... second item 202-8293303-5476357 order number there for them to see the delivery driver write attempted to deliver at 2.22 which is a lie ... no one attempted delivery ... the first time a complaint was made it was reassured the driver will call when reattempting he didn’t instead updated status attempted delivery at 4:47 . Made another complaint they said they’ll put credit on the account and prioritise to be delivered following morning at 9am. It’s now 11am no item chased them up said they have no notes and the item is not out for delivery !!!! Absolutely terrible service .... I have been a amazon account holder for years ... they clearly have bad staff !!! No one cares enough no more .... why do we pay prime subscriptions for a S h I t  service,5.0,175,0.9971811828220191,0.002818817177980937,32.10392459417667,Low Trust
