Andres Sampedro,GB,1.0,"Funny that I company claim they customers are the centre of their business, has just a poor customer services!Customer services impossible to contact, then advise you wrongly, and then or contact the seller, that was not Amazon, Don't take responsibilities for their actions.Dear Jeff Bezos, with all these millions you making invest in some Customer Services!!!!!",3.0,56,0.9969028545147828,0.003097145485217223,30.7830120695497,Low Trust
Kristin Bucek,US,1.0,"I’ve had many interactions with the Amazon drivers not delivering my purchases to the designated area. I have a box before you go past my gate that clearly states all packages go here. Also I have a no trespassing sign next to it. I have a very territorial dog and he will bite when a stranger comes up to the house. I’ve told many drivers to put items in the box, but they don’t seem to listen. I also warn them that my dog will bite. I had a recent altercation with a female driver. She pulled up to my house and my dog was outside. I asked her what she doesn’t understand about putting the boxes in the box.  She mocked me like I was crying and moved her hands as if saying blah blah blah. I took the box and asked her what does with the packages when she comes to the house. She states she throws them out the window. I again warned her about the dog. She put her hand in my face and of course my reaction was to put her hand down. She then slapped me and said she’s going to run over my dog! She still works there. I was assured that Amazon would not tolerate this behavior but I guess they do! They deserve no stars for customer service. Then Amazon put a hold on my account and to promise them I was not going to be verbally or physically abusive to their drivers. Ummm…. She hit me on my property. They definitely need a new HR director. Where’s Jeff Bezos?? Oh yeah he’s in space! These employees need more education in customer service and also anger management classes. I did press charges against her. I asked the lady from the “executive complaint department” why the drivers  don’t read the directions of where I want my packages on the delivery caption when I order something. She stated the drivers don’t see that caption until after the delivery!! Unreal!!",1.0,336,0.9968780145135093,0.003121985486490675,33.92502804605757,Low Trust
Ms Helen BROWN,GB,1.0,"Ordered 2 galvanised steel bins from marketplace seller on Amazon. Amazon choice item. Returns policy appeared to be easy.They arrived in a flimsy box, crushed. Not galvanised steel, plated tin.Requested return & refund. Approved.Label provided but I had to pay for their return!!Tracked return with photo evidence of delivery. No refund. No response from seller. A-Z guarantee initialled. APPALLING. An AI bot has requested the same tracking info multiple times. No refund. They keep closing the claim saying I have withdrawn the claim. I keep reopening. Not able to speak to a human in Customer Service.What Customer Service!!!!",16.0,98,0.996856232446362,0.0031437675536379883,31.256459269437364,Low Trust
