Wanyoung E. Kim,US,1.0,"I have been a loyal Amazon customer for 12 years. My father sent me a $250 Amazon gift card for Christmas that I tried to use to place an order and my account has been placed on hold for 2 weeks with no response from Account specialist team. My father is going to dispute his $250 since I cannot use it. Every time I call Amazon an outsourced Indian worker answers the phone and tries to put in a request to various departments like Leadership, Gift cards, and Account specialists but nothing is being done!!!!!! Jeff Bezos can suck it.",16.0,100,0.9959346371514399,0.004065362848560072,31.324973134015217,Low Trust
