Mindy Leazott,US,1.0,If I could give no stars I would! I have been an Amazon prime member for 18 years! I have had nothing but trouble with them! The icing on the cake was they delivered damaged lights to me I am a terminally ill Widow and I can't get out of my house and they refuse to pick them up and then they lied to me and told me UPS was on the way I sat on the phone for 2 hours and UPS has no knowledge of a pickup! They just keep taking the $13 a month for the membership and deliver stuff when they want and don't deliver stuff when they don't want and deliver damage stuff and don't want to make good on it! This is absolutely so unprofessional but Jeff bezo keeps making that money doesn't he!,14.0,140,0.9958533477499555,0.0041466522500445135,31.777719600724325,Low Trust
Bryan Coventry,GB,1.0,"Trying to walk 4 miniature dogs down our drive , the Amazon driver was very close behind and pressing me to move faster.One dog panicked and froze. I told the driver he was an idiot not giving me time. I am 73. He asked was I from the address he was delivering to, then said Im not delivering. After explaining this to customer service, they said they require me to sign a form to say their drivers will be safe !!!!! So its never Amazons fault then ?",45.0,88,0.9958232575771541,0.004176742422845936,31.195937513739043,Low Trust
Joanme,GB,1.0,"ABSOLUTELY FURIOUS!!!😡😡 my item got shoved through the front door, I opened the package only to find no item in the box. Tried to call Amazon to complain which of course is impossible as the driver hasn’t sent a confirmation email of delivery so they won’t even talk to me!! Just keep getting a robot to talk to! This is happening more and more, boxes being delivered with NO items or missing items in them.",3.0,75,0.9958146730457579,0.004185326954242119,31.050545091402515,Low Trust
Lada Poláčková,CZ,1.0,"I have had issue twice with two orders in last two weeks. The second issue I am still having is not resolved in the right way. Today I called the customer service at 8:00 and I was busy untill 9:24 to get answer.I called 4 or 5 times to be able to get to customer care in English. The dutch team was not able to help me, they were lying to me, I heard always different stories from all three employees. One told me that she has to verify me before she can put me through English department (she was not able for 10 minutes to pick up my email address after several times being spelled to her - even in dutch and she told me because she cannot pick up my email, she cannot help me). After she finally got my email sheput me through, the line told me that they are too busy and they have to hang up my phone which they did themselves.Second employee she did not suddenly need to verify me before she put me through the English department and she transffered me right away without verification. I was waiting 15 minutes on the line to be picked up by the english team - no success.Thrid call and third employee of the dutch team was telling me that she cannot verify me on the phone and I have to click on link in email to be verified while on the phone - how strange that the first employee could verify me on the phone, the second did not verify me at all and the third needed me to click on link in my email (while calling the data is not working so I had no internet connection to click on the link - I explained her about the process with two other employees but she did not care). She put me through english department again and I had to wait 13 minutes with no success being transffered. I called for the 4th time and after again waiting around 10 minutes I got connected with en english department - finally!!! I got finally normal employee but the resolution was not satisfying at all. I wanted replacement but they could not do that, only refund. I did not agree with this but I had no choice. Then I wanted to raise a complaint and have compensation for this awful customer experience being busy on the phone one and half hour, having employees coming with always different procedures how to verify me. It is disgusting! Teribble service! Of course they told me there is no compensation possible, unbelievable!",4.0,440,0.9958071710491304,0.004192828950869587,35.14514341052721,Low Trust
Monika Hoppe,GB,1.0,Amazon Customers service .. huge disappointment!!!! Bought few items try to use my gift card.. but instead  been charge on debit card!! Call same day to cancel the order or change the payment method.   Been promised  of refund  and accept  gift card .. but never happens.. call customer  services  week after again promised  refund . After 3 weeks been told they cant refund and use my gift card....DONT BUY AMAZON GIFT CARD..,1.0,72,0.9958017534306917,0.004198246569308339,31.01753992240821,Low Trust
Sami Akhtar,GB,1.0,"My sons Fire Tablet 10 HD which was still under warranty was not working.  I telephoned Amazon on the 6th December and was told they had no replacements in stock and I was advised to order a new tablet and once it was delivered to ring up for a refund.  I was not happy about having to purchase a new tablet at £199.99 but the representative assured me he had put all the notes on the system and that he would email before I purchased the new tablet so I had confirmation in writing that this is what he advised me to do.  Reluctantly I ordered a new tablet which arrived today.  I telephoned Amazon as advised and the customer service advisor basically told me that there was no way they would refund me for the tablet.  When I tried to explain that I was told to this by Amazon and I had proof, the advisor kept talking over me and cutting me off.  I asked to be put through a manager and at first after a short hold he advised me that none of the managers want to speak to me.  When I insisted I wanted to speak to someone higher up, a supervisor came on the phone who was extremely rude and said we didn’t send any email advising me to order a new tablet which Amazon would refund.  When I told her the date and time of the email and the person who sent it - she said she can’t help me and put the phone down.  Extremely bad customer service and I can’t believe such a big company will not honour what they said they would.  I WILL NOT BE ORDERING FROM AMAZON AGAIN!!!  CRAP COMPANY!!!",5.0,290,0.9957926662444747,0.004207333755525289,33.46331116337918,Low Trust
Mark Shortt,US,1.0,"If I could give them a zero I would. I had an old debit card get hot carded 1 year ago. I updated my primary payment method for Amazon with my new card I got from my bank. The new card worked for a month or two and then I noticed a part that I had ordered did not arrive when I expected. I went into Amazon and checked and it said order cancelled. Did I get an email, text notification or phone call.....NO! So after some digging and contacting their customer service they stated it was using my old card, I told them to remove it and ensure that my new card was set as default card. So another couple months go by and now another package is not shipping when I expect and so I login and check Amazon again and it states payment needs revision....It was trying to use my old card yet again! I called this time as I was upset and needed the order before I left out of town. I call to see if they can fix what is going on and also get my order shipped ASAP. The original order (Tuesday Morning) stated with my prime membership that they would have it to me Wednesday evening. However, since they messed up my payment method yet again, now when fixing the order after losing the whole day it states my order will not arrive until Friday evening, when I will be out of town! So their mistake and it cost me delivery time and do they offer to fix it. No!! They instead tell me all the reasons why I could have messed up the payment, which is absolute lie! They tell me after about 45 seconds that they cannot do anything about the shkpping to get it to me sooner. I cancelled membership and then they tell me I would not get a refund because I used up shipping credits, IT IS PRIME! When asking for when I used these credits they could not provide me any information....this was management.. They are going downhill and customer service is horrible.",1.0,356,0.9957139627334062,0.004286037266593823,34.20757163338017,Low Trust
julia,US,5.0,the best! great prices! fast shipping!!,2.0,6,0.9955435842889593,0.004456415711040718,150.29012308504727,High Trust
paul thomas,GB,1.0,"Your drivers are f@&ckinguseless and are as thick as sh!t yesterday my item was left outside and I was messaged that it was delivered via my letter box , anyone could have walked off with it and today 30/8/24 , the dumb idiot left my package next door once again outside! . Can’t your drivers read ?! I’m number 18 , not 20 !I am really pissed off with the level of incompetence and unprofessional practices  that I have witnessed , plus your feedback facility does not give the customer an opportunity to make specific comments/ complaints! Very disappointed ! ",5.0,100,0.9955138171482077,0.004486182851792253,31.346014134176826,Low Trust
Alli Bay,US,1.0,"Amazon's quality is horrific now!  Foreign sellers peddle trash (like, literally); shipping speed is much slower than before; and reviews are fake - bought and paid for lies.  So, you really can't trust anything!  I knew that going into my purchase, but I took a chance because the deal was good.  I guess that I should have known.  The item arrived late, damaged, and not as expected, as it was pictured and described as a set of three and what arrived was just one.  The seller will only provide a partial refund - blaming his false advertising on ""poor English"" - and Amazon won't do anything!  They keep saying that I've already gotten a full refund, so there's nothing else that they can do.  The thing is - I haven't gotten a refund at all.  You should be able to trust a giant like Amazon.  There's no way that I'd ever buy online from some random Chinese pop-up shop that I hadn't heard of - but getting Amazon's backing makes you feel protected.  Wrong!!!  Amazon allows its sellers to dupe you.  So now, I'm out of money and patience - the latter exacerbated by poorly trained, difficult-to-understand reps who put you on hold just to tell you ""I don't know""  Guess my Christmas shopping will be done elsewhere this year!",1.0,220,0.9955138168141848,0.0044861831858151735,32.69206014078262,Low Trust
Anya Sheran,GB,1.0,"Very bad costumer service ! I called 12 h after ordering rug I was reading had v bad reviews. Only AFTER 22 h of order they sent email that  rug was dispatched, costumer manager was cold and REFUSED!!!! To cancel this order ,she promised to call back NEVER did I feel harassed and forced to buy bad item .They have v bad couriers they leave items outside block and block have 70 flats ! They think once  they deliver item so costumer will keep it .  Amazon gone very bad towards long years costumers   Once this is sorted I will close my account with Amazon is not worse it all my stress .",13.0,113,0.9954321449154687,0.00456785508453128,31.49591939472011,Low Trust
