MD,GB,1.0,"I love Amazon the quick deliveries, items I’ve been pleased with but I have been let down so many times!   Deliveries are on way and they’re with the driver, then they don’t arrive?! then you get a message saying it will be delivered tomorrow, you wait and waste another day and it doesn’t arrive!  Another day wasted.   Why don’t they just tell you the driver has lost the parcel so therefore, will arrange a refund so you can re-order instead of wasting  another day waiting for a parcel that is already missing.  This has happened several times.  SUCH A LET DOWN and very upsetting!  Don’t always want a refund just want the item!!",6.0,113,0.9953596064742148,0.004640393525785158,31.499546316782805,Low Trust
Hannah Sutherland,GB,1.0,"Time to put a stop to this grasping and dishonest International beast!!Amazon seem to have started a new scam now. Advertise next day delivery, take your hard earned money, don’t give accurate tracking details and wait to be contacted. When you do contact them as all other reviewers have said, you go round in circles. My Mum has been on her own all Year and Mothers Day gift (advertised as ‘get it tomorrow’ on my Prime account). Never showed up so lonely Mum and no gift. Thanks a lot Amazon!!  Chased every day and contacted the seller. Just got weird random and repetitive responses. Wouldn’t agree to re-send until 5 days later. Also ordered something else and said next day delivery. Never showed but got message saying delivered. Contacted them AGAIN, (so bored of spending my time trying to get them to do their job). Got a message saying they had updated their system too early and item would be 2 more days at least. To cap it all I ordered white paint only to receive bright pink this morning!!!  And they refuse to post true and accurate bad reviews anymore. This is all in the last 10 days. Enough is enough. I’m going to spend with independent small businesses. Not lining corporate thieves’ pockets any more.",2.0,217,0.9953535057206361,0.004646494279363922,32.666424545712445,Low Trust
ANTHONY F,GB,5.0,"Best company in the world no one compares. The smartest business concept around and best customer service ever. When things go not as planned they always recitify even at their loss. I hope they open an Amazon  fresh store near me soon, I’ll be in there everyday. I hope they shut down all the uk supermarkets in the near future, cause they are all arrogantly crap especially Tesco and Asda who I hate with a passion. Carry on Amazon taking over the commerce world, much deserved bravo!!!!!",11.0,87,0.9953448621828287,0.0046551378171713065,151.20864023353946,High Trust
SISYPHUS 48,GB,1.0,Amazon have stopped posting reviews of Ring doorbells because of a large number of reviews they're receiving.  They say it's because it's not a verified purchase which might be reasonable but there is not a single negative review of the above.  They don't accept purchases from Ring but is owned by Amazon!!!What has happened is that Ring have hiked their Cloud users annual fee by 43% this year.  This represents a 100% hike over the last two years.It seems like Amazon/Ring are worried by the kick back from customers.  Also there is no way that a review can be left on Ring's own website!Like many customers I will not be renewing my annual package!,35.0,114,0.9952992829630469,0.004700717036953073,31.513779542257076,Low Trust
Sara  tandy,GB,1.0,"Would give 0, but I cant, 2 items haven't arrived! So frustrated that I'm considering cancelling prime! More angry as delivery person took photo and said ""handed to resident"" lies, lies, lies, lies, LIES! So someone, somewhere is enjoying my wallpaper AND Christmas present from hubby! Hope you enjoy, because I won't be!",21.0,53,0.9952474683720223,0.00475253162797773,30.83213022694011,Low Trust
Amanda Kelly,US,1.0,"I have had an account with Amazon for 5 years now. I updated the payment information for Prime and changed the password on the account.  Now it says ""We have detected unusual activity on your account. Please contact customer service.""  I called customer service on Friday, November 12, and was told that the Account Specialist department would contact me in 24 hours about my account.  No one ever contacted me by phone or email.  I called customer service again on Monday, November 15, again I was told that the Account Specialist department would contact me in 24 hours about my account.  Crickets.  Nothing. No one contacted me by phone or email.  I contacted customer service again on Friday, November 19, and they tried to start with the Account Specialist routine again.  I said no do not even start with that.  I asked the representative to contact Account Specialist department, if they exist, and get immediate assistant.  The representative refused.  I asked to speak with a supervisor.  She said she was the supervisor.  Oh so when did the CEO of Amazon become an Indian woman in a call center?  I guess Jeff Bezos has a new trick up his sleeve!!!  She said she could not help me and hung up the phone.  THE WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE EVER!!!  I filed a complaint with the Better Business Bureau.  Someone out there has to be able to help me with my account.  The moral of this story is:  1) Do not change your payment method for Prime 2) Do not change your password.",3.0,259,0.9952067380406115,0.004793261959388451,33.1448790261803,Low Trust
Melissa De Clercq,US,1.0,"Oh, my Goodness! Outsourced customer service! Hard to understand the rep. They always seem to be half asleep. Ask a specific question, they just repeat themselves over and over. No concern for customer’s issues. Try returning something. You either have to take time out of your busy day, to drop off at a UPS store, OR pay $7.99 for UPS to pick up the package from your home. Bull ….! You should NEVER have to pay ANYTHING to return a defective product! Fight enough like I did today, and last time I had this issue, and the outsourced rep will “comp” you the return fee, which you should never even been asked to pay in the first place! Horrible!",4.0,119,0.9951685371796973,0.004831462820302668,31.57640208100392,Low Trust
Martin Doherty,IE,1.0,I my opinionAmazon seems to have gone downhill! I thought since they moved a considerable amount of business over to the Ireland platform that they could provide next day delivery! But alas everything I have ordered this last while seems to have slowed down with delivery taking up to a week getting a bit like wish or geek!  Used to be a great company with a great versatile service but sluggish they have got! And I don’t like that I’m like! I want service and I want it now!!  No ifs or buts,17.0,93,0.9951516780100443,0.004848321989955662,31.28560174167389,Low Trust
Kamila Beblot,IE,3.0,"I use amazon for years now and never had any issues, I always found customer service very good. However this time everything changed. I ordered a little balance bike for my sons birthday specifically. Was waiting for over a week for it to be dispatched but noticed nothing was happening. I contacted amazon to check up on it the day beforw it was due to arrive and they send me an email that my order was cancelled due to stock availability. When I ordered the bike it was in stock so how can they sell items that are not in stock?!!  Also if there was an issue like that that could of informed me so I could shop elsewhere. If it wasn’t me chasing them I don’t even know if they would of let me know at all!!! I contacted them again and it didn’t feel like they cared at all. I do understand current circumstances but you just can’t put smth out for sale when it’s not in stock?!?! Now I ended up having no gift for my sons birthday. Never was So disappointed tbh. It sucks.",2.0,188,0.9951454164597657,0.00485458354023427,92.35153456119566,High Trust
Gma Girl,US,1.0,"My daughter has a Amazon account and she’s living in Bothell, Washington. I live in Chisholm, Mn. She ordered gifts for my granddaughter from me and I had her use my debit card to purchase them. Amazon charged my account a membership fee! I am unable to use that membership, because I don’t have an account! WOW. I have called several times trying to get a refund and they keep telling me I have an account, but I had canceled my membership last summer because they kept double charging my account. After I canceled, they continued charging the membership fees. I finally had to have my bank block them completely. They have totally gone down the tubes! Also, when I canceled I forgot I had a 20 dollar credit in the account. I called last night to try to have them credit it back to my bank and the customer service said they could credit my card and asked if they should proceed. I wasn’t even allowed time to respond when I got a message they had gone ahead!! The card on file wasn’t accurate anymore. He then passed me off to another rep and that one passed me off to another rep! The final rep was a phone call and I kept getting a fax number sort of sound every couple of words. Now when I think about it, I feel like it may have been some sort of scam call? I really used to love Amazon, now I absolutely despise that place. What a shame.",7.0,257,0.9951282370097086,0.004871762990291351,33.1263699778937,Low Trust
Cynthia Butler,US,1.0,If I could give them zero stars I would!!! I ordered hair for a client that was supposed to be delivered on a Wednesday guaranteed delivery and it was not delivered. I called Amazon and they told me I needed to talk to the carrier to see what my options were. The carrier tells me there is no way to get my package to me on time because the Amazon distribution center didn’t get the package out on time. I explained how important this is because this is my business and I can’t cancel on a client the night before that would make me look horrible! They then tell me I will need to pick up the package myself. This package is over 45 min from my house. I asked Amazon if they can compensate me for having to drive 45 min to get this package and they tell me they will give me $10 off my next order. $10 are you serious that doesn’t even pay for my gas to drive 45 min for a package that was guaranteed delivery. Then he asks me if I want to cancel my account. I asked to speak to someone higher up and he tells me he is the highest up they have wow so he must be the president of Amazon what a joke! I have been a prime member for years and to have an issue and be treated so awful blows my mind!,1.0,244,0.9951281343681969,0.004871865631803085,32.980553461062954,Low Trust
Nikki Loeffelman,US,1.0,"Amazon is the absolute worst! Horrible customer service, horrible deliveries, horrible products and it's ""out of their policy"" to make things right. I ordered an item back in July. It's now Aug 18,2022; never got the item. They cant credit my gift card balance back bc it was from a third party seller. Now telling me to file a claim with the seller with takes over a week for the review. The item is now $60 more than what it was when I ordered it. Now saying they don't prove match either. I'm out of money and a item and they don't care to make it right! HORRIBLE COMPANY!!!!",1.0,109,0.9951202922260218,0.00487970777397817,31.466643829528966,Low Trust
Slawi Slaw,GB,1.0,"Bought 2nd hand phone thru amazon been delivered with dpd and someone ( dpd driver ) stole the phone, once he made picture its been delivered !!!!Refusing to refund me !Lost 190£ thanks to amazon !Best option closing my accountHad to do police report and so on, had to send em everything at the end had email they couldn't verify my report with the local authority. In the email says to contact them a month later 😂😂Be aware",3.0,78,0.9950210506362461,0.004978949363753871,31.123877361625716,Low Trust
Nichola Turner,GB,1.0,"If I could give 0 stars I would! My account was hacked and £140 was taken from my account! Rang amazon for someone to tell me they will sort it and refund the money - no one rang! 3 days later I called back to follow up, again told someone would ring me, never happened! I got an email saying they will look into it and in the meantime to cancel my card. 3 weeks later I emailed back to see where they were up to, to be told, over email, that I was not being refunded by amazon and to call my bank! It would have been so much easier to take this up with the bank 3 weeks ago when the incident happened, but they left it with no contact whatsoever. I am absolutely disgusted in this company and will never use again!",4.0,145,0.9950132126697299,0.004986787330270137,31.87581160431496,Low Trust
