gone surfing,CR,1.0,"I have $600.00 + left on my Amazon account from a gift card and would rather have the money in my bank! I have used Amazon from day one when all Bezos sold was books, Used to be so easy to leave a good review (even had free surf board fins sent to me as a 'good review' thank you from a new Amazon upstart. Bought some total defective auto brake parts, king size sheets (that were queen size) a terrible highly flammable bath robe and other terrible items, attempted to log on to my review account and got this message ""SORRY BUT YOU DO NOT YET MEET OUR MINIMUM REQUIREMENT TO POST REVIEWS"" WHAT!, I was able to post a review on my very first order ever back in the day. As years went by I noticed my POLITE but negative reviews were gone, never to be seen by anyone. I bought cowboy boots and shipped them here to Costa Rica at a very healthy shipping fee, left boot was 1/2 size to small, not worth sending back, was once again NOT QUALIFIED to post a review. I have since put two and two together and can prove that Amazon will block/remove any negative reviews concerning their precious CHINES and MEXICAN stores to protect said stores from any monetary loss due to any negative reviews posted about these types of 'Amazon Stores' and to be sure you don't post any reviews good or bad they simply block you from posting. So, all you have to do is use their ROBO Contact Us Feature to voice your concern, sooner or later you will be contacted by some kid somewhere on planet Earth that will not be able to assist so ""YOU WILL BE CONTACTED BY OUR SUPERVISOR TEAM BY EMAIL"" YEAH.  RIGHT have gone that route TWICE and never heard from any one!! Amazon is total Bull Sheet  now adays, worse than ebay and that is pretty bad! BOYCOT JEFF BEZOS and his unprofessional money grab company, and I hear that Amazon workers are treated like worthless slaves and forced to work 90 MPH on the line or get fired, SOME BOSS YOU ARE BEZOS!",9.0,365,0.9948235308773303,0.005176469122669669,34.35304667542681,Low Trust
Sonia Rashid,GB,1.0,"My delivery was delivered by an amazon delivery driver this morning. He left the parcel unattended, got back in us car and left! Nobody answered the door! The instruction he left on the app 'handed to resodent' was extremely false! I have the ring doorbell and have video evidence of this. I wasn't able to check notification for this untill midday. Of which I saw this recording and another one in which a women is walking away from my door. After checking the doorstep I have seen there is no parcel. Speaking to customer services has been absolutely shocking! The first gentleman attempted to fob me of by saying it was falsely marked as delivered and I have to wait a couple of day. When I explained I had a video showing the delivery his tune changed. He said he has refunded me the moneys for the items. However I needed the items today so this is not helpful to me right now! He then said he has raised a complaint and I should hear back within 48 hours. He had transferred me to the delivery department, and I spoke with Darel. Darel was not helpful. And was extremely rude. Would always speak over me. I explained the situation again. And he said that as the package was delivered amazon fulfilled its service. I highlighted the fact the the package was left unattended. In full view of passersby. Darel then went on to blame me for not leaving delivery instructions. Stating that it is the perogative of amazon delivery driver to leave parcels on the doorstep unattended. I tried to explain to him that common sense dictates that if someone doesn't answer their door. They may not be in. So like every other delivery service and in a few cases prior, amazon themselves, they should leave a calling card and take the parcel with them! Darel said this is not what they do. I am furious by the blatent wantonness by amazon delivery drivers and customer service representatives. Absolutely ridiculous",4.0,340,0.9948169949642831,0.005183005035716892,34.07294722318237,Low Trust
RIchard Garneau,US,1.0,"The girl from Asia took at least three minutes (followed by a back-and-forth of silly questionis) to understand that I was simply having a problem where I said,""Find my phone"" to my Echo  and my Echo sounded like it was ringing my phone but my phone didn't ring.  I have my phone number  entered correctly on my cell phone app, but it still doesn't ring.  Typical. but the gal from China had NO IDEA WHAT SH WAS TALKING ABOUT!!!  Talk ab about a waste of time!!!",6.0,86,0.9947825571448716,0.005217442855128374,31.225538435521422,Low Trust
