Esmeralda Dominguez,US,1.0,This is the worse service:1.First they need people who can speak good English and really listen to you.2. I ordered a product was supposed to get delivered in two days I called the ups to track items and it didn’t exist so I call amazon and I get someone to tell me ooohhh no I’m mam seems to be a problem their will be a delay! They com me $5.00. So I was ok.3.  Next day I call ups to get my tracking info cause according to amazon it’s on its way and they tell me it does not exist!4. We do a three way between me amazon and ups and the Amazon rep was flat out rude! I was a problem to her in her voice as she would sigh every time ups would ask her to manifest the package so they can place on hold do I can pick up item at a store. Again Amazon rep is rude and finally I just gave up! 5. They charged me for the product I will not get and they charged me $14.99 for membership!Poor quality! I’m going back to EBay never had issues but thought I try something new.,2.0,200,0.9944126925963713,0.005587307403628672,32.52277535335586,Low Trust
Melissa Talevi,US,1.0,"Someone hacked my account and ordered a 350.00 floor jack which is being shipped to California, I live in RI and have never shipped anything to California! When I called on Monday they said they don't have the ability to cancel the order but I can refuse it when it's delivered!!! I live in RI, it's fraud how can I refuse an order delivered to California.? Then they just repeat the same thing ...I understand your frustration....I'm sorry you are experiencing this...I then reached out to the seller who told me the same thing .. Tuesday ( today) I get an email that the product has shipped ( it clearly didn't ship yesterday like everyone told me it did, and actually it hasn't still hasn't shipped because I spent hours tracking it and UPS does not have the package, it just means a shipping label was created! I call back Amazon, word for word what I was told yesterday. I told the girl I did not need her empathy, or her understanding all I need is for her to cancel the order, she said she can not do that . I asked to speak to a supervisor, after being on hold for over 12 more minutes I was hung up on!I have cancelled my membership. They do value their customers.",1.0,220,0.9943432591039747,0.005656740896025303,32.75058802629313,Low Trust
steven ferguson,US,1.0,"Am unable to sign in to my account due to a verification process that requires me to enter my password twice and then solve a captcha. After the verification process I was denied sign in because they said my password was incorrect. After repeating this process, i was told the captcha i entered was incorrect. I repeated this entire process as described 3 times. I wanted to contact customer service, but was sent back to log in. This is very frustrating and makes me glad I recently cancelled my ‘Prime’ account. Amazon sucks! The only reason I went back is because they owe me $, which I will apparently have to surrender to them due to the fact that they suck.Also, in case I forgot to mention, Amazon SUCKS!!!!!",2.0,129,0.9943144951111442,0.005685504888855775,31.731274683590293,Low Trust
