Silent.Oath87,US,1.0,"The US Amazon Customer Service is the Worst! Also, they need to change their method of charging cards! They shouldn't keep re-authorizing your card every time a fulfillment center doesn't have your item in stock! I got like 4 charges for the same item onto my debit card! Each time, it was cancelled and it takes over 7-10 days for a refund to process!? That is absolutely ludicrous.In this case, they should only charge my card once everything is ready to be shipped. (That's what they do for Amazon JP.) The customer service in the US doesn't even answer my question correctly via chat, that I have to physically call Customer Service. Even then, they keep telling me stupid things, and I even have to request to speak to someone higher up. I just don't want to have to have my card re-authorized again. If they don't have it in stock, just remove it from the website!",3.0,157,0.993947282282213,0.006052717717787037,32.063712722681274,Low Trust
