anonymousrebel,DK,1.0,"Costumor service is fecking sheet. I still cant log in and u just keep asking me for my ID verfication which i have sent, then u ask for my OLD bank card info which i obviuosly no longer know, so the xmas gifts i wanted and have waited 2 weeks now to buy, i give up! I suppose if i make a new account a with the same adress the algorythm gods will catch it and send me to prison and ill end up in the same place as i am now. i cannot change my card info or even get support because i cant fecking log in untill i give my old card info. I had to google for a mail to write u, ebcause its no where to be seen on ur site. that mail doesnt receive direct inc mail and just gives u links to support help on the site which all require u to be logged in!!! Then i found another mail and tried there, waiting to see. This is bullsheet, utter bullsheet and u ought to be procecuted for how u treat ur custumors. I have to make a new account now i guess and start over and some day someothing will bug out there too and ill end up in the same hell once again.Are u just raving mad in there, u dont give a sheet anymore do u? greedy feckers. DONT shop here and stop supporting the Elite who dont give a sheet about us anymore, this needs to be a thing u can demand form any online selling shop ffs.",83.0,268,0.9938370627809439,0.0061629372190561416,33.31431623840654,Low Trust
Elle Lee,GB,1.0,"There is so much wrong with the way Amazon deals with their customers and my experience with the company in the last 10 months, that it is pretty impossible to sum it up in a review. However given the awful experience and their ongoing failure to resolve the issues I feel others who may not have used this platform often or recently should know exactly what they might face if anything goes wrong. My account suddenly appeared to be frozen with the only option to make digital orders -very clever as I subscribe to Kindle- this issue first happened in May 24 which was frustrating as my daughter did not to receive her birthday present which I ordered in plenty of time. Eventually I was told the possible reasons and was passed on to FOUR different people over the space of three hours. I'll refrain from going through all the incompetence I experienced but I'll sum it up by saying it's now 7.15 and today at 3pm I was assured my order had been processed and would be delivered tomorrow, after speaking to 3 people and a manager I'm none the wiser and once again the items I urgently need won't be here! But of course payment has been taken and nobody has advised me not to place a new order, on the contrary I am told I'm a valued loyal customer and there's no reason for me to cancel an Amazon account that I can't access!!! Oh and apparently Complaints and Escalations team doesn't exist despite the email I've received from them and although I am visually impaired the only way to communicate is by email!!! It's so ridiculous I'd laugh if I had the energy after wasting so much time today Added 20/6/24 I've now read multiple reviews of this company and many people seem to have had the same experience as myself. Interesting Amazon don't even bother responding. ",6.0,321,0.9938278121824491,0.0061721878175509115,33.909282413872496,Low Trust
sue,US,1.0,"Amazon Pays for Fake 5-star reviewsI ordered a pair of hearing aids from Amazon and they are terrible.  Amazon mailed me a flyer “get $70.00 for a 5-star review.  This is almost 50% of the cost of the item.I thought this was a scam by the seller, since this is an immoral tactic. I called Amazon.  Amazon confirmed that it was their ‘promotion’ to encourage people to give reviews.I said, well they are only worth 2 stars, I wouldn’t want to mislead people, but I want the $70.00.She said “you only get paid if you give 5 stars”. I asked “so, Amazon will pay me to lie to people?”  And she replied “Sure, I guess.  I never thought of it that way before.” I did not know that I had a soft spot in my heart for Amazon, but I guess I did, because I feel Hurt in my Heart.  My feelings are Hurt.  Amazon’s rating system is a total lie!Please say it isn’t so! *a single tear*I’ve reported this immoral behavior to the atty general, the federal trade commission, and even the post office (the ftc recommended the last, since the card came regular mail *shrug*.  I guess it is illegal to facilitate crime using the post office for its normal uses.)Has this happened to you?  Have you ever gotten one of these post cards?  This wasn’t my first one.  Other people must be getting these too.Report it!  Stop the abuse of the rating system at Amazon.  If it is rated 5 stars it should earn that rating, not buy that rating.Of course, get the money first!!!  Then report them.   Hehe.",2.0,272,0.9938156170849194,0.006184382915080611,33.36025672287125,Low Trust
Rachel Murphy,US,1.0,"amazon asked for my review & then refused to post it!! Here it is.....Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the following guidelines:Amazon Community GuidelinesS-ZONE Women Genuine Leather Triple Zipper Small Wallet Change Coin Purse Holder 	★★★   from Froggie on February 28, 2020 leather change purse This is a nice change purse, beautiful color. I wasn't the happiest about the shipping because the seller never gave a tracking # or confirmation of shipping, so I had no idea why it was taking so long to just ship out one little purse then all of a sudden came in the mail one day. I hate that because we have had issues with carriers delivering to wrong address! If I can't see I'm supposed to be getting it how will I know if it got shipped somewhere else or if I'm still waiting!I can't imagine why they don't want to post it! It's not my fault the seller didn't give a tracking # like everyone else in the world does!",1.0,195,0.9937730471088149,0.0062269528911851335,32.49867237815432,Low Trust
Randall Cooley,US,1.0,"I Ordered a chair for my office. Over $120. I was told it would take a month to reach me. I waited the month and the TRUELITEAM on amazon asked me to cancle the ORDER!!!! HOW FRUSTRATING!! Then I had to jump through hoops to cancled the order. And then I got fed up trying to leave a poor review on AMAZON so Im happy I finally found this option. I think if AMAZON can quickly take your money then you should also have the option to QUICKLY leave a review hassel free wheather its good or in my case BAD. If there professional enough to take peoples money and credit card info they should be professional enough to mail the order to us customers on time.It simple, if we pay for it, mail it to us. Right?",1.0,138,0.9937725575935971,0.006227442406402939,31.8593250087105,Low Trust
Ed Peters,DK,1.0,"What a bunch of donkeys sitting in customerservice!!!Im new on amazon.have ordered 2 things,just to chek the procedure.it went only half ok.Both got shipped,but 1 got cancelled for some reason..Im danish,but lives in georgia and 9 out of 10 times,when i want to buy a thing,they dont ship to denmark or georgia.A friend here in georgia to me: use usa2georgia,all georgians use that.i made a profile there and went to amazon again.then problems began big time.Second time i tried to order,amazon locked my account and told me to log in and follow the instructions.They didnt said how to log in on a locked account,that was up to me,to find out of.They asked for billing statement,i dont know what that is,so i send them a pic of my bankcard.That was not the right thing,fair enough.I then asked what it was they needed in a mail,never got a answer.I mailed them again,ask them to explain to me,what a billing statement is,never got answer. I asked them again to mail me or call me on phone,never heard from them.Now ive googled what a billing statement is,i took a pic of my bankaccount and try to send them,but for some reason,it was not possible,dont know why.Now ive lost my temper and im boiling,i had enough of these fools. I've have wasted 1 hole day trying to fix the problem,trying to get in contact with them,now its simply game over.Completely waste of time and good energy.And i can see MANY reviews here from unhappy customers,so im not in doubt:NEVER EVER AMAZON AGAIN!!!",23.0,257,0.9937372428479954,0.006262757152004639,33.19591968597937,Low Trust
Gemma,GB,1.0,"I attempted to purchase something from Amazon and use a virtual Visa card which I was told BY THEM is basically like a credit card and I'd be able to use it! Then things took a ridiculous turn in that the card wouldn't work and in contacting their customer services team I got zero help. It's actually hilarious that in the end they sent me a total of 11 replies without managing to answer my actual query at all. I requested to make a complaint and continued to get conflicting information and random agents trying to tell me they were in charge yet continued to send me conflicting and useless information! I went and spent my money elsewhere in the end ...what a joke! I also ended up cancelling my Amazon unlimited account as there's nothing like shocking customer service to make you not want to give someone your money anymore - they were so unhelpful didn't seem like they wanted it.I have to admit this is the first time I've had an issue with Amazon ...I've been shopping with them for around 13 years, but this episode was pretty catastrophic and went on for about 2 weeks! I never did really get the response I was waiting for and that's why I gave up! I now prefer to use other online stores and eBay although I think Amazon is great for range of products, not interested in being treated like I don't matter as a customer again!",20.0,249,0.993720370896102,0.00627962910389801,33.10702688424706,Low Trust
David,GB,5.0,"I can't fault them! All my items ( & its a lot lately!!)have been on time,perfectly packaged & above all the delivery drivers are,respectfully,polite & carefull to make sure I receive them in one piece!! 5 Stars for me...Thank you",26.0,40,0.9937112440699353,0.006288755930064727,150.76311979313812,High Trust
Suzanne,US,1.0,"Originally I gave Amazon a 5 star - what a mistake! Over a mth ago ordered a crank, solar powered radio (sounded great) Received it within a couple days (prime). Wasn’t happy with it, so wanted to return it the next day. Unable to print label off phone, so requested they mail me a return label. I’ve called 4 times as nothing came - all in a span of almost a mth. Last rep I spoke with said - ‘no worries’ - I’m covered by the A-Z guarantee. I’ll be refunded and do whatever I wish with the item. I was pleased and relieved, BUT the next day received email from Amazon re the A-Z guarantee, saying it was under consideration and needed more info; like the tracking # that was on the package being sent back!? Seriously,,, THAT WAS THE PROBLEM! I’d never received a return label, so needless to say (email this morning) they are not honoring the A-Z guarantee in my case!!  THIS, imho IS A SCAM; so be sure you understand everything about this supposed safety guarantee.  Infuriating!  Spent a lot at Amazon, now rethinking everything.",10.0,190,0.9936826612813849,0.006317338718615062,32.44710641994646,Low Trust
Very Angry Gamer,SG,1.0,"I had a horrendous experience with Amazon Singapore. I purchased a video game over $100 using my amazon promo credits and I was still charged on my CC!?!? I told Veena an online amazon customer service staff bout it, she told me the video game is considered a digital order  which is why I was charged, which is utter nonsense! She has no idea what she is talking bout! To compound the issue, the physical product was left outside my door without any prior approval or knowledge. When I finally discovered its status, I opened the door and it was missing! Obviously, someone must have stolen it! So, I was wrongfully charged for an item I never received due to a nonsensical error and gross negligence by Amazon Singapore.",5.0,129,0.9936350397280601,0.00636496027193989,31.7652474527445,Low Trust
hjdsah,IN,1.0,"I purchased an order at $869 while on offer ( normal price $988). I waited 2 weeks with no shipping yet. I email them on 5 occasions to see where the order was.A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾A̳̳̾m̳̳̾a̳̳̾z̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̳̾ ̳̳̾c̳̳̾u̳̳̾s̳̳̾t̳̳̾o̳̳̾m̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾s̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾v̳̳̾i̳̳̾c̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾h̳̳̾e̳̳̾l̳̳̾p̳̳̾l̳̳̾i̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾p̳̳̾h̳̳̾o̳̳̾n̳̳̾e̳̳̾ ̳̳̾n̳̳̾u̳̳̾m̳̳̾b̳̳̾e̳̳̾r̳̳̾ ̳̳̾i̳̳̾s̳̳̾ ̳̳̾+̳̳̾1̳̳̾ ̳̳̾8̳̳̾4̳̳̾4̳̳̾ ̳̳̾4̳̳̾2̳̳̾0̳̳̾ ̳̳̾0̳̳̾0̳̳̾7̳̳̾2̳̳̾Then they cancelled order and said there was unauthorised activity on my account. But they've taken my money!!. So now Im waiting on a refund, which I dont want! I only want my item. Now they say I need to buy again, which of course is at the higer price of $988.. Conveniently . Amazon is SCAM and robbing thieves !! They cannot even honour the order!! Never again im buying from them",2.0,185,0.9936341950511061,0.006365804948893938,32.39344448188104,Low Trust
Cockney Londoner,GB,3.0,"My moan is about the delivery service provided by their Enfield (North London) Delivery Depot.Amazon Tracking states that packages leave their depot around NOON, yes noon.Most of my orders are delivered to my local 'locker' which happens to be within a Post Office which, on a Saturday, closes at 3 pm!!!!! Should I have a delivery to home the drivers have a tendency to tap on the glass in and surrounding the front door (which rarely I can hear), why I have no idea because there are TWO working doorbells which would be impossible to miss.",21.0,96,0.9936246045985425,0.006375395401457484,91.39560656199659,High Trust
Michelle Landsittel,US,1.0,If I could give zero stars I would! Run around trying to get my refund!! To bad the give jobs to people out of the USA. I've been waiting for a week and 2 Days ! I used Prime and still didn't receive my item. I cancelled and never got my refund!! Scam is all Prime is,4.0,57,0.9936176405863144,0.00638235941368559,30.95848981588899,Low Trust
Elaine Dunn,US,1.0,"Beware when you search for “Made in America”. I was ordering blouses and I was checking the “more info” and it reads in the small print “Made in China”!!!!!!  I don’t order anything from China if I can buy elsewhere. Very deceitful. Also they tend to give gift cards for returns, even though I mark the box Return to Original Payment.",3.0,61,0.9935667974266644,0.0064332025733355724,31.00590017353498,Low Trust
Oleksandr Kulakov,DE,1.0,"Awesome security system!Blocked the buyer's account!Just for no reason, because I wanted to buy a watch!Such rudeness!!How to fix it?",2.0,20,0.9935168064450677,0.0064831935549323205,30.548500676064055,Low Trust
Joseph Grimm,US,1.0,I hate these clowns it's always something and today as I'm waiting for a part for my car a rear shock I receive a curtain rod the work was supposed to be done today now I won't get the shock until next week. Come on seams to me someone flim flamed and stole the shock.. keep up the great work DB!!!!!,1.0,61,0.9935116502763851,0.006488349723614895,31.008657531048943,Low Trust
chamcha beta,IN,3.0,"I am still awaiting a refund from an item I returned in December 2019! I ordered a Xmas gift from Amazon at the end of November, they sent the wrong item, I returned it and asked for the order I had originally purchased to be sent!  Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝 Amazon _𝓽𝓸𝓵𝓵 𝒻𝓇𝑒𝑒 𝕙𝕖𝕝𝕡 +𝟏-𝟖-𝟓-𝟓'𝟑'𝟔'𝟗''𝟠'𝟝'𝟞,,𝟝The order was WRONG again! I spoke to Amazon twice about this and and asked for a refund. I returned the order and did not receive any email at first to say they had received it. On 2nd January I rang them, they said they had received it and I would have a refund. On 8th January I received an email saying they had received it. I rang again and Amazon said it would take 5-7 days to receive a refund. A week later I rang AGAIN! They said they would refund but it would AGAIN take 5-7 days from the call to receive a refund! I have rung TODAY and been assured I will now receive my refund! The lady today - Joanna - was good on the phone unlike o",3.0,237,0.993473725376728,0.006526274623272044,92.98475456122529,High Trust
David Hughes,GB,1.0,"Bought a litre of Bells Whiskey (together with another item so no need for delivery charge). No date for delivery after 4 days and Amazon say item still in stock and if I cancel will have to pay delivery on other item. Got in touch with customer service and they said ""out of stock"". Still showing ""In stock"". Took my money under false pretences. What a con!!!!",88.0,67,0.9934719124974672,0.006528087502532753,31.07794671949007,Low Trust
Sofia Zaman,GB,1.0,Bought last minute Xmas presents for the kids items they added for Santa at the last minute as kids tooOrdered from amazon one day delivery so would arrive just before Xmas day perfect Only the next day get a message it will not be arriving as there’s been a delay after a 15 min call reassures by amazon customer service advisor it will arrive by evening latest Xmas morning Ring back again as not arrived by 10pm after another 20 min call told it’s not even been put out for shipment need to cancel and reorder asked how exactly it’s happened not able to explain that’s the best they can do for ruining someone’s Xmas!!!Not happy at all not delivered the service promised and why was I not made aware of this in the first call when I still had time to go out and shop!!!Asked to speak to supervisor put on hold for another 10 mins listening to some annoying music Unbelievable really disappointed Spoke to manager couldn’t explain what has gone wrong no explanation as to what has happened said even if I place order again still wouldn’t get it till another 3 days Spoke to 3 people and got 3 different answersNot happy,1.0,206,0.9934318249784214,0.006568175021578582,32.63912103374859,Low Trust
Natalie J Angel,US,5.0,"I LOVE AMAZON, the products are of great quality, I am a Prime Member so I get free shipping and I order 3 times a week! I purchased a 36 pc set of Vander Make up brushes. They came perfectly wrapped, include a soft case for them and are SPECTACULAR!! I Highly Recommend Amazon for your EVERY NEED!!",3.0,58,0.9934118240532767,0.00658817594672334,150.97999769245675,High Trust
Andrea,US,3.0,"I buy almost everything through Amazon, it's so convenient when you're a Prime Member. Gotta love them for that! The issue I had with them was when I purchased a 12k of pint size Mason Jars. They were shipped in an extra big box with hardly any padding. So when I got the shipment it was obviously shattered to pieces. I called Amazon because I wanted to return it, I didn't want to deal with the mess and I was told that it was a liability for them to get it back from me. But it was ok for ME to get broken glass? I don't think so! So after I talked to the customer service rep and tell him/her about proper ways to ship items they offered me a new shipment of the same item. I was not happy. <<<< Fast forward 2 days later >>>> I get the new shipment in the mail. And yes, it was BROKEN, AGAIN! Shattered to small pieces, made nothing! So again I'm on the phone with someone in customer service who can't really change anything in the warehouse wanted to send me a replacement! I just asked for my money back and called it a day. For an e-commerce company that deals with so many products, they did not a very good job at properly packaging the glass items. Very disappointing!",3.0,229,0.9934020421658804,0.00659795783411965,92.8986023224407,High Trust
K Arnold,GB,1.0,"Not worth giving one star I’m devastated that Amazon is stopping use of Visa Credit cards, the biggest highest earning company again greed, greed no respect for loyal customers!! Amusing there not implementing before Xmas . I’m going to cancel my prime & Amazon account start using the smaller businesses shame on you. I won’t be held ransom by Amazon!!",52.0,60,0.9933514587738204,0.006648541226179638,31.005450056261306,Low Trust
Kelly & Chantel Menard,CA,1.0,I don’t have anything good to say about amazon at this point. I have been a happy prime customer for years until now. With amazon being such a huge company you’d think that their customer service and client care would be top notch! But it isn’t they have failed majorly in that department. I purchased an item from Amazon which caused me thousands of dollars in property damage. It’s been two months and I’m still getting the run around in the mean time I’m in financial turmoil from having to fix the property damage. You’d think a company this big would take care of their clients!!!!!,1.0,106,0.9933490239886212,0.006650976011378762,31.52155609165138,Low Trust
Bob Pearce,GB,1.0,"Non existent customer service!Worst company with non existent customer service. Things seem ok until there’s a problem then there is nothing but a chat bot that is totally useless and there is no way what so ever of contacting anyone to talk to. Another common misconseption that US companies have great customer service, well they don’t! This is proof! I purchased an item and it didn’t turn up. I tried to track it but it said attempted delivery and on hold. I tried EVERYTHING and I mean everything to contact this useless company!",90.0,93,0.9933194470046705,0.006680552995329547,31.377213291942585,Low Trust
Amy,GB,1.0,"Why can your drivers not follow simple basic instructions?Every single time they take no notice of the instructions I give, instead leaving my parcel in a shared hallway for theives to take. Now today once again because they can't follow the basic instruction of leaving my parcel at the security lodge, I am now told 'the driver will try again' and now I can no longer track it. Seriously, it doesn't take a genius!!!!Let this be the last time I use your site for anything!",10.0,85,0.993297747715635,0.006702252284365051,31.288561857067382,Low Trust
Eric Morissette,CA,1.0,"Amazon send me the wrong product and I have not received a refund. A lot of waste of time with the customer service. I lost $700!!! I do not understand how Amazon can live with this behaviour, Amazon is a robber, dishonest practice!!! I am so upset. Please get away from Amazon.",1.0,52,0.9932860152147551,0.006713984785244875,30.918985834887593,Low Trust
Roy,CA,1.0,I ordered from Amazon.ca and they didn’t send my package and when I called them they said your package is delivered. When I track the package from a third party website the package is somewhere else in a delivery facility. They said I have to deal with the seller directly!!! Amazingly Amazon filtered out my review!!!,3.0,56,0.9932807502536196,0.006719249746380385,30.964117282607855,Low Trust
Alla Kobets,US,5.0,"I've been using Amazon for a long time and it's amazing, I love it !!  because this company is the best !!!",3.0,22,0.9931826702042216,0.006817329795778426,150.58764158793812,High Trust
Jane,US,1.0,So apparently Amazon now charges tax on Prime membership and they allow people on Medicade and EBT to get Prime membership for half price. They wont give a senior a discount even though they offer it on amazon.com. They customer service is HORRIBLE. Even having Prime just because you're promised same day or next day delivery you dont get it. It is a shame that Amazon can treat their customers and members with so much disrespect and nothing happens to them. Its pretty funny that according to Amazon my state of California requires them to charge us tax on our membership but I dont pay tax on my gym or Costco membership. So it appears that California only allows Amazon to charge us tax on our membership. WHAT A FRAUD!!!!!!,2.0,130,0.9931651209850846,0.006834879014915418,31.799960439809144,Low Trust
Penny,GB,1.0,"I was notified that a parcel had been handed to the resident ! That's me and it wasn't then, another notification that said left in safe place . No it wasn't !When I tried to complain the "" customer service "" had me going round and round for 15 mins before I gave up.Next morning I found the parcel on the drive , full view of the road , but not the house, thrown on the grass over the gate . It was soaked .Amazon spend money on radio adverts about how good they are for young people , perhaps they should concentrate on customers first !!",59.0,107,0.9931478093076359,0.006852190692364091,31.542833875616523,Low Trust
LJ,GB,1.0,"We found recently that Amazon had subscribed us to something we didn’t want or request and had been debiting us for many months. The amounts they took each month differed as well and they shouldn’t for a subscription!! When we spoke via the chat facility to no less than FOUR customer service agents they all confirmed no refund due, and couldn’t and wouldn’t escalate to management regarding the differing amounts taken without my permission!!! When I asked all four to cancel my account, because they don’t let you do it yourself, they all said the account was closed and to give it a day or more etc. Well guess what, the account was still open a week later and still a month later. I removed bank details and personal details but the account remains open to date because they simply won’t close it... FRAUD ALERT! I would think twice before you use Amazon, and Wilkins instead recommend you stick with what you know, like an Argos etc.",3.0,167,0.9930886453374546,0.006911354662545444,32.21881506907792,Low Trust
Tony Simms,GB,1.0,I ordered a toy for my grandson on the 15th December. I received a e-mail from Amazon saying it would be delivered to my local hub on Tuesday 20th Dec giving me tracking and order numbers. I cancelled my Amazon account on the 21st Dec. I have never received the toy but amazon were VERY QUICK to TAKE the £39.99 out of my credit card.I have phoned them and they say because I do not have an account with them they cannot do anything!! They still KEPT the money though and the TOY!!! Absolutely left hand not knowing what the right hand was doing and appauling customer service. Will NOT be using them ever again,21.0,115,0.9930433385800869,0.006956661419913135,31.637793811320954,Low Trust
Carl Bigham Jr,US,1.0,"AMAZON, VERY POSSIBLY THE WORST BIG COMPANY ON THE PLANET WHEN IT COMES TO CUSTOMER CARE,,, IT SHOULD BE, ""CUSTOMER (WE DO NOT) CARE""!Now, I have no problem with saying that parts of the issues stem from my somewhat limited computer skills and my eventual loss of patience. The loss of patience however, was exacerbated by the Amazon System and the people I had eventually encountered.The System: I believe Amazon is one of the biggest companies on the planet and deals with such large volume of commerce giving them EXTREME POWER OVER SOCIETY AS A WHOLE,,, CONTROL OVER SELECT GROUPS,,, AND AS FAR AS THE INDIVIDUAL GOES... GREASE FOR THE GEARS! Amazon (and other huge companies highly advanced in technology) want to eliminate the ""Human Factor"" from their companies. They want ALL COMMUNICATIONS to be done with bots/A.I. on their end of the transactions... keep taking money from people to continue their automation and computerization. THEN, AS WAS WITH ME, the System failed. A $30 golf club arrives in bent box, broken in half. Needed to ask a question, (may have been somewhat or partially answered in their jumble of ""prepared answers"" if not in the first 50 or so maybe in the second group of 50 or so or 3rd group,,,). I struggled a bit but found a link to live chat. WHERE IT SEEMS MOST SITES YOU GO TO, YOU GET BOMBARDED WITH POP UP ADS,,, AND MOST JUMP RIGHT OUT WITH A, ""LET'S CHAT NOW, WHAT CAN I HELP YOU WITH TODAY"", I had to search around and when I got to the page, I started with a question, it said somethinglike,  ""chat has been started , you are #1 in queue"". About 20 minutes later, I did what they wanted, I ENDED THE CHAT, WITHOUT EVER GETTING ANY REPLY. So next is the attempt to call. Forget it. Not after West Coast work hours, unless you do not mind talking with some whoever, from wherever on the other side of the planet. I mind. Conversation with foreign dialect/accents is tough enough then add the stress brought about by personal and financial information in a world loaded with scammers and con artists. After running into a couple of walls with offshore AND NONE OF THEM ARE INTERESTED IN GETTING YOU ANY HELP WITH CONTACTING A U.S. REPRESENTATIVE FOR THE COMPANY. EVEN GETTING TO SPEAK WITH A SUPERVISOR IS A BATTLE WITH SOME.SO,,, I call the U.S. Corporate phone #. WORTHLESS! IF AMAZON IS LOOKING WHERE TO SAVE SOME WASTED MONEY,,, ELIMINATE THE ""CUSTOMER SUPPORT CALL CENTER"", ABSOLUTELY WORTHLESS. HEARTLESS. SOULLESS, UNCOMPASSIONATE GROUP THAT DO VERY LITTLE TOWARD HELPING (ME ANYWAY),,, AND THEY LIE! CHECK Y'ALLS RECORDINGS! The U.S. CUSTOMER SUPPORT PHONE #, basically 5 prompts. 1- customer service- gives recorded instructions to GO ONLINE. 2- instructions. 3- instructions. 4- instructions. Prompt #5- THE LIVE PEOPLE THAT DIRECT YOU TO CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE,,, THEY ARE JUST THE CALL CENTER,,, CUSTOMER SERVICE IS THE NUMBER I CALLED THAT EVENTUALLY RETURNS TO THEM!WHEN YOU START GETTING LOUD BECAUSE THEY ARE NOT LISTENING WHEN YOU TELL THEM THAT DOING WHAT THEY TOLD ME TO DO DIDN'T WORK AND ASK ""NOW WHAT?"",,, THEY THEN HANG UP ON YOU. AFTER TRYING TO EXPLAIN THAT THEY EITHER AREN'T LISTENING OR DON'T UNDERSTAND, THEY HANG UP ON YOU. BETWEEN THE SYSTEM ITSELF AND THE LIVE AGENTS IN THE CALL CENTER IN SEATTLE WASHINGTON, I CONTINUED TO CALL JUST TO GET A SCRIPT READ TO ME SAYING THEY HAVE GIVEN ME ALL THE HELP AND GUIDEANCE AVAILABLE AT THEIR LEVEL AND THEN HANG UP ON ME... WOULD NOT TELL ME WHAT TO DO WHEN WHAT THEY HAVE TOLD ME TO DO DOESN'T WORK.It concludes with a final attempt at 1 of many AMAZON CUSTOMER SERVICE #s. A guy in India that said he was a supervisor with the ""escalation team"", highest level you can get by phone he said, but I had spent literally HOURS dealing with the Devil, and it boils down to AMAZON UPPER LEVEL COULD CARE LESS WHAT HAPPENS UNDER THEIR FEET AS LONG AS THEY ARE CONTINUALLY BLINDED BY THE MONEY.",4.0,689,0.993023259432622,0.006976740567377959,38.07738442040479,Low Trust
Mark,NL,1.0,"Very very bad customer service!! i was a returning customer but not anymore. if a product is broken within two months, they no longer bear responsibility and you are out of luck. via the chat you make an appointment with an employee that is then not fulfilled! simply ridiculous! I will never buy anything here again!",28.0,56,0.9930220600963359,0.006977939903664132,30.977051790472043,Low Trust
Pippa,GB,1.0,"Paid for some books, not been told if or when i will get them, asked for an approximate timeframe, would not give one. Chat agent was nice and agreed if it were them in my position they would be angry too...comes to something when their own staff concur that the customer service is pitiful!!!!! Cannot wait until bookshops reopen....because if this is the future.....give me good ol fashioned shops and face to face customer service everytime",10.0,76,0.9929787836831625,0.0070212163168374975,31.203556609448157,Low Trust
Letsgo Brandon,US,1.0,"Amazon is terrible! Deliveries are NEVER on time, and customer service is the worst! Instead of trying to make the company better for their customers, their ceo is more intrested in taking trips to space and has the audacity to thank customers! ALSO a family member of mine who drives semi's for amazon tells me that trips from across the country that the 53 foot trucks you see on the road are only a quarter full! Makes sense why deliveries are never on time! Would give 0 stars if I could!",1.0,91,0.9929357173161317,0.007064282683868273,31.373965676537775,Low Trust
Ray Nock,GB,1.0,"Ordered my wife's birthday present from an on line company to be delivered on her birthday. Their chosen courier was Amazon. Total shambles. The present left the supplying company the day before her birthday, which was fine, and that was the last we heard of it. If you have occasion to come in contact with Amazon Shipping avoid like the plague. Totally ruined my wife's birthday and I will be out of the dog house sometime in August.Edit!!!!!I thought I was the only one moaning about Amazon until I just read all the other 1* reviews. What is the point of reviews if no-one takes any notice. These people would never make another sale if reviews were taken notice of. The thing is Amazon do not give a s--t as long as they continue to make billions each year.My advice is deal with a reputable company, that's if you can find one that is.",31.0,154,0.99293281626769,0.007067183732309967,32.08078487365981,Low Trust
Priscilla,US,1.0,"I have been an Amazon Prime member for numerous years. I am well aware of the purchase and return process. However, about three months ago, I have noticed a huge change in the return process. I ordered a small piece of furniture, worth $181.00. The item was damaged upon opening. I quickly filed a return on Amazon. I went to UPS, with the affixed label that I was provided, and they explained, I had to pay $240.00 in order to ship it back. The return label was not paid for by Amazon. I only had the item for less than a week and it was damaged. Why would any company expect me to pay that amount to ship it back? I have called Amazon at least a dozen times and every time I talk to someone new, I get a new answer. It’s a third party seller and we don’t get involved in that. After waiting three weeks with getting absolutely nowhere, I filed a dispute with American Express. Thank gosh for them because I would have never received a refund. I made the mistake and gave Amazon another try and ordered a bathingsuit a month ago. Here we go again! I returned it via post office per Amazon, with a delivery address to New Jersey, and item was delivered but no refund. Again, a third party seller. Even though, return address is in New Jersey. I had to call Amazon ten times so far and the A - Z process is ridiculous! They act like they are helping but they don’t! I am cancelling my Prime Membership and will never deal with this nonsense again! I heard that Amazon company sold off to third party sellers so buyers beware!! It’s scan now, if you ask me!",2.0,297,0.9929218085481681,0.007078191451831861,33.68537339760561,Low Trust
Mona Dewitt,US,1.0,"Absolutely no service after the sale!!!  They continue to take your annual prime membership dues of $125. But have used Covid as an excuse to delay their promised 2 day delivery times. Well over a year and still delayed delivery times! Now it’s even worse. Weeks on products that used to be delivered in 2 days. How about we all cancel our annual membership to show mr trillionaire Bezos he cant continue to charge for a promised service that he clearly is not delivering. Our annual membership cost shouldn’t be cut in half since most of us signed up for Prime membership to get stuff in 2 days as promised! Bottom line, Bezos getting even richer bc our annual prime membership cost have stayed the same, but our product gets delivered when amazon sees fit. So he’s saving a ton of money on expedited shipping, but our cost haven’t changed!",3.0,150,0.9929126822277896,0.007087317772210389,32.036923375991336,Low Trust
Rose D,US,1.0,"I was buying everything at amazon but not any more, I usually expend $700/month there. Last week, I returned 5 different items from different orders and send them back. I used to get my return 2-3 hours after I drop of the item at UPS. Now they said I have too wait until the items reach the facility which will take 2 weeks, (I did not use UPS, I used amazon locker which is close to my place), once they receive the item after 2 weeks, then the have to open the item and process it so add another week. No store ever takes that long to refund something!!!!  I will start buying from other stores and all of of them have better prices than amazon! I have been wasting a lot of money!",1.0,134,0.9928947000143132,0.007105299985686764,31.858349688011202,Low Trust
Chris Chesna,US,1.0,"Deliveries got so bad with being late or lost to my home that I had them delivering to their locker. The best one is form this weekend where they couldn’t deliver to their own locker and sent my order back to some warehouse! How can you screw that up!? It’s your own friggin’ equipment!!! After 14 years with Amazon, they can stick their cheap Chinese crap up their back ends.",4.0,70,0.9928549653901273,0.0071450346098727024,31.142445224604682,Low Trust
Matthew Merdick,US,1.0,Shopping on Amazon has always been great. My problem is with the Amazon driver that was so busy on her phone that traffic laws and other people's well being and safety meant NOTHING to her. I can say this with confidence because I was almost run into twice today ON A 3 LANE ROAD!!!!!! I  honked the 1st time and then within 30 seconds I had to swerve into the next lane again to avoid an accident. Called Amazon to report it and they seem to care less than the old lady driver who's phone was higher on the food chain than other human beings. But I guess as long as they're making their money and the Hindu tech guy from somewhere else who barely speaks understandable English then the world is going to go around. Right?????,1.0,137,0.9928164356088958,0.007183564391104236,31.89591405802969,Low Trust
Ian Jex,US,1.0,"For two years now I’ve been calling, writing, chatting, emailing Amazon about constant delivery issues. Not late delivery but actual driver misconduct/poor performance issues! For two years I’m promised they’ll address it, have a supervisor call me back, speak to the delivery center, and every other excuse you can think of to simply get me to go away and then surprise surprise no call, no response to complaints, still having the issues for two years!This horrible service all started when Amazon let go hundreds of USA based employees and started relying almost entirely on outsourced call centers /service centers in India! I’ve been lied too and even had a employee disable my account after I gave them a negative survey!Amazon has decided they’re too big to fail now and so they don’t care one bit about their customers anymore!I’m canceling my prime membership and blocking Amazon in our home as well as canceling the gift card order my company was going to place with Amazon for gifts for our staff! If they treat me this way after two years of complaints I won’t risk exposing my employees to this horrible service anymore",3.0,192,0.9927976762995738,0.007202323700426172,32.513789768868754,Low Trust
Brianna Jean,US,4.0,"Amazon has become the way of the world. We can find anything we need at the edge of our finger tips + 2 day prime shipping?! SIGN ME UP! I’ve worked hand in hand with Amazon and their affiliate program which has been wonderful. I’ve also ordered many of my own personal things through the site as well. From clothes, to toilet paper and even random items like a pineapple carver LOL. They have a large variety of items and various vendors to choose from. The only issue I’ve really ever had is they tend to lose my packages. I even have an Amazon hub at my apartment complex where they can drop off the package directly. It’s always frustrating when something doesn’t arrive on time or gets lost some way some how in transit. However, Amazon has always swooped right in to help save the day. Their customer service is awesome! I’m more of a pick up the phone type of gal. I like that one on one customer service (it must be the sales person in me) but Amazon does also offer a chat service where you can speak to a representative directly. I’ve had phone calls and chats with them but I’ve had instances before where I can’t leave my desk to make a phone call. Easily enough I’ve gotten right on the chat, let them know my package was missing and they have sent a new one right out to me. Easy peasy! I’ve had really great service and have always been satisfied with the overall experience of the company itself. I would highly recommend checking them out!!",2.0,272,0.9927240122914253,0.007275987708574738,123.41483696254596,High Trust
Mario Cezary Pyzik,US,1.0,"Dear Sir / Madam,My name is Mario Pyzik and I am a very unhappy customer.Starting from 6th of January you have cancelled my account 4 times. As apparently I was a fraud. I am a Polish citizen who came to USA to buy yacht and furnish it. Some of your people decided that I was spending too much money with Amazon and cancelled my account instead of calling me.Your help line unblocked the account 4 times and your 'specialist' cancelled it 3 times. Unbelievable. They have erased all my pervious orders from my account !!!!! I do not think it is legal.On 5th and 6th of January you have charged me USD144; USD34.91; USD62.99; USDS244.29. I do not know for what as I did not get these goods.I would like you to tell me what did you charge me for ? and get my money back. I spent over 10hrs talking to your representatives only to get promises that someone will get back to me in the next 24-48hrs (some in writing).Can someone tell me what did you you charge meUSD144; USD34.91; USD62.99; USDS244.29. or get me the money back. The last person I talked to was Jeff 806 (I think he was a real person, beforehandLisa, beforehand Rona, beforehand ....... 45min every time with no resolutionMario1hr after I posted this review, Amazon closed my account for the 4th time. They can do as they are pleased if you are not happy with the way they treat you ! They can take your money, not give any explanation etc etc etc",4.0,261,0.9926732759876018,0.0073267240123982,33.29398622866253,Low Trust
David,US,1.0,"Horrible delivery experience.  I kept checking the tracking and when I showed a map where the driver was, less than a mile from us and I was 4th in line, I went and waited in the front room.  I checked again and the tracking said I was next.  I checked again and it said delivery was attempted at 4:51 pm and that I can give permission through the app to leave it somewhere like in the mailbox or in a bush.  Probably because they wanted it to be on me if it got stolen because it is a pricey item.  They are probably doing this to a lot of deliveries so they can cut down on man hours of delivery drivers.  It takes more time to actually take a pricey item to a resident to find that there is no one home.  No one ever came to the door!  It was a pricey item for a birthday tomorrow morning.  I called Amazon to tell them the situation.  I get transferred to this carrier and they tell me he will come back before 9 pm.  I needed to go to bed because I work nights. I called Amazon to keep the item and I will go to Best Buy to purchase it.  Thanks a lot Amazon!  I love how your customer service says “thank you so much for being a Prime member.”  What a bunch of malarky!!!  You lost a 514$ sale Amazon.  No wonder so many people hate you!",1.0,249,0.9926636567658569,0.007336343234143117,33.15986259075932,Low Trust
Mike,VN,1.0,"Got Amazon trial to get some movies etc when in Vietnam for 6 months. But then I noticed that I need to switch to my local Swedish simcard just to receive a so called One Time Password (OTP) I decided to not use Amazon prime for movies. Good it was just a trial and hope I can cancel this garbage!Also, amazon chat support said it is for security purposes we ask for otp even though I explained I dont want to shift my sim card to local Swedish everytime I want to login to Amazon!!!I thought that companies like amazon knew that internet is interrnational and having to turn off phone, remove battery, shift simcard, restart the phone and then receive an expensive OTP message while in Vietnam is way to unsmooth. Security keep me from using Amazon. Idiotic Amazon.com. I saw Netflix I could probably sign up to here and will try them instead!! Amazon what the?",9.0,158,0.9926196097797134,0.007380390220286581,32.14131339772213,Low Trust
Maxine O'Sullivan,GB,1.0,"I purchased a small radiator cover from Amazon for £37 and absolutely loved it. I wanted another one for on my landing upstairs. I went to order the same again and the price had jumped from £37-£40. I went upstairs to take measurements before I placed an order and to my frustration it had shot up to £42.25! How can this happen in a few minutes? I telephoned customer services at Amazon only to be told it was an offer! I told them to cancel my order on principle as they wouldn’t do anything about it. They expect you to measure up correctly yet, raise the price twice in 5 minutes whilst doing so! I’m absolutely appalled at the service & price rises! I feel like cancelling my PRIME membership! ",6.0,130,0.9926195299857906,0.007380470014209384,31.827239989773844,Low Trust
Carol Campbell,CA,2.0,"Amazon is taking longer and longer to ship. When they finally do, they send your parcel (in N.B.) with Bonshaw. THE WORST DELIVERY COMPANY EVER!!! Have you read their reviews Amazon? NOT ONE is positive, the company is despised and yet you insist on using them and losing customers because of it. Prime membership is a joke, as is guaranteed delivery date. SO close to closing my account!!",2.0,68,0.9925892092518268,0.0074107907481731905,61.13329893168795,Medium Trust
Colin Crane,GB,2.0,"One of Amazon's third party sellers is ""Electrical Emporium,"" seemingly a trade name of Powerforce Distribution Limited.Despite receiving an email from the CEO stating all the usual ""bumph"" about how pleased he was with me buying a product from his company..... and if I have any concern in the future....... His employees cannot put the correct label on the appropriate product: I ordered a Vax vacuum cleaner. What did I get, a steam iron!I have no complaint with Amazon ""per say"" other than they immediately refunded the money and told me to keep the iron. However, that didn't help me purchase a particular model Vax vacuum cleaner, that I spent many hours considering against other makes and models to suit my wife and I using, as ""senior citizens"" with cats and dog fur to clean up etc.Now, I receive an email from Electrical Emporium asking me to return the product using the pre-paid label!!! What product? The one I didn't receive or the iron that Amazon told me to dispose of?Hello? To those it may concern, does any party talk to the other?I give up!I shall just ask Amazon and Electrical Emporium to read this review. Perhaps they will at least understand the problems I have and now face.",49.0,209,0.9925667878311667,0.007433212168833303,62.71602404085893,Medium Trust
