Benjamin Kuch,GB,1.0,"Worst seller experience ever! I had a buyer who claimed item not received (let's be honest, 9 out of 10 times that's a scam, but anyway!) and I was forced to refund the buyer because it was sent, as usual, Royal Mail 2nd class large letter, ie untracked/no signature. Ok my bad, fine. Next time I need to send a £20 videogame tracked signed for, spending a fortune on the shipping, right??BUT worst of all though is that, prior to the decision of granting the buyer a refund, I had lengthy discussions regarding this case where I was reassured by Amazon Seller support, that I needn't worry about this buyer. I quote (Mayank S.): ""Upon investigation, I would like to inform you that as per the tracking details the product has been delivered to the buyer."" Well thanks, but what tracking details are you talking about?! Anyway thanks for confirming that the product has been delivered...! And ""Hence, be assured that if buyer has any issue with the delivery then amazon will provide the certain support to the buyer.""Later I got a message from another person (Pranav Kumar C.): ""After reviewing your email I understand that the seller demands a refund, claiming the item has not been received but you have already refunded.Kindly be informed that I am forwarding this information to our concerned team right now so that they can investigate this buyer. I have filed the investigation report against this buyer. I assure you that our team will take strict action against the buyer accordingly. However, if the buyer leaves a negative feedback our team will remove the feedback. You do not need to worry about this buyer as our team will now take care of this issue as we never allow any buyer to give loss to our valued sellers like you. I also assure you that you will not face such inconvenience in future as your case is being handled on top priority."" Ok thanks again, but what are you talking about? I haven't refunded the buyer! And what action have you taken against that buyer exactly?It's absolutely nuts. Stay away from selling on Amazon is my advice.",16.0,362,0.9896872790988142,0.010312720901185846,34.576208114605,Low Trust
Cenk Arkin,GB,1.0,"All customers of amazon can purchase a product from a listed seller and start return progress but not post the product back to the seller still gets refund!I am a seller, customer wanted to return! It is accepted from my side and she send it to me she says! I am not responsible and paying for refunds unless a product has fault! Told her I never received product back than she told me parcel is lost by courier (Royal mail) and she never send it back. Amazon paid customer from my account for refund😂 Customer Anna Higgins Told me that parcel is lost by caurier but she told Amazon she never received the parcel from seller!All this messagings are in amazon’s messaging system and Amazon is unable to identify the trick done by customer.This is extortion.",13.0,136,0.9895916340425218,0.010408365957478183,32.04593708643252,Low Trust
Jalilioo Esaid,GB,1.0,"Amazon has no intention to improve its services, I feel humilated by them, their delivery services guy put my goods in the garbage bin and addressed it as "" delivered "" , I am not living in a garbage bin to tell that they "" delivered it "" ??I didn't receive this, instead of that I asked them to send their guys to collect it from the bin.I told them the story and they said they are sorry for that and refunded me and added me a promotional 10£!!I don't need their money, I need the justice I need to be treated like a human, they told me that they will conduct an internal investigation but the results of this investigation will not be disclosed?!?Unfortunately, this is the second time they do the same act with me, disrespectful!!",5.0,138,0.9895887411553126,0.01041125884468741,32.06851583062472,Low Trust
India Thomas,US,1.0,"I have never felt more frustrated, helpless and ignored then I do right now. Amazon customer service sucks! I’ve been a customer with Amazon for years and it seems like recently the service has went down hill. The delivery driver keeps dropping off my packages at the wrong house. My neighbor has a big sign telling them where to deliver it since she has been inconvenienced. I have talked to multiple reps saying they will fix it. It hasn’t been fixed and you driver is ignoring the big sign!!! I’ve spoken with someone who claims they were a supervisor on chat but didn’t greet me as such. Only to be disconnected by her when asked how do I file a complaint. They do not provide transcripts of the chat, but I took screenshots myself. I will not be using Amazon any more. This is how you treat paid members. I can’t even get my package delivered to the right house and I’m being treated like I did something wrong!",1.0,169,0.989466523702606,0.010533476297393984,32.42235525065208,Low Trust
