LINDA P,GB,1.0,"Usually great.  Today not so.  I tried to order 10 Covid test kits. Got an error message ""We're sorryThere was an internal error in our system. We logged the problem and will investigate it later. Our apologies for the inconvenience."" and a button to ""Continue Shopping"".   OK - so waited and tried again - same message.  Nothing to state payment would be taken.  So I went to another retailer site and ordered from them.  Then later I checked my credit card only to find TWO identical payments taken from Amazon without any notification to me!!  So I tried to cancel the order but system said it could not as dispatched.  So today, 20 Covid test kits arrived that I do not need. I tried to initiate a return, but system said these items cannot be returned or refunded. So I did an online chat with customer services to explain the issue, the system error message etc., but they simply refused to take any action or take the goods back.  So I am £22 out of pocket with 20 Covid test kits I will not use, (the expiry date of each is just 11 months hence.) So peeps...BEWARE - if ever you get a system error message as you order - that order WILL BE PROCESSED without your knowledge!!",74.0,218,0.9883012572109414,0.01169874278905858,33.03025402111305,Low Trust
H R,US,1.0,"I've just come to hate the Amazon Business model. I ordered a tablet on June 13 and still haven't received it! If you aren't on Amazon Prime and you choose the free shipping, then JUST FORGET IT! Amazon makes no effort to get your order to you in a timely manner! Since I ordered my tablet, an Amazon truck has been down my street at least 15 times and could have easily brought my order! Instead, they chose to send it USPS. Such lamebrains! USPS shows they never received it, and I believe it. You check the routing number:9361289670021256517671Is there anyone to call in customer service? NO. Does the chatbot help? NO, they just repeat what is already stated on the website. My recourse? I can get my money back tomorrow. I don't want my money back, I want the tablet I ordered!If they sent it USPS, then it's their problem that my tablet didn't get here. Well, no, actually it is mine. Amazon will take no further action on their own. They don't care if I received my item or not. I'm the one who has to take action, not Amazon.The credit card should be billed after the product is received. Then they would pay better attention and make sure the product is shipped in a way that gets it to the customer.Jeff, you need to come back down of your spaceship and do something about this Jassy guy before he destroys the company you created...",1.0,247,0.9882794531193073,0.011720546880692684,33.35663867325505,Low Trust
Mehdi,TN,1.0,"If you're a seller stay away! I had an awful experience with them and ended up losing $1600 of my hard earned money trying to sell on Amazon! Don't be fooled by the name as Amazon is only good for buyers, if you're a seller you'll experience things that you never expected like being scammed! Yes I'm not joking Amazon would scam you if you're a seller. Let me explain more! If you're using their fulfillment centers there's a high chance you loose a lot of your products. Why because some of the workers there have Amazon selling accounts like Amazon warehouse Wich is a selling account on Amazon and they steal from new seller's inventory and put it in their account. To be short it's a whole nightmare! Stay away if you don't want to get ripped off.",10.0,139,0.988276344563941,0.011723655436059022,32.14535271010918,Low Trust
TrevorDG,GB,3.0,"Amazon books orders. Mostly acceptable service from Amazon. However, oftentimes you get slightly dog eared edges to your ordered new book corners. This seems to be quite common showing lack of care in their handling of the books prior to or during picking or packing out of the order. This is slightly annoying. Overall delivery is good. Selection of US published book titles very good. Better probably than Waterstones or Book Depository too. Ordered were Krav Maga manuals titles and instructional all region DVD. I also benefited from a free offer one per customer of five pounds off my books order.",319.0,101,0.9881179685229672,0.011882031477032817,91.72702361535472,High Trust
