Kristy Spakowski,US,1.0,"So completely disappointed in what Amazon has become, which is completely unreliable with shipping, regardless of how you place your order. We placed a very large order before our vacation and had requested that our products be delivered on the same day in 1 package, as an Amazon prime member. The website stated that our products had been delivered when they had not actually arrived. When we called to see what the problem was, our order was cancelled leaving us scrambling to find the items we had ordered, the day before we leave. I have been a prime member for YEARS and have experienced this same problem too many times and should have known better than to trust this company. I will NEVER order from Amazon again and will be cancelling my prime membership. The stress that their lack of efficiency has created is not worth it to me. We will shop elsewhere. If I could give 0 stars, I would. Get your act together Amazon!!! People depend on you and you are FAILING!!!",2.0,174,0.9880561289155078,0.011943871084492241,32.548960239586364,Low Trust
