hermann gilly,AT,1.0,"I just copy the review:  ""Got a message that the package was delivered, but it wasn't there.""Similarly  I got the message of Amazon.de that DHL cannot deliver  by unknown reasons. Some hours later the message ""Delivery was not possible to the adress, go to the nearby shop to call for it."" It is always the same scenario: DHL just does not come up with a correct first delivery attempt to the customers adress. And if you want to call DHL you have to pay for the phonecall! What a shame! And Amazon is not ready to take responsibility for a parcel service which will do the job in a correct and reliable way. And this service is called Amazon Prime! What a shame! ""It's driving me really mad. Paying for something I didn't get and then being treated this way!""Dr Hermann Gilly",19.0,142,0.9869452944678988,0.013054705532101196,32.2455563646589,Low Trust
Melissa,CA,1.0,"This is the worst customer service I have ever experienced!! I recieved a pair of shoes that didn't fit, so I ordered a bigger size, and asked them to return the small ones. I received an email that they would be here between 11 and 2, and nobody showed up. I called customer service, they said the delivery company said they were here (they weren't) and the girl on the phone basically said I was wrong and there's nothing she can do. And I said then you can cancel my membership and I will never order another thing from Amazon. She replied, sure mam, I'll take care of that for you now...all done, have a nice evening. I guess they make enough money that one person's business doesn't mean anything to them. Worst service on the planet!!!",1.0,137,0.9868156233352117,0.013184376664788333,32.19595467171389,Low Trust
Shura N.,US,1.0,"Amazon is no longer a reputable company customer service is dysfunctional! A totally stressful experience trying to speak with their representative it is often frustrating trying to understand what is being said their respective accents make their English usage barely coherent! Orders often arrive damaged or not at all! I will end my Prime today, it is simply too stressful trying to explain any problematic issue with the present customer service representativeness! Their price increases for items coupled with the despicable customer care services no longer make Amazon appealing!",10.0,89,0.9868111119717987,0.013188888028201284,31.657761843922682,Low Trust
Antonio Alonzo,VE,1.0,"In recent days, I received a message from my bank, informing me that they had debited the amount of 426 dollars for an alleged purchase made by me, someone entered my account, changed the shipping address and made a purchase, the scam was detected by me almost immediately, I immediately contacted Amazon to cancel that order, that was not possible, I tried to cancel the purchase almost immediately but Amazon did not allow it, despite calling and notifying that I was being scammed by a hacker Online Amazon did Absolutely nothing !! The order was delivered the next day and they even sent me photos of the delivery. I think that if the order goes out through Amazon Logistics, they must have control to stop any irregularities. Now my account is blocked for ""SECURITY"" and the bank also charged me. the cost of the product! A security and communication failure within the Amazon departments! I clarify that this happened to me in Amazon United States !!",2.0,166,0.9867288150146066,0.01327118498539337,32.52558953530444,Low Trust
