Nozama,GB,1.0,"I bought a Amazon fire HD tablet from this company I had this thing for Just 5 days and then started having problems with the Bluetooth , I was on the phone to Amazon for 3 hours . Had to deregister and register the thing ..which worked for a while  but the problem kept coming back . Once again I had to phone Amazon at my expense because there call back system never works . The phone call resulted in a full factory reset ...but once again this only solved the problem for a short time  ... Then I started getting problems with taking screenshots , the device would take a screenshot but would store a blank screen , just a black box  ...this device really is a  piece of junkI was promised a NEW replacement device but the tablet Kindle sent me was  second hand refurbished device . Once again I contacted Amazon and was told all replacement fire tablets are refurbished . I refused to accept the refurbished device and demanded a NEW REPLACEMENT Amazon refused . Next I received a threatening email telling me that if the original NEW DEVICE was not returned in 15days I would be automatically billed DOUBLE the price I paid for it !!!!!",23.0,211,0.9866101719876152,0.013389828012384752,33.03628893286826,Low Trust
Gail Farrow,GB,1.0,"I ordered a pair of Hike Footwear Barefoot Shoes (trainers) in a size 5 but they sent a size 6.  These shoes are really shoddy, even in the right size would be embarrassing to wear! I ordered them from zhanlu EU - Amazon Market and am absolutely astonished that Amazon are allowing such awful things to be sold.  I asked to return them and had a message back from zhanlu EU saying there was no need to return them and what size would I like them to send! Well doesn’t that tell you everything, they are that cheap and tacky they are prepared to send a second pair without me returning the first.  I have replied to them and asked for a full refund, days ago, and have still heard nothing!Amazon and zhanlu EU have not heard the last of this! If you see these on Amazon or anywhere else do not buy, they are dreadful!",15.0,156,0.9865782929324208,0.01342170706757917,32.42094514025501,Low Trust
Latesha Jones,US,1.0,"Amazon is awful now! Last week I received some candy that was opened and it looked as if someone had eaten out of it. This week I ordered products for my baby shower that was set for next day delivery but instead it was set to be shipped 3 days later. I worked from home instead of going into office so that it would not be rained on. I called and had to go through the horrible automated response first which is annoying AF... then I spoke with someone from a different country who didn't speak English well. After 20 minutes getting nowhere with him I was transferred to a ""supervisor"" who had a very thick accent and she was even worse than the first person. She placed me on hold and randomly transferred me somewhere else. Then she called me immediately after transferred me and said the call was disconnected. I told her that it was not disconnected and that she transferred me someone else. SHE ASKED ME IF THEY WERE ABLE TO HELP ME.... I was beyond frustrated at this point. I asked to speak to a supervisor in America and she transferred me to someone that spoke English but they disconnected after answering and putting me on hold. I called back and reached someone else with a thick accent so I asked to speak to a supervisor in America. They transferred me to someone who spoke english but was not supervisor, was no help, and knew nothing about my package. She said to give it 48 hours and if it still hadn't arrived they would issue a REFUND. I NEED THESE ITEMS FOR MY BABY SHOWER!!!! I am livid at this point and ended up screaming.... The way they Amazon treats their customers is disgusting and it doesn't seem like they care.",3.0,305,0.9864220587259311,0.013577941274068861,34.10009728804444,Low Trust
