Sheila Hannah,GB,1.0,If I could give a lower rate I would! I cancelled my Amazon Prime in February and subsequently found that they had continued to charge me. When I contacted them they refused to give details of who had set up the payment as I didn't have Prime membership at that time. My credit card company cancelled the payment for me and refunded the payments made in June. I have just discovered that Amazon Prime has set up payments again without me being a Prime member!! I have had to cancel my credit card to stop them!!Do not trust Amazon Prime. ,8.0,100,0.9820234007632269,0.017976599236773083,32.020534953425866,Low Trust
