cheryl,US,5.0,"I absolutely LOVE  Amazon!!  It keeps getting better all the time.  Amazon almost always has what I am looking for and comes with reviews.  With all there is to choose from - it is so beneficial to be able to read what other people have to say about the products!!  And, I love that Amazon has Prime shipping - it has paid for itself over and over again.  When I have had a problem - the return process couldn't be easier.",2.0,81,0.9812279031143737,0.01877209688562631,151.84718588746696,High Trust
