David,ES,1.0,"The purpose of this review is not malicious, but made in an attempt to improve Amazon and customer confidence!. The concept of Amazon is a good one especially now that we are virtually locked in due to Covid-19. However, success has gone to Bezo's head and this can be clearly seen by an increasing in substandard products, poor delivery and the attitude of some of the customer service agents.I am TQM trained and run my former business along those lines. TQM means total Quality Management and the buck stops right at the feet of the person running the show. This means Jeff Bezo is vicariously liable for the actions  of all his employees, no matter how he tries to worm his way out the responsibilities they are firmly stuck with him..Amazon did not deliver my cooker and are refusing to reimburse me. I have asked them for proof of delivery and they cannot give it to me as simply they never delivered it. I have boded my time in order to gather evidence that Amazon will just leave packages unattended. I now have this proof. Also in the Costa Blanca Olive Press Oct 1st 2020 THERE IS A FRONT PAGE FEATURE ALLEGING THAT AMAZON CUSTOMERS ARE NOT GETTING THEIR PACKAGES DELIVERED BY DECEPTIVE DELIVERY DRIVERS.Clear proof that Amazon does not take care to ensure that what you buy and pay for your get!Amazon is fully aware if this. I also made them aware over two years ago about poor delivery and this directly caused a slight improvement. However, regrettably BEZO has never stayed on top of things as any competent CEO would do, preferring, as his does to pass the buck over onto his delivery firms.However, when you buy on AMAZON your contract is between you and Amazon, being as it is,  made at the point of your purchase. Amazon cant by law introduce a third party, ie their contracted delivery firms, into your already executed contract in an illegal attempt to shirk off its contractual responsibilities.No matter what the small print says you would have to physically agree to a third party being joined into an alrady existing contract,I feel that Amazon has grown too big for its boots! When I was able to prove that Customer Service Executive ANDRY A lied to me, purposely on two occasions, that is deception! When I complained over it I was told and I quote: I would appreciate if you keep communication on a professional way, as we always ensure our specialists provide a good service showing respect to our customer and we would appreciate if we received the same treatment form our customers.Katherine A.Departamento de Relaciones EjecutivasAmazon.esI MEAN PLEASE JUST..............How many ways can you tell Amazon this person, Andry A lied to me twice??Amazon refunded me 40 Euros!So back to the 500 euro cooker! Having given Amazon the chance to rectify the problem with no avail the next step is to report them, which I will now do to the following:- EU europa consumersAlso including the National Consumer Arbitration Board I would urge anyone with difficulties with Amazon to do the same and you would be more than welcome to quote this review.We are undoubtedly heading for difficult times and every penny will no doubt count. I kinda take objection to being ripped off...especially by the reputed richest man in the world.",8.0,561,0.9772862538166509,0.022713746183349093,37.42845231197172,Low Trust
Maureen Booth,GB,1.0,"I purchased a blood pressure monitor dispatched by Amazon. Cazon Store, from WANGQIAN Ltd. This Cazon item is unreliable. Given the readings I should be dead!! My Dr. was mortified that this monitor is allowed on the market. It’s dangerous!! After repeated attempts of raising my concerns I was blocked. Amazon acknowledged but took no further action. People’s lives are at stake here? CE approved apparently? What’s that?",31.0,68,0.9772145307793764,0.022785469220623633,31.902032855310487,Low Trust
