Vikki Kenny,GB,1.0,"Absolutely disgusting!!!!!They left an order outside my house for someone to take which they did. I called them and said I have to file and police report and get a crime ref number which I did, to then be told that I had to wait a few days for it to turn up even though I got a photo of it being left outside my house, I called up in a few days time for them to tell me we can’t refund you until you get the case closed from the police and send more documents over for proof. They never had intentions of sending me a new one or a refund. I’ll never ever use this company again.",1.0,119,0.9768494967943498,0.023150503205650153,32.49235410027129,Low Trust
Chris,US,1.0,If I could give a negative 5star I would worst customer service I've ever spoken with. Yes I know most are over seas now but I can normal deal with them and understand what they are saying. Amazon's customer service representative are the worst. Couldn't understand 3/4 of what they were trying to say. And when. I could they kept transferring me. And asking the same identical questions which weren't hard to answer. I was transferred to a specialist of absolutely nothing because he asked the same questions as the Normal representative. And gave the same answer. Saying they could reship my item and never did. Said they had to transfer me. By far the worst customer service EVER. JEFF BEZOS KEEP CUSTOMER SERVICE IN THE UNITED STATES SHAME  ON YOU!!!!!,1.0,131,0.9766610482597404,0.023338951740259573,32.63638112599222,Low Trust
Jav EBRA,AU,1.0,"Using Amazon over 12 years, in all ways including books, movies, products, etc... And how are we getting a customer support and appreciation? A nasty impolite email comes ""we are closing your account..."" without saying why and what's the reason of such st...d decision? We had to call and stayed over 30 minutes on the phone, the guy was nice he said it's a mistake! Well the person who made such a mistake MUST be fired immediately! You can do that to your customers... What a shame! Even account recovery doesn't make satisfication. Amzon simply became rubbish! You may think this text is rude? But Amazon's email was far more rude! Otherwise no reason to write such a text after being a customer over 12 years....",6.0,126,0.9765350111334563,0.02346498886654369,32.58659773272707,Low Trust
