mbrakes23,US,1.0,"Tried to buy new alarm clock. Had to enter e-mail and password. Entered password. Then it asked for password and captcha. Sent e-mail I had to confirm all just to log in. Finally logged in. Tried to check out. Wanted password. Entered password. Then it asked for password and captcha again, even though I had already gone through that just to log in. Would not let me check out. Called customer service. First person transferred me to second person. Had to give all the information again. He transferred me to a third person. ""Your account has been locked out because it has been so long. We'll have to connect you to our security..."" That's when I hung up. NOT WORTH IT!!! I'll never use Amazon again!",29.0,126,0.976006620701944,0.023993379298056006,32.61301725430269,Low Trust
