Ryan Hennessy-Saunders,GB,1.0,"Amazon…well where the hell do I start? To say that Amazon are a shocking shower of s**t, would be such a huge understatement. I used to have so much confidence and faith in Amazon, but only until recently, they’ve gone down hill dramatically, and is just a disappointing company. I have had NUMEROUS packages ‘get lost’ and when I’ve contacted their customer support, well they were as much use as a knitted condom and no explanations as to how or why this happened! Their overall business ethics are just horrifically diabolical and their customer service is just absolutely appalling to say the least! They’re quick enough to take OUR hard-earned money, but when it comes to refunding, well it’s like trying to pry a mouse from the jaws of a venomous viper! I am ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTED with Amazon and their customer service and I DO NOT recommend anybody to use them. AVOID them like you would a pit full of hungry rats!!",7.0,162,0.9758127627726474,0.02418723722735261,33.02652394773891,Low Trust
