Kaz,GB,1.0,"What is going on with this company?!It used to be trustworthy and reliable.Lately, I've had parcels not arrive even though it said handed to resident! Yesterday, I ordered a phone charger to arrive the next day because the one I'm using isn't fully connecting. I should have gone and found one in a shop instead of relying on this dreadful company!Here I am still sitting waiting for it at 8.15pm, knowing full well that it won't arrive tonight.I'm now wasting my 7% charge on writing an angry review!From now on, I will go into the city and find things myself. If I can't rely on Amazon, then there's no hope for online shopping anymore.",63.0,114,0.975437499678856,0.024562500321144043,32.506868706466626,Low Trust
DM Jewell,US,1.0,"Customer Service is AWFUL! Amazon told me an item I ordered was undeliverable and I would get a refund in 48 hours. I waited 10 days. No refund. It took 3 service reps to get my $7.57 refund. One agent kept insisting that I had to let him send me another one! Good grief! I didn't want it. I ordered a different one to replace that one, and paid for it, and already got it. I wanted a REFUND! 3 agents and 45 mins later I got a $7.57 refund. TERRIBLE CUSTOMER SERVICE. Amazon CS sucks!",3.0,96,0.9753969091936535,0.024603090806346484,32.30699133224105,Low Trust
p3r4 k0j07,RS,1.0,"Classic corporate waste!I don't have a bank account, so I decided to accept a $25 gift card in exchange for my services, with the idea of later exchanging it for Bitcon through purse.io.. I redeemed the card about a month ago, no problems, $25 added to my account balance. So over the coming weeks I accepted 3 more cards, $25 each, each redeemed successfully, giving me a total balance of $100. No communication from amazon about any issues.Yesterday I make my first earn transaction through purse.io for $26.99 and my account is immediately suspended and I'm asked to provide a purchase receipt for the gift cards. I explain the same as above, and my account is now closed and $100 balance gone. So it's a gift card, that you have to gift to yourself. If you didn't buy it yourself then you have to ask the person who gave you the card for proof of payment. Imagine that! Someone, God forbid, gives it to you as a gift, they have to include a receipt of purchase and probably an affidavit too, just in case.That's real convenient. Or maybe that's just the special treatment peasants from 3rd world countries get.CORPORATE WASTE !!!",3.0,201,0.9753049240866929,0.024695075913307107,33.48938082875565,Low Trust
Jeff Peppler,US,1.0,"tired of paying extra or higher prices for same day delivery and it never shows up that day , could be up to 3 days later.  also ordered a truck part, that i needed to go on vacation this weekend clearly marked will be delivered by 5 pm Friday, its now Saturday morning and nothing, got amazon to call me on it, "" oh it will be there by 5 am, according to there tracking it will be here by 10 pm tonight, i paid a mechanic to come to my house, to install the part that still has not showed up. 700 dollars for the mechanic and now have to cancel my vacation, and will not get the hotel that i rented out for the weekend. so amazon prime lies on stuff and im out 1500 bucks due to amazon and there ass backwards customer service as well as they can NOT deliver when they say they will !!!!! time to cancel prime and shop somewhere else this is about the 10th or 11th time this has happened. ",1.0,179,0.9752694625620384,0.02473053743796161,33.244378806839194,Low Trust
