Lavette Alexander,US,1.0,"Amazon used to be GREAT but now not so much! I ordered some rollerblades and roller skates and used my job as the delivery address. Amazon delivered packages to my job on the date my items should have been delivered but my items were not with the others. I reported it back to Amazon. They did not even offer to redeliver my items but told me I needed to file a police report. Well I did as instructed and emailed the police report THREE TIMES because they basically accused me of lying saying there was no attachment, but there were 3 SEPARATE ATTACHMENTS sent from my email which contained the pdf of the police report. Then they finally say they received it but cannot verify the Pokie report and to contact them in a few days. Just a bunch of run a round BS with them!!! The customer service is terrible now!",8.0,152,0.9712274517302653,0.028772548269734743,33.143619000699296,Low Trust
