Emma,DK,1.0,"Amazon does not even deserve 1 star!Amazon Sweden is absolutely a joke! I placed 2 orders and its a nightmare where I lose money! Nothing was delivered but ofcourse I was charged with no refund.Except that everything on the site is incorrectly translated in a very poor manner ""customer service"" is not even capable to understand the easiest cases, nor being able to check order history/status of order. Where did you find these people and why do you even have customer service when there is no such capacity? Amazon dont care if you are sent the item or not. They dont refund even if there is evidence the item never reached. Instead I got a voucher of 5 EUR for new orders, applicable to Amazon shipped items only, which by the way are so overpriced with ultra expensive shipping I wonder who will order anything from that range in the first place. This is fraud! I regret I gave Amazon a change, Im returning to Ebay where I shopped for years with no issues.",50.0,174,0.9529629028000735,0.04703709719992655,34.30362154535808,Low Trust
