customer,US,1.0,"Worst company ever, said delivered a package was empty nothing in it. Second time this has happened. Refuse to refund my money. Will never ever use Amazon again. They are Horrible!! Treat your customers better, or soon you wont have any!!",4.0,41,0.9526976559967255,0.04730234400327449,32.825016246714476,Low Trust
Louise B,GB,1.0,"Worst customer service!After all, customer service is what keeps a business going, yet how is this scam of a company still going? They should not be allowed to trade in how they treat their customers!They do not care when packages get lost in transit whether they are sent back or received or even got stolen because they left them on my doorstep. They simply say ""we can't refund you"" with no reasons, then they decide to end the chat, before you get a chance to reply!Second of all, how the hell are you ment to do a complaint against a customer service representative when they say ""we will give feedback to that person"" no you idio*, I want to make a complaint against the person not giving them dam feedback to them!",9.0,132,0.9525372236992338,0.04746277630076623,33.85378940393343,Low Trust
Tom`s tips,GB,4.0,"Our printer had been sat on a coffee table for a long time. It needed a proper printer unit. Shopped around, they all seemed to be above £200 which I thought was a bit pricey. Found this one on Amazon for £183.15 It comes in black, white or pine colour. Comprises of a 3 tier steel frame, which is quite strong. The whole unit comes with wheels, so makes it easy to move. Once the printer is on the top shelf, there is plenty of storage room below, with the two remaining shelves for printer paper, cartridges and other office stationary.It is a solid piece of equipment that doesn`t take up too much space. Very pleased with this purchase and the price. I would definitely recommend this item for domestic use. Especially, if you have to work from home.",217.0,139,0.9524684600521511,0.047531539947848866,123.93574693569866,High Trust
Christina,US,1.0,This company sucks.  Takes your money in 24 hours but a refund is taking longer than 2 weeks!  The customer agent don’t even speak good English!  They do not understand enough to help!  What BS!,1.0,35,0.9522685125593887,0.04773148744061129,32.77917111908609,Low Trust
Linda C,US,1.0,"Dont try to buy anything guaranteed same day. I haven't had anything delivered same day even though guaranteed. Full of excuses about things being out of their control. This time, the items I bought are Amazon items, not delivered same day because of delay but rescheduled for delivery today. Still nothing due to issues ""beyond their control"". Their warehouse is 15 minutes from my house. There were 3 Amazon vans in my housing area all at the same time while I was driving home from work. How can their product being delivered by their vans less than 15 minutes away be out of their control 2 days straight? Then, when I ask for a refund, I get the run around and my status on the orders say I refused the packages when they delivered. IT WAS NEVER DELIVERED!!! This is the 3rd time they pulled this crap. The first two times they promised gift cards (which I never received). I don't need them anyways. Goodbye prime, goodbye Amazon!!",2.0,168,0.9522379580369208,0.047762041963079205,34.27256648402048,Low Trust
Ttessy ago,IT,2.0,"A parte alcune marche  , non so come fa Amazon a vendere robe cinesi...tipo costumi da mare o altro abbigliamento!!!! Qualità inesistente,  taglie non conforme a quelle europee..le cinesate vendette in China...",8.0,32,0.9522325767284142,0.047767423271585785,62.747316760887195,Medium Trust
Jaz,US,1.0,"Of course Amazon is a giant mega corporation that everyone will continue to use no matter how bad the service or products are, but that’s only because they have a monopoly on most online retail. It’s unfortunate, but there are better places out there with cheap prices and just as fast shipment, without the need to pay for a useless membership. My issue with Amazon is that although I pay the membership, I don’t necessarily get membership “perks” when it comes to online purchases. Amazon doesn’t care if you select two day free shipping, because you’ll get it when they feel like sending it out and they expect you wouldn’t have a problem with that, because where else will you get a $20 bedsheet set?? (Spoiler alert: Walmart is a terrible company too, but they have lower prices than Amazon, offer two day shipping on most products AND they don’t require you pay monthly for a membership). If you happen to call Amazon with an issue like, “I never received my puppy play pen! It’s been a week and I selected TWO DAY shipping!”, you’ll most likely get a half hearted fake apology, a poor excuse, and then finally, they’ll help you (that’s only after keeping you on hold for 15 minutes out of the entire 30 minute call). When they finally “help” you with an issue they created, they offer no discounts, coupon, or refunds of any kind for your time and their mistake. No, you will have to haggle for that, because a $10-$20 credit will hurt the billion dollar business and how will they pay their poor employees??? (Btw most pet supplies can be found on chewy for the same price, and chewy also offers two day shipping!). All this to say, Amazon sucks, they only reason anyone would believe it to be even a half decent business, however, is because it’s taking over smaller companies and leaving consumers “no choice” but to buy from them. But that’s a lie, there are plenty of business out their that offer similar shipping with better service, we just need to look and support them more.Edit: turns out the chat option for customer service is somehow worse?? Its not accessible at all, so if you’re someone who cannot speak on the phone for whatever reason be it disability or other, you’re out of luck if you’re looking for service with customer service. I asked about it with the agent I chatted with, they also have no clue why they’re unable to perform the same tasks as an agent on the phone would. Also, you’ll never stay with the same agent because they always pass you around to a new agent. I’m not 100% sure, but I have a feeling this is because they’re not allowed to be on a single call (or in this case, chat) for longer than whatever allotted time. It’s not only screwed up to Amazons customers, but it’s really screwed up to the employees.Edit #2: I HAVE to update because this situation I’m going through with Amazon is surreal. I’ve been in chat with them for 3 hours now and have not received any help. They just regurgitate the info I gave them back to me as if they found some sort of secret I was unaware of. After consulting with maybe the 5th associate I’ve been bounced to, I asked him for someone higher up in hopes that I would receive a simple solution quicker and he tells me that associates are not able to do that through chat, which is why i made my first edit when I explained that the accessibility for chat was COMPLETELY different from a call. However, 3 hours and 21 chat associates later, my associate writes “…allow me a moment to transfer this chat to the concerned team.” And then does! Am I in the twighlight zone right now??? My issue is by no means resolved btw because each associate takes a good 10 minutes to respond only to come back and tell me they need to read my chat, but this happens maybe 5 times per associate, and they never come back with the right info anyway! As I’m writing this, the people I was transferred to and connected with just reconnected me to someone else. Hopefully I’ll have my issue resolved by the time I get to the 50th person.Edit #3: my last associate straight up lied to me, blamed me for my issue (an earlier associate had made the mistake of cancelling my prime membership rather than giving me a credit, this last associate kept referring to it as “your request for a cancellation” as if she was upset about it) and told me that the only way to resolve this was by signing up again. When I explained that I had no interest in signing up anymore after the service I received and the time Amazon had no issue wasting, and I just wanted the credit that was owed to me, she explained that she couldn’t do it and told me there was nothing more they can do.",2.0,853,0.9521581434570964,0.04784185654290363,41.9602364053841,Low Trust
Paulo,GB,1.0,"I used to buy EVERYTHING with Amazon, as a prime member. Once I stopped being a prime member, I’m not treated like a “king” anymore, not even properly helped or respected! No, I never asked to be treated like a king, but they do that just to keep you as a prime member.So many times I called, chatted with Amazon services and gave my suggestions to contribute improve the customer experience. They never improve on anything, they keep employing people who barely speak english or don’t have proper training to sort any kind of issues.Also, if you’re buying through a third party company, they do not defend or solve a problem for you, they throw responsibilities to the seller and yourself, they say you both should sort things out between you! Basically they allow anyone to use their platform to sell anything and don’t care about the quality of the products they’re selling or what type of company it is.Amazon also sells more expensive than others online platforms, so if their customer service is useless, takes ages to sort something out and do not defend customers interests first, then what’s the point in buying with them??????These days, all that matters for Amazon is MONEY, nothing else! They forget the basics, to make money you must take into account several aspects of a business, in order to keep customers happy and coming back!I spent thousands of pounds with Amazon since 2014, but now I’m avoiding it at all costs, buying directly from sellers websites or from other platforms lime Ebay.If there are more people like me out there, make yourself be heard with honest reviews like mine. It’s the best way to make ourselves be respected and heard by a company that lost their way. Now they should lose their customers until they understand that their are the most important part of the business. You have now lost me as a customer and your app is being deleted from my phone as soon as I finish typing this review.I don’t feel like buying from a company  run by hypocrites, greedy people who allow their employees no freedom to go to the toilet or go to have lunch, when the owners have the courage to spend millions to go to space, thanks to the exploitation that they do to their employees, treating them like slaves!",31.0,393,0.9519948600564689,0.04800513994353106,36.80855761411429,Low Trust
