DebraAnna Shanghai,AU,1.0,"Signing back into Australian Amazon - Global Company but keeping the rest of us in the stone age.I travel between the UK and Australia and have not been back to Australia for a year.  Despite having the same email as verification - I needed to enter my new Australian phone number. What a nightmare!!  I am so disgusted with both the service and attitude - as the ""customer service"" person kept saying the credit card entered on the site had expired. He couldn't get past this!!  Implying that I didn't qualify for the site - I kept saying if I can enter the site I will update my payment details.  I do this regularly in the UK.I have never been able to access the Kindle site because my Kindle was brought in Australia and I lived abroad.  However, when I was back in Australia I was told to buy a new Kindle, as too much time had elapsed to link it. ",2.0,161,0.946688462712516,0.053311537287483945,34.47152190082961,Low Trust
