Iren,RU,1.0,I would never recommend this platform to purchase goods and gift cards. I got Amazon gift cards from my friends recently and made a purchase using gift cards as a payment option. Right after Amazon confirmed my order I got a notifiation by email that due to suspicious activity my account has been blocked!! Although I filled in all my credit cards and personal information. Customer service asked me to send them bills that prove my solvency which I sent. Since that I never recieved any reply from support team although I keep sending them reminders every day 10 days in a row! As I am outside the US international calls are not available for meBe careful to deal with Amazon as you are not safe buying at them!Now all my funds I had on Amazon are blocked. Support did not send back gift cards to senders either. All my messages are being ignored!,3.0,154,0.9438975182988273,0.05610248170117271,34.532549772102946,Low Trust
