Ann Varsha Stanly,IN,1.0,"Disappointed!!!!Worst experience from Amazon, especially customer service and accounts specialist team are not good, obsessed with the reply, ""you will receive a call back within 24 hours"", but never ever receives an update from them, unless and until you actually pester them. My prime account is still on hold even after submitting the documents. And Amazon doesn't consider complaints from an unregistered email id, my luck is so good that I wasn't aware that email id was of so much importance in Amazon, even though they have kept an option to register using mobile phone.",1.0,95,0.9417645976364939,0.058235402363506106,33.97738986018315,Low Trust
Vinicius Zuchi,DE,1.0,"It is the third time that I order an item, on their system it states as ""delivered"" but in reality the item never arrived. In one of these three cases in their system there was even a picture of my supposed delivered item on the entrance of my building, only for me to get there and see absolutely nothing! Complete disregard for the customers...Not to mention in another situation where my package did arrive, but the box of the product was severely damaged and there was missing items on the inside!!!Awful user experience, I am only giving 1 star because I can't give 0",1.0,104,0.9414855367739755,0.05851446322602449,34.09229635255193,Low Trust
Donna Gale,US,1.0,"Amazon Delivery Truck Driver Rams into Garage and now I'm stuck paying for it, SHAME ON AMAZON!If you're living in the state of Rhode Island, BEWARE of Amazon delivery drivers! My husband and I recently had our garage rammed into. When we filed a police report with the pictures of the driver and truck and submitted a claim to amazon they simply responded with no witnesses, no video. Hope you understand! Now I'm working with our Homeowners insurance, but please invest in camera security, apparently this is a new occurrence happening in multiple homes in Rhode Island. They will not do anything unless you have video. SHAME ON YOU AMAZON, taking advantage of your loyal customers. Not anymore, buyers beware of amazon!",1.0,122,0.9414358564705264,0.05856414352947359,34.29668726621008,Low Trust
S.W,GB,2.0,"Amazon is a great place to shop, but select amount of delivery drivers need to learn how to read the safe locations and not just dump on doorsteps and then they get stolen. Quite afew parcels of mine have gone missing and I’ve received a refund or replacement and now I get an email saying my account is suspicious activity and it could be closed. Get your facts Amazon I’ve lost out on products I’ve needed/wanted because of your drivers incompetence not mine!!!! ",28.0,83,0.9412258104153843,0.058774189584615666,63.86972462224817,Medium Trust
