Jane Culley,GB,1.0,"Very disappointed. Bought a phone for my elderly mother and on receiving it the stylus was missing and the ringer didn’t work. So I did as instructed by Amazon to contact the 3rd party seller. The Seller came back offering me 15% and then 30% discount to keep the phone!! Why would I keep a phone that doesn’t work?!!This was so called escalated by the “a-z team” who frankly have done nothing. I am having to chase this every day. I was told to send the itemBack to a now UK address which l did and was told to pay for a signature which I did and although it has been signed for I have just been told that the payment is under review by the ‘payment team’. What the hell is going on at Amazon? This used to be a good company but now it’s just going down the pan and they don’t care who goes down with them. Disappointing, very disappointing",14.0,163,0.9405702953309425,0.059429704669057504,34.79986436974003,Low Trust
