Max Learner,US,1.0,"Prime member since it was rolled out.  Last 9 months has been awful with Amazon.  Lost shipments, lost gift cards for important events, shipments delayed days from promised date. The worst change is that Amazon has destroyed its customer centric approach/promise by totally farming out ALL OF THEIR support to 3rd party, off-shore, contracted customer service centers.  We live within 1 mile of Amazon’s headquarter yet there is NO WAY to speak to anyone on our continent!!  Amazon has NOT empowered these agents to do anything but make empty promises, lie, and do anything to get you off the phone or chat.  And because the FOX is watching the HEN HOUSE, Amazon’s now un-caring executive staff is blinded to what really goes on with the very people who provide a paycheck to these same self-important executives while they indulge themselves with million dollar bonuses while laying off thousands of US workers!  This is truly a ROTTEN company now!  We plan to look ANYWHERE else to shop!  ",2.0,166,0.9334148314605475,0.06658516853945251,35.191288713007395,Low Trust
