Aaron Ellerbrock,US,1.0,"While Amazon is convenient, they are useless when there is an issue. Somehow, someone got the number for my business debit card and racked up charges on Amazon. The card was not a card in my account nor did they use my account to make purchases, just my card. I of course called the bank and put stop payments on these purchases and they suggested I reach out to Amazon. Well, Amazon sure doesn't want to hear from you!!! They limit you to 200 characters to explain the issue. I tried three time to tell them the problem and they continued to send me an automated email that says ""we looked at your account and have determined there has been no suspicious activity"" and then they would close my case. HEY...AMAZON...I said it three times...it is not on my account. Someone used my card to purchase on their own account!! No matter how hard I tried, I got the same response every time. From their response, it is apparent they did not even read the 200 character messages I sent. Hey Jeff Bezos...we are not all billionaires and can't afford when there is fraud on a card. Do better Amazon. With all the money you have you should have a dedicated department to assist. Truly frustrating, disappointing, and sad that you care so little for the customers that made you what you are.",2.0,233,0.9309759508774957,0.06902404912250426,36.06477508652341,Low Trust
Jeff Cunningham,US,1.0,"Today, our Office Manager requested that the Amazon Driver make his deliveries to the rear of the building (we are a place of business). A sign is posted on the front door saying to do so as well.We found our packages in the parking lot, behind the truck of one of our employees...in the pouring rain!!Amazon Drivers are unprofessional, careless and irresponsible!!I've seen it over and over again... If you dislike Amazon Drivers actions like I do, post your experiences here.",1.0,81,0.9307385615829628,0.06926143841703725,34.3716529640375,Low Trust
JustAnswer Customer,US,1.0,"I don't know what is happening with Amazon. It used to be that you would get fantastic service and customer support, but lately, everything is a mess. I bought a pair of shoes and got the wrong size, so they sent me a replacement, and I got the wrong size again. I decided to return the item and get the shoes from a different place, and two weeks later, I haven't received my refund!!! I also bought a Fire Stick, and it is defective, so Amazon again offered a replacement, but the replacement never came when I called Amazon again, saying that I even had an email with a tracking number. Now they are saying that it was a mistake from the customer representative, and they can not send me a replacement even when the item is under warranty.  I’m a Prime member and basically I buy everything on Amazon but never again!! ",6.0,153,0.9306994345384065,0.06930056546159347,35.181236910208106,Low Trust
Alun,GB,1.0,"Never ever ever ever order a Kayak through Amazon to third party seller. Due to go on kayak holiday with children but the kayak never arrived despite taking the £255. Gutted. Amazon keep blaming the supplier. Supplier is “Sunny Sales” 252 Bath Road, Edinburgh… no phone number!! Disgusting customer service from Amazon again. The least they could do is send a replacement from their Amazon stock. My children are heartbroken that their summer kayak holiday is ruined because of fraudulent supplier and poor Amazon management. DONT EVER USE THEM!!",22.0,89,0.9305680058798855,0.06943199412011447,34.46991714851834,Low Trust
J Lindsay,GB,1.0,"Been a seller on Amazon for 2 years. What people don’t know is that when they pay for prime and they get free delivery.Amazon don’t pay for it. In fact Amazon don’t pay for anything stock delivery nothing, when a person sends something back to Amazon they don’t know Amazon charges the seller for the postage and re stocking fees and the seller looses a lot more money than people think.So while Amazon profits allThe time no matter what the seller pays for everything and lots are loosing everything.I have recently spent £35,000 to start an Amazon account that was with Smart FBA (fulfilled by Amazon) and in that two years all I have to show for it is less than £3,000 back. I spent £25,000 to get my account set up and have spent £10,000 in the products/clothes and shoes etc, all that for less than £3,000 back in total.It’s all grossly unfair. I have written to Andy Jassy and Jeff Bezos 9 times in 12 months and not once I have had a reply, that to me says it all, Shocking to say the least. My advice is shop elsewhere………spare the sellers because eventually no body will be able to afford to sell on there, Amazons greed will put an end to that!!!!",36.0,215,0.9305089290028528,0.06949107099714724,35.88621928176987,Low Trust
Chris Adkins Rutkey,US,1.0,"On Saturday 9/14/19 around 10:00 am a driverless Amazon truck went by my house headed toward another house! I screamed, I ran, I caught up to the truck and unable to get in while it was in motion, I could only turn the wheel to take it of course before it hit a house! Another person jumped in and put the truck in park after my turning the wheel slowed it down and my screams got their attention. The driver 4 houses down delivering the package comes jogging up to the truck that's stopped in the middle of someone's front lawn, looks at me and without a word, he jumps in and flee's. The neighbors video shows him run the stop sign at the corner as he sped away! I reported it and the fact that my arm hurt me for several days. I pulled the muscle reaching up and yanking on the wheel so hard. It was very sore. After repeating the story to numerous people over a couple weeks time, the final response from Amazon was to call my own auto insurance that they should cover any injury! NOT EVEN A THANK YOU FOR SAVING A PERSONS HOUSE FROM IMPACT. Not a THANK YOU for anything. SHAME on them.",1.0,211,0.9303415270737406,0.06965847292625937,35.849721178561985,Low Trust
Fanny Clante,DK,1.0,"I bougt my first item on Amazon.uk, an Roii parka faux fur jacket, i recieved it quickly as i paid an huge amount so i could track the package, but the jacket i recieved was nothing like on the picture, poor chinese quality, the fabric sound like paper you croll up, the faux fur was the badest quality i have ever seen, Roiii did have good reviews on Amazon, but how with that poor copy  jackets, now Amazon had removed my review on their store, that seems even more quirius to me, do they only sell poor quality on their store, NEVER EVER WILL I BUY ON AMAZON AGAIN, LETS SEE IF I GET A FULL REFUND OF MY MONEY....!!!!",8.0,120,0.9300822655591339,0.06991773444086613,34.84193271194796,Low Trust
Sean Doherty,GB,1.0,"Worst customer 'journey' and by far the worst complaints 'journey i've ever experienced in my life! I've called Amazon 5 different times since around November 2017 (now coming up for March 2018) to get a simple, easy fix complaint resolved but after numerous promises of call backs and resolutions I have't even received an email of acknowledgment let alone a call or resolution. Terrible service for such a big company. Out of pocket, been detrimental with no care or customer service from Amazon. Worst company ever! I've spent thousands of pounds over the years with this company but now I'm looking to cancel prime membership, tell everyone I know to cancel theirs and not use Amazon anymore. Useless staff!!",1.0,119,0.9300207168707811,0.06997928312921886,34.833793096449725,Low Trust
MR J FISHER,GB,1.0,Don’t normally have a problem with these sellers but ordered a fountain was told it was going to be delivered on one day then they changed it to another day then was told it would be here only to find out yes they change the day for the second time?.So all in all IF it comes it will be seven days days later totally not happy with this it was a present but waste of time as the person I bought it for has gone back home.Hope you’re happy with your Selves I’m not and this will be my last purchase.Disgusting why of treating your customers!!!!,34.0,106,0.9299805434899827,0.07001945651001729,34.68998011658331,Low Trust
Mr. Sen,US,5.0,"Amazon is an amazing company. I ordered beats solo pro with fast delivery during the pandemic, because my neighbors are screaming in their backyard everyday. For some reason, the shipping got messed up and it said delivery exception, I called support and they gave me a full refund and said I can keep the product, that's 299 beats solo pro for free! In addition, they also gave me 50 dollars of promotion credit! I received the headphones just now, 2 days later, but for free! Thank you amazon!",1.0,88,0.9298348646387915,0.0701651353612085,154.4953571606572,High Trust
