Shirley,US,1.0,"If you live in an apartment, I suggest you NEVER buy from amazon! My kids are always buying things online and sometimes from amazon. My daughter just ordered something and she changed the delivery location because they always leave it outside my door and NEVER knock to let me know its there (regardless of the note I write telling them to knock or leave it at the office). They OBVIOUSLY can't read! And they did it again tonight (even though it was suppose to be delivered to a different address). I told you, can't read! And we have had many packages stolen from our porch before. I'm so ANGRY right now! DON'T BUY FROM AMAZON because they don't care about your packages, just your money.",2.0,125,0.9293055943752881,0.07069440562471185,34.93685152071961,Low Trust
