Darren,GB,1.0,This company is absolutely crazy! They think its OK for you to not receive a item they then refund you but then make threats they will close your account on the basis you've requested many refunds we'll yeah ... I've not received what I've paid for!!,37.0,46,0.9282119332700862,0.07178806672991378,34.105387632625806,Low Trust
Mark Smith,GB,1.0,"Amazon groceries.I did an order through Amazon (groceries) for a delivery between 2200hrs and 2400hrs.The delivery was marked as ""packed and ready"" midnight came and went, it then said ""we are late, but we will deliver as soon as possible"" 0200hrs, still nothing!.Then even later I got a ""you delivery has been cancelled?""Money for shopping is still pending, and i'm unable to spend money pending on more food? This is a totally unacceptable AMAZON! Rang up Amazon (Anna) to be told its your ""banks fault!"" With no explanation why my order was cancelled? Three days later over £110 still pending and still I'm unable to get any food! The amount of stress and anxiety this is causing is unacceptable.AMAZON GROCERIES Liverpool, delivering to Widnes, Cheshire.⁰/¹⁰.Update; it ended up taking seven full days for the pending (£118) to be usable again.Beware Amazon groceries buyers!",2.0,143,0.9281411971616479,0.07185880283835211,35.19697827988732,Low Trust
Victoria,GB,1.0,"Wish I could give zero stars!! It all started 8 days ago when I placed an order for a luggage set. Everything seemed fine until I looked at my orders the next day and noticed that it needed a revised payment method. I did just that and the same happened again. I rang my card company and they said everything eas ok there end. I then tried a few other cards which did the same. I rang and was assured it was resolved. It was not. Tried again, didn’t work so rang again. Was assured it would be fixed and I’d get a call back within 30 minutes. I did not. Tried again, didn’t work so rang again. Was told it will be passed to the payment team and they would definitely resolve it. They did not. Tried again and again and rang them back to be greeted by a fourth advisor that said aw I don’t know should I just cancel it. The set had been discontinued and that was the last one available in the UK which I’d explained. Still no further help so I cancelled every subscription I have with them. I then emailed my issues I have had with them. Since then I have received countless calls directing me to an advisor while they argued that I called them. I did not. One advisor then said we’ll thanks for calls you have a nice day. Terrible customer service. All I wanted to do was order an item simple and effective. Well that didn’t happen. I’ve had to deal with 8 days of crap. Keep acting this way and it won’t just be my family who won’t order from you again. I’ll be sure to make sure all my family and friends hear about your terrible service too so they can decide if you’re worth the hassle. You clearly aren’t as customer focused as you make out to be!!",7.0,322,0.9280193620396835,0.07198063796031651,37.21092197092665,Low Trust
