A G H,US,1.0,"I ordered 5 items on Sunday for delivery on Tuesday and Wednesday. An inflatable dinghy and accessories. The accessories arrived along with a drum kit, no dinghy, now I have an engine to attach to a bass drum, I doubt it will float! I sent Amazon feedback about the picture they send confirming delivery two days ago, no contact from them at all! On their website this morning, no way to contact someone, but I can return my dinghy if I wish! Chance would be a fine thing. Avoid dealing with this company, in theory the offering is good, but if you can mistake a dinghy for a drum kit, well enough said. I'll update if anyone bothers to contact me!",1.0,121,0.9229794326292647,0.07702056737073526,35.20829140835729,Low Trust
