Fuckyoy,US,1.0,"Do you know where your Amazon product ships from? I doubt it.. Does Amazon want you to know where in the world your product is coming from?       I doubt it! Should you be informed about where the product you want to order is coming from before you order it? Hell yes!Most people would be surprise to know that 60-75% of Amazon products are cheap knock-offs coming from China.! Do you want corvid-19 sent to your house direct from China, i don't and neither should you.!  I'd also like to know where the product I'm ordering is coming from so i can make an informed decision of whether or not Amazon can realy and logically deliver it in two days or if thier just blowing smoke up my butt..   I think it's time ""we"" the customer tell Amazon that we'd like to know where the products we want are coming from...",1.0,150,0.9193380378475606,0.08066196215243937,35.71565559500279,Low Trust
jane hunter,US,1.0,"Amazon has no customer service and no security. My account was compromised with what is called ""Amazon Brushing"". I called immediately and talked to a Juan who thought had it all under control and my account would be placed on temporary hold. I was told to hold on to the packages and they would be needed for evidence because of the tracking nbr on them. I waited two weeks then talked to a Joseph and a Ann from security. I again was told they were working on it. Well now 6 weeks later, I just called Amazon Customer Service again and was told all they could do was put the account on hold and I would need to open a new account.  That means I have no order history.  Really this is suppose to be a high tech company and the best they can do for fraud activity is put your account on hold/freeze for forever. Doesn't sound like a big company to me.  Sounds like a start up company.  Too bad Amazon has the multiply for on line ordering.  Since they are about the only way to order on line and hold all the ""marbles"" I guess they don't have to really  worry about dissatisfied customers.  So order at your own risk!!!!",1.0,213,0.9192051964190632,0.08079480358093682,36.4289718111276,Low Trust
