Leone McGee,US,1.0,Customer service has gone to crap with Amazon! You have a bunch of foreign people on the phone who can barely understand you. The. When you call because the drive puts a note on delivery that says HANDED TO CUSTOMER when they didn’t even walk it to the door the. We go to look around for it and they didn’t even deliver it. So between the customer service and the lazy drivers. It’s pathetic!!! But instead of firing those drivers that don’t do the job correctly. They then won’t return your money for their own lazy employees….,1.0,97,0.9136132383996625,0.08638676160033754,35.40739192185647,Low Trust
Andreea Alexandra Nanescu,GB,1.0,"Lately all amazon Prime One day delivery failed to be delivered the next day,yesterday I have bought again a duvet with Prime One day delivery which was supposed to be delivered Today and guess what,the delivery is delayed untill the 26th!!!! This company does not respect the delivering days that they promise and do not give you any compensation for breaching basically the contract.",29.0,64,0.9135753499577653,0.08642465004223465,35.03912369672755,Low Trust
KIRSTEN,US,1.0,"I,  like many others got an email telling me that my item had been delivered.  Surprise,  surprise,  it had not.  This is the 3rd time in two months (1st time was was twice on the same day)  they have pulled this on me.  I don't care that the drivers show an item as delivered when it has not been.  What kind of company tells it's employees to flat out lie to it's customers?  When your item shows as being delivered,  they ""claim"" they can't help you,  as your item has indeed been delivered.  I don't care if my item is going to be late.  Just tell me it will be late.  Do not tell your employees to lie and say it's there.   They are also stealing my money,  as when I am using Prime,  to get said item quicker,  I am NOT getting that item at all,  because it's still with the driver,  who lied and said I have my item.  This has been a very normal practice for Amazon.  Make em pay for Prime,  and don't give them the items we have all ready been paid for.Yeah boss,  your right!  What a wonderful business model!!! And don't even get me started on the error filled emails I have gotten,  if your going to copy and paste your emails,  all least take 30 seconds to proof read it before you send it.  It makes Amazon,  on a whole,  look like complete morons.",2.0,242,0.9134902772075323,0.08650972279246771,37.04001221926444,Low Trust
