Afi,US,1.0,"I am so frustrated with Amazon! They keep increasing the annual cost for Amazon Prime and the service keeps getting worse and worse. I am sick and tired of them promising me that an item will be delivered by a certain date and failing to do so! If it is an item that you really need by a certain date it really puts you in a bind. Not only does it leave stuck without the item, but then when the item arrives too late, you have to deal with the hassle of returning it! They either need to start delivering items on time or compensate their customers for the inconvenience! I will not be renewing my Prime membership.",1.0,118,0.9119094280419897,0.08809057195801029,35.72814048797343,Low Trust
