Kelli McGrath Naylor,US,1.0,"SHAME on you Amazon!!  I have a defective item that is outside the return window.  I asked for a FAIR credit on my account and your management, LEXI, refused AND she also wouldn't give me her boss's name (she said it was against policy).  I spend A LOT of money through AMAZON, including being a Prime member for a very long time..that spending will NOW STOP....I will be using a company that appreciates my business from now on!!",3.0,78,0.9021306634803119,0.0978693365196881,35.76839671942243,Low Trust
