Erickson Castro,US,1.0,"Amazon is like a big bully, if the product is right and works fine, no problem, but if you have to return something then they give you all this headaches, i have return several items that were defective and the return center always either don’t receive the items or then they claim is not the item or serial number you sent in order to keep your money, i am honestly going back to the old ways, i have had enough, I’ve lost so much money and the problem is that it takes so long, items get lost in the mail on their way back, then they claim they did receive it but is the wrong item, i wanted to see what happens if i ask them for the so wrong product ti be mail back to me but they claim Amazon destroyed it, what a lie, we all know Amazon doesn’t destroy anything, they sell the items ti a third party company in pallets and then other retailers refurbished them and sell them.So no item back but also no money back , they pretty much tell you, Screw you, and there’s nothing we can do, as a Custumer i think there should be a way to report them to the cops, they are taking advantage and getting richer because they are stealing from people!!!!",2.0,224,0.8981278307378123,0.10187216926218767,37.60622764426474,Low Trust
