Beach Life,US,1.0,0 Stars for Scamazon! I ordered a Chris Brown Hoodie on August 2021 and it was not delivered. I requested a refund and Amazon assured me I would receive it within 30 days! It is December 2021 and Scamazon never returned my money. I am dealing with my bank to recover my money. The seller disappeared off of Amazon soon after I purchased my merch. Beware of the sellers and Scamazon! No wonder they are filthy rich because they don't deliver your merch but they keep your hard earned money. I am done with Scamazon for good! 👎🙄,2.0,98,0.8968544574503624,0.10314554254963759,36.25654801923734,Low Trust
