Laura,GB,5.0,Never had a problem with Amazon. Think they are great! Myself and my partner are always ordering from here and are exceptionally happy! I’ve ordered so many different types of products from nail stuff to a barbecue etc etc. Never had a problem. I love the fact you can order some items and receive them the same day. Not a lot of companies have this to offer and I think this is what makes Amazon stand out against the rest of them! We also have Amazon Prime and like the different movies/tv shows available. Keep doing what you are doing!,14.0,100,0.8923903757985691,0.10760962420143094,156.50218620165876,High Trust
Suzana deist,US,1.0,"I am very desapoitend with Amazon company... My sister's bought several items and a backpack of mindcraft for  my son birthday's.  She did one time payment for all the items was purchased it. She received a information of 3 different dates of delivering. Until them we ok it...the only we have not  reived yet was the mindcraf backpack....were supposed to arrived no later than July 17.. week pass by and nothing. I contacted my sister to let her know that we did not receive the package.  I asked her to check Amazon site. She said the information on her order was gone , not information or delay or not having the item...nothing. I know she order because I saw it was there and was promised by Amazon to be delivered it!  If Amazon cannot deliver the item because is not available; should had offered another option right way and not saying is going to be delivered from theses dates as was promised it .  we had the expectation to receive ; included my son!.  Amazon needs improve on their costumer service.  We did not received any information of the item not be available. For now on take pictures of everything from purchasing to the dates of delivering.  So, they can't say you are not laying; and they have to respond from their mistake. It is not the first  time this happen. I waitted and waitted from a tennis shoes I was supposed to received it. I could not find any information...so I had to contact them to see what happened.  Should received some credit or coupon from the inconvenience!  They don't care ! They can't even talk with you properly! 😒",1.0,281,0.8923501858414027,0.10764981415859731,38.53448173428993,Low Trust
Mary Malisko,US,1.0,"I am sorry to say that Amazon has just lost me aa a customer. I always was able to order from Amazon with ease, now all of a sudden it has become a big deal to order. It won't accept my passcode without verifying my email address. No one seems to be able to help me. One customer service rep had me create a new account & even though i saved my password, it still won't work unless i go to my email & verify email address. Every time I close out of Amazon & check email & get passcode & go back it says invalid.  2nd rep tells me I have to keep the screen open to Amazon. I keep telling them I can't do that & even spoke to a supervisor & he couldn't even help me. Told me there is no other way to log in.Well if this is such a big deal now I'll order from someplace else. I used to love shopping with Amazon, but you just lost me & I told supervisor that & he didn't seem to really care. So much for appreciating your customers! He didn't even attempt to have me place my order over the phone. Bye bye Amazon!!!     Mary Malisko",1.0,210,0.8921190773866575,0.10788092261334248,37.74962661300027,Low Trust
