Sarah Potter,US,1.0,"I ordered a glasses case from Amazon that was a Prime 2 day shipping product.  I am a paid Prime subscriber.  I expect to get what I pay for and my Prime orders on my doorstep 2 days after shipment.  Lately I've noticed that it takes a week or so for many items to even ship and another week to be delivered.  And to add insult to injury Amazon refused to publish my negative review.  My review stated the same thing as I'm stating here.  No profanity.  Nothing untrue.  Just the facts.  So, buyer beware!!!!  Not only will your Prime subscription of $125 a be ignored, you will no be allowed to voice your opinion on the matter. All those rave reviews you see for a product are allowed.  Negative reviews are censored.",5.0,133,0.8914707511425259,0.10852924885747406,36.918330081684694,Low Trust
