noemi guetta,GB,1.0,Paid for prime and I will never buy again from them! I paid from prime because the delivery guarantee but in the end they are not delivering by the day promised and they create excuses to explain why (they literally delivered for people that live in my same building the same day they supposed to deliver my parcel and costumer service said that they try to deliver but they were an able…). It is cheaper and safer to buy on eBay as you can still have fast delivery and you are more protected. The costumer service at Amazon it’s awful and I asked the email to make a complaint but they did not give me anything!!! Awful,2.0,117,0.8877628496536577,0.1122371503463423,36.92425235747415,Low Trust
Shane,GB,1.0,"Amazon removed £30.03 from my account without contacting me about an A-Z Guarantee claim or communicating with me about it at all. Amazon refunded this buyer the FULL amount without any prior warning or communication with myself.After contacting Amazon (Case ID4660614962), they say:""We have reviewed the buyer’s claim and the information you provided for order 202-3006323-3497911. You are responsible for the claim because we contacted you on 28 September 2018 but you did not represent the claim within 3 calendar days.We understand you may not agree with our decision, but the A-to-z Guarantee claim will remain unchanged.""Despite this decision which was made by Amazon without my consent, I showed Amazon customer support picture proof of proof of shipment to the buyer. This includes the postage paid, the postal method, proof of shipment, place of postage... Pretty much everything you need to know.I told Amazon they did not contact me, not one time, and also, if their website allowed me to attach proof of postage, there wouldn't have been an issue to begin with, but it does not. So they put a 3 day tab on my account (without contacting me) for me to provide this. So I'm supposed to find out that I need to email this to their payments-guarantee email as their website will not accept my proof of postage, it's simply ridiculous!I have provided Amazon proof of postage via their payments-guarantee email account, however, they will not reverse this decision and will not claim any responsibility. This is NOT a business which inspires trust by it's sellers.The bottom line is, I have shipped out an item. I have proof of postage.Amazon refunded the buyer without contacting me and refuse to reimburse me.So I have lost: My item AND my money. I have ALSO lost £8.35 on shipping.What do Amazon have to say about this? : ""We understand you may not agree with our decision, but the A-to-z Guarantee claim will remain unchanged.""... Not even an apology. Disgusting!I am demanding:1. Refund my money at once! For a total of £30.032. An apology for the way this was handled.",77.0,349,0.8876242755659698,0.11237572443403021,39.533536642340884,Low Trust
Rosie Brocklehurst,GB,1.0,"Small issue. Small amount of money involved. But Amazon Customer Service this time have been very poor indeed. Twice! It's the principle of the issue. I bought a small sturdy 8"" folding standing step so I could reach blinds in my hallway . I am partially disabled. The step arrived from Nubiru via Amazon with a broken hinge, with a leaflet saying do not use if damaged. I had to repackage the item and arrange to get to a post office which is difficult for me, given my disability, and all the inconvenience you can just imagine! The post office is half a mile away. On top of this, I had to pay for return postage as this item was not under the Prime Membership for which I pay £7.99 per month. I don't use any other Amazon services (as I don't know how to or whether it is worth it, other than Prime for postage). I did not receive any notification that the seller had received the item (which was only worth £5.74pence. Not a lot I know. So I chased. They then wanted proof of postage. I had to use my camera to sort this out and sent proof of postage to them via my email. (It goes to Amazon and is then forwarded). I received the £5.74 but not the postage reimbursement so I am out of pocket for a broken item by £3.00!  I sent a message to the seller and rang Amazon customer service. They also sent a message to the seller on Monday last. They said if I had not heard back in 48 hours I was to contact Amazon again. I did this today It was a call centre in India I believe. I called this morning and the person I spoke to wanted to have a copy of the post office receipt I photographed. I found it on my system and sent it and then she said she could not read it , and I needed to photograph it again. I am so fed up. I obviously would not have got even £5.74 back if I had not sent the proof of postage to Nubiru, the market place seller. I have had to to sort out my camera and then upload the picture  as I do not have or use a suitable smartphone. I feel like closing down  my account with Amazon, where I have spent many £thousands over 20 or more years, and speak to someone higher up about this. And Customer Service used to be so good at Amazon. I think it is attrition -their new policy - to be so unhelpful  they don't have to reimburse the money themselves and want me to give up. Thousands of small amounts unclaimed  add up to a lot of money for Mr Bezos.",53.0,471,0.8874402700503504,0.11255972994964958,40.91121700785825,Low Trust
Marcel Marcel,NL,1.0,"Vorige week 6-6-2022 heb ik 2 SUPER-RIESEN-MYSTERY-BOXEN from AMAZON voor totaal 100 euro gekocht! De website doet voorkomen dat je een palet met surpriseboxen met meerdere artikelen zal ontvangen. Ze houden die informatie express heel wazig. In werkelijkeid zijn het 2 kleine doosje van 55x55 cm met als inhoud een massagun van 35 euro en een mini bevochtiger te koop bij Ali Express voor 15 euroJe wordt gewoon opgelicht, je krijgt niet wat je zou mogen verwachten en geen waar voor je geld.Letzte Woche 6-6-2022 habe ich 2 SUPER-RIESEN-MYSTERY-BOXES bei AMAZON für insgesamt 100 Euro gekauft! Die Website gibt den Anschein, dass Sie eine Palette von Überraschungsboxen mit mehreren Artikeln erhalten. Sie halten diese Informationen absichtlich sehr verschwommen. Tatsächlich werden die 2 kleinen Schachteln von 55 x 55 cm, die eine Massagepistole für 35 Euro und einen Mini-Luftbefeuchter enthalten, bei Ali Express für 15 Euro zum Verkauf angeboten.Man wird einfach abgezockt, man bekommt nicht das was man erwarten sollte und kein Gegenwert fürs Geld.Last week 6-6-2022 I bought 2 SUPER-RIESEN-MYSTERY-BOXES from AMAZON for a total of 100 euros! The website makes it appear that you will receive a palette of surprise boxes with multiple items. They keep that information very blurry on purpose. In actuality, the 2 small boxes of 55x55 cm containing a massagun of 35 euros and a mini humidifier are for sale at Ali Express for 15 euros.You just get ripped off, you don't get what you should expect and no value for money.",2.0,247,0.8874234877932633,0.1125765122067367,38.39943693955725,Low Trust
Rick James,US,1.0,"Amazon is straight trash! They are crooks. They allow companies to sell horrible products on their page and then the pretend to be innocent, well you are just as guilty Amazon because you have been told over and over by your customers but you do not remove the sellers! They false advertise to get you to buy certain items by offering expedited prime shipping, (same day delivery) in some cases and then the item never shows or shows really late. The only compensation they offer for the inconvenience is to have you spend more money with them with a stupid promo credit that can only be used on Amazon shipped and sold items (which are trash products too). I don't want to give you more money, I want my damn money back and/or a credit towards the items I already bought!!No matter how many complaints you make they continue the nonchalant attitude because they know that Ebay and Walmart or other shipping companies don't have the same shipping options. Its a shame because they will keep this poor service until they have some competition that can actually threaten their place in the market...Also when you try to give a bad review they pull it down so I plan on putting this review everywhere I can. I was actually surprised to see the number of bad reviews were almost 50%...I didn't think that anyone would allow people to tell the ugly side of that company lol.",2.0,245,0.8871474212222182,0.11285257877778176,38.390806168277756,Low Trust
Teasha Beme,US,2.0,So again I tried giving Amazon another chance to get it right and yet again they FAILED BIG TIME!!! I purchased Amazon prime again per Amazon request to give them another chance and they had gotten better. I returned 2 items and it stated that my refund would go back to the card it was paid with but that did not happen Amazon chose to put my refund on a gift card and top it off with taking the $12.99 prime fee from it. I called about this matter to which a representative would try to convince me that I chose to put it on a gift card. NO MA’AM I DID NOT! I was then told that because my refund was put on a gift card and the prime was deducted from it that it couldn’t go back on the purchase card. So you’re telling me that because Amazon decided to make an unauthorized decision to move my payment to a card I did not ask for and no one can explain why??? Oh that’s not good... I’m not understanding this at all. The returns were requested day of delivery and returned the next day or so. This move really just annoyed me. I don’t feel I can trust Amazon. You played with my money yet again and during the WRONG TIME...Canceled Membership and service... App Deleted... Very disappointed...,2.0,230,0.8871123153144795,0.11288768468552046,68.22430571492661,Medium Trust
Teodora,GB,1.0,"Terrible customer service. They have no complaints procedures, treat you horribly, hanging on the phone in your face whilst you still speak, won't provide proper invoices for important and expensive devices. It is so horrible! I spent thousands of pounds on their website to be treated this awful way! I will stop my membership with them and never look back! it feels like a scam, with no complaints and nothing that can be ever done if something goes wrong",3.0,79,0.8869650652696554,0.11303493473034465,36.53789367987113,Low Trust
Jonathon,GB,1.0,"We have had major problems with items never turning up from amazon's chosen delivery service 'amazon logistics', just like soo sooo many people!And now amazon tell me that I must pay for items I never receive or they will prohibit my account from ever buying things that never arrive again?!Their horrific customer service team conducted an 'investigation' and the results of their 'investigation' was that ""amazon does not make mistakes"" and ""they will not discuss it any further"", so clearly a comprehensive investigation!But I guess this is the power that the largest online marketplace has?!Pay for items they never actually deliver or get banned........Complain to them about their customer service and get blocked......Truely the ""Earth's Most Customer-Centric Company""",8.0,118,0.8867741237673877,0.11322587623261227,36.984905701703525,Low Trust
