Jane Emma,US,3.0,Slow delivery! Good product!,1.0,4,0.8854099893734737,0.1145900106265263,95.77436873098979,High Trust
4T's,US,1.0,"First of all, I never write reviews, but I feel compelled to after getting off the phone with customer service regarding the status of my refund.  I ordered my husband a New England Patriots jacket for Christmas and the sizing ran small so I exchanged the jacket for a larger size, but instead received a Chargers jacket (not to mention the larger size cost an additional $33)!  That was disappointing and returned the jacket in December.  My account shows the jacket was received on January 8th and ""refund is processing"".  Well, it's been over 2 weeks, which prompted my call today.  I had a very hard time understanding the first associate and she put me on a long hold and returned to say, "" yes, we will process your refund and then she proceeded to say she would return a majority of the refund to a gift card.""  I was very confused as I had purchased both items on my debit card and never used a gift card.  She kept repeating that I had used a gift card and didn't seem to care what I was saying.  I asked to speak with a supervisor, and after a 5-7 minute hold was connected to a supervisor who was equally hard to understand and didn't seem to care whatsoever about my experience.  She said she had requested my refund to be returned to my debit card with no explanation of how long that would take.  When I asked how much longer, she said it could be another 5 business days.  Really!!  I've purchased some rather expensive items from Amazon and this is my first experience with a return.  Absolutely ridiculous!  It was very clear that either of these women cared less about me as a customer.  And, I feel if I hadn't called I would have never received a refund.",1.0,308,0.8850773641174642,0.11492263588253582,39.2009831682154,Low Trust
Jan kaliszeski,US,1.0,An order I placed for a costume was originally to be deliverrd 6/25 is now delayed til 6/26 according to my account. This order is for a costume that my granddaughter had to have for curtain call on 6/27 for a musical.  Customer service could not help me to see if order was lost or damaged and could not get an order to me in time.  They gave me a number for logistics and the girl who spoke broken english told me the new delivery date of 6/27!  She could help me with nothing!  Amazon cannot be depended on!  Never again will i place an order with Amazon!,1.0,108,0.8849829911966223,0.11501700880337773,36.96229183108308,Low Trust
