Sturmbringer,DE,5.0,"Stop searching for the world's best retailer, you found it! Good pricing, fast and easy to manage website, splendid customer service and never one fail in 14 years!As I live in Germany receiving the shipments takes a while. Out of hundreds of orders since then only one box got lost - Amazon instantly refunded the price. They even phone you in Germany if you want.It's a pleasure ordering from them!",18.0,72,0.883846282197654,0.11615371780234596,156.6153134840601,High Trust
J Rene,US,1.0,"At Amazon the customer service representatives are not trained well and Amazon does not care. For instance, I bought a $ 5373.98 zero turn motor from a third party seller on Amazon. I had to summit an A to Z claim because I received a damaged unusable mower due to a crushed mower deck underneath unit. I won the claim at first but an Amazon employee  told me that I won it and since my banking services (Amazon visa credit card) due date was in a day or two,  he told me to dispute it with credit card, because it was  refunded and I wouldn’t be penalized for the dispute.  So A to Z took refund back, if you dispute the amount on your credit card A to Z won’t honor their refund.   Amazon didn’t care even if I had submitted a  Notarized witness statement of a friend visiting and who heard speaker phone calls.  Also had an witness to mover problems. Then Amazon told me to cancel dispute again. That this change would get my refund back.  Again she witnessed the speaker phone conversation. I just got lucky she was here.  Amazon took no responsibility for their workers statements concerning making or canceling the  credit card dispute in the first place and then they just dropped it.  They would not pay the return shipping and the seller will not.  This seller had bad BBB score and complaints. So I have re disputed with credit card with no other recourse. So Amazon is not your friend. So started shopping others sites with free shipping and returns. Wow I beat Amazon prices to heck and back. From 50 to 15 percent on every item plus no tax, too.  I took a friends new monthly statement of $4376.00 and shopped  those items. (They paid their bill off every month like I do.) The same exacted items, He would of saved big nearly $1000.00by buying with other non Amazon sellers was amazing (with free shipping and returns! WOW This was a shock. I think he is returning most of them. I told him to be careful with too many returns, (he likes prime streaming services,) they would bar him from Amazon, if they received to many returns.  I have decided I want to help people wake up and see the real Amazon. I want them to use Amazon not let Amazon use them.  I have Several meetings arranged with different groups this month. I will address and make aware of the Ins and outs with Amazon. I call it “Amazon Ain’t Your Friend”. I compare Amazon to Sears in the late1800- 1930. And Amazon will fall too.  I just do not ever want Amazon to rip off another person. They obviously don’t check out their sellers. At the end of this month, I am canceling prime ASAP. I am not stupid, I want to finish using bonus points. Got 40 dollars to go. You can keep your Amazon-visa credit card and used your points against your statement balance. Amazon has become an American Bad Habit and addiction. It would be a Tragedy for Americans to be left with only Amazon, once every other retailer goes bust because of them! Then u will be at the mercy of Amazon the Almighty!   I got a car and truck sign ordered “Amazon ain’t your friend”. So a new adventure awaits me. Good Luck. If you would like for me to give a presentation for your group, just email me, no can’t leave an email  but here’s my phone number 870-723-3625, send me a text, Attention Amazon issues. The presentation is free in the continental USA at this time. Also if I can help let me know.  I will check it out, but my opinion is Amazon doesn’t want their real policies known. I didn’t know you would lose an A to Z refund if amount was disputed on Amazon credit card. Who would of known. I couldn’t find anything information concerning A toZ refunds. This has never happened on eBay or pay pal. I had an 7800.00 dispute due the purchase of a truck. The engine blew up after delivery. I got my money back. Guys,  we the customers created a monster retailer, they have sold our information and got rich doing it. So that’s why I am doing this. I Hope I can help.  I bought a vlogging equipment from another business and returned the one from Amazon. Saved 50 bucks! Maybe You Tube is next step for me. I am retired.  So again Amazon Ain’t Your Friend, Pal!",1.0,764,0.8835377466143495,0.11646225338565053,44.39293880500883,Low Trust
lori miller,US,1.0,"The agent canceled my prime membership because I inquired about a subscription order that was delayed. Jokers…. So took my money for the 70+ order and for all my prime subscriptions ( video, music, discovery.+ and paramount +) then told me to sign back up and pay again even tho I didn’t cancel ANYTHING!!!",1.0,54,0.883426649314691,0.11657335068530905,36.43438822972255,Low Trust
