Shannon Goodman,US,1.0,"I purchased an OtterBox defender phone case on December 11 and the color was wrong so I returned it, been waiting for weeks for some kind of word on my $38 and when I call amazon iam told that they refunded a completely different card, not the one used to purchase this item but one from over a year ago Nov 2018 to be exact that I had purchased an OtterBox on over a year ago! When I pointed this out that it was a different card that was used to purchase this , Amazon didn’t seem concerned about it and said that I should try to contact the card issuer to find my money! I don’t even know what card it was ? I wasn’t given the last 4 of it or anything! I was so shocked I asked for the transcript so I could read it again. Customer service is non existent at this so called American Company! Nor do they employ anyone American at thier customer service.",1.0,170,0.87342090804797,0.12657909195203,38.23585308329976,Low Trust
