Breane Perkins,US,1.0,I will never in this lifetime order from Amazon ever again. I placed a big order for my kids Christmas gifts and realized that a couple items were duplicated. This caused me to call Amazon to speak with customer service which led me to speak to a supervisor because they cannot find my orders. Once a little discovery was done they were able to find out that my Orders were completely canceled. They claim this was done because it had been along time since I ordered from my Amazon account. After the conversation with the supervisor it was stressed to me that my card would not be charged as one item was already charged to my account. She said that my account Would be refunded what had been taken out already and would not be charged further. This was a complete lie as my account was still charged over $500. Because I was told my order was canceled I purchased items from other sites. About an hour after I received a notification that my bank account had been charged by Amazon. Again this happened after they told me my account would not be charged. Never again!!!!👎🏽👎🏽👎🏽😡😡,2.0,196,0.8727244131490339,0.12727558685096607,38.56232112605924,Low Trust
