eeing to pay for me for my time I my going rate is $23 per/hr. Then we can talk about doing research into order you already have all the info on. Great that you hidden this but I am saving our post, if I need them at a later date.0640 28 nov 19Amazon Prime Let's look into this in real-time! When you have a moment, please reach out to us via phone/chat here: (REMOVED ACCOUNT LINK), and we can provide additional assistance with this.-Joshua K.645 28 nov 19Woody A. Guevara Been there done that and problem was not fixed, still do not have item, items show up on your app. I came to you because that link didn't help. So stop trying to pass them ball and fix this.642 28 nov 19Amazon Prime Unfortunately we cannot access your account on Facebook so you would need to contact us on the link previously provided so we can assist your further.-Sarah659 28 nov 19Woody A. Guevara If I call AGAIN you are agreeing that Amazon paying me for my time?",1.0,544,0.8702477659961736,0.1297522340038264,42.58968685442576,Low Trust
