Tiby Hegedus,AR,1.0,"Funny company, don't know how they got to be so big, or are they? Logged in as usual, placed some products in my cart as normal, paid what I had to pay, and rested I will get my products as any normal person. I Guess Amazon had other plans for me, like why should I benefit from their products, who am I to attempt buying from them, like what are my titles, and what's my social status to even dream about being their costumer. So, to resume the issue, I paid and waited, they sent me an email that there was a suspicious payment and they needed to look into it. Asked for more details and proof that I was the person paying with my own card. They've asked for the payment statement(which I couldn't see because the payment was pending on their side) Sent them all the proof and maybe even more than I should have, they got to me saying it's not enough. Got more info that I am the owner of the card from my payment provider, sent them that too, guess what... Got an email stating they must close my account and there is nothing else to be talked about hahahahahahahahahah ahahahaha ahhahahahGarbage company! I can't believe it! Good there are plenty of options out there, hope they go down soon like they deserve. Have a great day everyone! And remember, keep you mental health and money safe and stay away from Amazon.",12.0,247,0.8675472738134399,0.13245272618656012,39.39324763854842,Low Trust
