Артур Сенють,GB,1.0,"Careful, Amazon - scammers and thieves! On September 11, I ordered my mother a Xiaomi Note 10 Pro phone as a gift. September 13, I received the package. There was no limit to joy until they realized that the phone was not in the box. There was Type-C charging, instructions, a case, and there was no phone. After that, I carefully checked the box, but found nothing. This caused me a lot of bewilderment - is it possible that the largest company in the world can deceive its customers.. I began to write and call in support, but they could not help me - they said to call the police. When the emotions moved away, I drew attention to the package, there was written weight - 0.4 kg.I put all the parts back in the box and put them on the kitchen scales. And what I saw was 435 grams. That is, the phone was not from the very beginning of packaging and delivery! I later explained this to support, but I was still sent to the police. Once even the consultant said goodbye and, without finishing the conversation, he hung up! Obviously, this is an internal Amazon case and the police will not solve anything, but I still turned. The police refused to even give the number a reference number. As a result of all the above, it is obvious that Amazon brazenly stole my phone! I have the video with my scales and the parcel, but I cant add the link.",1.0,253,0.8637571628271966,0.1362428371728034,39.650055487355814,Low Trust
