Heidi Wise,US,1.0,Amazon has gone from a phenomenal company to a horrible company in  just a couple of months. Returns used to be seamless and now they are a nightmare. Their customer service has become arrogant and will hang up on you when you get frustrated and upset with them. Returns are an absolute nightmare. If it’s from a third-party seller you can’t take it to Staples  you have to take it to UPS. The UPS store is 25 minutes from me! Several months ago I had a problem with a wicker chair from a third-party seller. It was a complete nightmare… the seller canceled the order and I ordered somewhere else and then they delivered the chair anyway..it was an absolute nightmare trying to get it back to the seller UPS refused to pick it up and kept asking me for a tracking number and I said I don’t have the tracking number you give me the tracking number  it’s here it’s ready to be picked up and they just refused to pick it up. Amazon‘s A-Z guarantee is an absolute joke they don’t stand behind it. I probably spend five hours of my time on this chair and trying to return it. Eventually I charged it back on my bank credit card. My bank came down on my side. If all of that isn’t bad enough now they are requiring signatures and codes in order to deliver your packages. How can someone give a signature if they are at work so your package goes back-and-forth eventually you don’t get it at all and then you can try re-ordering it and hope that you’re home when they come by for your signature. I ordered items for my brother and they sent the code to me by the time I got it to my brother it was too late the driver had already been there they tried again to deliver and he wasn’t there and eventually all the items went back to amazon. Who in the world is running this company? I understand they arehaving problems with stolen packages but the solution is that the customer doesn’t get their package at all!!! so is it worst if its stolen or to have amazon take it back because they’re not able to get your signature or some code in order to leave your package.?  I don’t know if they’ve been taken over by new management but I have never seen such a terribly run company and how that can happen in a few short months is just beyond me.,11.0,426,0.8556091834397419,0.1443908165602581,41.998004092174426,Low Trust
Mrs Russell,GB,1.0,"Ordered size 5 shoes , first pair came in sexy 4, 2nd replacement sent in size 4, 3rd replacement sent in size 4 too! Is a bloody joke , now I’m stuck with 3 pairs of size 4 shoes and have to post them back to get my money back!! Not happy at all .All you hear is “we sorry that happened to you, we gonna escalate this “ twice this year it happen, I think it’s time to go somewhere else , Amazon is loosing it.",16.0,87,0.8550500095872611,0.14494999041273893,38.22338286331782,Low Trust
Lord John,GB,1.0,Amazon UK EXTREMELY RUDE !!!!I’ve tried to contact them to sorted out an order that hasn’t arrived unfortunately they simply kept me in the phone for 1 hour and then promised a call back in few days surprisingly that never happened therefore I’ve tried to get in touch with them and they simply switch the phone call let me talking.. of course the order never arrived and lost £60 also I pay for Amazon prime every month for next day delivery. Really don’t recommend them useless and really rude.,5.0,89,0.8549075093474583,0.1450924906525417,38.252941975139706,Low Trust
Sam,GB,1.0,"Really gone off Amazon. It used to sell great quality products at reasonable prices but now it seems they've succumbed to allowing China to a foot in the door and there is just so much tat on the site I lose interest trying to find anything that doesn't resemble a cheap knock off of something. I also signed up for Amazon Prime because of benefits like next day delivery, access to music and videos but I cannot remember the last time something took less than several days to a month to arrive and you can forget listening to decent music or watching anything good that you don't have to sign up to an additional subscription for. HUGE FAIL!! I'm cancelling the membership as there isn't any benefit to having the membership. Also, they're allowing too much tat from China. I dislike all the low quality products flooding Amazon and always skip when the seller or product origin is China.Temu is another Professional tat site to avoid!!",2.0,166,0.8545539995022806,0.14544600049771939,39.13433031092074,Low Trust
