George Christoff,US,1.0,"I am an amazon Prime member and spent thousands of dollars just this year on purchases but I found they ve been playing a really simple scam with the ""gift card"" thing to make you keep buying stuff. I always pay with a debit card,and when I request a return and a refund I want it back in my bank account. Last time I made a purchase for $230 and when had to return it money automatically goes to a gift car, instead of my bank acct. Supposedly there is an option to dis-select the ""gift card"" option, but it is not exactly visible, and you wouldn't expect the money to go n a gift card when you paid with a debit card. Same day I made 3 purchases which was paid through the gift card (that is how I understood that the $230 went on a gift card). After I called to request my money to be put back in my bank account instead of the gift card, they told me that I have to return all items because they cant transfer money from a gift card unless it the full original amount which was there. I had other stuff to purchase so I used all the money from the gift card but unfortunately I had to return another order for $80 , which was paid through that gift card and those money are back in gift card and I can get them back unless I return all I ve purchase through the gift card, which is at least 5 different orders. So now I am 'forced"" to spend another $80, want it or not otherwise they will stay in that useless gift card. that s kinda f a scam f you ask me to have you keep some money on a gift card that the only way to have use of them is to make another purchase through amazon. After all the money I spend, they cant solve a simple issue like that! And again, when I requested the return for the $230 - they automatically went to a gift a card. And I have never used a gift card with amazon before...That s a small and simple SCAM! Plain and simple!",25.0,374,0.854123987291894,0.14587601270810602,41.488977303941475,Low Trust
Derek Mcgillivray,GB,1.0,I am totally unable to access my account. I have just placed an order with a rival supplier for over 12000 pounds sterling.I will NEVER USE amazonianCompletely useless!!!,1.0,28,0.8533001932483796,0.14669980675162042,37.64906773522544,Low Trust
SAM,GB,1.0,Appalling customer service.I have purchased from Amazon many many times and never had an issue. This said however on 12 December I ordered a large item (a chair/bed) which is something I have not done before. I needed the chair/bed for a guest visit and ordered it on 10 December. I was initially happy with the fast delivery date which was due to be 14 December. However despite the fact that Amazon claim to have attempted delivery in 14 December this attempt definitely didn’t not happen (I have an advanced security system which I had reviewed) when the chair eventually arrived with no notice in 18 December on a dark wet and windy evening it was left by my gate in the rain until I could get help to lift the very heavy boxes inside. Once inside it took hours to put the chair together with the poor and hard to follow instructions. Once installed it was apparent that the chair was of very poor quality and defective. I immediately reported the matter to amazon who quite frankly have been totally unhelpful. They have basically explained the item is from a ‘third party seller’ which apparently means they don’t really care!! I have always believed that items bought on the Amazon platform gave me some kind of protection but this is definitely not the case. I am now still arguing with the ‘third party seller’ with no help from Amazon. I have been informed that the seller sees no problem with the chair which quite frankly is alarming in itself. I have been told I need to return the chair in the original packaging (which I don’t Have as it arrived wet and damaged) and pay for a courier to collect it !! I have since discovered that previous reviews of the same chair are much of the same . Please read reviews before making any purchase these are often informative and an insight into the kind of company you are dealing with .,33.0,334,0.8529081867713394,0.1470918132286606,41.10108533333432,Low Trust
Rob Baxby,CA,1.0,"I purchased different things all on February 11, 2020 I’ve received a few things, but most of it I still have not received. It is now March 7th.2020 Extremely dissatisfied with amazon. They billed me in February 11th I needed a lot of this equipment for a martial arts class, and now I get to sit on the sidelines cause I have no gear! Thanks for the poor service Amazon, buy elsewhere!!",1.0,72,0.8518890426808154,0.14811095731918456,38.21317545990202,Low Trust
Grimace,NZ,1.0,"Has anyone purchased this product recently? I placed an order in March and Amazon have stuffed up the delivery twice now! I will be lucky to receive the correct product by Christmas at this rate!!1st delivery attempt - Amazon didn't log my shipment properly, so someone else got delivered my item mid April. 2nd delivery attempt - I got a nice surprise today and received a completely different product! Amazon are currently investigating why customers have been receiving the wrong product. They have advised an uncertain timeframe for receiving the product now. Amazon customer service have been very unhelpful with making things right - no thanks to Abhishek and your supervisor. The least they can do is offer an equivalent, in stock product to the affected customers while Amazon sort out their issues. There is also no ability to escalate the matter to a regional or national customer service manager. Update - It is now 19/5/17 and my replacement order has not shipped yet. Don't know why it's taking so long. Amazon are not providing any updates or reasons why their service is soooo bad...I would have given a 0 star rating if there was an option.Awesome Amazon.",2.0,198,0.8518638984614889,0.1481361015385111,39.62778096026823,Low Trust
Claudia Jones,US,1.0,"I ordered a Fire TV Stick 4K and the remote control did not work properly. It was depleting the batteries within 24 hours of replacing them. Amazon agreed to replace the items so I returned the remote and the fire stick. Instead of replacing it with the fire stick and the remote, they only sent the fire stick. I called customer service and was told I would have to purchase a remote and request a refund. Ridiculous, anti consumer response. I sent them the remote and fire stick and they replace it with a fire stick and no remote.  In other words I now have a product that is unusable. I’ve been a Prime customer for many years and make very frequent purchases. That stops now!!!",1.0,126,0.8517593416762032,0.14824065832379685,38.82538120558973,Low Trust
