Monica Sutton,US,1.0,"Normally I don’t have problems with Amazon! But these last 3 times have been utterly freaking ridiculous. I asked to have my package thrown over my fence. Twice now my package has been left on my doorstep. I even put a note on my door and nope! So today, I got an alert my package was dropped off. I go to my backyard. No package. I go to my front yard nothing. I even see the Amazon driver on my security camera and nothing. Checked outside the gate nothing. So I reached out to Amazon. Guess what, I have to wait 24hrs to report my package missing because sometime the drives mark packages are dropped off even though they are not. Utter bs! Go back to shopping in stores people!",1.0,130,0.850618261478503,0.14938173852149705,38.927303415138226,Low Trust
