Cc,US,1.0,"All these reviews are so true! All but the 5 stars. You people order one or 2 things a year. The rest of us depend a lot on amazon to save time and money. I have spent thousands since they became the pos they’ve become. Dates are not on time. Deliveries end up 6 houses down. Credits to correct their errors are never seen. I never thought I would ever see anything worse than Walmart but Amazon has completely succeeded. By the way, Amazon, it is illegal to place packages in the mailbox! If it happens again, I will report it. I found out this is a federal offense hence the US Postal Service!! People, go on Walmarts website they have something going on like Amazon and their packages actually arrive on time and in a lot of cases, you will save the same money. Yes they will make mistakes but at least you get your money back or a replacement item.",1.0,162,0.8312089294183467,0.16879107058165332,40.25671561545395,Low Trust
