Line Côté,CA,5.0,Well i have been a customer for a year now!Prime and Paramount Plus of course !Yellowstone of course !From Montréal  everything i bought so far good quality and fast service and a lab top at 75% off great buy !So far great !The only thing was( dog food Salmon )Wich my dog didnot want to eat !Complex for return  ......,4.0,60,0.8284383719579009,0.17156162804209907,159.25110439705728,High Trust
diane hnath,US,1.0,"I live on a 25mph street littered with kids. Its a dead end. Delivery guy sped up this street going atleast 40 minimum. He does this regularly.He was stopped several times by neighbors on several occasions for speeding on the street. I stopped him before and he looked at me out of the corner of his eye, turned up his stereo and went 40 leaving this 25 mph roadHe recorded my husband as he was told to stop speeding this time. Then proceeded to throw packages inside the van. I heard him thudding them off the inside of the van.  He then drove by me giving me the finger!I will never order from you EVER. This guy is extremely unprofessional and rude!Id attach the photo if i could!I have now been on on the phone for nearly 40 minutes with consumer complaints customer service. Ive spoken to a person about 3 minutes of that time",1.0,155,0.8282082434566669,0.17179175654333312,40.328230564126834,Low Trust
