Jo Trastuzumab,US,1.0,"I can't believe this multi-billion dollar company has disgusting customer service! Fresh grocery order was supposed to arrive on Saturday afternoon. On whatever reason i don't know, they said the delivery had a problem and suggested me to wait for the status to change. I had to stayed home the whole day, then i contacted an agent to complaint. Noticing how annoyed and upset i was, he suddenly hung up on me. Another agent did the same, no one listened or finally gave resolution. Over the conversation, those associate agents promised me both my gift card amount and courtesy credit used to purchase would be returned back (OF COURSE I WANT MY SINGLE MONEY BACK, THE CANCELATION / TROUBLED DELIVERY WAS NOT FROM MY END, I FURIOUSLY HAD TO WASTE MY ENERGY AND TIME). 2 days passed and nothing changed, no refund, no delivery, no nothing. I spent my time reaching to customer service again, this time i made a call. This lady promised my gift card amount along with courtesy credit to be refunded back. After hours i got my gift card amount back but i didn't get my credit back! It was half of the total payment. I don't want to lose money for something that i didn't spend on! Chatted and called again everyone gave 360 different answers. Called like for 30 mins just to hear the customer service went against me and assumed me lying. Dude i say just listen to the call recording at the time when i was promised with my credit back, or my chat histories! But no, i only receive arrogance. Oh then if you don't wanna return my money then send me the items i spent those money on. They couldn't even do replacement saying that i already asked for a refund (YES BUT I WAS REQUESTING FULL AMOUNT OF REFUND IN ALL FORMS AND YOUR AGENT PROMISED IT). Well dude just so you know those are the attitude of most agents i received. I didn't receive my credit back + being treated rudely. They are nice in the beginning yet shows their unprofessionalism when i start complaining for my right. It's not just the matter of the policy, it's the attitude that i receive that i'll never forget. Funny how customer service from a big company shows their true self.",1.0,390,0.8248005783094469,0.17519942169055314,43.13462055171778,Low Trust
