Ann M,GB,1.0,"BE WARNED WHEN PURCHACHING HIGH VALUE ITEMS!! recently I purchased and iPhone for my partner from Amazon, I requested to send this back due to my partner upgrading making my present unwanted, they arranged the collection for the next day, but then told me that refunds are 14 days, 14 days pass then i am told that as the item is HIGH TICKET ITEM  this may take up to 30 days. I had the item on split payments so had only payed x1 instalment and clearly because i wouldn't go away they refunded the money during the chat. This is such a silly process as if you by an item from JL or Curry's you return the item they refund the money! they clearly are sales driven. I now will not purchase from Amazon if i can help it!",3.0,139,0.8223158547051859,0.17768414529481413,40.44337720304693,Low Trust
