Roger Stanley,GB,1.0,"Firstly I had to tick one star to open this box, Amazon don't deserve even that!A delivery was made to a neighbour and in so doing the driver managed to run over our fence. We heard the noise but the driver made off before we realised what he had done! Trying to get any response other than 'ill put you through to a manager' or 'we will get back to you in 24 to 48 hours' appears impossible! This is criminal damage and so far have only asked the police for advice. It's not an expensive fence and I can probably fix it myself, it's the principle! I will keep trying but Amazon really need to sort themselves out because reading other reviews they really are an awful company",6.0,129,0.8219196405460337,0.17808035945396627,40.35101741184582,Low Trust
