See Jay New Man,US,1.0,"I think Amazon has officially ""jumped the shark"".  The icing on the cake is their delivery drivers pulling into my driveway, dropping mud clumps and other crud on my new pavers.  Girl says ""I got 200 deliveries so that's why I pull into driveways.""  I said ""That's not my problem and you are not to pull in driveways in our development"".  I have a ring video of it and to add more idiocy to her lack of respect is she threw the pkg over the gate instead of leaving it at the door.  Volume of the radio in the van was cranked, so basically I had some 2 bit punk disrespecting my property in more than one way.  AMAZON, I TOLD MY WIFE THAT YOUR COMPANY IS TOAST FROM HERE ON OUT AND ON AVERAGE WE SPEND HUNDREDS PER MONTH. GET YOUR HOUSE IN ORDER!!!  Camp Verde AZ",3.0,148,0.8166233414804859,0.18337665851951412,40.82895631352478,Low Trust
