Leonardo Escoto,GB,1.0,"SCAMMERS !!!Amazon let your order go through without fixing the item price after changing the delivery address during checkout... let me explain.If an item is at $45 only in the U.S. and your default delivery is outside the US, the price increases example $65...I noticed that so I tried, before and AFTER, if you change the delivery to the US before placing the item in the cart, the price updates, and drops to $45. However, if you do it during checkout, the price remains at $65 even after you placed the shipping address within the U.S.So what do Amazon do with that extra $20, well it pays the Gas for another Moon ride...SCAMMERS",9.0,113,0.8159411813536318,0.1840588186463682,40.470467572811955,Low Trust
Shaun,GB,1.0,Been trying to get my refund since april have had my atoz claim approved but my money is stuck in the system which is funny as my cards never changed and they are happy for me to pay for other items and take my prime membership money out of !!! Every times threw chat its always you’ll be contacted in 24hrs 48hrs it takes 3days 5days 1-2 weeks your and Absoulte joke of a firm,6.0,75,0.8159232727063063,0.18407672729369373,40.04511510837509,Low Trust
Romeco Kissoonauth,US,1.0,"I honestly wish I could give them 0 stars! I live in Orlando, purchased a birthday present for my nephew and had it shipped to his home in Baldwin N.Y instead of carrying it on the flight with me. His birthday is on 1/16 and the item guarantee that it will be delivered by the 15th so when I get to NY I would be able to give him his B-day present on the 16th. It said the item was delivered on the 15th BUT no package was delivered, no photo taken to show proof of delivery. I paid for a birthday present, travel all the way to NY and Amazon did not make good on their commitment to have my purchase delivered. When I called customer service , all I got was "" we'll refund your money"". What the hell, such an inconvenience! I ended up going to the store and purchasing a present for him. I'm not renewing my prime and I'm closing my Amazon account. Amazon- Good for nothing! stick with the old way - driving to the store and making my purchase in hand.",1.0,188,0.8157948726889201,0.18420512731107985,41.31906174973795,Low Trust
