JB,US,1.0,"Worst customer service ever. 3 supervisors never called us back, after saying they would. Last supervisor said he saw the acct was closed for fraud, that we needed to open a new account but we had to pay full price for new acct with no credit for the acct they closed. They have our remaining amt and won,t refund the amt remaining.(with a business model like that no wonder Bezos can afford to fly to outerspace !).  I asked the supervisor to connect me to the fraud department. He said they don,t take phone calls and even he, a supervisor, was not able to talk to them!! I wonder if there even is a “fraud department “??   Guess we start shopping at WalMart or Target or….",1.0,126,0.7992686998232377,0.20073130017676233,41.44991329823801,Low Trust
