Quinetta James,US,1.0,"I purchased 2 Amazon Fire Tv’s sticks in November. Both remotes went out Janurary. I have been buying batteries every since thinking that there was an issue with the battery. Finally I got around to some free time to contact Amazon for the 2nd time about the remotes and the agent said that they were unable to replace the remotes because of a warranty being outdated. There is obviously an issue with the devices themselves being that BOTH REMOTES ARE NOT WORKING JO MATTER WHAT AAA BATTERIES I PURCHASE. Instead of apologizing for the inconvenience and assisting me with replacing 2 products that I bought from Amazon, the agent said “Download the app and use that for my TV’s”. How inconsiderate to tell me to pass my phone around the house so me or my guests can play hot potato me with my cell phone, and God forbid I need to talk on my phone while someone wants to watch TV. I will be discontinuing ALL SERVICES that has to do with Amazon and so will others that I recommend Amazon to. Very distasteful experience!!!",1.0,185,0.7914102835580699,0.20858971644193014,42.50464005653285,Low Trust
Ingrid IR,US,1.0,AMAZON STOLE MY MONEY!!! I didn’t received 2 items ( in Nov and Dec ) . I called 2 days after I noticed the missing items . 4 months calling and never received the refund. They didn’t believe me that I didn’t receive the items and debated with me about the items were sent to the right address. I will not spent 4 months of my time and energy for $50 if I did receive the items. There is not need for me to lie. Amazon became a monstrous  company out of control with deliveries and poor and disrespectful customer service. I lost my money and was treated as a lier. I’ll never use this company again for shoppings. In other words they are thieves. THEY STOLE MY MONEY .,1.0,130,0.79103473078581,0.20896526921419,41.90647994977287,Low Trust
