kenny,GB,1.0,"My parcel was delivered yeserday !!!   According to the email the parcel was "" handed to resident "" I am at a loss as how the driver can hand something to the resident when the resident and daughter were out at the time of delivery 2.08pm according to the tracking . Perhaps the driver handed the parcel to one of the cats who opened the door ??? It is very common fo amazon drivers to dump parcels on doorsteps in full view of everyone who comes down our road . I have in the past had parcels go missing as have many others here , i have sent Amazon photos of parcels left dumped on peoples and my doorstep yet they continue to do . WHY ?  Why do your drivers do this amazon ? Now i have to wait 48 hours to raise a full non delivery complaint . Perhaps i need to shop elsewhere in future and dump Amazon . ",26.0,162,0.7907717607847167,0.20922823921528333,42.27857404713545,Low Trust
