klant,NL,1.0,"I pre-ordered a book on september 1st that would come out november 7th and a book on october 7th that would also come out on november 7th. The iron flame sprayed edges and the fourth wing holiday special. They would both arrive on the 14th or 15th of november, but on the 15th I received two emails explaining for both books that they are currently unavailable and that they would email me when a new delivery date was known. Well, i contacted customer service about this, and I got a very 'know-it-all' CSA , they explained to me that they are currently sold out of both books and are waiting on confirmation of the publisher... Excuse me? I pre-ordered, what do you mean sold out? The CSA kept telling me that this is how a pre-order works , no! If I pre-order I reserve a book for myself. If Amazon does not have the stock, then they shouldn't sell it. And both books were still available for pre-order long after I bought them, so I know a LOT of people are as disappointed as I am right now. But the CSA wouldn't answer my question of why, they just kept repeating that this is a pre-order. Bs. Then, i contacted another CSA and they told me one of my orders was canceled!!!?? I have never approved this cancellation and I still have not received any email about this. I did get my money back, but it seems like contacting customer service had triggered this cancellation because Amazon still hasnt cancelled my other book. But moral of the story, dont pre-order from Amazon, they are just trying to make as much money without actually knowing if they can deliver. So pre-order on your own risk, its a gamble. I also cannot order a new book because it's literally sold out everywhere and I cant undo the cancellation. The CSA also told me that they can't promise me that I'll get my books because they don't even know if they are gonna get 'new' stock from the publisher.... (probably never because both books are limited edition) Very very disappointed, and also very very angry and frustrated.",6.0,364,0.7728841480216421,0.22711585197835793,45.43879876829535,Low Trust
