Dominic,GB,1.0,"What went wrong this time?  Simply put, amazon delivered an empty package in place of an Intel CPU.  But it gets worse.  The seal on manufacturer's package had clearly been broken BEFORE it was shipped from the amazon distribution centre, as the amazon shipping box had not been tampered with.  Would amazon provide a replacement or refund?  Nope!Instead, amazon insist that I report the matter to the local police to get a Crime reference and a crime report.The police provide the Crime reference but will only give the crime report to amazon but amazon insist that I need to get the report to them.So now I am playing-piggy-in-the-middle, with the police saying they will only talk to amazon and amazon wanting me to get the crime report to them and refusing to talk to the police.Meanwhile, I am £550 out of pocket!  And amazon call themselves the most Customer centric business on the planet!UPDATE:After wasting half a day with email exchanges between myself and amazon or myself and the police, every email to amazon gets the same response: We couldn't verify the details of the Crime Reference you provided.So the Crime ref provided by the police is not good enough for amazon and ""Therefore, we're unable to assist you any further in this matter. We would ask you to resolve the issues and reshare the Crime Reference with us"".So the police have issued the Crime reference but amazon do not like it so the process stops and there is nothing I can do.I have had 7 phone conversations with amazon and it is like talking to a wall. They want me to provide the crime report, which is impossible as the police will only give that to amazon.",26.0,288,0.7681966074348876,0.2318033925651124,44.82068000402679,Low Trust
