Telboy,GB,1.0,"I REVIEWED THIS ITEM HONESTLY BUT AMAZON REFUSED TO PUBLISH IT.  INFORMATION THAT POTENTIAL BUYERS SHOULD BE TOLD.Thank you for submitting a customer review. Thank you for submitting a customer review on Amazon. After carefully reviewing your submission, your review could not be posted to the website. While we appreciate your time and comments, reviews must adhere to the guidelines: Neos SmartCam | Security Camera, Works with Alexa, 1080P Full HD, Night Vision, 2-Way Audio Smart Camera | UK Warranty	 ★★   from mrhappy on 31 October 2019  BUYER BEWARE - SAMSUNG ‘A’ & ‘J’ SERIES PHONES PROBLEMS WITH NEOS APP Just discovered that my 18 month old A Series Samsung phone won’t work on these cameras platform. A known problem according to Neos tech people. Confirmed by email that ‘J’ series also problematic. Why is this not indicated on the sales literature ? I think I’ve got a clue !!Had about 8 emails back and forth with NEOS regarding the failure of my phone not working with the app. Think they were getting more terse near the end. Obviously my fault for having the wrong phone !I pointed out in the end, that I could cope using the iOS app on my iPad which is working OK, and the reply I got was also abrupt. My reply was, do they expect me to buy a new iPhone or Android phone (that’s if I knew which make/model would work) to get the app to work ?It’s a shame really because I can see that these cameras are great for the price if you have the correct phone. They just need to be more transparent about which makes/models won’t work with their App.",8.0,281,0.7508388784241796,0.24916112157582038,45.61004710515108,Low Trust
