Molly Schleede,US,5.0,"We always use Amazon. Never have an issue. Ordered some last minute items some stating they wouldn't arrive in time. Thankfully we received an email that they will. They always exceed our expectations. Never have an issue with customer service (kids purchased amazon prime on our Roku like 6 times, and after calling and explaining the situation to the customer service agent, they fixed it every time! Always laughing at the situation), and I will add this, my mother bought a gift from a private Amazon seller. The woman did not send it ""in time"" and when it showed up, a wonderful note, and extra gift was included. It was very sweet. Love shopping at Amazon, and will continue to do so!  Thank you Amazon!",2.0,125,0.7405944623529525,0.25940553764704755,164.37240812183637,High Trust
Nicole,US,1.0,"Amazon sends all things out as new now instead of new but opened or used. You get items and can tell someone else has had it. They also are review Nazis. They pick and choose which reviews they want posted. They hide behind community rules for reviews. Even if your reviews follow all their rules they will still send you nasty email saying you have been warned. Yet they never explain which review or what is wrong with the review. They just say it doesn't comply. Well, let's be honest if you write a review that is positive and is only about product there is no reason to reject it. I even read it to a few representatives and they didn't see an issue with it either. They have an AI controlling which reviews are allowed. They program it. No person actually decides. Since Bezzo left Amazon has gone to pot!!!",2.0,151,0.740564408342403,0.259435591657597,44.66555412017654,Low Trust
JY,US,5.0,Amazon prime is my go to for everything. Sometimes they are more expensive and I choose another avenue - but for the most part I am obsessed with amazon! When a product arrives and was damaged in shipping - replacement was easy. When a product was damaged when we were opening the packaging - replacement was easy. When I needed to return something but the timing window had passed - they made an exception and the return was easy! The online chat is exceptional and their customer service is top notch. I always have a smile on my face when I see an amazon box on my doorstep!,3.0,108,0.7403293992326666,0.2596706007673334,164.19497142928086,High Trust
