Adam Valencia,US,1.0,"What a crap company... first they literally made me eait ovet a month for my item... not that it took long to ship but they literally never pit my order in and why? Because im not prime... wow.... i ordered April 4h they ""processed"" my order and charged me may 13th!! Then they told me it was coming in 1 day... 6 days after that i realized myself the item is now out of stock and discontinued.... wooow with no email letting me know literally just left me on the hook for mouths! Walmart treats their employees before their customers better and actually gives customer service without having to PAY FOR CUSTOMER SERVICE  like on Amazon... they wont help you of you're not prime... so ridiculous and will never by from this crap company again",1.0,135,0.7396114960761825,0.2603885039238175,44.53372693483361,Low Trust
SHANE,GB,1.0,"Ordered 4 chairs, only 2 arrived in one box, my wife was there to receive that one box, so I got in touch with Amazon customer service and was told that a couple of minutes later that they had carried out an investigation and the other box had been stolen, stolen from where? they could not give me any answers to my questions and told me to contact the police, hung up on that person and was told by the next person exactly the same, clearly they were reading the same pathetic direction! Phoned the delivery service was told that one parcel had been dropped off and another was due the next day! Amazon your call centre abroad is a load of rubbish and should be shut down immediately! Really bad service.",4.0,132,0.739513164714255,0.260486835285745,44.504992353182374,Low Trust
