Gia Fill,US,1.0,"I tried to contact amazon customer service several times regarding the emails they send about order delivery. Absolutely useless!!! They barely speak English and can't understand what I say to them. I tried to find the email address I could contact them with, no such luck. One email I found, bounced back and they provided their stupid categories for help, which are useless. There is never a category I need. Why we can't enter our own category, I don't understand. They should be ashamed, making so much money and not providing decent customer service.",1.0,94,0.7391795228144102,0.26082047718558976,44.09542655137147,Low Trust
