Osvaldo Lisboa,GB,1.0,"I bought item as prime customer to be delivered Sunday for my son birthday, spent all Sunday waiting for the parcel arrive! Didn’t go anywhere just make sure i will get the delivery, eventually i got message saying my parcel was 4 stops away, went to the front door to be ready to collect nothing come and for my surprise i had message saying they attempted to delivery but they couldn’t no one was at home! Phone amazon straight way customer service said there was nothing they could do it about! They are going to delivery next day, amazon be come company with no respect for their customers, definitely will cancel my prime membership and never buy from Amazon again",6.0,120,0.7348695588005727,0.2651304411994273,44.60256804987602,Low Trust
