Emma Parfitt,GB,1.0,If I could give 1 i would...I ordered a train from Amazon for my little boy for christmas using a voucher code it didnt work I contacted them...I then used the voucher and it worked...Today I waited in all day and they said it had been cancelled but I had waited in all day..They said the money was refunded which I never requested or was told and still wanting the trainset to be delivered ...I feel like they have been very sneeky covering up there mistake...I will be contacting the obsudman about this ...I I used a voucher to get goods and they didnt send them and they didnt do anything...I m gunna get more from the obsudman now anyway ..Already sent off a claim...Jokers!!!,8.0,125,0.7330129819411877,0.2669870180588123,44.75148214242463,Low Trust
Cin,US,1.0,I am not only disgusted that you charge what you do for Prime and half the time items take twice the promised time or more.I am also so disgusted with the political stance of this company and its monopoly.I am closing my account and will NEVER order from Amazon again!!!,3.0,50,0.7328021240070893,0.26719787599291067,43.92074629543914,Low Trust
David Bowman,GB,1.0,"Amazon openly allows copyright infringement on their products and does absolutely nothing when told about it. I found a product that was using some of my work in the details and submitted an 'Infringement' form. Received an email from Amazon saying they needed more information. Filled in the form again and supplied all of the information they asked for. Received another email from Amazon saying that they STILL couldn't verify my claim and asking me to submit the form yet again! No info on what they needed, just a two line email. Tried submitting yet again and this time the form wouldn't pick up the product in question despite it still being for sale on the Amazon website. This is disgraceful and clearly shows that Amazon couldn't care less about copyright infringement as long as they get to sell their products!",56.0,141,0.7327599496532505,0.26724005034674947,44.94360655547544,Low Trust
Mr. T,US,1.0,"I didn't know how bad Amazon was until I had to return something on 11/03/2020. I never even thought to search for bad reviews but now I am amazed at how many bad reviews Amazon.com has! Amazon is turning into a garbage company especially after dealing with customer service. This whole idea how Amazon puts the customer first is absolute nonsense. After this experience its much safer to buy things from retail stores. If you don’t like something its an easy no hassle return. Don't waste literally a day trying to return packages to a UPS shipping center and then being insulted by an Amazon customer service rep. I had to return some gym equipment it was a bit large and heavy but it turned out to be an absolute nightmare! First the seller was price gouging which Amazon allows. Don’t be fooled with yoyo prices on Amazon they allow sellers to take advantage of people during a pandemic. Be careful with Amazon pricing. Second I just didn’t want the equipment it was too large for my space. To make things worse customer service yelled at me on the phone. I am not kidding this women actually told me that Amazon takes no responsibility for the sale if its from a third party then instead of helping me figure out how to return the items she hangs up on me! I am not kidding she didn’t finish helping me and hung up the phone on me because I was asking them to please make returning large items more easy. I didn't even know it was from a third party until I tried to return it and I was having some problems with how or where to return the items. I was treated like a fool, insulted by their customer service and they never even resolved the problem! I used to buy a lot from Amazon but we are now reconsidering everything we buy from Amazon for several reasons. Amazon will NOT help the customer with return problems. Amazon prices are all over the place. They have no consistency for pricing its like trying to buy something with Bitcoin one day its selling for half the next day its up 100%. I will only be made a fool one time. I know I am just one little tiny voice in a company who has taken over the United States but I know for sure if their customer service acted like this to me they are doing it to others. With this kind of behavior some day some online retailer will catch on and make online shopping a much better experience. Don’t even try to have Amazon customer service call you unless you are ready to be insulted and don't order anything that cannot be returned at the UPS Store. I am just warning others before they waste a day and get insulted. Minus 100 stars for Amazon.",2.0,486,0.7326259254356537,0.26737407456434625,48.82018998733116,Low Trust
