Hart,GB,2.0,"Ordered a mens fragrance called BOSS in 100ml size. Clearly they always come in a glass bottle, and Amazon dispatch, shipped it in a cardboard box with no protection. It arrived as a sweet smelling box with broken glass. Hardly surprising. Whats happening at Amazon? they seem hell bent on annoying customers with awful service. So far its all they do well!!!",15.0,62,0.7322720953509876,0.2677279046490124,74.08185232723469,Medium Trust
