Kevin Latham,GB,1.0,"Beware of the Amazon driver!! I have just had a neighbour at my door brandishing a card claiming that his parcel has been delivered to my address. It has my name on it, how, I can't imagine since I never order from the company. on the day it was SUPPOSED to have been left I was out at work and couldn't have accepted it even if I wanted to. This has left me looking like a thief. Can this company get any worse? I would complain directly to the hell hole but I can't unless I have an account...which will NEVER happen!",1.0,102,0.7244912162121991,0.27550878378780086,44.919578280809,Low Trust
CaptnRye,US,5.0,"I have to say, I do $50K online shopping a year, between personal and business. Not a single online vendor gets it 100% right all the time, but Amazon comes about as close as anyone can get statistically to getting it right! Prices are almost always lowest or close (of course there are exceptions), they hold the vendors they allow to use them as a Marketplace to high standards of customer satisfaction, and are quick to step in and make things right.At the end of the day, I almost always revert to buying things on Amazon rather then go to a retail store only to find the almost never have the exact item I want anyway. I can do my comparitive shopping, search reviews, and with little exception have it sitting on my front porch 2 days later. Living in a very rural area, this is a life changer, and I go out of my way to support Amazon, after supporting my local small businesses when possible, for providing the level of service and customer support that they do!Keep up the good work Amazon!",6.0,184,0.7238195659476959,0.2761804340523041,165.87295888713567,High Trust
Al,US,1.0,They stole my money from my credit balance on my account. Then put some of the worst customer service people ever from the Philippines who has no interest in helping you. AVOID!!!,2.0,32,0.7237926574222837,0.2762073425777163,44.16931272619372,Low Trust
AMM,US,1.0,"Amazon sold me a USED water filter as new!!!I am so angry at Amazon right now.  I ordered a NEW water filter for my refrigerator, When it arrived, the box was ripped and banged up.  I thought it was just a warehouse or shipping issue.  Then when I opened the box, the filter unit was scraped and look old/used.  Still hoping, I installed it and ran the water for 3 minutes as instructed.  The (polluted) red light stays on - meaning, not only is the ""new"" filter not working, I believe it is a USED filter that has been sold to me as new.  Disgusting.  I have an elderly/sick father who lives with me and he can get infections very easily so this is also a dangerous result of a USED and BAD product.  This filter doesn't show a RED light until 6 months, so this ""new"" filter has been used for over 6 months and then sold to me as new.  I am starting to trust Amazon less and less.I am never going to order this again from Amazon, I am going to order from SEARS which is where the previous one came from.",1.0,195,0.723717571008806,0.27628242899119404,46.00144618315476,Low Trust
glai 5393,HK,1.0,"Worst customer service. I had to contact the online customer service live chat team over 5 times! WHAT A JOKE!First I got accused and questioned why I would want to return an item and why didn't I cancel it. Which I tried to do, but it wasn't accepted. I escalated the situation to the leadership team, then I got a promise of an advanced refund which DID NOT happen. Then when I contacted them again, I was told that they didn't have the authority to authorise it. Which baffles me, why would the leadership team make promises they can't keep? and if they don't have the authority, then who has?Since my postage needed to be reimbursed as well, I was given the same email address over 3 different live chats, and when I did send my postage receipts to it, it got rejected as it didn't allow for direct emails. THEN WHY THE HELL DID YOUR CUSTOMER SERVICE TEAM OFFER THAT EMAIL AS A CONTACT POINT WHEN I CAN'T SEND A DIRECT EMAIL TO IT. JUST ABSOLUTE RUBBISH> AMAZON, get your team trained! AND PROPERLY>bloody waste of my time and energy.",1.0,191,0.7232614993897009,0.27673850061029914,45.979381564446534,Low Trust
