Magi,GB,5.0,"I'm shocked at the terrible rating that amazon has on trustpilot!! I came here because I felt i needed to thank this company for the wonderful shopping experience that I have had for the past so many years. You order a thing and they give you an expected delivery date a few days away (I'm not a prime member) but the next morning they send you a link to show your delivery driver is 7 stops away! Such a quick, convenient service. Customer service is absolutely amazing. I cancelled a delivery and for some reason it couldn't be cancelled and the thing was dispatched, amazon calmly tells me to refuse that delivery or if its delivered initiate a free return and I'm refunded. If an item has a tiny bit of fault, i just complaint and they either send you a replacement or a full refund. What else can a shopper ask for?it can't get better than this. Thank you amazon",2.0,161,0.7201528564004742,0.2798471435995258,165.7983022164317,High Trust
