Drew Burgess,US,1.0,"They are thieves!!! I ordered 4 Ipads for my job and ended up not needing them. I never opened them. They sent me a return label and I shipped all four in the same box. A month has passed by and no credit to my card. I called them and was told they only received one. I should have them out in four different boxes. I said no one told me that. Then I said if you have you have all four and want my money back. Then I said if you claim I only sent one back then why haven't I seen that credit. So basically they stole $2,300 from me. Will never use Amazon for anything. What they did to me is illegal and I want justice.",3.0,129,0.7048085144297271,0.29519148557027286,46.20657371766115,Low Trust
Shannon Cecere,US,1.0,"I have been an amazon prime member for years. Up until a few weeks ago, I have never had an issue with any orders or ever had to contact customer service. I placed an order that was not completely fulfilled from seller. From that point, there was a lot of suspicious activity and emails that did not make sense. I tried to place another order and realized my account was locked. When I called and spoke to a customer service rep, she was friendly at first. As she looked further into my account, she stated that I needed to re-pay for a few items that were being disputed. First of all, why should I ever have to pay again for items that I already paid for. One order was for something I never even ordered, nor was it ever delivered to my home. When I stated that, she was extremely rude and her words when I told her I didnt order it was ""oh yes you did"" I have never experienced such rude customer service. I have been a member for years and have placed orders on a weekly basis. When I asked to speak to the account specialist she said no. When I asked to speak to her supervisor, she said no. When I asked to cancel my account she told me no. They dont cancel accounts. Its a paid membership!!! I should have the option of cancelling. I will never order from Amazon again. I intend on taking this further as well. To be told I can not cancel a paid membership is absurd. The customer service is horrible. So disappointed",1.0,273,0.7047023503403206,0.2952976496596794,47.82713711001706,Low Trust
